\par }{\fs20\lang1024\langfe1024\noproof {\shp{\*\shpinst\shpleft1440\shptop2070\shpright10512\shpbottom2070\shpfhdr1\shpbxpage\shpbxignore\shpbypage\shpbyignore\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt0\shpz2\shplockanchor\shplid2049{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn fFlipH}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fFlipV}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn shapePath}{\sv 4}}{\sp{\sn fFillOK}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fFilled}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fArrowheadsOK}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn posrelh}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn posrelv}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}}{\shprslt{\*\do\dobxpage\dobypage\dodhgt8194\dpline\dpptx0\dppty0\dpptx9920\dppty0\dpx1190\dpy2070\dpxsize9920\dpysize0\dplinew15\dplinecor0\dplinecog0\dplinecob0}}}}{\f0\fs16  \par }}{\footerf \pard\plain \s22\ql \b\f354\fs18  Page {\field{\*\fldinst PAGE}{\fldrslt 1}}{     }\'a9 2025 \uc2 Factiva, Inc.  All rights reserved.\par }{\footer \pard\plain \s22\ql \b\f354\fs18  Page {\field{\*\fldinst PAGE}{\fldrslt 1}} of {\field{\*\fldinst NUMPAGES}{\fldrslt 1}}{     }\'a9 2025 \uc2 Factiva, Inc.  All rights reserved.\par }\pard\plain \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\fs20 {\par\fs20\uc2 France\u8217\'20\'19s only cash buy Bitcoin merchants share tell Cointelegraph about their views on \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin business in France:  \highlight22\uc2 Regulation \highlight\uc2 , education and cash buy frustration\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Joseph Hall \par \uc2 1,930 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 February 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 In conversation with the only Bitcoin business in France that allow Bitcoin cash buys, Bitcoin Lyon.\par \par \uc2 Jimmy Chambrade and Aurore Galves Orjol, co-founders of Bitcoin-lyon, first heard about Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) in 2014. Around that time, their close friend and now business partner, Emmanuel, mined Bitcoin using application-specific integrated circuits. However, it took three years and a face-melting bull run before the pair could set aside the time to engage with the technology.\par \par \uc2 Fast forward to 2017, and Chambrade and Galves Orjol had just returned from an around-the-world trip. Although ready to return to the world of work, they would rather avoid the traditional \u8220\'20\'1Cnine-to-five\u8221\'20\'1D fiat lifestyle, or the \u8220\'20\'1Cm\u233\'00\'E9tro, boulot, dodo\u8221\'20\'1D (subway, work, sleep) routine as it\u8217\'20\'19s known in France.\par \par \uc2 They began investigating Bitcoin and the cryptocurrency space, attending crypto meetups and testing out the tech. Their research and curiosity {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.crypto-lyon.fr/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 led}}}\uc2  to the creation of Crypto Lyon. As their first foray into the world of crypto, Crypto Lyon is a catch-all community for crypto enthusiasts in France\u8217\'20\'19s third-most populous city.\par \par \uc2 They\u8217\'20\'19re not \u8220\'20\'1CLyon\u8221\'20\'1D about Bitcoin\par \par \uc2 On a deeper level, though, something about Bitcoin twigged during their encounters with fellow crypto enthusiasts \u8212\'20\'14 the pair was hooked. It could have been the philosophy behind Bitcoin, but the privacy, self-sovereignty and pseudonymous elements were also compelling, particularly for Chambrade. Either way, it soon became clear that working in Bitcoin was a fait accompli.\par \par \uc2 Galves Orjol noted that before committing to Bitcoin:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s important to get to grips with the entire crypto ecosystem. We examined the world of crypto through the eyes of individuals and later an association. We developed and deployed smart contracts, hosted events for traders, and mixed with developers and analysts. Ultimately, though, the path led to Bitcoin.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 They met and engaged with a host of crypto-curious and crypto-obsessed individuals in France before opening the bureau for Bitcoin-lyon in 2019.\par \par \uc2 Initially, Bitcoin-lyon was a space for customers in Lyon to buy over-the-counter Bitcoin. However, \u8220\'20\'1Cbeing profitable purely through the sale of Bitcoin on margin was tricky. Competing with the likes of \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 , Kraken and Binance was not enough,\u8221\'20\'1D Galves Orjol explained. The business soon developed a budding consulting operation, particularly useful for francophones new to Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Galves Orjol details that a lot of their dealings with the consultancy space revolve around the \u8220\'20\'1Cblockchain not Bitcoin\u8221\'20\'1D confusion, a term and trend first {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://unchained.com/blog/bitcoin-not-blockchain/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 coined}}}\uc2  by OG Bitcoiner Parker Lewis. In essence, entrepreneurs are often drawn to \u8220\'20\'1Cblockchain,\u8221\'20\'1D the technology that\u8217\'20\'19s now ironically world-renowned thanks to Bitcoin. But because Bitcoin receives bad press, entrepreneurs are put off building on Bitcoin and are thus pulled away from the real revolution.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe lion\u8217\'20\'19s share of our working day is speaking to clients about blockchain technologies, and more often than not, they realize that the killer app is the Bitcoin blockchain. Often, their big project doesn\u8217\'20\'19t need a blockchain, it needs Bitcoin!\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The Crypto Lyon association lives on as Bitcoin-lyon grows into a one-stop shop for all things Bitcoin. Whether Lyonnais wish to buy, sell, learn about or integrate Bitcoin payments into their businesses, the team working at Bitcoin-lyon is on hand to provide Bitcoin educational and consultative tools.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin-lyon also takes advantage of a considerable unique selling point: It is the only Bitcoin vendor in France that accepts cash for crypto.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 An exceptional case among the Bitcoin vendors in France, customers of Bitcoin-lyon can swap their euro bills for Bitcoin. Galves Orjol and Chambrade were granted the license \u8220\'20\'1Cby jumping through each and every hoop established by the AMF [L\u8217\'20\'19autorit\u233\'00\'E9 des march\u233\'00\'E9s financiers],\u8221\'20\'1D France\u8217\'20\'19s Anti-Money Laundering (AML) organization.\par \par \uc2 Indeed, French regulatory laws concerning Bitcoin are harsher than Zinedine Zidane when he\u8217\'20\'19s all riled up. Know Your Customer (KYC) is required from amounts of just 1 euro. In practice, it means that an 18-year-old with 50 euros in their pocket thanks to a generous birthday gift must disclose their name, address and contact details to buy a petite amount of Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 A mere 100 miles away, in neighboring Switzerland, customers can buy 900 euros of Bitcoin a day \u8212\'20\'14 no questions asked. Chambrade laments France\u8217\'20\'19s overbearing rules for crypto, \u8220\'20\'1CRegulations are killing us. In 10 years\u8217\'20\'19 time, there will not be a Bitcoin vendor left in the country.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 To make matters worse, compliance and AML requirements dictate that transactions must be traced. The combination of traceability and \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  stymies the ease of doing Bitcoin business:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CCompliance is expensive for Bitcoiner companies in France, whereas nearby in Switzerland, the rules are far more relaxed. Sometimes, we are not able to accept customers\u8217\'20\'19 money here in France because we are very careful with AML and KYC laws. Yet we know that when we finish speaking with what could have been our customer, they can drive for one hour to buy Bitcoin without the same restrictions in Geneva.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The situation is exacerbated by the French government\u8217\'20\'19s treatment of Bitcoin businesses. Whereas \u8220\'20\'1Cblockchain-focused\u8221\'20\'1D projects receive wild investments and incentives, Bitcoin-related projects in France are hamstrung by \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The country\u8217\'20\'19s widely lauded \u8220\'20\'1CLa French Tech\u8221\'20\'1D startup scene has still not accredited a Bitcoin startup despite the relative {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://ecosystem.lafrenchtech.com/companies/f/locations/allof_France/tags/anyof_bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 success}}}\uc2  of companies such as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://stackinsat.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 StackinSat}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The well-known French crypto unicorn Ledger is an exception, but it started out as a hardware company in Paris. Chambrade explained:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CLedger hit a critical mass for revenue and customers in hardware before it turned to software and retail avenues. Plus, hardware and R&D is a well-funded area of industry in France.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Speculation vs. accumulation\par \par \uc2 As Bitcoin-lyon is the only physical retail outlet for Bitcoin in France, its clientele reflects the growing trends and demographics of Bitcoin buyers in the region. Broadly speaking, there are two clearcut groups of buyers: those in it for the technology (accumulators) and those in it to get rich (speculators).\par \par \uc2 There are those \u8220\'20\'1Cwho want to buy it now and sell it once it does a 4x,\u8221\'20\'1D Chambrade explained, and there are \u8220\'20\'1Cthose that have a real need for Bitcoin.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Worth noting is that while French crypto regulations are strict, French tax laws are tighter still. A whopping 30% tax is imposed on all crypto sales for any profit over 300 euros. It pales in comparison to the United Kingdom\u8217\'20\'19s 14,000-euro tax-free limit. Over in Switzerland, it\u8217\'20\'19s a different ballpark: There is zero tax on personal crypto gains.\par \par \uc2 Notwithstanding, the rise of nonfungible tokens (NFTs) has enticed a growing number of speculators into the space. The \u8220\'20\'1Cget-rich-quick\u8221\'20\'1D crowd often calls for appointments at Bitcoin-lyon to shill their next big NFT, assuming that Bitcoin is somehow required in their plan.\par \par \uc2 Similarly, the flavor-of-the-month altcoin, \u8220\'20\'1Cwhether it\u8217\'20\'19s Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ), Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) or Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) that\u8217\'20\'19s mooning; it often leads to phone calls from potential clients who just want to buy the next big thing.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Often, investors are simply impatient to part with their money. Galves Orjol sighed, \u8220\'20\'1CPeople don\u8217\'20\'19t even understand what they are trying to buy.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Chambrade is frank with these kinds of requests. First, he sets up a consultation to explain Bitcoin. He patiently illustrates the properties and history of Bitcoin, underlining the risks associated with any kind of crypto investment.\par \par \uc2 Following the consultation, if the customers are still keen to buy NFTs or altcoins, Chambrade helps them to set up a wallet to receive Bitcoin and shows them how to swap for Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), Solana or otherwise.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoiners in Lyon\par \par \uc2 Galves Orjol noted that the prosaic \u8220\'20\'1Ccrypto bro\u8221\'20\'1D demographic has been improving over the years. Currently, their customers are about 70% male, 30% female. The stand-out age group is 35- to 55-year-olds. They tend to have some disposable income and a desire to understand the technology and represent one basket among the \u8220\'20\'1Caccumulators.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Common convincing arguments to orange pill this demographic are the rising prices in France (inflation sits at around 5%\u8211\'20\'136%) as well as wealth diversification strategies. Plus, these people have worked and lived through the 2007\u8211\'20\'132008 financial crisis in which banks\u8217\'20\'19 predatory lending and malpractice crippled the global economy. In this context, Bitcoin is the life raft.\par \par \uc2 At the graying end of the demographic spectrum, there are internet-phobic, savvy pensioner customers. This group is keen to protect its wealth in \u8220\'20\'1Cdigital gold.\u8221\'20\'1D While the older generations may struggle to set up a Bitcoin wallet, \u8220\'20\'1Cthey understand money on a deeper level than younger people,\u8221\'20\'1D said Chambrade.\par \par \uc2 For example, the over-60s have lived through two periods in history where the French franc (the former national currency) lost purchasing power, so they understand what a devaluing currency means for wealth preservation.\par \par \uc2 The current macroeconomic background is enough to convince them that a currency with a fixed supply is a good hedge. Plus, they\u8217\'20\'19ve seen money die, such as when the euro took over as the national and, indeed, Europe-wide currency in 1999.\par \par \uc2 Remittance is a beret good idea\par \par \uc2 Finally, there is the remittance camp of Bitcoiner customers: immigrants, expats or francophone diasporas who want to send money abroad cheaply and simply.\par \par \uc2 At the foot of the Alps, Lyon is an economic engine and metropole with high employment rates. It\u8217\'20\'19s an increasingly attractive destination for jobseekers traveling from the Maghreb (Algeria, Libya, Mauritania, Morocco and Tunisia), as well as France\u8217\'20\'19s former colonies, from Haiti to Djibouti.\par \par \uc2 Chambrade illustrates the situation, telling the story of the Algerian truck driver who transports and sells construction materials in Algiers. The trucker keeps Bitcoin \u8220\'20\'1Cin his pocket\u8221\'20\'1D as opposed to bags of cash because it\u8217\'20\'19s safer. If he were to transact with cash, he\u8217\'20\'19d have to keep thousands of Algerian dinars on his person, which just isn\u8217\'20\'19t worth the risk.\par \par \uc2 He said, \u8220\'20\'1CAlthough Bitcoin is still illegal in certain Maghreb countries, as long as you\u8217\'20\'19re not winding up the authorities and, provided the sums aren\u8217\'20\'19t astronomical, you can use Bitcoin without a hitch.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Moreover, Bitcoin is an outlet that sidesteps the \u8220\'20\'1Cmonopoly money\u8221\'20\'1D risk. Sadly present in many African countries, but most well-known to Venezuela, currencies become monopoly money when hyperinflation takes over. Traders are forced to use stacks and stacks of cash to do business as the money devalues faster than ink can dry on the freshly printed notes.\par \par \uc2 Finally, for those without banking services, Bitcoin enables a certain level of financial freedom. And with the rise of the lightning network on Bitcoin, transactions from a fraction of a penny and up can be sent instantly and globally at a negligible cost. Customers can come in, set up a wallet, and easily send Satoshis to family members based in Africa or in developing countries around the world.\par \par \uc2 At home in Lyon, the footprint for merchants accepting Bitcoin and Bitcoin Lightning payments services is swelling. Bitcoin-lyon\u8217\'20\'19s payment solution for merchants and e-commerce retailers has opened up the Bitcoin economy in the city.\par \par \uc2 Currently, there\u8217\'20\'19s a barber, a few bars, a Lyonnais-style restaurant known locally as a \u8220\'20\'1Cbouchon,\u8221\'20\'1D a T-shirt seller and an IT store. While the bull market ebbs and flows, the rendezvous list for new businesses is expanding every week.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDIvNGJiOTAzZmQtMzdkOS00YTYyLTkwZDctYzNmMGM3ZTk2ODM4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220211ei2a0005p\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 2/9: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, LUNA, AVAX, DOT, DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,836 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 February 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC price is expected to consolidate in the current $44,000 zone, allowing altcoins to climb higher before Bitcoin makes a more decisive move.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has recovered close to $44,000, indicating that the downtrend could be coming to an end. However, the price may not rally to the all-time high in a straight line. This means bulls are likely to face several hurdles in-between and the price action may remain volatile.\par \par \uc2 JPMorgan\uc2  analysts {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/jpmorgan-estimates-fair-value-of-bitcoin-at-38k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said in a recent investor note}}}\uc2  that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s boom and bust cycles are hindering further institutional adoption. The analysts estimate that with \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  four times that of gold, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s fair value is about $38,000. If the \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  reduces to three times that of gold, their fair value estimate for Bitcoin rises to $50,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/5e47fdd0-d8da-4860-8f60-866d35acdb95.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The Wells Fargo Investment Institute, the research division of Wells Fargo Wealth and Investment Management, in its report titled "Cryptocurrencies \u8212\'20\'14 Too early or too late?" said the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/global-crypto-adoption-could-soon-hit-a-hyper-inflection-point-wells-fargo-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 crypto markets were still in the early days}}}\uc2  of adoption. The report added that \u8220\'20\'1Cmost of the opportunity lies before us, not behind us [...]\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and altcoins extend their relief rally or will profit-booking pull prices lower? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke above the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($42,659) on Feb. 7 and reached the overhead resistance at $45,456 on Feb. 8. This level proved to be a strong resistance and the price turned down from it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/c06bcea4-3ab2-4adc-b1fc-0a57740b2063.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair formed a Doji candlestick pattern on Feb. 8, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears. However, the upsloping 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($40,751) and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive zone indicate that the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 If bulls thrust the price above $45,456, the pair could rise to $48,000 and thereafter to the stiff overhead resistance at $52,088. Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the 50-day SMA, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the resistance line of the channel on Feb. 7 which is an indication that the downtrend could be over. Although bears defended the 50-day SMA ($3,208) on Feb. 8, they have not been able to pull the price back into the channel.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/0453aacb-c14e-4a28-a324-4b07e0649720.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This suggests that bulls are attempting to flip the resistance line of the channel to support. The buyers will once again try to drive the price above the 50-day SMA on Feb. 9. If they succeed, the ETH/USDT pair could start a new up-move.\par \par \uc2 There is a minor resistance at $3,400, but if this level is crossed the next stop could be $3,900. The rising 20-day EMA ($2,924) and the RSI in the positive territory indicate advantage to buyers.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate in the short term if bears sink and sustain the pair below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the downtrend line on Feb. 18, indicating strong resistance from the bears. The price has dropped to the 20-day EMA ($409), which is an important support to keep an eye on.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/e8761710-2a26-4f6c-99ae-07ce80da643d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rises from the current level, the bulls will again attempt to push the BNB/USDT pair above the downtrend line of the channel and the 50-day SMA ($453). If they succeed, it will suggest that the downtrend could be over. The pair could then start its march to the psychological level at $500.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the trend remains negative and higher levels are attracting selling by the bears. The pair could then drop to $390 and later extend its slide to $357.40.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) surged and closed above the 50-day SMA ($0.75) on Feb. 7, which is the first indication that the downtrend could be over. Traders are booking profits near $0.91, which could result in a minor correction or consolidation.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/dd23c21b-b3d6-4750-a85a-cc09aa4e3543.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is in the overbought zone, indicating that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If the price turns up from the current level or rebounds off $0.75, the bulls will try to propel the XRP/USDT pair above $0.91.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the up-move could reach the psychological level at $1 where the bears may again pose a strong challenge. This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down and plummets below the moving averages.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to propel Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the 50-day SMA ($1.23) on Feb. 8 but the bears held their ground. This pulled the price back to the 20-day EMA ($1.14). The price is now stuck between the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/a1ed0a7a-ca64-4a46-a2ab-515774f43a3e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The RSI is just above the midpoint and the moving averages are flat, indicating a range-bound action in the short term. If buyers push and sustain the price above the 50-day SMA, the pair could rally to the resistance line.\par \par \uc2 This is the critical level to watch out for because a break and close above the channel will be the first sign that the downtrend could be over.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the 20-day EMA, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could slide to $1.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the overhead resistance at $116 on Feb. 7, but the bulls could not extend the relief rally further. The bears pulled the price back below $116 on Feb. 8.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/9e65cd6e-fe00-4804-9635-eb61b0e8fed3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers have not yet given up as they are trying to defend the 20-day EMA ($112). If the price rebounds off the current level, the bulls will attempt to push the SOL/USDT pair above $121.93. If they manage to do that, the pair could rally to the resistance line.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bears pull the price below the 20-day EMA, the pair could drop to the uptrend line. If this level also cracks, the pair could decline to $94. The flat 20-day EMA and the RSI below the midpoint, suggest a range-bound action in the near term.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 The relief rally in Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token hit a wall at the 20-day EMA ($58). This suggests that the sentiment remains negative and bears are selling on rallies to strong resistance levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/8caa1674-0366-4cfb-b708-2db69bbb2718.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks and sustains below $54.20, the LUNA/USDT pair could lose strength and gradually drop to the strong support at $43.44. Such a move will suggest that the current up-move was a relief rally in a strong downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off $54.20, it will suggest that traders are not waiting for a deeper correction to buy. The bulls will then attempt to push the pair above the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the pair could rise to the downtrend line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-centers-on-44k-as-btc-price-macd-delivers-long-awaited-bull-signal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin centers on $44K as BTC price MACD delivers long-awaited bull signal}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) soared on Feb. 8 to reach the downtrend line but the long wick on the day's candlestick shows that bears are defending the overhead resistance aggressively. The bulls regrouped quickly and are attempting to push the price above the 50-day SMA ($88).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/1e1ed226-afd5-4c30-85b4-61146e69e0ab.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The RSI is nearing the 62 level from where it had turned down on Dec. 21 and before that on Nov. 30. If buyers push the RSI above this resistance, it will indicate advantage to buyers. A break and close above the downtrend line could signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level or the downtrend line, the AVAX/USDT pair could find support in the zone between the 20-day EMA ($77) and $75.50. The bears will have to sink the price below this zone to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) tried to rise above the zone between $22.66 and the 50-day SMA ($24.05) on Feb. 8, but the bears were in no mood to relent. A minor positive is that the bulls have not allowed the price to break below the 20-day EMA ($21.06).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/28aab21a-74fa-4eba-a367-158a2d369cdb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages have flattened out and the RSI is close to the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. A break and close above the 50-day SMA could tilt the advantage in favor of the buyers.\par \par \uc2 The DOT/USDT pair could then rise to $28 where the bears may again pose a stiff challenge. Alternatively, a break and close below the 20-day EMA could signal that the pair may remain range-bound between $22.66 and $16.81 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) broke and closed above the 50-day SMA ($0.15) on Feb. 7 but the bulls could not build upon this advantage. The bears pulled the price back below the 50-day SMA on Feb. 8, indicating that they have not given up yet.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/1bd30b33-0ad8-4d80-ae79-30f1de8e280c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.15) is the important level to watch on the downside. If the price rebounds off this level, the possibility of a break above $0.17 increases. If that happens, the DOGE/USDT pair could rise to the stiff overhead resistance at $0.19.\par \par \uc2 The gradually upsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive territory indicate a slight advantage to buyers. This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA. The pair could then drop to the strong support at $0.13.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDIvN2FmNDFlMjMtNDYzYi00N2JiLTkwODMtOTkzMzMzZjVlODg5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220209ei29000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin rebound hits $45.5K as focus switches to future support retests\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 578 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 February 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin rises to $45,500 in the latest phase of the BTC price rebound.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) hit new multi-week highs above $45,000 on Feb. 8 as the largest cryptocurrency\u8217\'20\'19s comeback continued.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/a2e39f3c-85dd-4bf9-81e6-e7c9465504f8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 $40,000 becomes popular retest target\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.142027444.742658523.1640948929-762064149.1640948929"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD reaching $45,500 on \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2  in its latest surge before consolidating.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  was once again in evidence as the pair fluctuated by $1,000 on intra-hour timeframes, circling $44,800 at the time of writing.\par \par \uc2 Fears of a major correction were nonetheless left unfounded on the day, despite theories that $40,000 could see a retest next.\par \par \uc2 lol okay a couple hundred dollars lower than previous tweet but I'm back to thinking we run it back to retest 40K idk honestly listening to this space has my brain all sorts of messed up clearly not thinking clearly\par \par \uc2 either way just keep stacking\par \par \uc2 trend is \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 add on dips {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/swQXuSqDYC"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/swQXuSqDYC}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 K A L E O (@CryptoKaleo) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoKaleo/status/1490939433520033792?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 February 8, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph reported, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s latest moves represent a breakout of a downtrend in place since November\u8217\'20\'19s all-time highs.\par \par \uc2 Sparked by a similar exit from its relative strength index (RSI), BTC price action is now {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-faces-crucial-trend-battle-as-bitcoin-rsi-confirms-breakout"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 closing in on its yearly opening price}}}\uc2  just above $46,000.\par \par \uc2 Analyzing the fuel behind the past days\u8217\'20\'19 progress, on-chain analytics resource Material Indicators noted that large-volume traders were accumulating, while whales, who had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whales-buy-at-38k-as-btc-supply-per-whale-hits-10-year-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bought in at prices around $38,000}}}\uc2 , were now neutral.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CDriver of the rally were orders of size $10k - $100k (green), which made up almost all of the total CVD, and evidently TWAP\u8217\'20\'19ed since the bottom was in. Whales remained either flat or sold into the rips,\u8221\'20\'1D it {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Mtrl_Scientist/status/1490733194316025857"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 summarized}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 In a separate development, news came Monday that United States regulators had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/nasdaq-will-list-valkyrie-s-etf-linked-to-bitcoin-mining-firms-on-feb-8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 approved a new form of exchange-traded fund}}}\uc2  focused on Bitcoin mining.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CJust as the move down gave no dead cat bounces or clean retests, this up move so far has given shallow dips and no clean retests, leaving sidelined capital sweating and potentially having to chase,\u8221\'20\'1D a positive William Clemente {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/WClementeIII/status/1490710975674294272"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added}}}\uc2  about the latest price performance.\par \par \uc2 XRP leads top 10 altcoin gains\par \par \uc2 Altcoins, meanwhile, were slightly more sluggish as Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rally stole the show.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-returns-to-43k-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC price returns to $43K \u8212\'20\'14 5 things to watch in Bitcoin this week}}}\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), the largest altcoin by market capitalization, was up 2.8% in 24 hours compared to Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s 5%, with only Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  conspicuously outperforming the majority.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/6b1bcdbe-32e0-4fad-83be-7efd80d1dbb3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD 1-day candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The latter saw daily gains in excess of 16%, marking a clear turnaround and paving the way for an attack on the $1 mark.\par \par \uc2 That is the strongest daily candle we have seen on XRP/BTC in 6 months. We have broken our falling wedge downtrend line and a key cluster of resistance. May have avoided the breakdown I was concerned about. Will get more confirmation in the coming days if this move is legit. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24XRP&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $XRP}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/wW4GdizlZ1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/wW4GdizlZ1}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Credible Crypto (@CredibleCrypto) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CredibleCrypto/status/1490861373252800514?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 February 8, 2022}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD was up 6.3% at $1.23, its highest level since Jan. 20.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDEvNDMwNzBiZDktMzUxYS00YWU0LWJjMTctNTgzMDRiMjZlMTNjLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220208ei280005q\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin rebound hits $45.5K as focus switches to future support retests\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 578 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 February 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin rises to $45,500 in the latest phase of the BTC price rebound.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) hit new multi-week highs above $45,000 on Feb. 8 as the largest cryptocurrency's comeback continued.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/a2e39f3c-85dd-4bf9-81e6-e7c9465504f8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 $40,000 becomes popular retest target\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.142027444.742658523.1640948929-762064149.1640948929"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD reaching $45,500 on \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2  in its latest surge before consolidating.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  was once again in evidence as the pair fluctuated by $1,000 on intra-hour timeframes, circling $44,800 at the time of writing.\par \par \uc2 Fears of a major correction were nonetheless left unfounded on the day, despite theories that $40,000 could see a retest next.\par \par \uc2 lol okay a couple hundred dollars lower than previous tweet but I'm back to thinking we run it back to retest 40K idk honestly listening to this space has my brain all sorts of messed up clearly not thinking clearly\par \par \uc2 either way just keep stacking\par \par \uc2 trend is \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 add on dips {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/swQXuSqDYC"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/swQXuSqDYC}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 K A L E O (@CryptoKaleo) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoKaleo/status/1490939433520033792?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 February 8, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph reported, Bitcoin's latest moves represent a breakout of a downtrend in place since November's all-time highs.\par \par \uc2 Sparked by a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-faces-crucial-trend-battle-as-bitcoin-rsi-confirms-breakout"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 similar exit}}}\uc2  from its relative strength index (RSI), BTC price action is now closing in on its yearly opening price just above $46,000.\par \par \uc2 Analyzing the fuel behind the past days' progress, on-chain analytics resource Material Indicators noted that large-volume traders were accumulating, while whales, who had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whales-buy-at-38k-as-btc-supply-per-whale-hits-10-year-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bought in}}}\uc2  at prices around $38,000, were now neutral.\par \par \uc2 "Driver of the rally were orders of size $10k - $100k (green), which made up almost all of the total CVD, and evidently TWAP'ed since the bottom was in. Whales remained either flat or sold into the rips," it {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Mtrl_Scientist/status/1490733194316025857"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 summarized}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 In a separate development, news came Monday that U.S. regulators had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/nasdaq-will-list-valkyrie-s-etf-linked-to-bitcoin-mining-firms-on-feb-8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 approved}}}\uc2  a new form of exchange-traded fund focused on Bitcoin mining.\par \par \uc2 "Just as the move down gave no dead cat bounces or clean retests, this up move so far has given shallow dips and no clean retests, leaving sidelined capital sweating and potentially having to chase," a positive William Clemente {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/WClementeIII/status/1490710975674294272"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added}}}\uc2  about the latest price performance.\par \par \uc2 XRP leads top ten altcoin gains\par \par \uc2 Altcoins meanwhile were slightly more sluggish as Bitcoin's rally stole the show.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-returns-to-43k-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC price returns to $43K \u8212\'20\'14 5 things to watch in Bitcoin this week}}}\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), the largest altcoin by market cap, was up 2.8% in 24 hours compared to Bitcoin's 5%, with only Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  conspicuously outperforming the majority.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/6b1bcdbe-32e0-4fad-83be-7efd80d1dbb3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD 1-day candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The latter saw daily gains in excess of 16%, marking a clear turnaround and paving the way for an attack on the $1 mark.\par \par \uc2 That is the strongest daily candle we have seen on XRP/BTC in 6 months. We have broken our falling wedge downtrend line and a key cluster of resistance. May have avoided the breakdown I was concerned about. Will get more confirmation in the coming days if this move is legit. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24XRP&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $XRP}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/wW4GdizlZ1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/wW4GdizlZ1}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Credible Crypto (@CredibleCrypto) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CredibleCrypto/status/1490861373252800514?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 February 8, 2022}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD was up 6.3% at $1.23, its highest level since Jan. 20.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDEvNDMwNzBiZDktMzUxYS00YWU0LWJjMTctNTgzMDRiMjZlMTNjLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220208ei280002z\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin stays higher after stocks propel BTC price toward $42K\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 524 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 February 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC price action retains levels above $40,000 as \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  wanes out of hours.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) held above $41,000 into the weekend after a late surge Friday took the largest cryptocurrency to two-week highs.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/d2d429da-89e0-47bd-834b-8d65c0c1f63c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-day candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 "The only good bear is a dead bear"\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.142027444.742658523.1640948929-762064149.1640948929"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD maintaining newly re-won ground Saturday, with the pair's correlation to stock makets firmly in focus.\par \par \uc2 Analysts had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-hits-38k-as-bitcoin-analysts-focus-on-weekly-close"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 highlighted}}}\uc2  the $39,600 area as a key line to cross and flip to new support in order to secure further upside. In the event, this was no issue for bulls, as Bitcoin "gapped up" in seconds as it neared $40,000 to continue higher.\par \par \uc2 Amid the newfound strength, the mood was conspicuously more buoyant than in recent days or even weeks.\par \par \uc2 Popular analyst Credible Crypto compared current action to Q4 2020, in which Bitcoin challenged $12,000 prior to breaking three-year all-time highs.\par \par \uc2 Characteristic of a 1-2, 1-2 or start of a new impulse is strong moves up, shallow pullbacks, continuation. The first chart is from 11-12k before our breakout and run to 60k. The second chart is now, and what I expect to play out to further confirm our major 5th has started. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BTC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BTC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/gDvt4hsQoq"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/gDvt4hsQoq}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Credible Crypto (@CredibleCrypto) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CredibleCrypto/status/1489897678393774082?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 February 5, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 "The only good bear is a dead bear," trader and analyst Pentoshi {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Pentosh1/status/1489768774555389957"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 quipped}}}\uc2  as the market continued rising to spike to local highs of $42,000.\par \par \uc2 Others were less convinced of the sustainability of the current move, with data showing considerable large-volume selling beginning as $40,000 reappeared.\par \par \uc2 CT cheering about a break of 40k, but orders of size $100k+ are still selling this rip {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/BTC?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #BTC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/IfACqoRBs5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/IfACqoRBs5}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Material Scientist (@Mtrl_Scientist) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Mtrl_Scientist/status/1489646796121022469?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 February 4, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-faces-crucial-trend-battle-as-bitcoin-rsi-confirms-breakout"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 , signs had already been circulating that an uptick was due, thanks mainly to the time-tested relative strength index (RSI) breaking a two-month downtrend in late January.\par \par \uc2 "Probably worth mentioning price is at historic levels of oversold to on-chain demand/supply, and the futures traders have halted their sell-down," statistician Willy Woo {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/woonomic/status/1489649247846731776"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 commented}}}\uc2  while comparing similar RSI breakouts.\par \par \uc2 Fear lingers for wary hodlers\par \par \uc2 Turning to sentiment, the sense of caution characterizing the market since November's $69,000 peak remained.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-2-4-btc-eth-bnb-ada-sol-xrp-luna-doge-dot-avax"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 2/4: BTC, ETH, BNB, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , SOL, XRP, LUNA, DOGE, DOT, AVAX}}}\par \par \uc2 According to the Crypto Fear & Greed Index, "fear" was still the overriding emotion among market participants, even after the price jump.\par \par \uc2 The Index, which uses a basket of factors to produce a nominal sentiment score from 0-100, measured 33 at the time of writing, having spent most of January below 25 \u8212\'20\'14 the "extreme fear" zone.\par \par \uc2 Nonetheless, the last time that the Index was so high was almost six weeks ago, just after Christmas.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/10805468-e7bf-4846-bcec-787237971606.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto Fear & Greed Index (screenshot). Source: Alternative.me\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDIvZDllM2VkNzItZmJlMy00Nzc0LThkZjQtZDczN2U3ZGY0ODQ1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220205ei250002t\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Proof-of-Stake\par \b \uc2 Winter is coming! Here are 5 ways to survive a crypto bear market\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Jordan Finneseth \par \uc2 1,174 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 February 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The multi-month pullback in crypto prices are giving veteran investors flashbacks of the 2018 crypto winter. Here are 5 things investors can do to survive a bear market.\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency market has an interesting way of catching even the most seasoned veterans off guard as each bull and bear market initially shows similarities to previous cycles only to veer off in an unexpected direction and wipe out the fortunes of newly minted crypto millionaires.\par \par \uc2 This was the case with the weak close of 2021 which completely went against the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  $100,000 BTC price estimates that crypto analysts and influencers were peddling nonstop.\par \par \uc2 Currently, Bitcoin price is more than 50% away from its $69,000 all-time high and altcoins have fared worse, with many down more than 60% in the last 2 months. In times like these, traders need to regroup and re-evaluate their investment strategy, rather than just buying every price dip.\par \par \uc2 Here are five strategies traders can use to survive an unexpected crypto winter and retain as much value in one\u8217\'20\'19s portfolio as possible.\par \par \uc2 Reduce exposure to highly volatile altcoins\par \par \uc2 Once a widespread market downturn commences, the first step to take is to reevaluate current positions and reduce exposure to the most volatile assets.\par \par \uc2 Oftentimes these are new projects that have come out of the trending sectors of the crypto market such as meme coins, NFTs or {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/wonderland-co-founder-throws-in-the-towel-on-beleaguered-defi-project"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rebase projects like Wonderland}}}\uc2  (TIME), because many of the token holders are new to the community and not long term investor like the user bases for more established projects.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24TIME&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $TIME}}}\uc2  to pack it up. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/hJI3jB6eU0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/hJI3jB6eU0}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 humble defi farmer (@PaikCapital) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/PaikCapital/status/1486121407981387777?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 January 25, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 A good way to begin the evaluation process is by looking at a project\u8217\'20\'19s \uc2 GitHub\uc2  account to see the level of activity and the number of developers dedicated to building out the protocol.\par \par \uc2 If there is hardly any development despite flashy marketing gimmicks and big promises, the project may be one an investor should cut when the market begins to lose momentum.\par \par \uc2 Traders could then put these funds in stablecoins that can be staked to earn yield or buy future market dips.\par \par \uc2 Dollar-cost averaging\par \par \uc2 Dollar-cost averaging (DCA) is the process of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/new-to-crypto-trading-here-are-5-tips-on-how-to-start-2022-on-the-right-foot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 buying an asset in tranches over time}}}\uc2  to average out the price paid and account for \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 -induced changes in price.\par \par \uc2 There's a reason that bitcoiners have the most aggressive dollar-cost-averaging community.\par \par \uc2 They correctly identify work and true scarcity, and understand it. It's hard to rival that force and utility of something that *can't* be increased in supply.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Lyn Alden (@LynAldenContact) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/LynAldenContact/status/1487946367741870080?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 January 31, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 While DCA strategy is a good way to increase exposure to fundamentally sound projects over time, it is usually best to wait until after the dust has settled somewhat and a period of consolidation has commenced.\par \par \uc2 The focus of dollar-cost averaging should be on projects that have active development, engaged communities and a roadmap that lays out how the project will continue to grow and remain viable in the future.\par \par \uc2 Staking\par \par \uc2 Staking is perhaps the simplest way to increase the value of a portfolio long-term and it removes the pressure of obsessing over daily price fluctuations since the staked asset is continuing to accrue tokens.\par \par \uc2 Most layer-one protocols offer the ability to stake their native token on the network to earn a yield, including Solana, Cardano, Polygon and Avalanche.\par \par \uc2 \u9889\'26\'A1\u65039\'FE\'0FTop Projects by Total Staked Value\par \par \uc2 25 January 2022 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24SOL&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $SOL}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ADA&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ETH&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ETH}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24LUNA&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $LUNA}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24AVAX&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $AVAX}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24DOT&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $DOT}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BNB&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BNB}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ATOM&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ATOM}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ICP&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ICP}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24NEAR&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $NEAR}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24MATIC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $MATIC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24FTM&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $FTM}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24XTZ&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $XTZ}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ALGO&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ALGO}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24CAKE&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $CAKE}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/X9IgsonWKr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/X9IgsonWKr}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 CryptoDep (@Crypto_Dep) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Crypto_Dep/status/1485927613231210506?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 January 25, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 Ether holders can also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-hash-rate-scores-new-ath-as-pos-migration-underway"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 stake their tokens}}}\uc2  on the beacon chain for Eth2, but it\u8217\'20\'19s important to note that staking rewards will not be able to be claimed until Eth2 is fully launched.\par \par \uc2 There are many other staking options out there from gaming protocols like Axie Infinity and Illuvium to NFT marketplaces like LooksRare, so once a deep dive has been made and fundamentally sound projects are chosen, staking becomes a matter of setting it and forgetting it.\par \par \uc2 Find projects with growing ecosystems and perks\par \par \uc2 Projects that help token holders earn via staking, liquid staking, borrowing and airdrops are also worth considering when the market turns \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Staking is the simplest form of this as the number of tokens increases over time, but other options include token launchpads, NFT marketplaces and protocols known for offering {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/opendao-sos-looksrare-looks-and-wtf-token-3-airdrops-with-1-scam"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 airdrops to community members}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 One example of a protocol where early adopters are being rewarded is the Cosmos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/cosmos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ATOM}}}\uc2  ) network and its growing community of projects connected via the Interblockchain Communication Protocol (IBC).\par \par \uc2 Best site to keep track of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/cosmos?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @Cosmos}}}\uc2  Airdrops {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/XzOOIb5TAG"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/XzOOIb5TAG}}}\par \par \uc2 Builders: submit your upcoming airdrop on that site if you want to increase awareness. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CosmosUplink?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @CosmosUplink}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/IPoDqZ8ymp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/IPoDqZ8ymp}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Cryptocito | YouTuber \u9883\'26\'9B\u65039\'FE\'0F (@Cryptocito) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Cryptocito/status/1486131865144725511?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 January 26, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 ATOM stakers and those who have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/the-expanding-cosmos-here-s-why-osmosis-osmo-hit-a-new-all-time-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 engaged with the Osmosis}}}\uc2  (OSMO) decentralized exchange have been rewarded with a long list of airdrops from projects launching within the ecosystem as a way to help bootstrap activity within their communities.\par \par \uc2 Invest in yourself\par \par \uc2 One of the most personally beneficial things an investor can do during a down market is to invest in themselves by learning something new.\par \par \uc2 Not only will this help investors to avoid the urge to sell and miss out on future gains, but it can also lead to new avenues to build wealth.\par \par \uc2 Level up and invest in yourself:\par \par \uc2 - read more books\par \par \uc2 - work out well more often\par \par \uc2 - spend time with family and friends\par \par \uc2 - take a course and learn a new skill\par \par \uc2 - invest in a hobby to share w/others\par \par \uc2 You get out of life what you put into it.\par \par \uc2 Find your values and invest in them.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Wealthy Tree (@WealthyTree) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/WealthyTree/status/1488616571346071554?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 February 1, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 Despite the market downturn, cryptocurrencies continue to advance along the path to mass adoption and the number of jobs in the blockchain sector is only going to increase moving forward.\par \par \uc2 Whether it\u8217\'20\'19s learning to program in Solidity, experimenting with graphic and digital design to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/nifty-news-the-lennon-collection-gucci-and-lamborghini-nfts-atari-s-50th-anniversary"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 create a new line of NFTs}}}\uc2  or just doing research to gain a deeper understanding of the various sectors of the market.\par \par \uc2 Ultimately, the key to surviving a bear market is staying positive and being patient.\par \par \uc2 Want more information about trading and investing in crypto markets?\par \par \uc2 * Crypto staking: How to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-staking-how-to-pick-the-best-staking-coins-for-passive-income"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pick the best staking coins}}}\uc2  for passive income\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/web3-innovations-are-replacing-middlemen-with-middleware-protocols"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Web3 innovations are replacing middlemen}}}\uc2  with middleware protocols\par \par \uc2 * How to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/how-to-pick-or-analyze-altcoins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pick or analyze altcoins?}}}\par \par \uc2 * Inside the blockchain developers\u8217\'20\'19 mind: How to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/inside-the-blockchain-developers-mind-how-to-build-the-next-big-social-dapp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 build the next big social DApp}}}\par \par \uc2 * How can the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/how-can-the-metaverse-help-the-food-industry"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Metaverse help the food industry}}}\uc2 ?\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDIvMDg2ZDE3ZTUtYjEyZC00N2NlLTk5NTAtYTdkMjczMDI1MzliLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220205ei2400006\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 SEC\par \b \uc2 SEC again delays decision on Grayscale\u8217\'20\'19s \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Sam Bourgi \par \uc2 377 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 February 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The securities regulator cited familiar concerns around manipulation and fraud in postponing its decision on Grayscale's \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC) has once again delayed its ruling on whether to approve Grayscale\u8217\'20\'19s application for a Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) exchange-traded fund (ETF), citing familiar concerns around manipulation, liquidity and transparency.\par \par \uc2 In a notice published Friday afternoon, the SEC {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.sec.gov/rules/sro/nysearca/2022/34-94151.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 expressed}}}\uc2  concerns about how the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  manager intends to convert its \uc2 Grayscale Bitcoin Trust\uc2  (GBTC) into a spot ETF. Namely, the regulator wasn\u8217\'20\'19t convinced that Grayscale\u8217\'20\'19s proposal was designed to prevent alleged fraud and manipulation in the Bitcoin market. The SEC has invited the public to comment on these issues, giving interested parties 21 days to respond in writing.\par \par \uc2 The SEC has just delayed their decision on whether GBTC can convert to a bitcoin ETF.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Pomp (@APompliano) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/APompliano/status/1489730031115030533?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 February 4, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph reported, Grayscale\u8217\'20\'19s initial application to convert shares of GBTC into a spot \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  was submitted to the SEC in October. Less than two months later, the securities regulator announced that it was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-delays-decisions-on-bitwise-and-grayscale-s-bitcoin-etfs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 postponing its decision on Grayscale\u8217\'20\'19s application}}}\uc2  and a similar proposal put forward by Bitwise.\par \par \uc2 Grayscale is the world\u8217\'20\'19s largest \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  manager with $36.5 billion in assets under management as of Feb. 4. Its GBTC product accounts for over 71% of its total assets.\par \par \uc2 02/04/22 UPDATE: Net Assets Under Management, Holdings per Share, and Market Price per Share for our Investment Products.\par \par \uc2 Total AUM: $36.5 billion {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BTC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BTC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BAT&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BAT}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BCH&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BCH}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24LINK&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $LINK}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24MANA&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $MANA}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ETH&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ETH}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ETC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ETC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24FIL&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $FIL}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ZEN&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ZEN}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24LTC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $LTC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24LPT&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $LPT}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24XLM&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $XLM}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ZEC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ZEC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24UNI&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $UNI}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24AAVE&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $AAVE}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24COMP&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $COMP}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24CRV&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $CRV}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24MKR&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $MKR}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24SUSHI&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $SUSHI}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24SNX&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $SNX}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24YFI&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $YFI}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ADA&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24SOL&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $SOL}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24AMP&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $AMP}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/1IqNGLX3QP"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/1IqNGLX3QP}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Grayscale (@Grayscale) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Grayscale/status/1489718412473479169?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 February 4, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/canadian-bitcoin-etf-sees-its-third-biggest-daily-inflow-ever"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Canadian Bitcoin ETF sees its third-biggest daily inflow ever}}}\par \par \uc2 While the SEC has been hesitant to approve a spot \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2 , the regulator has been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/top-5-bullish-stories-of-2021"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 much more receptive to a futures-linked product}}}\uc2 . In October, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/proshares-bitcoin-linked-etf-launches-on-nyse-as-btc-price-dips-above-63k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ProShares Bitcoin Strategy ETF}}}\uc2  became the first Bitcoin futures fund to be approved in the United States. Shortly thereafter, the SEC approved a pair of Bitcoin-linked Strategy ETFs from Valkyrie and VanEck.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDIvODAzMWQxOTAtNmI0Ny00ZDU1LThmYzAtMzI3ZWE0M2IwMDU4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220205ei2400005\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 2/4: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, XRP, LUNA, DOGE, DOT, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,776 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 February 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC and altcoins finally broke above their respective overhead resistance levels, but the actions of traders over the next few days will determine whether bulls are back in control.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) are attempting to build upon their recent recovery as the U.S. equity markets try to resume their relief rally, backed by strong results by Amazon. Bollinger Bands creator John Bollinger recently tweeted that Ether looked to be in a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-bounces-after-amazon-stock-gains-15-in-us-tech-comeback"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 good spot to be added}}}\uc2  to his existing long positions.\par \par \uc2 The Purpose Bitcoin exchange-traded fund also witnessed its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/canadian-bitcoin-etf-sees-its-third-biggest-daily-inflow-ever"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 third-largest inflow on Feb. 1}}}\uc2 , according to Glassnode data. This suggests that traders may have started accumulating Bitcoin at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/e8c87921-244f-446b-ab65-4d5832172b99.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Even though crypto markets are reeling under a bear phase, investor interest remains strong. Popular social media platform Stocktwits said that it has partnered with FTX.US to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/social-platform-behind-retail-short-squeeze-launches-crypto-trading"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 launch its crypto trading next quarter}}}\uc2 . The platform boasts 5 million monthly active users. This could result in several new investors starting their crypto investment journey.\par \par \uc2 Does the strong move in Bitcoin and select altcoins indicate the start of a new uptrend? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bounced off the minor support at $36,155.01 and the bulls have pushed the price above the overhead resistance zone between the 20-day exponential moving average ($38,974) and $39,600.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/c042032a-51c1-4276-affe-16bde6417580.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains above $39,600, buying could pick up momentum and the BTC/USDT pair could rally to the 50-day simple moving average ($43,021). The bulls will have to clear this hurdle to signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level, it will suggest that bears continue to sell on rallies. A break and close below $36,155.01 could clear the path for a retest of the Jan. 24 intraday low at $32,917.17.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether turned down from the 20-day EMA ($2,795) on Feb. 2 and dipped below the support at $2,652 on Feb. 3 but the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests aggressive buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/1cbe2a81-c7d4-4de7-b32b-538b343ec995.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out and the relative strength index (RSI) is just above the midpoint, indicating that bears are losing their grip. Sustained buying by the bulls has driven the ETH/USDT pair above the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 If bulls sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rise to the resistance line of the channel. A break above the 50-day SMA ($3,291) will indicate that bulls are back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price turns down from the current level and plummets below $2,550. That could open the doors for a decline to the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the minor support at $357.40, indicating that bulls are buying at lower levels. The bulls will now attempt to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($401).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/5765954e-201c-474a-a2d7-4ef0e3fcbb16.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the BNB/USDT pair could start its northward march toward the resistance line of the descending channel. A break and close above this resistance will signal a possible trend change.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. The bears will then try to pull the pair below $357.4 and challenge the strong support zone at $330 to $320.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been trading between the critical support at $1 and the 20-day EMA ($1.12) for the past few days. This tight-range trading is likely to result in a directional move soon.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/28628ab4-1b86-41cd-96f6-5fff098718f8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the 20-day EMA will be the first sign that the buyers are back in the reckoning. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then rise to the resistance line of the descending channel where the bears are likely to pose a stiff challenge. If the bulls overcome this hurdle, the pair could signal a trend change.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the moving averages, it will suggest that traders are selling on rallies. The bears will then try to pull the pair below $1. If they manage to do that, the decline could extend to $0.80.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/solana"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($110) on Feb. 2 but the long tail on the Feb. 3 candlestick suggests buying at lower levels. The bulls will again endeavor to push the price above the breakdown level at $116.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/12a61459-b880-47d4-8d31-b4df6030e125.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the SOL/USDT pair could rally to the resistance line of the descending channel. A break and close above the channel will signal a possible change in trend. Alternatively, if the price turns down from the resistance line, the pair could continue to trade inside the descending channel.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, $80.83 is the critical support to watch out for because if it cracks, the selling could intensify further and the pair may plummet to the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/ripple"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) continues its random price action between $0.54 and $0.65. If the price breaks above $0.65, it will suggest that the range-bound action may have been accumulation by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/73c8c151-828a-4eaf-89c6-74f38b839f6d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USDT pair could then move towards the 50-day SMA ($0.76) where the bears may mount a stiff resistance. A break and close above this resistance will be the first sign of a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from $0.65, the range-bound action could continue for a few more days. The bears will have to pull the price below the support at $0.54 to indicate the resumption of the downtrend. The pair may then retest the psychological support at $0.50.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token is trading between $43.44 on the downside and $54.20 on the upside. The 20-day EMA ($59) is sloping down and the RSI is in the negative zone, indicating that bears hold a slight edge.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/5efa923e-9608-42e1-b87b-f04c35b4e139.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the overhead resistance at $54.20, the range-bound action may continue for a few more days. A break and close below the support at $43.44 could indicate the resumption of the downtrend. The LUNA/USDT pair could then drop to the critical support at $37.50.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bulls drive the price above $54.20, the pair could rally to the 20-day EMA where the bears may face stiff resistance. The bulls will have to clear this hurdle to indicate a possible change in the short-term trend. The pair could then rally to the downtrend line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-surges-toward-39k-as-stocks-volatility-keeps-wall-street-on-edge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin surges toward $39K as stocks \b  \highlight22volatility\b0 \highlight22  keeps Wall Street on edge}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) continues its listless price action inside the range between $0.13 and $0.15. This indicates that both the bulls and bears are not waging large bets and are playing it safe.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/e09f7a19-7c89-4d28-921d-65135c1ec0ec.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are sloping down and the RSI is in the negative territory, suggesting that bears hold a slight edge.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA ($0.14) the bears will attempt to resume the downtrend by pulling the DOGE/USDT pair below $0.13. If they succeed, the pair could decline toward the psychological support at $0.1.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.16) to signal that the bears are losing their grip. The pair could then rise to $0.19.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) is trading between the 20-day EMA ($20.47) and the strong support at $16.81. The weak rebound off a strong support and the failure to break above the 20-day EMA indicates a lack of aggressive buying by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/fe890c71-0cb8-419d-8a0e-d3728f952388.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Although the RSI has inched higher, it is still in the negative territory. The moving averages also continue to slope down, indicating that bears are in command. This suggests that the bears may again attempt to defend the 20-day EMA with vigor.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the bears will try to pull the DOT/USDT pair below $16.81. If they succeed, the downtrend may resume. This negative view will invalidate in the short term if bulls push the price above the 20-day EMA. In that case, the pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($24.34).\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/avalanche"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($73.58) on Feb.2 but a positive sign is that the bulls held the support at the uptrend line. This indicates that the sentiment is improving and traders are buying on minor dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/21e427fb-ea69-4066-8029-2c88090103b1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now attempt to drive the price above the breakdown level at $75.50 where the bears are again expected to mount a stiff resistance. If the bulls overcome this barrier, the AVAX/USDT pair could start its journey toward the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from $75.50, it will suggest that bears continue to sell on rallies. That could keep the pair sandwiched between $75.50 and the uptrend line. A break below the uptrend line could open the doors for a decline to $60 and later to $51.04.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDIvNzNkZjczMGQtNDhiOC00YzdjLWJkYjQtZmQ0ZWJkMjM4NTM5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220204ei24000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 2/2: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, XRP, LUNA, DOGE, DOT, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,803 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 February 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins took an unexpected dip today, signalling that even with $40,000 in sight, the overall sentiment remains negative.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) rose above $39,000 on Feb. 1 but the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-dives-with-stocks-as-fresh-sell-off-sees-paypal-shed-nearly-25"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sharp fall in the shares of PayPal}}}\uc2  may have resulted in aggressive selling by the short-term traders.\par \par \uc2 However, in the long-term, large investors seem to be viewing the decline as a buying opportunity. On-chain monitoring resource Whalemap said that whales holding between 100 to 10,000 BTC {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whales-buy-at-38k-as-btc-supply-per-whale-hits-10-year-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 have accumulated during the recent decline}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Fidelity recently released a paper dubbed \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin First,\u8221\'20\'1D which highlights that Bitcoin is the most \u8220\'20\'1Csecure, decentralized form of asset\u8221\'20\'1D and is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/fidelity-bitcoin-is-a-superior-form-of-money"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 unlikely to be overtaken}}}\uc2  by any of the altcoins \u8220\'20\'1Cas a monetary good.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The report said that Bitcoin combines \u8220\'20\'1Cthe scarcity and durability of gold with the ease of use, storage and transportability of fiat.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/38368eb1-5a01-4600-9103-61b67a7f9ab1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Irrespective of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-network-transaction-volume-surpasses-american-express-research"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 transaction volumes at the end of 2021}}}\uc2  clocked an annual growth of nearly 100% over the past five years, according to a recent NYDIG report. This boosted Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s annual transaction volume to $3 trillion in 2021, surpassing popular credit card network \uc2 American Express\uc2 , which recorded $1.3 trillion worth of payments and Discover, which had $0.5 trillion.\par \par \uc2 Could the accumulation by the bulls indicate that a bottom may be around the corner? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s recovery reached the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($39,116) on Feb. 1, which is acting as a stiff resistance. This suggests that sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies to the overhead resistance levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/27e1654b-2759-4037-876b-1ee9df12bdc8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to pull the price below $36,632.61. If they succeed, the aggressive bulls who had purchased the recent dip may book profits, dragging the BTC/USDT pair below $35,000.\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the relative strength index (RSI) in the negative territory indicate that bears have the edge.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off $36,632.61, it will suggest that bulls are buying on dips. They will then make another attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at $39,600.\par \par \uc2 This is an important level to watch out for because if the pair sustains above this level, the next stop could be the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($43,421). The bulls will have to clear this hurdle to signal a possible end of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the breakdown level at $2,652 on Jan. 31, but the bulls could not clear the overhead hurdle at the 20-day EMA ($2,792). This suggests that the bears are defending this level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/c02b7520-0e1a-4030-a9aa-bff0f0c086c6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price slips and sustains below $2,652, it will suggest that the bears are back in action. The ETH/USDT pair could then drop to $2,476 and later to the support line of the channel. The downtrend could resume on a break below $2,159.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the current level, it will suggest that bulls are buying on dips. The buyers will then again attempt to push and sustain the pair above the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, the pair could start its march toward the resistance line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the support line of the channel on Jan. 31, indicating that bulls are buying on dips. However, the bulls could not push the price to the 20-day EMA ($407).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/0939ce17-140a-41e0-bbd9-e6b48a8188bb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This indicates a lack of demand at higher levels. Both moving averages are sloping down and the RSI remains in the negative territory, indicating that bears have the upper hand. The sellers will now attempt to pull the price back below the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the BNB/USDT pair could drop to the strong support zone at $330 to $320. Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the current level and rises above the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the selling pressure could be reducing.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) continues to struggle to rebound off the strong support at $1. This indicates a lack of urgency among traders to accumulate at the current levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/b8efa73d-37ed-4bb7-aad5-f40624ad6098.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the bulls fail to push and sustain the price above the moving averages within the next few days, the possibility of a break below $1 may increase. If that happens, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could resume its downtrend.\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is $0.80. If this level cracks, the decline may extend to the support line of the channel. Conversely, a break and close above the 50-day SMA ($1.25) could result in a retest of the resistance line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned up on Jan. 31 and broke above the overhead resistance at $104.82 on Feb. 1. The price reached the 20-day EMA ($112) on Feb. 2, which is acting as a strong resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/32eed2d7-e3d5-44ef-a9c3-b56c33157ad3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are attempting to pull the price below $104.82. If they succeed, it will suggest that bears continue to sell aggressively at higher levels. The SOL/USDT pair could then retest the recent low at $80.83.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the current level and rises above $116, it will suggest that bulls are making a comeback. The pair could then attempt a rally to $130 and later to the resistance line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) remains stuck between $0.54 and $0.65. The attempt by the bulls to start a relief rally could not even challenge the overhead resistance at $0.65. This indicates a lack of conviction among the bulls to buy at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/5f391c43-2797-4542-8bc5-9443c17cc4a6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI near the oversold territory indicate that bears are in command. If the price breaks below $0.58, the XRP/USDT pair could drop to the strong support at $0.54.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below this level could pull the pair to the psychological support at $0.50. This negative view will invalidate in the short term if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the 20-day EMA ($0.66).\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token bounced off the support line of the descending channel on Jan. 31 but made a Doji candlestick pattern on Feb. 1. This indicates that demand dried up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/2d6d5a8e-7094-4e00-b512-a4f9e4d0f9e2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The uncertainty of the Doji candlestick pattern has resolved to the downside and the bears will now try to pull the price to the strong support at $37.50. The downsloping 20-day EMA ($61.58) and the RSI in the negative zone indicate that bears are in command.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level and breaks above $54.20, it will suggest that bulls are accumulating on dips. The LUNA/USDT pair could then reach the 20-day EMA which may act as a barrier. A break and close above this resistance will be the first indication that the bears may be losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-did-wazirx-token-wrx-jump-30-after-india-announced-its-big-crypto-tax"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why did WazirX token (WRX) jump 30% after India announced its big crypto tax?}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has remained stuck between $0.13 and $0.15 for the past few days. After failing to break below the support, the price rose to the 20-day EMA ($0.14), which is acting as a stiff resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/a0cb2383-c7fe-4719-8549-77ce5c72d5fa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price has turned down from the 20-day EMA and the bears will again attempt to sink and sustain the DOGE/USDT pair below $0.13. The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par \uc2 If the price slips and sustains below $0.13, the next stop could be $0.10. Conversely, if the price rebounds off $0.13, the pair could extend its range-bound action for a few more days. The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.16) to signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bears to pull Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) below the strong support at $16.81 in the past few days could have attracted buying from the aggressive bulls. This started a relief rally that reached the 20-day EMA ($20.74).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/15bcf272-c68c-401a-a357-751e75a3a055.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The long wick on Feb. 2\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick indicates that bears are aggressively defending the 20-day EMA. The sellers will now make one more attempt to sink and sustain the price below the critical support at $16.81.\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the downtrend could resume and the DOT/USDT pair may drop to the next important support at $10.37.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($24.63).\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) relief rally stalled near the breakdown level at $75.50, indicating that the trend remains down and bears are trying to assert their dominance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/849bcbfb-9d2e-43f8-83ae-0e44653f5bc4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears pull the price below $64, the AVAX/USDT pair could gradually slide toward the critical support at $51.04. This level could again act as a strong support and a rebound off it may result in a range-bound action for a few days.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns up from the current level, the bulls will make one more attempt to push the price above the overhead resistance at $75.50. If they manage to do that, the pair could rally toward the downtrend line of the descending triangle.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDIvMDViNDdiMzktMTE0NC00ODE0LWJlMmItYzBhZTcwODU5Mjg5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220202ei22000e3\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Kiss\par \b \uc2 Kiss this: You can buy Gene Simmons\u8217\'20\'19 Las Vegas mansion with crypto\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Keira Wright \par \uc2 567 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 February 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Kiss bassist and co-lead singer Gene Simmons will accept payments in a number of cryptocurrencies including BTC, ETH, and LTC for the sale of his $13.5 million Las Vegas mansion.\par \par \uc2 Rock legend Gene Simmons says he will accept crypto payments for the sale of his $13.5 million mansion in Las Vegas.\par \par \uc2 The iconic bassist and co-lead singer of Kiss will accept payments in or in a combination of Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ), Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/uniswap-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ), Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ), Aave ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/aave-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AAVE}}}\uc2  ) or Try.Finance, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.blabbermouth.net/news/gene-simmons-says-he-will-accept-cryptocurrency-for-sale-of-his-las-vegas-valley-estate/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according}}}\uc2  to the hard rock news site, Blabber Mouth.\par \par \uc2 Listing broker Evangelina Duke-Petroni from Berkshire Hathaway Home Services {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.reviewjournal.com/business/housing/kiss-gene-simmons-open-to-selling-henderson-mansion-for-cryptocurrency-2522561/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2  the Las Vegas Review-Journal in a Monday interview that any potential crypto payment for the property would have to be \u8220\'20\'1Cverified through closing costs, including taxes and commissions.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The three-level mansion {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.isluxury.com/isluxury-listings/7-talus-court-2/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sprawls}}}\uc2  across over 11,000 square feet in the Ascaya luxury community overlooking the Las Vegas skyline.\par \par \uc2 Rock legend {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/genesimmons?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @GeneSimmons}}}\uc2  is selling his home in Henderson's Ascaya community for $13,500,000 and says he will accept cryptocurrency as payment.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin, Ethereum, \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 , Uniswap, Polkadot, \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 , Aave, Try \u8212\'20\'14 or a combination of those. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/HlTHZkrJfX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/HlTHZkrJfX}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Las Vegas Locally (@LasVegasLocally) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/LasVegasLocally/status/1488716482863243280?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 February 2, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 Although Duke-Petroni didn\u8217\'20\'19t provide any further clarification, she did add the property will \u8220\'20\'1Cbe paid in a currency that\u8217\'20\'19s recognized by traditional standards.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Simmons describes himself as an \u8220\'20\'1Coutspoken proponent of cryptocurrency.\u8221\'20\'1D He said:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt is the future of money, and it just makes sense to offer interested parties the option of using cryptocurrency to purchase the estate."\par \par \uc2 The Demon has been \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the crypto scene for quite some time now. Back in 2017, the Israeli-American musician {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/rock-band-kiss-lead-singer-gene-simmons-says-he-is-bitcoin-fan"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 alluded to his interest in Bitcoin}}}\uc2  during an interview with The Street.\par \par \uc2 He also made headlines back in 2020 with some elusive comments on a tweet from Gemini co-founder Cameron Winklevoss, suggesting that he was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/kiss-front-man-gene-simmons-suggests-he-s-working-to-make-crypto-more-accessible"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 working on making crypto more accessible}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 I will. I am. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/GQJMpDUYCH"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/GQJMpDUYCH}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Gene Simmons (@genesimmons) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/genesimmons/status/1305854146105540613?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 September 15, 2020}}}\par \par \uc2 On February 1, 2021, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/kiss-rocker-gene-simmons-is-bullish-on-doge-and-xrp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/kiss-rocker-gene-simmons-is-\b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22 -on-doge-and-xrp}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/kiss-rocker-gene-simmons-is-bullish-on-doge-and-xrp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Simmons confirmed he owned both Ripple}}}\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) and Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ). Six days later, he returned to \uc2 Twitter\uc2  to share that he had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/snoop-dogg-and-gene-simmons-join-elon-s-musk-s-dogecoin-army"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bought even more DOGE}}}\uc2 , and yet again on Feb. 19, claiming he had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/gene-simmons-says-he-s-added-300k-of-cardano-to-his-bags"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 purchased $300,000 worth of Cardano}}}\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 The rock star has also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/genesimmons/status/1359973082190987267"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 shared}}}\uc2  that he owns $300,000 worth of Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), and $300,000 worth of Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ). However, some members of the crypto community appeared skeptical of Simmon\u8217\'20\'19s rapid-fire crypto endorsements.\par \par \uc2 What happened to DOGE coin? wasn't that your favorite coin some days ago?\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Jaime Cornejo (@Realkaisser) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Realkaisser/status/1362596689505378305?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 February 19, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ceo-of-coinbase-crypto-exchange-reportedly-buys-la-mansion-for-133m"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coinbase CEO reportedly buys LA mansion for $133M}}}\par \par \uc2 Simmons originally purchased the property for $10.8 million in May 2021, before listing it for sale at $14.95 million in October, not even half a year later.\par \par \uc2 He\u8217\'20\'19s not the first celebrity to accept crypto payments for his home. Back in June 2021, DJ David Guetta put his luxury $14 million {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/dj-david-guetta-puts-luxury-miami-pad-up-for-sale-will-accept-38-bitcoin-for-it"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Miami Beach apartment up for sale}}}\uc2  and was accepting payments in BTC and ETH at the time.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDIvNGY4OWMxNTctODVlNS00NTAxLWE0YzMtMTBjZGYyZWQwMDIwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220202ei22000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Kiss\par \b \uc2 Kiss this: You can buy Gene Simmons\u8217\'20\'19 Las Vegas mansion with crypto\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Keira Wright \par \uc2 547 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 February 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Kiss bassist and co-lead singer Gene Simmons will accept payments in a number of cryptocurrencies including BTC, ETH, and LTC for the sale of his $13.5 million Las Vegas mansion.\par \par \uc2 Rock legend Gene Simmons says he will accept crypto payments for the sale of his $13.5 million mansion in Las Vegas.\par \par \uc2 The iconic bassist and co-lead singer of Kiss will accept payments in or a combination of Bitcoin, Ethereum, \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 , Uniswap, Polkadot, Aave or Try.Finance {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.blabbermouth.net/news/gene-simmons-says-he-will-accept-cryptocurrency-for-sale-of-his-las-vegas-valley-estate/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according}}}\uc2  to hard rock news site, Blabber Mouth.\par \par \uc2 Listing broker Evangelina Duke-Petroni from Berkshire Hathaway Home Services {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.reviewjournal.com/business/housing/kiss-gene-simmons-open-to-selling-henderson-mansion-for-cryptocurrency-2522561/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2  the Las Vegas Review-Journal in a Feb 1 interview that any potential crypto payment for the property would have to be \u8220\'20\'1Cverified through closing costs, including taxes and commissions.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The three-level {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.isluxury.com/isluxury-listings/7-talus-court-2/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 mansion}}}\uc2  sprawls across over 11,000 square feet in the Ascaya luxury community overlooking the Las Vegas skyline.\par \par \uc2 Rock legend {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/genesimmons?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @GeneSimmons}}}\uc2  is selling his home in Henderson's Ascaya community for $13,500,000 and says he will accept cryptocurrency as payment.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin, Ethereum, \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 , Uniswap, Polkadot, \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 , Aave, Try \u8212\'20\'14 or a combination of those. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/HlTHZkrJfX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/HlTHZkrJfX}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Las Vegas Locally (@LasVegasLocally) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/LasVegasLocally/status/1488716482863243280?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 February 2, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 Although Duke-Petroni didn\u8217\'20\'19t provide any further clarification, she did add the property will \u8220\'20\'1Cbe paid in a currency that\u8217\'20\'19s recognized by traditional standards.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Simmons describes himself as an \u8220\'20\'1Coutspoken proponent of cryptocurrency.\u8221\'20\'1D He said:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt is the future of money, and it just makes sense to offer interested parties the option of using cryptocurrency to purchase the estate."\par \par \uc2 The Demon has been \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the crypto scene for quite some time now. Back in 2017, the Israeli-American musician {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/rock-band-kiss-lead-singer-gene-simmons-says-he-is-bitcoin-fan"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 alluded to his interest in Bitcoin}}}\uc2  during an interview with The Street.\par \par \uc2 He also made headlines back in 2020 with some elusive comments on a tweet from Gemini co-founder Cameron Winklevoss, suggesting that he was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/kiss-front-man-gene-simmons-suggests-he-s-working-to-make-crypto-more-accessible"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 working on making crypto more accessible}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 I will. I am. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/GQJMpDUYCH"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/GQJMpDUYCH}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Gene Simmons (@genesimmons) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/genesimmons/status/1305854146105540613?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 September 15, 2020}}}\par \par \uc2 On Feb 1 2021, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/kiss-rocker-gene-simmons-is-bullish-on-doge-and-xrp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Simmons tweeted confirming}}}\uc2  he owned both Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) and Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ). Six days later, returned to \uc2 Twitter\uc2  to share that he had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/snoop-dogg-and-gene-simmons-join-elon-s-musk-s-dogecoin-army"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bought even more DOGE}}}\uc2 , and yet again on Feb 19 claiming he had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/gene-simmons-says-he-s-added-300k-of-cardano-to-his-bags"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 purchased $300,000 worth of Cardano}}}\uc2  (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ).\par \par \uc2 The rock star has also shared that he owns $300,000 worth of Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/genesimmons/status/1359973082190987267"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $300,000}}}\uc2  worth of Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ). However, some members of the crypto community appeared skeptical of Simmon\u8217\'20\'19s rapid fire crypto endorsements.\par \par \uc2 What happened to DOGE coin? wasn't that your favorite coin some days ago?\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Jaime Cornejo (@Realkaisser) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Realkaisser/status/1362596689505378305?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 February 19, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ceo-of-coinbase-crypto-exchange-reportedly-buys-la-mansion-for-133m"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coinbase CEO reportedly buys LA mansion for $133M}}}\par \par \uc2 Simmons originally purchased the property for $10.8 million in May 2021, before listing it for sale at $14.95 million in Oct, not even half a year later.\par \par \uc2 He\u8217\'20\'19s not the first celebrity to accept crypto payments for his home. Back in June 2021, DJ David Guetta put his luxury {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/dj-david-guetta-puts-luxury-miami-pad-up-for-sale-will-accept-38-bitcoin-for-it"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $14 million apartment on Miami Beach up for sale}}}\uc2  and was accepting payments in BTC and ETH at the time.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDIvNGY4OWMxNTctODVlNS00NTAxLWE0YzMtMTBjZGYyZWQwMDIwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220202ei2200002\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Decentralized Exchange\par \b \uc2 3 reasons why QuickSwap (QUICK) price spiked by 50%\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Jordan Finneseth \par \uc2 693 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 February 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 QUICK price gained 50% shortly after a partnership with CelsiusX proves that the platform is serious about bridging the gap between DeFi and CeFi.\par \par \uc2 Decentralized finance (DeFi) and the control it gives users over their assets is one of the most applicable sectors of the cryptocurrency ecosystem, but the general public is still hesitant to interact with most DeFi products due to the steep learning curve and the possibility of losing funds.\par \par \uc2 One decentralized exchange (DEX) that is taking strides toward bridging the gap between DeFi and centralized finance (CeFi) is QuickSwap (QUICK), the top ranked DEX on the Polygon network.\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  shows that the price of QUICK saw a rapid 50% spike in value from $166.40 on Jan. 31 to a daily high of $250 on Feb. 1 after its 24-hour trading volume surged by 168%.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/ebde6381-6673-4986-a0a9-4715a925ce9c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 QUICK/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Three reasons for the rapid bounce back in QUICK price include the announcement of a partnership with Celsius, the addition of new high yield liquidity pools and the launch of stable-stable pools that offer a higher yield and decrease the risk of impermanent losses.\par \par \uc2 QuickSwap partners with CelsiusX\par \par \uc2 The most significant recent development for QuickSwap was the announcement that the DEX partnered with CelsiusX, the DeFi arm of the Celsius banking and financial services platform that is focused on integrating CeFi and DeFi.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/DeFi?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #DeFi}}}\uc2  is about to get a lot more interesting\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CelsiusXDeFi?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @CelsiusXDeFi}}}\uc2  x QuickSwap x {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/0xPolygon?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @0xPolygon}}}\par \par \uc2 \u10084\'27\'64\u65039\'FE\'0F\u8205\'20\'0DNow THAT is progress {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CelsiusNetwork?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @CelsiusNetwork}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24MATIC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $MATIC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24QUICK&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $QUICK}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/jgn4GZQFLX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/jgn4GZQFLX}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 QuickSwap (@QuickswapDEX) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/QuickswapDEX/status/1481340207718752257?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 January 12, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 Partnering with QuickSwap also allows for the creation of wrapped versions of popular tokens like Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  and Dogecoin (DOGE), which do not currently have a major presence on Polygon, along with well-funded liquidity pools for these assets so that users, bots, arbitrageurs and institutions have easy access to that token.\par \par \uc2 This also provides DOGE and \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  holders with added ways to use their assets in DeFi to earn a yield instead of simply holding their DOGE or staking their \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 New liquidity pools could attract a new breed of investor\par \par \uc2 A second factor helping to bolster the price and momentum of QUICK has been the launch of multiple new liquidity and \u8216\'20\'18syrup\u8217\'20\'19 pools. This could be a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign, especially when considering that a handful of projects launched and integrated bridges to the Polygon network in January.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-02/d4b52531-7997-49d0-b407-dc7964ed365e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Aside from the addition of support for DeFi protocols like Atlantis Loans or the layer-one blockchain solution Orbs (ORBS), QuickSwap has seen a flurry of added support for nonfungible tokens (NFT) projects, which have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/nfts-are-stayin-alive-as-new-minting-trends-ai-and-music-based-projects-thrive"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 once again been gaining momentum}}}\uc2  despite the wider weakness in the cryptocurrency market.\par \par \uc2 Some of the newly supported NFT projects on QuickSwap include the UniArts network, Dogira, OneRare and Blockchain Monsters Hunt.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/1b-worth-of-eth-burned-in-the-past-30-days-due-to-record-high-opensea-nft-transactions"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $1B worth of ETH burned in the past 30 days due to record high OpenSea NFT transactions}}}\par \par \uc2 New staking options for stablecoin holders\par \par \uc2 A third factor helping to attract users and liquidity to the QuickSwap DEX is attractive yields for liquidity providers of stablecoin-stablecoin pairs.\par \par \uc2 Yielding on stables sound good?\par \par \uc2 \u9878\'26\'96\u65039\'FE\'0FQuickSwap offers several stable-stable pools where LPs can earn over 14% {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/APY?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #APY}}}\uc2  & balance risk of Impermanent Loss\par \par \uc2 If yielding on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24USDC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $USDC}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24USDT&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $USDT}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24MAI&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $MAI}}}\uc2  & {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24DAI&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $DAI}}}\uc2  while earning {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24dQUICK&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $dQUICK}}}\uc2  rewards sounds like your jam: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/Ac4PagsDsY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/Ac4PagsDsY}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/uRMQ8C790G"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/uRMQ8C790G}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 QuickSwap (@QuickswapDEX) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/QuickswapDEX/status/1485620011825713158?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 January 24, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 These pools provide users with an opportunity to earn a decent yield while also decreasing the risk of impermanent loss associated with other types of liquidity pools.\par \par \uc2 This could also present more attractive stablecoin yields for depositors on the Celsius network and increase the overall liquidity locked on the QuickSwap protocol.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDIvYjk5MjFhZmEtZDAxNi00MmMwLTk3MDAtYjYxNzlkYzhiZjVhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220202ei2100008\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 CoinShares\par \b \uc2 Is the bottom in? Institutional crypto funds record second week of inflows\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Sam Bourgi \par \uc2 354 \uc2 words\par \uc2 31 January 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  funds recorded heavy outflows at the start of 2022, but the tide appears to be slowly shifting.\par \par \uc2 After recording heavy outflows at the start of 2022, cryptocurrency investment funds have seen a gradual uptick in investor demand over the past two weeks, offering cautious optimism that the worst of the market downturn had passed.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  investment products saw $19 million worth of cumulative inflows last week, according to \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 . Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and multi-asset funds led the gains with $22 million and $32 million worth of inflows, respectively.\par \par \uc2 The news wasn\u8217\'20\'19t all positive, as Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) continued to suffer from negative sentiment with outflows totaling $27 million. That marked eight consecutive weekly outflows for ETH-focused funds. Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ), Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) and Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) products also registered outflows for the week.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  products have seen heavy outflows since December, as institutional investors took profits and reduced their positions amid extreme selloffs in the market. So far this year, Bitcoin funds have seen a net $131.8 million worth of outflows, according to \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  data. Ether ) funds have seen $111.2 million worth of drawdowns.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price rose to as high as $38,778 on Monday, according to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.235324995.390825259.1639680713-68533732.1612103760"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2 . However, the flagship cryptocurrency is down over 20% in January, marking its worst start to the year since 2018.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-down-20-so-far-in-2022-after-worst-january-since-2018"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price down 20% so far in 2022 after worst January since 2018}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/c0144733-69f0-4f68-9f23-8e9401f4f569.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 The Crypto Fear & Greed Index, which monitors market sentiment using several sources, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://alternative.me/crypto/fear-and-greed-index/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 remains}}}\uc2  in a state of \u8220\'20\'1Cextreme fear\u8221\'20\'1D with a reading of 20. The index, which sides along a scale of 1 to 100, plunged as low as 13 last week.\par \par \uc2 Nevertheless, net inflows into Bitcoin and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/vaneck-launches-its-first-multi-token-cryptocurrency-fund"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 multi-coin funds}}}\uc2  suggest that institutional money is slowly returning to the market. While traders remain at odds over {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/no-signs-bitcoin-has-bottomed-as-data-warns-btc-price-downtrend-continuing"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 whether the market has actually bottomed}}}\uc2 , long-term investors posit that a sub-$40,000 Bitcoin is an attractive buy opportunity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDEvYzBiMGY4ZmEtNTVjNi00ZWMwLWI1OGEtYWZiNjY2MzZiYjhiLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220131ei1v000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/31: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, XRP, LUNA, DOGE, DOT, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,797 \uc2 words\par \uc2 31 January 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC and altcoins are attempting to end January on a positive note by overcoming overhead resistance levels as Bitcoin aims to flip $40,000 back to support.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) started 2022 on a losing note, dropping about 20% to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-down-20-so-far-in-2022-after-worst-january-since-2018"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 its worst performance in January since 2018}}}\uc2  when the price plunged 26.61%, according to on-chain analytics resource Coinglass.\par \par \uc2 Now, all eyes turn to February, which has historically favored the bulls. The only two negative closes in February were in 2020 and 2014.\par \par \uc2 One positive sign during the recent price decline has been that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-crypto-executive-order-looms-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long-term hodlers have not panicked}}}\uc2 . Glassnode data shows that the number of coins that last moved between five and seven years ago surged to a new all-time high.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/9d0b03cf-0b51-4b36-97d6-4f749f75266f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 El Salvador's President Nayib Bukele projected a \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/el-salvador-president-predicts-gigantic-price-increase-for-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 gigantic price increase}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D for Bitcoin. Bukele\u8217\'20\'19s prediction is based on the fact that if the millionaires of the world, who are more than 50 million in number, want to buy at least one Bitcoin, there isn\u8217\'20\'19t enough supply to fulfill that demand.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and the major altcoins end the month on a strong note? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has pulled back in a strong downtrend. In a sliding market, the sentiment is to sell on rallies rather than buy the dips as traders make more money on the downside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/9f38f012-748d-4ebd-a3c9-5db9e046736f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The first sign of a change in sentiment will be a break and close above the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($39,318). Such a move will indicate that demand exceeds the supply near the 20-day EMA resistance. The BTC/USDT pair could then march toward the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($43,791).\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears are defending this level aggressively. The pair could then dip to $35,507.01. If this support cracks, the selling could pick up and the price could retest the Jan. 24 low at $32,917.17.\par \par \uc2 This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if it cracks, the pair could plummet to the strong support at $30,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) is facing resistance near the breakdown level at $2,652 but a minor positive is that bulls have not given up much ground. This suggests that traders are buying the dips as seen from the long tail on Jan. 31\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/4c342bc7-b487-4b5d-871a-8b7c8b89003a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now again try to push the price above $2,652 and the critical resistance at the 20-day EMA ($2,802). If they succeed, it will suggest that the selling pressure could be reducing. The bulls will then see an opening and attempt to push the pair to the resistance line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA, the bears will attempt to pull the ETH/USDT pair to the $2,300 to $2,159 support zone. The bears will have to sink and sustain the price below this zone to clear the path for a further decline to $1,700.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) re-entered the channel on Jan. 25, but the recovery faltered near $400. This suggests that the bears have not yet given up and are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/c82ca4d2-0251-4586-9950-4270465307fe.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears sink and sustain the price below the channel, the BNB/USDT pair could again retest the critical support zone at $330 to $320. The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that sellers hold the edge.\par \par \uc2 The pair could plummet to $250 if the $320 support gives way as several traders are likely to panic and rush to the exit. This negative view will invalidate in the short-term on a break and close above the 20-day EMA. The pair could then rise to the resistance line of the channel.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to secure a meaningful rebound off the psychological support at $1 indicates a lack of aggressive buying at this level. The bears will now attempt to build upon their advantage and sink Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) below $1.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/a9c6e889-a78c-4f21-ba13-7d4317de34ba.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping down and the RSI is in the negative zone, indicating that the bears are in command. A break and close below $1 could signal the start of the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could first drop to $0.80 and then to the support line of the channel. The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the resistance line of the channel to signal a change in trend.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating in a tight range between $80.83 and $104.82 for the past few days. The bulls tried to push the price above the range but failed and now the bears will try to grab the opportunity and attempt to pull the altcoin below $80.83.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/6cd0a79f-0291-4fa0-876c-69f2383a3ce6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the SOL/USDT pair could resume its downtrend. The pair could first drop to the support line of the channel where the bulls may attempt to arrest the decline. If they fail in their endeavor, the pair could plunge to $66.03.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off $80.83, the pair may extend its stay inside the range for a few more days. The buyers may gain strength if they push and sustain the pair above the breakdown level at $116.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating between $0.54 and $0.65 for the past few days. After failing to cross above the overhead resistance, the price could now drop to the support of the range.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/aa2f441d-6692-4651-b344-93b2959fac38.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the oversold territory indicate advantage to bears. The critical level to watch on the downside is $0.54 because if it cracks, the XRP/USDT pair could drop to $0.50.\par \par \uc2 This level is likely to act as a strong support as a break and close below it could lead to panic selling. On the upside, a break and close above the 20-day EMA ($0.66) will be the first sign that bulls are on a comeback.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token is struggling to sustain the rebound off the support line of the descending channel. This indicates that sentiment is negative and demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/e0c26663-3360-42b6-b2e4-ba687f57e7ba.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the bounce again fails to sustain the higher levels, the sellers may smell an opportunity and try to sink the LUNA/USDT pair below the channel. If they succeed, the pair could drop to $37.50, which may act as strong support.\par \par \uc2 If the current rebound sustains, the bulls will try to start a relief rally, which could reach the 20-day EMA ($63). If the price turns down from this resistance, the pair could again turn toward $37.50. Alternatively, if bulls push the pair above the 20-day EMA, the rally could reach the downtrend line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-price-risks-dropping-to-2k-on-bear-flag-setup"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum price risks dropping to $2K on \u8216\'20\'18bear flag\u8217\'20\'19 setup}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating between $0.13 and $0.15 for the past few days. This suggests that bulls are buying near the support but have not succeeded in pushing the price above the overhead resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/00f6f22a-1adc-4d31-9adb-7501592608dd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A minor positive is that the RSI has formed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence indicating that the selling pressure may be reducing. However, if buyers fail to drive the price above $0.15, the bears may regroup and again attempt to pull the DOGE/USDT pair below the support.\par \par \uc2 A close below $0.13 could result in further selling, driving the pair to the psychological level at $0.10. The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.16) to ward off the short-term threat from the bears.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) weak rebound off the strong support at $16.81 indicates a lack of buying at current levels. The downsloping moving averages and the RSI near the oversold territory indicate the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/a6d0ea23-5a2c-4541-8718-e625b57e0eb8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears sink and sustain the price below the $16.81 to $15.83 support zone, it will indicate the resumption of the downtrend. The DOT/USDT pair could then drop toward the strong support at $10.37.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rises from the current level, the bulls will make one more effort to propel the pair above the 20-day EMA ($20.98). If they succeed, the pair could rise to the breakout level at $22.66 where the bears may pose a strong challenge.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) is facing stiff resistance at the breakdown level at $75.50, which suggests that the sentiment remains negative and bears are selling on rallies. The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that bears have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/23406a94-3cc8-45e7-9643-d4f54de168e2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sellers will now try to sink the price below the immediate support at $61.06. If they manage to do that, the AVAX/USDT pair could drop to the strong support zone at $51.04 to $47.66. The bulls are likely to defend this zone with vigor.\par \par \uc2 A strong bounce off the support zone could brighten the prospects of a bottoming formation with the price remaining stuck between $47.66 and $75.50 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above $75.50. Alternatively, a drop below $47.66 could signal the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDEvY2VmY2NjZjctZTBlNy00MjhjLTg4YmEtY2E3MTgyYzI5YjQyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220131ei1v000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/28: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, XRP, LUNA, DOGE, DOT, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,751 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 January 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Technical analysis points toward early bottoming signs in BTC and altcoins, but analysts forecast another sharp downside move.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and most major altcoins are turning down from overhead resistance levels, indicating that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on every available opportunity.\par \par \uc2 Decentrader analyst Philip Swift said that the on-chain spent profit output ratio (SOPR) metric, which aggregates the price of purchase versus price sold during a given period, indicates that traders are {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bull-or-bear-market-bitcoin-losses-from-panic-selling-mount-in-2022"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 selling their Bitcoin holdings for a loss}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Another metric that is worrying traders is the funding rates, which has further {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-analysts-fear-new-btc-price-dip-as-funding-rates-drop-post-fed"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 slipped into the negative territory}}}\uc2  following comments by the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2 . Crypto research firm Delph Digital expects Bitcoin to \u8220\'20\'1Cmake a lower low after recently testing the $34K level."\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/eb86b428-964f-49f3-8330-50baef43442f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Among several \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  projections, there was an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/eth-to-hit-20-trillion-market-cap-by-2030-ark-invest"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 uber \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  long-term forecast}}}\uc2  by Cathy Wood\u8217\'20\'19s Ark Invest. The report projected Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price to cross $1 million by 2030 and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) to reach between $170,000 to $180,000 during the same period.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and most major altcoins bottom out near current levels? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is facing stiff resistance in the overhead zone between $37,332.70 to $39,600. This suggests that bears are unwilling to let go of their advantage and are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/c785994a-7cda-4eb1-970d-1527ac4e39e2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The pullback of the past few days has resolved the oversold levels in the relative strength index (RSI). The bears will now attempt to resume the downtrend by pulling the BTC/USDT pair below $32,917.17. If they succeed, the next stop could be $30,000.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above $37,332.70, it will suggest accumulation at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 The buyers will then attempt to push the price above the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($39,714) and challenge the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($44,428). A break and close above this resistance will signal that the downtrend could be over.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether surged above the overhead resistance at $2,652 on Jan. 26 but the bears sold aggressively at higher levels and pulled the price back below the channel.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/5f4c9419-9fae-4129-87d8-73573de917f2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Since then, buyers have struggled to push the price back inside the channel. The bears will now try to resume the downtrend by pulling the price below the Jan. 24 intraday low at $2,159. If they succeed, the ETH/USDT pair could drop to $2,000 and then to $1,700.\par \par \uc2 The RSI is stuck inside the oversold zone for the past few days, suggesting that the selling may have been overdone in the near term. Therefore, the bulls may again attempt a relief rally, which could reach the 20-day EMA ($2,856).\par \par \uc2 This is an important hurdle for the bulls to cross because the previous three relief rallies had turned down from the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the $330 support and re-entered the descending channel on Jan. 25 but the bulls are struggling to push the price toward the 20-day EMA ($424). This suggests a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/cd3f4262-edef-4475-aeda-8ab6082d2dda.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will sense an opportunity and try to pull the price back toward the strong support zone at $330 to $320. This is an important zone for the bulls to defend because if it cracks, the BNB/USDT pair could plummet to $250.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rises from the current level, the bulls will try to thrust the pair above the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the pair could rally to the resistance line of the channel. A break and close above the channel will signal that the downtrend could be over.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the psychological support at $1 for the past few days. This suggests that bulls are defending the support but have failed to push the price higher.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/66e2c405-4063-4af6-8815-3e2cf2046f60.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative territory suggest that the path of least resistance is to the downside. If bears sink and sustain the price below $1, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to $0.80.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate in the short term if the price bounces off the current level and breaks above the moving averages. The pair could then test the resistance line of the channel. The bulls will have to clear this barrier to signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been trading close to the support line of the descending channel for the past few days. This suggests that bulls are defending the support line but haven't been able to achieve a strong rebound off it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/6f738ee2-c9b0-4c3d-bc5b-e013063cb810.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The RSI has been trading in the oversold territory for the past few days, signaling that the correction may have been overdone in the short term. This indicates the possibility of a consolidation or minor pullback in the next few days.\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the SOL/USDT pair could rise to the 20-day EMA ($118). A break and close above this level could clear the path for a possible rally to the resistance line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 This short-term positive view will invalidate if the price turns down and dives below the channel. The pair could then drop to $66.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls attempted to push Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $0.65 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bears are in no mood to relent.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/27d0e334-fef3-481e-9b53-ec80b97be9d0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping down and the RSI is in the oversold territory, indicating that bears are in command. The sellers will now attempt to sink the XRP/USDT pair below $0.54 and challenge the psychological support at $0.50.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if bulls push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.68). Such a move will be the first sign that the selling pressure could be reducing. The pair may then rally to the overhead resistance at $0.75.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token has again slipped to the support line of the descending channel. This suggests that traders continue to sell on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/f59b33ed-61c4-4dfc-ac85-942b985de14d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($68.8) and the RSI near the oversold territory indicate that bears have the upper hand. If bears sink the price below the support line of the channel, the selling could intensify and the LUNA/USDT pair may plummet to $37.82.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off the current level, the bulls will make one more attempt to push the pair to the 20-day EMA. This level is again likely to act as a stiff resistance but if the bulls overcome it, the pair may rally to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/defying-the-bear-market-this-automated-strategy-is-up-15-so-far-in-2022"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Defying the bear market, this automated strategy is up 15% so far in 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($0.15) on Jan. 26, indicating that bears are selling near this overhead resistance. The price is back inside the tight range at $0.15 to $0.13.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/20052428-c1fb-43d2-bf6f-9f101a7ce64e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 While the downsloping 20-day EMA indicates advantage to bears, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence on the RSI suggests that the selling pressure could be reducing. This state of uncertainty is unlikely to continue for long.\par \par \uc2 If bulls push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, the DOGE/USDT pair could rise toward the overhead resistance at $0.19. Conversely, if the price slips and closes below $0.13, the pair could drop to the psychological support at $0.10.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the strong support at $16.81 for the past few days but a minor negative is that the bulls have not been able to achieve a powerful rebound off it. This indicates a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/a8c55c0c-3517-442d-aafb-e0a02f2ceca0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to pull and sustain the price below $16.81. If they manage to do that, the selling could intensify and the DOT/USDT pair may drop toward the next major support at $10.37. The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the oversold zone suggest the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bulls drive the price above $20.16, it will suggest a pick-up in demand. The pair may then rise to the 50-day SMA ($25.44). This is an important level to watch out for because a break above it will signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long wick on Avalanche\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) Jan. 26 candlestick shows that bears are defending the breakdown level at $75.50. The bears will now try to pull the price to the strong support at $51.04.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/4a011dd9-fe57-4be3-9ba9-daa2f8ba3ce8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $51.04, it will suggest that bulls are buying on dips to this level. That could keep the AVAX/USDT pair range-bound between $75.50 and $51.04 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above $75.50 will be the first indication that the correction could be over. The pair could then rise to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price breaks below $47.66, the next leg of the downtrend could begin. Until then, the pair could remain volatile inside the range.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDEvZWUzNmRmMDEtZTY5OC00M2NlLWJiZjItZjQyNDcxYTgzZjA3LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220128ei1s000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/26: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, XRP, LUNA, DOGE, DOT, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,754 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 January 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC and altcoins are in a strong relief rally, but overhead resistance levels and expected comments from the Fed could impact the recovery.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and most major altcoins have bounced off their strong support levels but could the rally sustain to the extent that traders feel confident that a bottom is in place?\par \par \uc2 Bloomberg Intelligence senior commodity strategist Mike McGlone said that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price is \u8220\'20\'1Cabout 30% below its 20-week moving average,\u8221\'20\'1D roughly at the same position, which had led to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-pundits-split-over-btc-floor-as-bloomberg-analyst-eyes-bounce"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bottom formations in March 2020 and July 2021}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Although Bitcoin has corrected sharply in January, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/stop-panic-selling-bitcoin-whales-bag-spare-btc-as-exchange-balances-fall"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 exchanges\u8217\'20\'19 balances dropped}}}\uc2  from 2.428 million Bitcoin on December 28 to 2.366 million Bitcoin on Jan. 24, according to data from CryptoQuant. This indicates that investors may be stashing away their recent purchases safely.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/a97935b5-abfe-4001-9f81-d5c2568f145e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, it may not be a V-shaped recovery for Bitcoin as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-holds-onto-10-gains-ahead-of-crucial-fed-rate-hike-comments"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22volatility\b0 \highlight22  is likely to remain high}}}\uc2 . Traders will keenly watch the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s decision following the conclusion of its two-day policy meeting on Jan. 26.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and most major altcoins extend their relief rally? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s Jan. 24 candlestick shows aggressive buying at lower levels. Sustained buying by the bulls has propelled the price above the immediate resistance at $37,332.70.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/8ce50222-e29e-4ce0-a1f5-291537f65171.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair could now reach the 20-day exponential moving average ($40,438), which has been acting as a strong resistance during relief rallies. If the price turns down from this resistance, the bears will try to pull the pair below $32,917.17. If they succeed, the pair could drop to the strong support at $30,000.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price breaks above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rally to the 50-day simple moving average ($44,935). A break and close above this resistance will be the first sign that the corrective phase could be over. The pair could then challenge the 200-day SMA ($48,750).\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) sharply bounced off $2,159 on Jan. 24, as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. This suggests that bulls are aggressively buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/a604b71b-79e3-4fcf-9a35-079c605557f6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Sustained buying has pushed the price back into the channel today. This is the first sign of strength. The buyers will now attempt to push and sustain the price above the overhead resistance at $2,652.\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the ETH/USDT pair could rise to the 20-day EMA ($2,966). The bears are likely to mount a strong defense of this level.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. The bears will then again try to resume the downtrend by pulling the pair below $2,159.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) rebounded sharply off the $330 support on Jan. 24 as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. This suggests that buyers are aggressively accumulating near $330.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/f83d4225-eaa9-4661-98a2-1418099320da.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price back inside the channel on Jan. 25 and will now attempt to drive the BNB/USDT pair to the 20-day EMA ($435). If this hurdle is overcome, the pair could rally to the resistance line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that traders continue to sell on rallies. The bears will then again try to sink the pair below the strong support zone at $330 to $320.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is attempting to bounce off the strong support at $1, indicating that bulls are buying on dips to this level. The relief rally could now reach the 50-day SMA ($1.28).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/00f1c699-5c55-4a50-8d1d-4f1d97e77c1b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls thrust the price above the 50-day SMA, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to the resistance line of the descending channel. A break and close above the channel will signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the moving averages, it will suggest that bears continue to sell on rallies to strong resistance levels. The bears will then again attempt to sink and sustain the price below $1. If they succeed, the pair could decline to $0.80.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls again successfully defended the support line of the descending channel on Jan. 24 as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. If bulls push the price above $104.82, Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) could reach the 20-day EMA ($125).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/a79b42a9-3f46-4818-b430-8f1fdb648801.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the 20-day EMA will be the first sign that the selling pressure could be reducing. The SOL/USDT pair could then rise to the resistance line of the descending channel. The bulls will have to push the price above the channel to signal a change in trend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears continue to sell on rallies. The bears will then again try to sink the pair below the channel. If they succeed, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up and the pair could drop to the psychological support at $50.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside a tight range between $0.65 and $0.54 for the past few days. This suggests that both bulls and bears are playing it safe and not waging large bets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/991fc853-7355-4c79-a830-add88d347116.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.70) and the relative strength index (RSI) near the oversold territory indicate that bears have the upper hand. If the price turns down from $0.64, the XRP/USDT pair could plummet to the psychological support at $0.50.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if bulls drive the price above $0.64, the pair could challenge the 20-day EMA. A break and close above this resistance could open the gates for a rise to the 50-day SMA ($0.79). The bulls will have to clear this hurdle to signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token continues to trade inside the descending channel pattern. The downsloping 20-day EMA ($73) and the RSI in the negative zone indicate an advantage to sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/9e4ebf23-92c8-428c-ad79-4139664fd10d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears pull the price below $59.13, the LUNA/USDT pair could again drop to the support line of the channel. This level has held during the previous two declines, hence the bulls will again try to defend it.\par \par \uc2 If they do, the pair could rise to the 20-day EMA and then rally toward the downtrend line of the channel. A break and close above the channel will be the first sign that the downtrend could be over.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/can-defi-and-cefi-coexist-three-takeaways-from-experts-panel"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Can DeFi and CeFi coexist? Three takeaways from experts panel}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The buyers once again purchased the dip below $0.13 on Jan. 24 as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. This started a relief rally, pushing Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) to the 20-day EMA ($0.15).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/4e073673-771e-4af2-8478-02fa759014af.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls drive the price above the moving averages, the DOGE/USDT pair could rally to the critical overhead resistance at $0.19. If the price turns down from this resistance, the pair could extend its stay inside the $0.19 to $0.13 range for the next few days.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the moving averages, it will suggest that demand dries up at higher levels. The bears will then try to pull and sustain the price below $0.13. If they do that, the pair could resume its decline to the psychological support at $0.10.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls have successfully held Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) above the critical support at $16.81 for the past few days. This could attract further buying by short-term traders propelling the price toward the breakdown level at $22.66.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/dc1b6c7f-4b89-46b6-af2f-be606258f02d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($22.77) is sloping down and the RSI is in the negative zone, indicating that bears have the upper hand. The DOT/USDT pair is likely to face stiff resistance at this level.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will again try to pull the pair to $16.81. If this support holds, the pair could remain range-bound for a few days.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below $16.81 could start the next leg of the downtrend while a break above the 50-day SMA ($25.88) may open the doors for a possible rally to $32.78.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bears to sink Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) below the $51.04 to $47.66 support zone may have attracted buying from aggressive bulls who have pushed the price above the 200-day SMA ($65).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/9d170b1a-5b8f-4716-b3e8-fbc44cc5e756.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The AVAX/USDT pair could now rise to the breakdown level at $75.50 where the bears may mount a stiff resistance. This is an important level to watch out for as the 20-day EMA ($80) is placed just above it.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the breakdown level, the bears will try to pull the pair below the 200-day SMA. If they succeed, the pair could again drop to $51.04. Alternatively, a break and close above the 20-day EMA could open the gates for a possible rally to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDEvNTkzYzczNWYtN2M5YS00ZTliLTlmZmMtOWQ0ODU4YWVhZjE0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220126ei1q000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/24: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, XRP, LUNA, DOGE, DOT, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,786 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 January 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and most altcoins have fallen to key support levels, but traders lack the confidence to chase after an oversold bounce.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and most major altcoins are struggling to find a bottom, indicating that traders are dumping their positions out of fear. The big question on everyone\u8217\'20\'19s mind is whether the selling is over or could the decline continue?\par \par \uc2 UTXO Management senior analyst Dylan LeClair highlighted that the network cost basis, the average price at which Bitcoin was last moved by various investors, is $24,000 and historically, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/illiquid-supply-going-up-relentlessly-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the ratio of cost basis to price}}}\uc2  has bottomed out below 1.0.\par \par \uc2 If history were to repeat itself, Bitcoin may have to fall some more to make it an attractive buy according to the metric.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/34440503-0e72-4bd7-bab7-f7ec57c41ca3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Long-term investors don\u8217\'20\'19t seem to be perturbed by the recent correction in Bitcoin. Glassnode data suggests that investors continue to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/illiquid-supply-going-up-relentlessly-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 withdraw their coins to cold storage}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin illiquid supply is going up relentlessly,\u8221\'20\'1D said Lex Moskovski, chief investment officer of Moskovski Capital.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and most major altcoins are nearing strong support levels. Could investors use their opportunity to buy or will the bears prevail? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been trading below the $39,600 to $37,332.70 zone for the past two days. The buyers attempted a relief rally on Jan. 23 but could not even challenge the overhead resistance at $37,332.70. This indicates weak demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/264e0420-26c6-4ac9-85a8-d1d31d227220.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling renewed on Jan. 24 and the bears pulled the BTC/USDT pair below the Jan. 22 intraday low at $34,008. The next support on the downside is the critical zone between $30,000 and $28,805.\par \par \uc2 The oversold level on the relative strength index (RSI) suggests that the selling may be overdone in the short term. This could attract buying from traders near the support zone. If the price rebounds off this zone, the bulls will try to push the pair above $39,600.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($40,835) will be the first indication that the bears may be losing their grip. A trend change may be signaled after the price rises and sustains above the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($45,404).\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) plummeted and closed below the descending channel on Jan. 21, indicating an increase in selling pressure. The bulls tried to push the price back into the channel on Jan. 23 but failed.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/2a530db7-ba0a-4a8d-bab6-d607f528e696.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This renewed the selling pressure on Jan. 24 and bears have pulled the price below the Jan. 22 intraday low at $2,300. The ETH/USDT pair could now decline to the psychological level at $2,000 where the buyers may provide support.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this level, the bulls will again try to push the price back into the channel. If they succeed, the pair could rise to the breakdown level at $2,652. Conversely, if the price breaks below $2,000, the pair could slide to the next major support at $1,700.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) plummeted below the support line of the descending channel on Jan. 21 and follow-up selling on Jan. 22 pulled the price toward the strong support zone at $330 to $320.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/e1ca1a0e-2186-4d86-9daa-052502a352e1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers attempted a relief rally on Jan. 23 but the bears did not allow the price to re-enter into the channel. This indicates that bears are defending the support line of the channel. The selling resumed on Jan. 24 and the bears will try to sink the price below the support zone.\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below $320, the BNB/USDT pair could slide to $254.50 and then to the next support at $225.40. The first sign of strength will be a break and close inside the channel. The pair could then attempt a rally to the 20-day EMA ($443).\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke below the strong support at $1 on Jan. 22 but the long tail on the candlestick shows that bulls purchased the dip and defended the level successfully.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/2c4efd37-de5b-4284-bbc9-774cef2864b6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, a minor negative is that the bounce off $1 could not even reach the 20-day EMA ($1.24). This suggests that bears are pouncing on minor relief rallies and not waiting for higher levels to sell.\par \par \uc2 The bears again pulled the price below $1 on Jan. 24. If they sustain the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair below this level, the selling momentum could pick up. The pair could then decline to $0.80 and later to the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) nosedived below the $116 support on Jan. 21 and the price reached the support line of the descending channel on Jan. 22. Although bulls defended this level, they could not push the price to the breakdown level at $116. This indicates that buying dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/645ce00d-c871-42ce-98cd-151aeb84ae44.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears resumed their selling on Jan. 24 and are attempting to sink the SOL/USDT pair below the support line of the channel. If they succeed, the selling could pick up momentum and the pair may drop to $66 and later to $58.\par \par \uc2 The incessant selling of the past few days has pushed the RSI below 22. This indicates that selling may have been overdone in the short term and a relief rally is possible. The first level to watch on the upside is $116 and then the 20-day EMA ($131).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) broke below the Dec. 4 intraday low at $0.60 on Jan. 22. There was an attempt by the bulls to start a relief rally on Jan. 23 but it did not find any takers at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/f09172f0-edc9-47e7-a5ed-8f5affe8b410.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling resumed on Jan. 24 and the bears are trying to pull the price to the psychological level at $0.50. This is an important support for the bulls to defend because if it cracks, the XRP/USDT pair could slide to $0.39.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off the $0.50 support, the bulls will attempt to push the pair to the 20-day EMA ($0.72). A break and close above this resistance could signal that the selling pressure may be reducing.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token rebounded off the support line of the descending channel on Jan. 22, but the recovery hit a wall at $70.22 on Jan. 23. This suggests that bears have not given up and are actively selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/236c8979-fe87-4be2-b7bf-bb3054e13b87.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is in the negative territory, indicating that bears have the upper hand. The sellers will now try to pull the price to the support line.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this line once again, the possibility of a move back to the downtrend line increases. Alternatively, if bears sink and sustain the price below the channel, the selling could intensify and the pair may plummet to $37.82.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-enters-value-zone-as-btc-price-floor-metric-goes-green-again"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin \u8216\'20\'18enters value zone\u8217\'20\'19 as BTC price floor metric goes green again}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) plummeted below the strong support at $0.13 on Jan. 22 but the long tail on the candlestick shows buying at lower levels. The buyers attempted to start a recovery on Jan. 23, but higher levels attracted selling.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/67069c86-a75c-4165-bb5d-06dfcb284922.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price turned down on Jan. 24 and the bears are attempting to pull and sustain the DOGE/USDT pair below the $0.13 support. If they succeed, the pair could start its slide toward the psychological level at $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level, the bulls will again try to push the pair to the 20-day EMA ($0.15). A break and close above the 50-day SMA ($0.16) could keep the $0.13 to $0.19 range into play.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) plummeted below the critical support at $22.66 on Jan. 21 and reached the next support at $16.81 on Jan. 22. Although bulls defended this level, they could not extend the relief rally on Jan. 23. This indicates a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/7893ff32-79ba-4665-9dfb-936e47c12aac.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears resumed their selling on Jan. 24 and are attempting to sustain the DOT/USDT pair below $16.81. If they do that, the pair could extend its decline to the next major support at $10.37.\par \par \uc2 The sharp selling of the past few days has pushed the RSI into the oversold territory. This suggests that the selling may have been overdone in the short term and a relief rally could be possible.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level and rises above $19.20, the pair could rally to $22.66.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) plunged and closed below the $75.50 support on Jan. 21, completing a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern. The bulls defended the $51.04 support on Jan. 22 but could not push and sustain the price above the 200-day SMA ($65) on Jan. 23.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/c13ed11b-c89b-4dbc-beb2-25dba8e8b63a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This suggests that bears continue to sell on minor rallies. The bears have resumed their selling as of Jan. 24 and will try to pull the AVAX/USDT pair below the strong support zone at $51.04 to $47.66. If they succeed, the pair could plummet to $32.23.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the support zone, it will indicate accumulation at lower levels. The bulls will then attempt to push the pair to the breakdown level at $75.50, which is an important level to watch out for.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDEvMTBmZTI1ZjItNTE3OS00NzNkLTg1ZjAtZTQxYWE0MzdlZjBjLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220124ei1o000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 Indonesia\u8217\'20\'19s crypto industry in 2021: A kaleidoscope\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Anisa Giovanny \par \uc2 1,172 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 January 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Indonesia reportedly has the seventh-largest crypto user base.\par \par \uc2 In 2021, the number of global crypto holders has been estimated to have increased by 3.9% to more than 300 million crypto users worldwide, with more than 18,000 businesses already accepting cryptocurrencies as payment. India is currently in the lead with 100 million users, followed by the United States with 27 million users and Russia with 17 million users.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://triple-a.io/crypto-ownership/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 According}}}\uc2  to data from Triple A, Indonesia has the seventh-largest crypto user base, below Brazil and Pakistan. It is estimated that there are 7.2 million Indonesians who own cryptocurrencies, while according to the Indonesian Blockchain Association, as of July 2021, the number of crypto owners in Indonesia is 7.4 million people, an increase of 85% from 2020. This number is significantly more than the number of stock investors in Indonesia with only 2.7 million investors, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnnindonesia.com/ekonomi/20210421170028-92-632977/di-indonesia-investor-bitcoin-dkk-ungguli-investor-saham"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 based}}}\uc2  on data from the \uc2 Indonesia Stock Exchange\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/0527d460-56b4-44a1-9b3a-0e0f07422cba.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 The total population of Indonesia in June was 272 million people, which means that only 2.7% of the Indonesian population owns crypto. This shows that there is still room for the crypto industry to grow, develop and reach more corners of Indonesian society.\par \par \uc2 The rapid growth of crypto investors in Indonesia is partly the result of Indonesian regulators that have welcomed crypto and blockchain developments with open arms. Throughout 2021, there have been many discussions with officials, new crypto regulations and developments in the sector.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/3a13516a-ec10-4126-891e-9f9f11bab676.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 According to Dhila Rizqia, head of growth at local industry media firm Coinvestasi, the growing number of Indonesian crypto investors is also reflected in the rise of the crypto media. \u8220\'20\'1CIn 2021, Coinvestasi has gained a lot of new audiences across our channels, including \uc2 Instagram\uc2  and \uc2 YouTube\uc2  which have grown over 1,787% and 1,388%, respectively.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 2021 has been an incredible ride for cryptocurrencies, in this article we\u8217\'20\'19ll take a look at the hottest trends in the Indonesian crypto industry last year.\par \par \uc2 Whitelist of legal digital assets\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is legal in Indonesia as a commodity and can be traded on crypto exchanges. Early this year, the Commodity Futures Trading Regulatory Agency (BAPPEBTI) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://bappebti.go.id/resources/docs/peraturan/sk_kep_kepala_bappebti/sk_kep_kepala_bappebti_2020_12_01_i6tg8tfb_id.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 issued}}}\uc2  a whitelist of legal crypto assets for trading in Indonesia.\par \par \uc2 This whitelist consists of 229 crypto assets, including Bitcoin, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and the popular memecoin Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ), that are allowed for trading on registered exchanges.\par \par \uc2 These crypto assets are selected by two approaches: The first is a juridical approach which looks at the top 500 coins based on market cap in accordance with the provisions in \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  Number 5 of 2019.\par \par \uc2 The second is through a process of hierarchy analysis, wherein BAPPEBTI assesses the security aspects, profiles of the founders and developer team, blockchain system governance, blockchain system scalability, roadmap and its verifiable progress.\par \par \uc2 Crypto taxation\par \par \uc2 With the growth of crypto users and investors in Indonesia, the government, through BAPPEBTI and the Director General of Taxes, is also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinvestasi.com/berita/pajak-crypto-indonesia-semakin-jelas-ini-penjelasan-tarifnya"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 considering}}}\uc2  imposing taxes on crypto trading. For now, crypto taxation is still under discussion with several market players such as exchanges and industry associations.\par \par \uc2 BAPPEBTI {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://bappebti.go.id/resources/docs/pojok_media_2021_08_03_85akugq0.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 stated}}}\uc2  that the crypto tax in Indonesia could be around 0.05%, lower than the 0.1% tax imposed on stock trades.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the government has reportedly {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbcindonesia.com/news/20210910112351-4-275228/kripto-bakal-kena-pajak-003-begini-penjelasan-djp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 begun}}}\uc2  to discuss an income tax for investors in crypto assets of 0.03%.\par \par \uc2 Crypto is haram\par \par \uc2 The question of Bitcoin and crypto assets being halal (permissible) or haram (forbidden) under Islamic law has been a long and heated debate. As a country with a majority Muslim population, the topic is of particular importance for Indonesia.\par \par \uc2 In October, the East Java branch of one of Indonesia\u8217\'20\'19s largest Islamic organizations ruled that while the government may approve of cryptocurrencies, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/major-indonesian-islamic-organization-declares-crypto-haram-or-forbidden"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 they cannot be considered halal}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Cbased on several considerations, including the prevalence of fraud, it is considered unlawful.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Less than one month later, the National Ulema Council (MUI) \u8212\'20\'14 Indonesia\u8217\'20\'19s top Islamic scholarly body \u8212\'20\'14 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/indonesia-s-national-islamic-council-declares-bitcoin-haram"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 found cryptocurrencies to be haram}}}\uc2  due to alleged elements of \u8220\'20\'1Cuncertainty, wagering and harm.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Furthermore, the trading of crypto as a digital commodity/asset did not meet other requirements of Islamic financial law because, according to the MIU, it lacked necessary elements such as having a physical form, having value, being proprietary and able to be handed over to the buyer.\par \par \uc2 NFTs find support from celebrities to the governor\par \par \uc2 The development of nonfungible tokens (NFTs) in Indonesia took off in 2021, especially after Ridwan Kamil, the Governor of West Java, jumped on this trend by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/ridwankamil/status/1463772991796305923"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 inviting}}}\uc2  artists from West Java to create and promote their art as NFTs to be traded on NFT platforms such as OpenSea.\par \par \uc2 NFT: A NEWMIND ECONOMY\par \par \uc2 Seiring dgn logika2 baru ekonomi digital. Saya akan memulai transformasi kesejahteraan baru newmind economy utk para pelaku ekonomi kreatif.\par \par \uc2 Yaitu bantu menjualkan karya2 seniman jalanan di bursa aset digital dunia yaitu NFT via pasar marketplace Opensea. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/p91VlRBtZI"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/p91VlRBtZI}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 ridwan kamil (@ridwankamil) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/ridwankamil/status/1463772991796305923?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 November 25, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 Indonesian singer Syahrini {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.binance.com/ru/nft/blindBox/detail?productId=166902901137774592&ref=CBHM0BL3&number=1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sold}}}\uc2  17,800 NFTs for 20 Binance USD (BUSD) or around 286,300 rupiahs per NFT on the Binance NFT exchange, netting the singer a total income of around 5.1 billion rupiahs, or $356,000.\par \par \uc2 There is also chef Arnold Poernomo, a celebrity chef who also created his own NFT and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/arnoldpoernomo/status/1438865731492270087"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 promoted}}}\uc2  it on \uc2 Twitter\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Exchange tokens\par \par \uc2 Exchange-issued tokens such as Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) and FTX Token (FTT) can be used by holders to get benefits provided by the exchange such as discounts on deposits, no withdrawal fees, opportunities to participate in promotional activities and so on.\par \par \uc2 Indonesian local exchanges began to issue their own such tokens in 2021, with Tokocrypto {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://research.binance.com/en/projects/tokocrypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 releasing}}}\uc2  Toko Token (TKO) in collaboration with Binance on Binance Launchpad. From the beginning of this year\u8217\'20\'19s listing, TKO has increased by over 1,000%.\par \par \uc2 Domestic crypto exchange PINTU {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pintu.co.id/ptu"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 launched}}}\uc2  its Pintu Token (PTU) in November, which is now available on various exchanges such as Bybit and FTX and is also supported by leading investors like \uc2 Lightspeed\uc2 , \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  and Pantera.\par \par \uc2 With two local exchanges launching their own native tokens in 2021, it will be interesting to see if other exchanges such as Indodax, Rekeningku or Triv follow suit in 2022.\par \par \uc2 Binance partners with largest Indonesian telco\par \par \uc2 To cap off the year Binance {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinvestasi.com/berita/binance-dan-mdi-venture-telkom-akan-dirikan-bursa-kripto-di-indonesia"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 partnered}}}\uc2  with a subsidiary of Telkom Indonesia, MDI Ventures, to create a new exchange.\par \par \uc2 Within the collaboration, Binance will provide infrastructure and asset management technology to support the development of a crypto-asset exchange platform, which will be a joint venture between the two firms.\par \par \uc2 Donald Wihardja, the CEO of MDI, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.investing.com/news/cryptocurrency-news/binance-partners-with-mdi-ventures-to-establish-crypto-exchange-services-in-indonesia-2712791"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  that the partnership will help advance crypto and blockchain, which he believes are the financial systems of the figure.\par \par \uc2 With a friendly regulatory atmosphere, support and partnerships from global cryptocurrency firms, and growing interest in \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading, it will be interesting to see how the industry continues to develop in 2022.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDEvNGVmNzE0NTQtN2VhNy00Mzg4LWJkYzAtOWM5ZjU3NTUyODUyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220124ei1o0008e\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/21: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, XRP, LUNA, DOT, AVAX, DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,673 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 January 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and major altcoins near breaking below critical support levels and traders\u8217\'20\'19 reluctance to buy could exacerbate the sell-off.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and most major altcoins continue to witness a bloodbath on Jan. 21 and the result of the most recent downturn has been a $200 billion reduction in market capitalization.\par \par \uc2 A new report by Huobi Research, in collaboration with Blockchain Association Singapore, forecast {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/new-research-expects-a-gloomy-year-for-bitcoin-as-defi-and-daos-rise"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin to enter a bear market in 2022}}}\uc2 . The liquidity tightening measures undertaken by the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2  and other central banks across the world and the regulatory action by authorities could play spoilsport and keep crypto prices under check.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/a30a28ec-7b04-4889-a1f6-77b069951ae3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The calls for a bear market have not shaken up the resolve of MicroStrategy CEO Michael Saylor who is determined to hold on to the company's Bitcoin holdings. Saylor said in a recent interview with Bloomberg that the firm\u8217\'20\'19s strategy is to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-ceo-won-t-sell-5b-btc-stash-despite-crypto-winter"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 acquire and hold Bitcoin and not sell}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and most major altcoins start a relief rally from their strong support levels? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin attempted a recovery on Jan. 20 when bulls pushed the price to the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($43,041). However, the bears had other plans as they sold this rise and pushed the price lower as seen by the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/ce3678f1-0950-471a-9150-a14b9174fa97.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling continued on Jan. 21 and the BTC/USDT pair has broken below the strong support at $39,600. There is minor support at $37,332.70. The bulls are likely to defend this support zone with all their might.\par \par \uc2 The oversold level on the relative strength index (RSI) also points to a possible consolidation or a rebound. If the subsequent relief rally rises above the 50-day simple moving average (SMA), it will indicate that the downtrend may be over.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price plummets below the support zone, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up and the pair may slide to $30,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) long wick on the Jan. 20 candlestick indicates that the trend remains negative and traders are selling on relief rallies to strong resistance levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/9cfa1553-8143-4b41-8775-0f2189bd995e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling has continued on Jan. 21 and bears have pulled the price below the immediate support at $2,928.83. This opens up the doors for a possible drop to $2,652 where buyers are anticipated to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 If the price bounces off $2,652, the bulls will again try to push the ETH/USDT pair above the 20-day EMA and the resistance line of the channel. If that happens, the pair could signal a change in trend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bears sink and sustain the price below $2,652, the selling could accelerate and the pair may drop to $2,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($474) on Jan. 20, indicating that bears are defending this resistance aggressively. The sellers will now try to pull the price below the Jan. 10 intraday low at $405.60.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/78974e93-ad80-46e6-b368-f78c2cdaca8d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative territory indicate advantage to bears. If the price sustains below $405.60 and the descending channel, the selling could intensify and the pair may drop to $325.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off $405.60 or the support line of the channel, the bulls will again attempt to push the BNB/USDT pair above the 20-day EMA and the resistance line of the channel. If they do that, it will signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke and closed below the moving averages on Jan. 20. The long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick showed that bears continue to sell on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/15c53d25-e5f2-4d44-a0b5-7bc0f52cba43.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears sustain the price below the moving averages, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to the critical support at $1. This is an important support to watch out for because it has not been breached on a closing basis for about ten months.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the moving averages, it will indicate that traders are accumulating on dips. The buyers will have to push and sustain the pair above the descending channel to signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) formed an outside day candlestick pattern on Jan. 20. Traders sold aggressively at higher levels and pulled the price below the immediate support at $130.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/26179e0d-2f8c-42ea-9ff5-2dad73306cb1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The SOL/USDT pair has dropped to the strong support at $116. If this level also fails to provide support, the decline could extend to the support line of the descending channel. The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the oversold zone, suggest the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up from $116, the bulls will again try to overcome the barrier at the 20-day EMA ($146). If they manage to do that, the pair could rise to the resistance line. A break and close above the channel could signal a change in trend.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed below the $0.75 support on Jan. 19. The bulls tried to reclaim the level on Jan. 20 but the long wick on the candlestick shows that bears continue to sell on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/f5174188-4b9a-4dba-8d05-18fcfdd9806c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USDT pair has broken below the support at $0.69. If bears sustain the lower levels, the pair could extend its decline to $0.60. The downsloping moving averages and the RSI near the oversold territory indicate that sellers are in control.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the moving averages. Such a move could suggest accumulation at lower levels. The pair could then start its up-move toward $1.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token once again turned down from the downtrend line on Jan. 20, indicating that bears continue to defend this level with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/02576507-4b51-4b24-97ab-334a5db67348.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Although the 20-day ($79) is flattish, the RSI has slipped below 46, indicating that bears have a slight advantage. If the price sustains below $73.95, the LUNA/USDT pair could start its decline toward the critical support at $62.46.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off the current level, the bulls will again try to push the pair above the downtrend line. If they succeed, it will indicate that the correction may be over. The pair could rally to $93.81.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/3-wildest-theories-explaining-500b-crypto-market-crash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 3 wildest theories explaining $500B crypto market crash}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has dipped below the critical support at $22.66, which is an important level to keep an eye on because it has not been breached on a closing basis since mid-August of last year.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/0026f476-c97a-4978-8175-cf3643f257ab.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the current level, the bulls will again attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at the moving averages. A break and close above the 50-day SMA ($27.08) will be the first indication that the selling pressure may be reducing. The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above $32.78 to signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the DOT/USDT pair sustains below $22.66, it will suggest that supply exceeds demand and traders are rushing to the exit. The pair could then drop to the next support at $16.81.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) turned down from close to the 20-day EMA ($90) on Jan. 20 and broke below the strong support at $75.50 on Jan. 21.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/22808da2-927c-40f5-a85c-32517e787e20.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative zone indicate that bears are in command. A close below $75.50 will complete a descending triangle pattern, signaling that a top may be in place. The AVAX/USDT pair could then start its decline toward $50.\par \par \uc2 However, the bulls are unlikely to surrender without putting up a strong fight. If the price rebounds off the current level, the pair could recover to the 20-day EMA and later to the downtrend line. The bulls will have to clear this hurdle to signal a possible end to the corrective phase.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) back above the moving averages on Jan. 20 but failed. This suggests that sentiment remains negative and bears are selling near resistance levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/c33fb631-9437-4600-8e19-af531a1d9e43.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair could now gradually drop toward the strong support at $0.13 where the buyers may step in to arrest the decline.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this level and rises above the moving averages, it will suggest that the range-bound action may continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The critical level to watch on the upside is $0.19 and $0.13 on the downside. The next trending move could start after the price breaks out of either level. Until then, volatile random moves inside the range may continue.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDEvZGNlZGZmZGQtNTA3Ny00NTcyLTg0OTctMGVjZTQ5OWE3MDU1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220121ei1l000e4\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/21: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, XRP, LUNA, DOT, AVAX, DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,674 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 January 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and most major altcoins are close to breaking below critical support levels and traders\u8217\'20\'19 reluctance to buy in the current range could exacerbate the sell-off.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and most major altcoins continue to witness a bloodbath on Jan. 21 and the result of the most recent downturn has been a $200 billion reduction in market capitalization.\par \par \uc2 A new report by Huobi Research, in collaboration with Blockchain Association Singapore, forecast {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/new-research-expects-a-gloomy-year-for-bitcoin-as-defi-and-daos-rise"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin to enter a bear market in 2022}}}\uc2 . The liquidity tightening measures undertaken by the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2  and other central banks across the world and the regulatory action by authorities could play spoilsport and keep crypto prices under check.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/a30a28ec-7b04-4889-a1f6-77b069951ae3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The calls for a bear market have not shaken up the resolve of MicroStrategy CEO Michael Saylor who is determined to hold on to the company's Bitcoin holdings. Saylor said in a recent interview with Bloomberg that the firm\u8217\'20\'19s strategy is to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-ceo-won-t-sell-5b-btc-stash-despite-crypto-winter"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 acquire and hold Bitcoin and not sell}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and most major altcoins start a relief rally from their strong support levels? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin attempted a recovery on Jan. 20 when bulls pushed the price to the 20-day exponential moving average ($43,041). However, the bears had other plans as they sold this rise and pushed the price lower as seen by the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/ce3678f1-0950-471a-9150-a14b9174fa97.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling continued today and the BTC/USDT pair has broken below the strong support at $39,600. There is a minor support at $37,332.70. The bulls are likely to defend this support zone with all their might.\par \par \uc2 The oversold level on the relative strength index (RSI) also points to a possible consolidation or a rebound. If the subsequent relief rally rises above the 50-day simple moving average (SMA), it will indicate that the downtrend may be over.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price plummets below the support zone, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up and the pair may slide to $30,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) long wick on the Jan. 20 candlestick indicates that the trend remains negative and traders are selling on relief rallies to strong resistance levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/9cfa1553-8143-4b41-8775-0f2189bd995e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling has continued today and bears have pulled the price below the immediate support at $2,928.83. This opens up the doors for a possible drop to $2,652 where buyers are anticipated to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 If the price bounces off $2,652, the bulls will again try to push the ETH/USDT pair above the 20-day EMA and the resistance line of the channel. If that happens, the pair could signal a change in trend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bears sink and sustain the price below $2,652, the selling could accelerate and the pair may drop to $2,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($474) on Jan. 20, indicating that bears are defending this resistance aggressively. The sellers will now try to pull the price below the Jan. 10 intraday low at $405.60.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/78974e93-ad80-46e6-b368-f78c2cdaca8d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative territory indicate advantage to bears. If the price sustains below $405.60 and the descending channel, the selling could intensify and the pair may drop to $325.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off $405.60 or the support line of the channel, the bulls will again attempt to push the BNB/USDT pair above the 20-day EMA and the resistance line of the channel. If they do that, it will signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke and closed below the moving averages on Jan. 20. The long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick showed that bears continue to sell on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/15c53d25-e5f2-4d44-a0b5-7bc0f52cba43.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears sustain the price below the moving averages, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to the critical support at $1. This is an important support to watch out for because it has not been breached on a closing basis for about ten months.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the moving averages, it will indicate that traders are accumulating on dips. The buyers will have to push and sustain the pair above the descending channel to signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/solana"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) formed an outside day candlestick pattern on Jan. 20. Traders sold aggressively at higher levels and pulled the price below the immediate support at $130.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/26179e0d-2f8c-42ea-9ff5-2dad73306cb1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The SOL/USDT pair has dropped to the strong support at $116. If this level also fails to provide support, the decline could extend to the support line of the descending channel. The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the oversold zone, suggest the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up from $116, the bulls will again try to overcome the barrier at the 20-day EMA ($146). If they manage to do that, the pair could rise to the resistance line. A break and close above the channel could signal a change in trend.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/ripple"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed below the $0.75 support on Jan. 19. The bulls tried to reclaim the level on Jan. 20 but the long wick on the candlestick shows that bears continue to sell on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/f5174188-4b9a-4dba-8d05-18fcfdd9806c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USDT pair has broken below the support at $0.69. If bears sustain the lower levels, the pair could extend its decline to $0.60. The downsloping moving averages and the RSI near the oversold territory indicate that sellers are in control.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the moving averages. Such a move could suggest accumulation at lower levels. The pair could then start its up-move toward $1.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token once again turned down from the downtrend line on Jan. 20, indicating that bears continue to defend this level with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/02576507-4b51-4b24-97ab-334a5db67348.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Although the 20-day ($79) is flattish, the RSI has slipped below 46, indicating that bears have a slight advantage. If the price sustains below $73.95, the LUNA/USDT pair could start its decline toward the critical support at $62.46.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off the current level, the bulls will again try to push the pair above the downtrend line. If they succeed, it will indicate that the correction may be over. The pair could rally to $93.81.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/3-wildest-theories-explaining-500b-crypto-market-crash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 3 wildest theories explaining $500B crypto market crash}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has dipped below the critical support at $22.66, which is an important level to keep an eye on because it has not been breached on a closing basis since mid-August of last year.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/0026f476-c97a-4978-8175-cf3643f257ab.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the current level, the bulls will again attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at the moving averages. A break and close above the 50-day SMA ($27.08) will be the first indication that the selling pressure may be reducing. The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above $32.78 to signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the DOT/USDT pair sustains below $22.66, it will suggest that supply exceeds demand and traders are rushing to the exit. The pair could then drop to the next support at $16.81.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/avalanche"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) turned down from close to the 20-day EMA ($90) on Jan. 20 and broke below the strong support at $75.50 today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/22808da2-927c-40f5-a85c-32517e787e20.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative zone indicate that bears are in command. A close below $75.50 will complete a descending triangle pattern, signaling that a top may be in place. The AVAX/USDT pair could then start its decline toward $50.\par \par \uc2 However, the bulls are unlikely to surrender without putting up a strong fight. If the price rebounds off the current level, the pair could recover to the 20-day EMA and later to the downtrend line. The bulls will have to clear this hurdle to signal a possible end to the corrective phase.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) back above the moving averages on Jan. 20 but failed. This suggests that sentiment remains negative and bears are selling near resistance levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/c33fb631-9437-4600-8e19-af531a1d9e43.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair could now gradually drop toward the strong support at $0.13 where the buyers may step in to arrest the decline.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this level and rises above the moving averages, it will suggest that the range-bound action may continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The critical level to watch on the upside is $0.19 and $0.13 on the downside. The next trending move could start after the price breaks out of either level. Until then, volatile random moves inside the range may continue.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDEvZGNlZGZmZGQtNTA3Ny00NTcyLTg0OTctMGVjZTQ5OWE3MDU1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220121ei1l000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/19: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, XRP, LUNA, DOT, AVAX, DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,804 \uc2 words\par \uc2 19 January 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Sell pressure on BTC and altcoins is beginning to alleviate, but data suggests that it\u8217\'20\'19s too early to call for a reversal.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and select altcoins are showing signs of some buying near support levels. According to Arcane Research, the seven-day average real Bitcoin trading volume has dropped to the lowest level since July 2021. During the previous instance, the sharp drop in volume {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bearish-sentiment-may-soon-abate-according-to-coinshares-and-bitcoin-metrics"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 marked a bottom}}}\uc2  and led to a strong rally from August to October 2021.\par \par \uc2 However, Bloomberg Intelligence {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-will-emerge-stronger-after-stocks-dip-10-20-bloomberg-analyst"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 senior commodity strategist McGlone warned}}}\uc2  in a recent podcast that risk assets may correct as the \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2  increases rates and reduces asset purchases.\par \par \uc2 After the corrective phase is over, McGlone expects Bitcoin to transition from a \u8220\'20\'1Crisk-on to a risk-off asset\u8221\'20\'1D and \u8220\'20\'1Ccome out better off.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/ce6065d3-eb09-41bb-aba8-18b0fcb0b5f5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 In the short term, analysts at Decentrader, a crypto market intelligence firm, expect {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/analysts-warn-that-bitcoin-could-dip-to-38k-before-an-eventual-breakout"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin to stay range-bound}}}\uc2  between \u8220\'20\'1C$44,000 and potentially $38,000 before an eventual breakout.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 While analysts are divided on their forecasts for Bitcoin, let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find the path of least resistance.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears are attempting to pull Bitcoin toward the strong support at $39,600 but the long tail on the candlesticks of the past two days shows that bulls have other plans. The buyers are buying on dips but a minor negative is that they have not been able to push the price above the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($43,804).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/f1a943b5-854a-45a1-b465-51459fdb299e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping down and the relative strength index (RSI) remains in the negative zone, indicating that bears have the upper hand. If the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA, the bears will again attempt to sink the BTC/USDT pair to $39,600. This is a key level to keep an eye on in the short term.\par \par \uc2 If this level cracks, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up as several stop-losses could be triggered. That may result in a decline to $30,000.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the current level or the $39,600 support, the buyers will attempt to push the pair above the moving averages. If the price sustains above the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($47,070), the negative view will invalidate and the pair could rally to the stiff overhead resistance at $52,088.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has continued its down move and is close to the support at $2,928.83. The bulls may attempt to defend this level and start a relief rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/eedae15e-2691-4ce5-ac2d-16d52d03834c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the ETH/USDT pair could rise to the 20-day EMA ($3,381). This is a key resistance to watch out for because a break above it will be the first indication that the bears may be losing steam.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the channel will signal a possible change in trend. The pair could then start its upward march toward $4,200.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA, it will increase the possibility of a break below $2,928.83. If that happens, the pair could slide to the strong support at $2,652.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade inside the descending channel pattern. The 20-day EMA ($485) has started to turn down and the RSI has dipped below 43, suggesting that bears are at an advantage.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/4ddcaa28-1d29-4f8e-afa3-54b214a541d5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to defend the minor support at $450. If the price rebounds off this level, the buyers will make one more attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at $500. If they succeed, it will indicate a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 The BNB/USDT pair could then start its northward march toward $572 and later to $617. Alternatively, if the price breaks below $450, the bears will try to pull the BNB/USDT pair to the support line of the channel.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) rallied to the resistance line of the descending channel on Jan. 18 but the bulls could not push the price above the channel. This suggests that bears are defending the resistance line aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/cc6e4a51-c237-4ccb-b392-ea5141ea2ef7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair has dipped to the moving averages, which could act as a strong support. The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is in the positive territory, indicating advantage to buyers.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the current level, the bulls will again try to drive the price above the channel and the developing neckline of a possible inverse head and shoulders pattern. If that happens, the pair could start a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the price breaks and sustains below the moving averages. Such a move could pull the pair down to $1.06.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has reached near the minor support at $130. The bulls had defended this level on Jan. 10 and may again try to do so during the current decline.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/3fbcf918-5dbd-4aed-98a9-9c4ab308145f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the support, the bulls will again attempt to push the SOL/USDT pair above the 20-day EMA ($151). If they succeed, the pair could rally to the resistance line of the descending channel.\par \par \uc2 This is an important level to watch out for because a break and close above it will signal the possible start of a new up-move.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the $130 support cracks, the pair could drop to the critical support at $116. A break below this level could pull the price to the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) had been stuck between the 20-day EMA ($0.78) and the $0.75 support for the past few days, which resolved to the downside on Jan. 19. This indicates that bears have overpowered the buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/ea099cd1-a0cd-4342-b7bf-9a2c55448582.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that the path of least resistance is to the downside. If the price sustains below $0.75, the bears will try to build upon their advantage and sink the XRP/USDT pair to $0.69.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above the moving averages, it will indicate that bulls are accumulating on dips. That could start a relief rally which could reach the overhead resistance at $1.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token dipped below the 50-day SMA ($76) on Jan. 18 but the bulls bought the dip and pushed the price back above the 20-day EMA ($80). This is a positive sign as it shows traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/999ec86d-dc64-4a11-90c4-8ea2018991be.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the bulls maintain the price above the 20-day EMA, the LUNA/USDT pair could rise to the downtrend line. A break and close above this level will suggest that the selling pressure could be reducing. The pair could then rise to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $87.88 and later to $93.81.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down and breaks below $73.95. Such a move will suggest that supply exceeds demand. The pair could then decline to $68.33 and later to $62.46.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/43-of-bitcoin-trading-volume-during-us-market-hours-arcane-research"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 43% of Bitcoin trading volume during US market hours: Arcane Research}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) continues to drift down toward the strong support at $22.66 where the bulls will try to halt the decline. The strength of the rebound off this level could indicate whether the decline is over or not.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/9ae2a9b6-dfe1-4177-9560-d7c4d6f3e182.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the bounce rises above the moving averages, it will suggest accumulation at lower levels. The DOT/USDT pair could then rise to the overhead resistance at $32.78. A break and close above this level will suggest the start of a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the moving averages, it will indicate that sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. That will increase the prospects of a break and close below $22.66. If that happens, the pair could drop to $16.81.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) continues to slide toward strong support at $75.50. The price action of the past few days has formed a descending triangle pattern that will complete on a break and close below $75.50.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/041d21a9-42f7-483a-8f55-5b9b3e295dc5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping down and the RSI is in the negative territory, indicating that bears have the upper hand. The sellers will have to sink and sustain the price below $75.50 to indicate the start of a new downtrend.\par \par \uc2 The bulls are unlikely to surrender the $75.50 level easily. If the price rebounds off this support, the AVAX/USDT pair could reach the moving averages. If buyers push the price above the moving averages, the pair could rise to the downtrend line. The bulls will have to propel the price above this resistance to indicate a change in trend.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) dipped below both moving averages on Jan. 18, which brings the $0.19 to $0.13 range into play. The flattish 20-day EMA ($0.16) and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/ee9c417c-3f15-4faf-af18-c99e7bcf709d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below the moving averages, the DOGE/USDT pair could gradually drop to $0.15 and if this level also cracks, the decline could extend to $0.13. A break and close below $0.13 will indicate the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up and breaks above the moving averages, it will suggest that bulls are buying on dips. The buyers will then attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at $0.19 and push the pair to $0.22.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDEvMTAzMTU0NjItZmRiYS00MjFjLTkxZDAtNzRmOGJkNmIwYjA0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220119ei1j000ba\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cardano\par \b \uc2 Cardano goes \u8216\'20\'18full send\u8217\'20\'19 with a 50%  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2  rally ahead of SundaeSwap launch\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 832 \uc2 words\par \uc2 18 January 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  bulls cranked the price higher as excitement mounts over the upcoming SundaeSwap DEX launch.\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) traded within striking distance of its three-week high at the start of this week, leading some investors to suggest that a trend reversal was in order. In reality, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is primarily connected to an anticipation of the upcoming decentralized exchange (DEX) called SundaeSwap.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price rose by nearly 12% on Jan.17 to reach an intraday high of $1.60, a day after SundaeSwap {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://sundaeswap-finance.medium.com/wen-sundae-thursday-9389e4439530"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced}}}\uc2  the launch of its "fully-functional beta decentralized exchange (DEX)." Nonetheless, the upside swing also came as a part of a wider rebound trend wherein \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  jumped by almost 50% in just seven days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/9e7df903-368e-46be-b014-0d1ef8aae0a3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily price chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 In detail, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rebound began {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/most-bullish-macro-backdrop-in-75-years-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 almost in sync with similar retracement moves}}}\uc2  across the cryptocurrency market. That included Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), which sharply reversed its trend on Jan. 10 after its price dipped to as low as $39,650. At press time, BTC price trades at $41,500.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  initially tailed the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/fidelity-exec-says-bitcoin-is-technically-oversold-making-40k-a-pivotal-support"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 crypto market's reversal}}}\uc2 , but later continued its upside momentum on its own after taking cues from the euphoria surrounding the SundaeSwap DEX launch on Jan. 20. As a result, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  emerged as one of the best performers among the top-ten cryptocurrencies based on a 24-hour adjusted timeframe.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/24944103-9b3f-4403-9632-b1cd36bc4477.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Top 10 cryptocurrencies in the past 48 hours. Source: Messari\par \par \uc2 What makes SundaeSwap \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ?\par \par \uc2 SundaeSwap's official DEX launch announcement {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://sundaeswap-finance.medium.com/wen-sundae-thursday-9389e4439530"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 included}}}\uc2  evidence of greater demand for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  tokens in the future and this is typically a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  signal for investors.\par \par \uc2 The moment we've all been waiting for has finally come!\par \par \uc2 We're excited and proud to share that SundaeSwap and the ISO will be launching on the evening of Thursday, January 20th (EST)!\par \par \uc2 Check out the article below! {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/8oDYU6i3k9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/8oDYU6i3k9}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/upgNZx2xH2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/upgNZx2xH2}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 SundaeSwap Labs (@SundaeSwap) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/SundaeSwap/status/1482435023630483466?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 January 15, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 The DEX platform also introduced its native SUNDAE token and discussed three ways to distribute it among users: via an initial stake offering (ISO) round, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/defi-protocol-to-introduce-fixed-rate-interest-yields"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 yield farming}}}\uc2  and direct exchange-based conversion.\par \par \uc2 Discussing the ISO round, SundaeSwap explained that it would {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-risks-60-90-drop-warns-trader-with-ada-painting-a-classic-bearish-pattern"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 distribute 5% of the total SUNDAE supply}}}\uc2  via five epochs. Each epoch represents a five-day reward cycle wherein users delegate their \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  tokens into a stake pool.\par \par \uc2 "If you want to make sure you qualify for all five ISO reward rounds, you must have \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  staked with eligible SPOs [Stake Pool Operators] before 21:45 UTC on January 25," the DEX's announcement read, adding:\par \par \uc2 "Your reward will be calculated based on the snapshot taken at that time, and at the same time at each subsequent epoch boundary."\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/ba5c0c29-4c51-47ee-8841-9a78e1f096fb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the yield farming program saw SundaeSwap adding four \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -based liquidity pools: SUNDAE/\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , LQ/\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , WMT/\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  and CARDS/\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The DEX also allocated 500,000 SUNDAE per day from January through June.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  to $2?\par \par \uc2 The SundaeSwap-led bounce pushed \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  toward its 100-day exponential moving average (100-day EMA; the blue wave) near $1.57.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/35b2632f-4858-4faa-890c-742fadf95fdd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily price chart featuring 100-day EMA resistance. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Additional \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  cues have also been coming from the anticipated launch of Pavio, Cardano's first metaverse undertaking.\par \par \uc2 Pavio is a Decentraland-like virtual land startup with some 100,000 land parcels, each being {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.globenewswire.com/en/news-release/2022/01/15/2367457/0/en/The-Metaverse-arrives-on-the-Cardano-blockchain.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 minted}}}\uc2  as a unique nonfungible token (NFT) with coordinates. The advent of the Metaverse in the crypto sector in the past months and Cardano's involvement in it may boost demand for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  further.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/meta-poaches-staff-from-microsoft-and-apple-for-metaverse-plans"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Meta poaches staff from Microsoft and Apple for metaverse plans}}}\par \par \uc2 This raises the possibility for Cardano to close above its 100-day EMA resistance wave, thus shifting the next upside target toward the 200-day EMA near $2.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, risks of an overall crypto market crash led by the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2 's {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-rallies-above-49k-following-fed-fomc-announcement-of-rate-hikes-in-2022"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tapering programs}}}\uc2  this year could spoil \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup to an extent.\par \par \uc2 "While \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is far from its peak, the prospect of obtaining more scalability as part of its 2022 roadmap explains why investors appear to be betting big on Cardano. This point was also noted by Liam Bussel, the chief marketing officer of Cardano-native DEX WingRiders in a statement to Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 Bussel said,\par \par \uc2 "In a world characterized by high performance and novel use cases, Cardano will be able to keep up and lead the pack. As a result, a weekly closing above $1.80 is likely, barring any last-minute profiteering by sellers."\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDEvNWQ5NDEwNTAtODZkMC00M2I0LTk2OWUtY2QyYWM5MDA1MjljLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220118ei1i000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 Early birds: U.S. legislators invested in crypto and their  \highlight22\uc2 digital asset \highlight\uc2  politics\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By David Attlee \par \uc2 1,611 \uc2 words\par \uc2 18 January 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 United States lawmakers remain underinvested in crypto, but this is likely to change in 2022.\par \par \uc2 According to some estimates, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/coinbase-warns-infrastructure-bill-s-crypto-provisions-could-impact-20-of-us-population"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 as many as 20% of Americans}}}\uc2  were invested in cryptocurrencies as of August 2021. While the exact number can vary significantly from one poll to another, it is clear that cryptocurrencies are no longer just a niche passion project for tech enthusiasts or a tool for financial speculation. Rather, digital assets have become a widespread investment vehicle with the prospect of becoming mainstream.\par \par \uc2 Optimistic as that is, this level of mass adoption still does not enjoy a commensurate political representation, with senior United States politicians largely lagging behind the curve of \b \highlight22\uc2 crypto adoption\b0 \highlight\uc2 . This makes the very narrow group of congresspeople who are also hodlers particularly interesting. As a lawmaker, does owning crypto, or at least having some crypto exposure, mean that you also vocally support the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  industry?\par \par \uc2 According to \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin Politicians\u8221\'20\'1D \u8212\'20\'14 a crowdsourced data project aimed at tracking U.S. political figures\u8217\'20\'19 crypto holdings using public financial disclosures \u8212\'20\'14 there are {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://bitcoinpoliticians.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 currently}}}\uc2  seven known crypto investors across both chambers of Congress. Here\u8217\'20\'19s a closer look at the way their personal financial strategies are reflected, if at all, in their public political stances.\par \par \uc2 Michael McCaul\par \par \uc2 Michael McCaul, a 59-year-old Republican representative from Texas, holds the position of ranking member of the House Foreign Affairs Committee. He was also the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.statesman.com/story/news/2018/03/10/3-austinites-are-among-the-wealthiest-members-of-congress/10093436007/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fifth-wealthiest}}}\uc2  member of Congress in 2018. McCaul is known for his hawkish foreign affairs positions \u8212\'20\'14 vocally opposing the U.S. withdrawal from the Yemeni Civil War and supporting President Joe Biden\u8217\'20\'19s airstrikes on Iranian-backed targets in Syria.\par \par \uc2 In 2016, McCaul co-sponsored a bipartisan bill {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.documentcloud.org/documents/2724063/Commission-Xml-1.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 proposing}}}\uc2  a commission to study the debate over the use of encryption, including its potential economic effects. In recent years, the Texas lawmaker hasn\u8217\'20\'19t been seen making any public crypto-related statements.\par \par \uc2 Barry Moore\par \par \uc2 A newcomer to the House of Representatives, Barry Moore is a staunch Republican from Alabama. In January 2021, he objected to the certification of the results of the presidential election and even got his \uc2 Twitter\uc2  account temporarily suspended for posts that echoed the claims of a \u8220\'20\'1Cstolen election.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 According to a public disclosure, Moore purchased between $1,000 and $15,000 worth of Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) in June 2021 \u8212\'20\'14 an investment whose value has since dropped nearly 50%. The legislator also invested in Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) (up to $15,000) and Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  (up to $45,000). Still, Moore hasn\u8217\'20\'19t publicly expressed his opinions toward crypto.\par \par \uc2 Marie Newman\par \par \uc2 57-year-old Marie Newman, another new addition to the House of Representatives, is a Democrat from Illinois who is aligned with the progressive wing of the party. She is a proponent of abortion rights, gun control, a $15 minimum wage and the Green New Deal.\par \par \uc2 Newman holds \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  shares as of December 2021, having purchased between $30,000 and $100,000 worth. She also registered the acquisition of more than $15,000 in \uc2 Grayscale Bitcoin Trust\uc2  shares. Newman hasn\u8217\'20\'19t made any public statements about the crypto-related assets, but she is a member of the Congressional Blockchain Caucus, a bipartisan group working to promote a more relaxed regulatory approach to crypto that would allow the technology to flourish.\par \par \uc2 Jefferson Van Drew\par \par \uc2 A retired dentist with almost three decades of experience as a New Jersey legislator, Van Drew was elected to the House in 2018 as a Democrat but changed his colors in 2020, becoming a Republican. This comes as no surprise, as Van Drew was one of just two members of the Democratic party to vote against former President Donald Trump\u8217\'20\'19s impeachment inquiry in December 2019. Still, he voted in line with Democrats 89.7% of the time during his tenure in the party.\par \par \uc2 In a 2020 disclosure, Van Drew accounted for up to $250,000 in an investment trust operated by Grayscale, one of the larger \b \highlight22\uc2 digital-asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  management firms on the market. At the time, the representative\u8217\'20\'19s office declined to give the press any details about the exact nature of the investment, and Van Drew himself has remained silent with regard to \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2 -related policy issues.\par \par \uc2 Michael Waltz\par \par \uc2 Yet another recent House electee, Michael Waltz \u8212\'20\'14 a retired army colonel and former Pentagon adviser \u8212\'20\'14 is the first ever Green Beret to serve in Congress. A Republican from Florida, Waltz maintains a warrior ethos with a pinch of Florida spice, having called for a full U.S. boycott of the 2022 Winter Olympics over the Chinese Communist Party\u8217\'20\'19s treatment of the nation\u8217\'20\'19s Uyghur population. Waltz also voted against President Biden\u8217\'20\'19s $1.9-trillion economic stimulus bill and opposed the establishment of a commission to investigate the Jan. 6, 2021 attack on the U.S. Capitol.\par \par \uc2 According to disclosures, Waltz bought up to $100,000 in Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) in June 2021, which makes him one of the few lawmakers to publicly own the original cryptocurrency, specifically. Nevertheless, on social media, the representative prefers to speak on foreign policy issues, and when he was asked about his crypto investment, he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/senators-own-cryptocurrency-assets-as-they-shape-rules-for-industry-11640005202"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 compared}}}\uc2  Bitcoin to gold in terms of serving as an inflation hedge. Waltz is also a member of the Congressional Blockchain Caucus.\par \par \uc2 Cynthia Lummis\par \par \uc2 In the case of Cynthia Lummis, a Republican senator representing Wyoming, her fame as a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-lawmaker-planning-to-introduce-comprehensive-crypto-bill-in-2022-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 major crypto proponent}}}\uc2  probably comes before her credentials as a \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  investor. A hardline Republican, Lummis was at one point the only female member of the conservative Freedom Caucus.\par \par \uc2 In her January 2021 disclosure, Lummis \u8212\'20\'14 a member of the Senate Banking, Housing and Urban Affairs Committee \u8212\'20\'14 registered the purchase of between $50,000 and $100,000 in Bitcoin. The Senator revealed that her overall holdings amounted to some 5 BTC.\par \par \uc2 Lummis certainly {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/law-decoded-putting-your-bitcoin-where-your-mouth-is-oct-4-11"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 puts her mouth where her money is}}}\uc2 . For one, she famously compared the U.S. to Venezuela in terms of inflation, and she has stated she {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-congressman-expresses-importance-of-crypto-wallet-privacy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wants to launch a financial innovation caucus}}}\uc2  that would aim to \u8220\'20\'1Ceducate members of the \uc2 U.S. Senate\uc2  and their staffs about Bitcoin, its advantages, and why it is just such a fabulous asset to dovetail with the U.S. dollar.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Around Christmas 2021, Lummis revealed she was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-lawmaker-planning-to-introduce-comprehensive-crypto-bill-in-2022-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 drafting a comprehensive bill}}}\uc2  that she plans to introduce sometime in 2022. In a tweet, Lummis asked voters to contact their senators to support the bill, stating that she was seeking bipartisan cosponsors.\par \par \uc2 Pat Toomey\par \par \uc2 Republican Senator Pat Toomey of Pennsylvania can be called the arch enemy of government spending (with a peculiar exception for charter school funding), having once {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://edition.cnn.com/2001/ALLPOLITICS/03/14/congress.taxes.02/index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 proposed}}}\uc2  a budget plan with a $2.2 trillion tax cut. He also happens to be a strong supporter of banking deregulation.\par \par \uc2 During the past year, Toomey emerged as one of the main public supporters of crypto in Washington. He criticized Senator Sherrod Brown\u8217\'20\'19s plan to give up crypto \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  to executive agencies and urged Treasury Secretary Janet Yellen to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/six-senators-urge-treasury-secretary-to-clarify-definition-of-broker-in-infrastructure-law-before-2022"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 clarify the language}}}\uc2  in the infrastructure bill around the tax reporting requirements for crypto. In December 2021, Toomey came up with his {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/senate-hearing-on-stablecoins-compliance-anxiety-and-republican-pushback"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 own set of regulatory principles}}}\uc2 , released ahead of a congressional hearing on stablecoins. In June 2021, he bought between $2,000 and $30,000 in shares of Grayscale\u8217\'20\'19s Bitcoin and Ethereum trusts.\par \par \uc2 Will the trend continue in 2022?\par \par \uc2 The list of publicly crypto-friendly lawmakers grew significantly last year, and although not every hodler on the Hill dared to reinforce their investment with symmetric political statements, it is an important trend for the industry. As Chris Kline, co-founder and chief operating officer of cryptocurrency retirement investment provider Bitcoin IRA, told Cointelegraph:\par \par \uc2 As more representatives invest in cryptocurrencies, I think lawmakers will begin to understand digital assets on a deeper level, leading to a more informed and detailed crypto policy that will benefit investors on every level.\par \par \uc2 Eric Bleeker, analyst and general manager at finance and investing advice company The \uc2 Motley Fool\uc2 , also stressed the importance of the knowledge-enhancement side of lawmakers\u8217\'20\'19 crypto exposure:\par \par \uc2 You definitely have to view those investments as beneficial for the industry. Did Visa receive worse legislation after Nancy Pelosi invested in its IPO? At the end of the day, crypto can be seen as a \u8216\'20\'18threat\u8217\'20\'19 by governments \u8212\'20\'14 we\u8217\'20\'19ve already seen it outlawed in China. Having legislators own it adds to knowledge of the industry.\par \par \uc2 Kline also believes that the growing number of politicians invested in crypto will inevitably convert to active support, both verbal and legislative. With new concepts like the Metaverse, nonfungible tokens (NFTs) and digital banking steadily conquering the attention of society, there is no reason for society\u8217\'20\'19s representatives to not follow these trends.\par \par \uc2 In Kline\u8217\'20\'19s opinion, this will require legislators\u8217\'20\'19 understanding of the deep complexities and nuances of cryptocurrencies and blockchain: \u8220\'20\'1CI see 2022 as the year legislators consider the potential of digital assets and another step in their widespread adoption.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Bleeker expects more U.S. legislators to get into the crypto game in 2022 for a simple reason: \u8220\'20\'1CRight now, they\u8217\'20\'19re tremendously underinvested.\u8221\'20\'1D Bleeker noted that as of 2018, the median net worth of congresspeople was $1 million, with 10 senators having a net worth of over $30 million. It\u8217\'20\'19s true that some legislators may avoid crypto for political reasons, but just by looking at the numbers, more crypto ownership from lawmakers can be expected from a pure portfolio diversification standpoint.\par \par \uc2 The hope is that more investment in crypto by lawmakers will come with better understanding of this asset class and more political support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDEvMTM2ZWFiODAtMDk0NS00MDNiLTllZjQtNDhmZDFjY2Y1NzY1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220118ei1i000ba\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cardano\par \b \uc2 Cardano goes \u8216\'20\'18full send\u8217\'20\'19 with a 50%  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2  rally ahead of SundaeSwap launch\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 832 \uc2 words\par \uc2 18 January 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  bulls cranked the price higher as excitement mounts over the upcoming SundaeSwap DEX launch.\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) traded within striking distance of its three-week high this at the start of this week, leading some investors to suggest that a trend reversal was in order. In reality, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is primarily connected to anticipation of the upcoming decentralized exchange (DEX) called SundaeSwap.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price rose by nearly 12% on Jan.17 to reach an intraday high of $1.60, a day after SundaeSwap {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://sundaeswap-finance.medium.com/wen-sundae-thursday-9389e4439530"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced}}}\uc2  the launch of its "fully-functional beta decentralized exchange (DEX)." Nonetheless, the upside swing also came as a part of a wider rebound trend wherein \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  jumped by almost 50% in just seven days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/9e7df903-368e-46be-b014-0d1ef8aae0a3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily price chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 In detail, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rebound began almost in sync with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/most-bullish-macro-backdrop-in-75-years-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 similar retracement}}}\uc2  moves across the cryptocurrency market. That included Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), which sharply reversed its trend on Jan. 10 after its price dipped to as low as $39,650. At press time, BTC price trades at $41,500.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  initially tailed the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/fidelity-exec-says-bitcoin-is-technically-oversold-making-40k-a-pivotal-support"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 crypto market's reversal}}}\uc2 , but later continued its upside momentum on its own after taking cues from the euphoria surrounding the SundaeSwap DEX launch on Jan. 20. As a result, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  emerged as one of the best performers among the top-ten cryptocurrencies based on a 24-hour adjusted timeframe.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/24944103-9b3f-4403-9632-b1cd36bc4477.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Top 10 cryptocurrencies in the past 48 hours. Source: Messari\par \par \uc2 What makes SundaeSwap \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ?\par \par \uc2 SundaeSwap's official DEX {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://sundaeswap-finance.medium.com/wen-sundae-thursday-9389e4439530"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 launch announcement}}}\uc2  included evidence of greater demand for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  tokens in the future and this is typically a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  signal for investors.\par \par \uc2 The moment we've all been waiting for has finally come!\par \par \uc2 We're excited and proud to share that SundaeSwap and the ISO will be launching on the evening of Thursday, January 20th (EST)!\par \par \uc2 Check out the article below! {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/8oDYU6i3k9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/8oDYU6i3k9}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/upgNZx2xH2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/upgNZx2xH2}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 SundaeSwap Labs (@SundaeSwap) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/SundaeSwap/status/1482435023630483466?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 January 15, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 The DEX platform also introduced its native SUNDAE token and discussed three ways to distribute it among users: via an initial stake offering (ISO) round, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/defi-protocol-to-introduce-fixed-rate-interest-yields"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 yield farming}}}\uc2 , and direct exchange-based conversion.\par \par \uc2 Discussing the ISO round, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-risks-60-90-drop-warns-trader-with-ada-painting-a-classic-bearish-pattern"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SundaeSwap}}}\uc2  explained that it would distribute 5% of the total SUNDAE supply via five epochs. Each epoch represents a five-day reward cycle wherein users delegate their \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  tokens into a stake pool.\par \par \uc2 "If you want to make sure you qualify for all five ISO reward rounds, you must have \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  staked with eligible SPOs [Stake Pool Operators] before 21:45 UTC on January 25th," the DEX's announcement read, adding:\par \par \uc2 "Your reward will be calculated based on the snapshot taken at that time, and at the same time at each subsequent epoch boundary."\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/ba5c0c29-4c51-47ee-8841-9a78e1f096fb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the yield farming program saw SundaeSwap adding four \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -based liquidity pools: SUNDAE/\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , LQ/\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , WMT/\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and CARDS/\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The DEX also allocated 500,000 SUNDAE per day from January through June.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  to $2?\par \par \uc2 The SundaeSwap-led bounce pushed \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  toward its 100-day exponential moving average (100-day EMA; the blue wave) near $1.57.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/35b2632f-4858-4faa-890c-742fadf95fdd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily price chart featuring 100-day EMA resistance. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Additional \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  cues have also been coming from the anticipated launch of Pavio, Cardano's first metaverse undertaking.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.globenewswire.com/en/news-release/2022/01/15/2367457/0/en/The-Metaverse-arrives-on-the-Cardano-blockchain.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Pavio}}}\uc2  is a Decentraland-like virtual land startup with some 100,000 land parcels, each being minted as a unique nonfungible token (NFT) with coordinates. The advent of a the Metaverse in the crypto sector in the past months and Cardano's involvement in it may boost demand for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  further.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/meta-poaches-staff-from-microsoft-and-apple-for-metaverse-plans"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Meta poaches staff from Microsoft and Apple for metaverse plans}}}\par \par \uc2 This raises the possibility for Cardano to close above its 100-day EMA resistance wave, thus shifting the next upside target toward the 200-day EMA near $2.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, risks of an overall crypto market crash led by the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2 's {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-rallies-above-49k-following-fed-fomc-announcement-of-rate-hikes-in-2022"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tapering programs}}}\uc2  this year could spoil \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup to an extent.\par \par \uc2 "While \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is far from its peak, the prospect of obtaining more scalability as part of its 2022 roadmap explains why investors appear to be betting big on Cardano. This point was also noted by Liam Bussel, the CMO of Cardano-native DEX WingRiders in a statement to Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 Bussel said,\par \par \uc2 "In a world characterized by high performance and novel use cases, Cardano will be able to keep up and lead the pack. As a result, a weekly closing above $1.80 is likely, barring any last-minute profiteering by sellers."\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDEvNWQ5NDEwNTAtODZkMC00M2I0LTk2OWUtY2QyYWM5MDA1MjljLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220118ei1i000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Fear\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin price can\u8217\'20\'19t find its footing, but BTC fundamentals inspire confidence in traders\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Marcel Pechman \par \uc2 760 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 January 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Data shows traders still feel confident about BTC price because the futures premium and other fundamentals show no signs of stress.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) sudden crash on Jan. 10 caused the price to trade below $40,000 for the first time in 110 days and this was a wake-up call to leveraged traders. That week, $1.9 billion worth of long (buy) futures contracts were liquidated, causing the morale among traders to plunge.\par \par \uc2 The crypto "Fear & Greed" index, which ranges from 0 "extreme fear" to 100 "greed" reached 10 on Jan. 10, the lowest level it has been since the March 2020 crash. The indicator measures traders' sentiment using historical \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , market momentum, volume, Bitcoin dominance and social media.\par \par \uc2 As usual, the panic turned out to be a buying opportunity because the total crypto market capitalization rose by 13.5%, going from a $1.85 trillion bottom to $2.1 trillion in less than three days.\par \par \uc2 Currently, investors seem to be digesting this week\u8217\'20\'19s economic data, which shows December 2021 retail sales in the United States going down by 1.9% compared to the previous month.\par \par \uc2 Investors have reason to worry about stagflation, a scenario where inflation accelerates despite the lack of economic growth. However, even if this eventually proves that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s digital scarcity is a positive characteristic, markets will still take shelter with whatever asset is deemed safe. Thus, the first wave will potentially be damaging for cryptocurrencies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/8654bd4d-497d-403e-a5ee-2bc8a4a5d99a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Top weekly winners and losers on Jan. 17. Source: Nomics\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price was flat over the past seven days, effectively underperforming the altcoin market's 7% gain. Part of this unusual movement can be explained by layer-one decentralized applications platforms showing a positive performance that was driven by Fantom (FTM), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), Near Protocol (NEAR) and Harmony (ONE).\par \par \uc2 Loopring (LRC), a zkRollup open protocol for decentralized exchanges on Ethereum, presented the worst performance of the week. The DEX volume using the protocol peaked at $30 million per day in early December 2021 but is now near $6 million. Meanwhile, Dfinity (ICP) and Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) are adjusting after a 40% or higher rally in the first 10 days of 2022.\par \par \uc2 Tether's premium and the futures premium held up well\par \par \uc2 The OKEx Tether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tether-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDT}}}\uc2  ) premium or discount measures the difference between China-based peer-to-peer (P2P) trades and the official U.S. dollar. Figures above 100% indicate excessive demand for cryptocurrency investing. On the other hand, a 5% discount usually indicates heavy selling activity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/ca25a69a-eb2b-4cfd-aabb-94bfae141a04.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 OKEx USDT peer-to-peer premium vs. USD. Source: OKEx\par \par \uc2 The Tether indicator bottomed at a 3% discount on Dec. 31, which is slightly \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  but not alarming. However, this metric has held a decent 2% discount over the past week, signaling no panic selling from China-based traders.\par \par \uc2 To further prove that the crypto market structure has held, traders should analyze the CME's Bitcoin futures contracts premium. That metric analyzes the difference between longer-term futures contracts to the current spot price in regular markets.\par \par \uc2 Whenever this indicator fades or turns negative, it is an alarming red flag. This situation is also known as backwardation and indicates that \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment is present.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/30d0d5db-d265-462b-8323-28e362d91c25.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC CME 2-month forward contract premium vs. Bitcoin/USD. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 These fixed-month contracts usually trade at a slight premium, indicating that sellers request more money to withhold settlements for longer. As a result, futures should trade at a 0.5% to 2% premium in healthy markets, a situation known as contango.\par \par \uc2 Notice how the indicator flipped negative on Dec. 9 as Bitcoin traded below $49,000 but it still managed to sustain a slightly positive number. This shows that institutional traders display a lack of confidence, although it is not yet a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  structure.\par \par \uc2 Considering that the aggregate cryptocurrency market capitalization is down 9.5% to date, the market structure held rather nicely. The CME futures premium would have gone negative if there had been excessive demand for short-sellers.\par \par \uc2 Unless these fundamentals change significantly, there is not yet sufficient information available that would support calls for a sub-$40,000 Bitcoin price.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/noshitcoins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 author}}}\uc2  and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDEvZDM1ODU5MTktZDYxNi00ZDBlLTg0NjktY2RmMTFlM2MyODAxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220118ei1h000bg\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Fear\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin price can\u8217\'20\'19t find its footing, but BTC fundamentals inspire confidence in traders\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Marcel Pechman \par \uc2 758 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 January 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Data shows traders still feel confident about BTC price because the futures premium and other fundamentals show no signs of stress.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) sudden crash on Jan. 10 caused the price to trade below $40,000 for the first time in 110 days and this was a wake-up call to leveraged traders. $1.9 billion worth of long (buy) futures contracts were liquidated that week, causing the morale among traders to plunge.\par \par \uc2 The crypto "Fear & Greed" index, which ranges from 0 "extreme fear" to 100 "greed" reached 10 on Jan. 10, the lowest level it has been since the Mar. 2020 crash. The indicator measures traders' sentiment using historical \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , market momentum, volume, Bitcoin dominance and social media.\par \par \uc2 As usual, the panic turned out to be a buying opportunity because the total crypto market capitalization rose by 13.5%, going from a $1.85 trillion bottom to $2.1 trillion in less than three days.\par \par \uc2 Currently,