sures the difference between China-based peer-to-peer (P2P) trades and the official U.S. dollar. Figures above 100% indicate excessive demand for cryptocurrency investing. On the other hand, a 5% discount usually indicates heavy selling activity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/ca25a69a-eb2b-4cfd-aabb-94bfae141a04.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 OKEx USDT peer-to-peer premium vs. USD. Source: OKEx\par \par \uc2 The Tether indicator bottomed at a 3% discount on Dec. 31, which is slightly \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  but not alarming. However, this metric has held a decent 2% discount over the past week, signaling no panic selling from China-based traders.\par \par \uc2 To further prove that the crypto market structure has held, traders should analyze the CME's Bitcoin futures contracts premium. That metric analyzes the difference between longer-term futures contracts to the current spot price in regular markets.\par \par \uc2 Whenever this indicator fades or turns negative, it is an alarming red flag. This situation is also known as backwardation and indicates that \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment is present.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/30d0d5db-d265-462b-8323-28e362d91c25.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC CME 2-month forward contract premium vs. Bitcoin/USD. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 These fixed-month contracts usually trade at a slight premium, indicating that sellers request more money to withhold settlements for longer. As a result, futures should trade at a 0.5% to 2% premium in healthy markets, a situation known as contango.\par \par \uc2 Notice how the indicator flipped negative on Dec. 9 as Bitcoin traded below $49,000 but it still managed to sustain a slightly positive number. This shows that institutional traders display a lack of confidence, although it is not yet a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  structure.\par \par \uc2 Considering that the aggregate cryptocurrency market capitalization is down 9.5% to date, the market structure held rather nicely. The CME futures premium would have gone negative if there had been excessive demand for short-sellers.\par \par \uc2 Unless these fundamentals change significantly, there is not yet sufficient information available that would support calls for a sub-$40,000 Bitcoin price.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/noshitcoins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 author}}}\uc2  and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDEvZDM1ODU5MTktZDYxNi00ZDBlLTg0NjktY2RmMTFlM2MyODAxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220118ei1h00008\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/17: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, XRP, LUNA, DOT, AVAX, DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,717 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 January 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and most major altcoins took a turn for the worse after BTC price dipped below $42,000.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been shrinking in the past few days. The standard deviation of daily Bitcoin returns for the last 30 and 60 days as calculated by the Bitcoin \b \highlight22\uc2 Volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  Index is at 2.63%, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-likely-to-repeat-q4-2020-move-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 least volatile it has been since November 2020}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Generally, tight ranges are followed by strong price expansions. In 2020, the low \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  period in November was followed by a sharp rally in mid-December, which resulted in a supercycle that carried the price all the way to $64,854 on April 14, 2021.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/82616bee-6fc6-4d3b-9d7f-9f10da8955b8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, there is no certainty that the \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  expansion will happen only to the upside. The price could break out in either direction. Commentator Vince Prince warned that the high leverage ratio of Bitcoin could {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-stays-in-tight-range-as-analyst-eyes-potential-interesting-week-in-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 trigger a big chunk of stop-losses}}}\uc2  if the $40,000 support breaks down.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin start a new up-move or will bears pull the price below the support levels, triggering a sell-off in altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been trading near the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($44,181) for the past few days. Although bulls have not been able to push the price above this resistance, a minor positive is that they have not given up much ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/4ca48fbf-6f99-4e65-8502-d938ae4c9bd4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level or $41,725.95, the bulls will make one more attempt to clear the overhead resistance at the 20-day EMA and the horizontal resistance at $45,456.\par \par \uc2 If they do that, the pair could rise to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($47,680) where the bulls may again encounter stiff resistance from the bears. A break and close above this resistance could push the pair to $52,088.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price breaks below $41,725.95, the BTC/USDT pair could drop to the strong support at $39,600. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if it breaks down, the selling could intensify and the pair may plummet toward $30,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) recovery off the support line of the descending channel fizzled out near the 20-day EMA ($3,439), which suggests that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/b479d0d7-dbf3-4911-adeb-304eba7e7291.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to pull the price below $3,188. If they manage to do that, the ETH/USDT pair could drop to $2,928.83. This is an important support to watch out for because if it collapses, the decline could extend to $2,652.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the 20-day EMA, the bulls will try to push the pair above the resistance line of the channel. If that happens, the pair could rise to $4,200.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) failed to break above the resistance line of the descending channel pattern on Jan. 16. This may have sparked selling by short-term traders, pulling the price below the 20-day EMA ($488).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/4e465941-b386-416f-bd05-1087766e289b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears pull the price below $466.50, the BNB/USDT pair could decline toward the support line of the channel. The flat moving averages and the RSI just below the midpoint, indicate equilibrium between the bulls and bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $466.50, the bulls will again try to thrust the price above the channel and the 50-day SMA ($530). If they succeed, it will signal a possible change in trend. The pair could then rally to $572.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the 50-day SMA ($1.34) on Jan. 16, indicating that bulls are attempting a comeback. The price could now reach the resistance line of the descending channel.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/837c3fa0-713c-4149-8cef-f2c9078a74b0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI has jumped into the positive zone, indicating that bulls have the upper hand in the short term. If buyers propel and sustain the price above the channel, it will signal a change in trend.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could first rally to $1.87 and if this level is crossed, the next move could be to $2.47. On the other hand, if the price turns down from the resistance line, the pair could again drop to the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade inside the descending channel pattern. The bulls attempted to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($154) on Jan. 13 but failed. This suggests that bears are selling on every minor rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/e2be4d16-7a33-41a4-ab46-a6193f9e03ae.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will now attempt to pull the price below the support at $130. If they succeed, the SOL/USDT pair could drop to the strong support at $116. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break below it could sink the pair to the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rise to the resistance line of the channel. A break and close above the channel will signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between the 20-day EMA ($0.79) and the support at $0.75. This squeeze is soon likely to end in a range expansion.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/89175e05-83c5-410e-adb6-f12e741419b9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks below $0.75, the XRP/USDT pair could resume its downtrend and drop to $0.69 followed by a decline to $0.60. The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative territory indicate advantage to bears.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from $0.75 and breaks above the moving averages, it will suggest accumulation at lower levels. The pair could then start its northward march toward the stiff overhead resistance at $1.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token could not rise and sustain above the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $87.88 on Jan. 15 and 16. This may have triggered profit-booking by short-term bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/04f6b01d-98dc-4eca-815c-460cf72aac84.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price has turned down to the 20-day EMA ($80.17), which could act as a support. If the price turns up from the current level, the bulls will again try to propel and sustain the LUNA/USDT pair above $87.88.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the pair could rally to the 78.6% Fibonacci retracement level at $94.80. Alternatively, if the price slips below both moving averages, it will suggest that traders are rushing to the exit. The pair could then drop to $68.33.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/propy-rallies-227-as-real-estate-nfts-become-reality-and-pro-lists-at-coinbase"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Propy rallies 227% as real estate NFTs become reality and PRO lists at Coinbase}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) rose above the 20-day EMA ($26.90) on Jan. 12 but the bulls could not push the price above the 50-day SMA ($28.15). This may have attracted profit-booking from the short-term traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/fdc5164b-35ab-4632-a420-4b8c68d40a5e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled the price back below the 20-day EMA on Jan. 17. If sellers sink the price below $25.45, the DOT/USDT pair could drop to the strong support at $22.66.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flat and the RSI is just below the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. This suggests that the pair could remain range-bound between $22.66 and $32.78 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level and rises above the 50-day SMA, the pair could rally to $32.78. The bulls will have to clear this hurdle to signal the start of a new up-move.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($95) on Jan. 16, indicating that bears continue to defend this level aggressively. If the price sustains below the uptrend line of the symmetrical triangle, the next stop could be $75.50.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/7316a351-a515-47a6-98a6-75480dad764d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative zone indicate that bears have the upper hand. A close and below $75.50 could complete a descending triangle pattern, which could signal the start of a new downtrend.\par \par \uc2 The AVAX/USDT pair could drop to $57.02 and then to $50. This negative view will be invalidated if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the downtrend line. The pair could then rally to $128.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) failure to rise and sustain above the $0.19 overhead resistance on Jan. 15 may have attracted profit-booking from short-term traders. This has pulled the price to the 20-day EMA ($0.16).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/f9079d68-b1f4-402b-8459-ec8d87f5d071.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA and the RSI just below the midpoint signal a consolidation in the near term. If bears sink and sustain the price below the moving averages, the DOGE/USDT pair could drop to $0.13.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the current level, the bulls will make one more attempt to push and sustain the pair above $0.19. If they manage to do that, it will indicate the start of a new up-move.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDEvZDNjY2JhMjQtOGY2NC00ZmI2LTk2OTMtZDdiZDBmOGFjOTliLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220117ei1h000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin stays in tight range as analyst eyes potential 'interesting week' in BTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 574 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 January 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC price action could flip "interesting" in the coming days while Bitcoin slowly loses traders' attention.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) hovered near $43,000 on Jan. 17 as its "boring" price action combined with signs that the market could be stabilizing.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/fde27ada-11f3-409f-a9d8-b55362deba9b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Leverage comes off all-time highs\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.142027444.742658523.1640948929-762064149.1640948929"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD staying firmly within its established trading range between $40,000 and $45,000.\par \par \uc2 With few surprises expected thanks to the Wall Street holiday, traders took the opportunity to call for a level-headed approach on focus on altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is down a few hundred dollars! Quick, someone come up with a narrative for this incredible crash and spread it around the media and \uc2 twitter\uc2 !\par \par \uc2 (This is sarcasm, nothing is happening, Bitcoin is sideways and boring)\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 The Wolf Of All Streets (@scottmelker) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/scottmelker/status/1483048791255175178?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 January 17, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 Popular analyst William Clemente, meanwhile, highlighted Bitcoin bouncing along an ascending trendline this month, this soon to approach a turning point as part of a wedge construction.\par \par \uc2 "Should be an interesting week," he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/WClementeIII/status/1482861890703343621"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 forecast}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Beyond spot price, data {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptoquant.com/asset/btc/chart/market-indicator/estimated-leverage-ratio?exchange=all_exchange&window=DAY&sma=0&ema=0&priceScale=linear&metricScale=linear&chartStyle=line"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 showed}}}\uc2  that market composition still employed near all-time high leverage, this only just beginning to reduce in week two of January.\par \par \uc2 Such leverage prevalence previously sparked {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-leverage-ratio-reaches-new-highs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 concerns that a liquidity cascade}}}\uc2  could be made all the more real, with a significant move up or down hitting traders.\par \par \uc2 "The highly increased leverage ratio of Bitcoin that since some days remains at an all-time high is showing concerns that a massive \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  increase will follow up," commentator Vince Prince {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Vince_Prince_/status/1483029581376356355"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 warned}}}\uc2  on the day.\par \par \uc2 "Technically if Bitcoin breaks the $40,000 level this will trigger a big chunk of stop-losses."\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/abd08c16-868d-4814-bba3-6d1a29d7a906.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin leverage ratio chart. Source: CryptoQuant\par \par \uc2 Cardano stands out among altcoins\par \par \uc2 On the topic of altcoins, meanwhile, some moves diverged from the flat performance seen more broadly.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-likely-to-repeat-q4-2020-move-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC \u8216\'20\'18likely\u8217\'20\'19 to repeat Q4 2020 move \u8212\'20\'14 5 things to watch in Bitcoin this week}}}\par \par \uc2 The top 10 cryptocurrencies by market cap were led by Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), which conspicuously bucked the sideways trend to post daily gains of almost 9% at the time of writing. This placed \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD at a three-week high.\par \par \uc2 "Crucially, the market psychology is working on \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  again," Cointelegraph contributor Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1483038362932064257"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 summarized}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "Last weeks the sentiment was comparable to a graveyard and expectations were that it would go south. Now, the sentiment is switching and the hype is getting back in."\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/e0591268-de8e-4c8b-a2c4-ebd1ee104daf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD 1-day candle chart (\uc2 Coinbase\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Further down, \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) managed 4.5% gains in some brief respite for hodlers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24LTC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $LTC}}}\uc2  / {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BTC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BTC}}}\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 's friend intervened, told him life was worth living and said "think of your family."\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  said "NOT TODAY" and stepped back from the ledge.\par \par \uc2 Another bounce at strong support. A break of the blue resistance should send this flying. Not there yet. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/CvJtodHwNB"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/CvJtodHwNB}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/VOC5psrUhF"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/VOC5psrUhF}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 The Wolf Of All Streets (@scottmelker) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/scottmelker/status/1483038765471969280?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 January 17, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 "Another bounce at strong support. A break of the blue resistance should send this flying. Not there yet," trader, analyst and podcast host Scott Melker added about the LTC/USD pair. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/scottmelker/status/1483038765471969280/photo/1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://twitter.com/scottmelker/status/1483038765471969280/photo/1}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDEvNjNlNDQ3Y2UtY2Q4OS00YjViLWJhYTctNDU4Yzg2MjJiNDE3LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220117ei1h0008e\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/14: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, LUNA, DOT, AVAX, DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,847 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 January 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Right now, bulls are buying each dip and bears are selling the top of each rally, suggesting that BTC and altcoins will remain range-bound.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and most major altcoins are facing selling at higher levels and buying on dips, indicating the possibility of a range formation. On-chain analysis firm Whalemap said that a \u8220\'20\'1Creclaim of $46,500 will look like a trend reversal,\u8221\'20\'1D for Bitcoin as the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/analysts-expect-turbulent-bitcoin-price-until-46-500-flips-to-support"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 previous accumulation phase of 90,000 BTC}}}\uc2  was at this level.\par \par \uc2 Fidelity Digital Assets\uc2  said in its annual report that the \u8220\'20\'1Cmassive \u8220\'20\'1C Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-cycle-is-far-from-over-and-miners-are-in-it-for-the-long-haul-fidelity-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 accumulation by Bitcoin miners}}}\uc2  suggests that the \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin cycle is far from over.\u8221\'20\'1D The report went on to add that more sovereign nations may \u8220\'20\'1Cacquire Bitcoin in 2022 and perhaps even see a central bank make an acquisition.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/75c2a9b8-e84e-4392-a26e-fae9b46ab378.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Switzerland-based financial institution SEBA Bank CEO Guido Buehler said in a recent interview that if the right counterparties and necessary regulations are in place, asset pools at SEBA may invest in Bitcoin at the right time. Buehler {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/institutional-investment-will-boost-bitcoin-to-75-000-says-seba-ceo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 portrayed a \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  picture for Bitcoin}}}\uc2 , saying a rally to $75,000 was possible.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin and most major altcoins remain range-bound in the short term? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin turned down from the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($44,681) on Jan. 13, indicating that bears continue to sell on rallies. The bears will now attempt to pull the price back to the strong support at $39,600.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/b0e8a9c5-290b-480b-b3ca-fb10d9c2e231.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping down and the relative strength index (RSI) is in negative territory, indicating that the path of least resistance is to the downside. If sellers sink and sustain the price below $39,600, the BTC/USDT pair could extend the decline to $30,000.\par \par \uc2 However, the bulls are unlikely to give up easily at $39,600. A strong rebound off the current level or from $39,600 will suggest accumulation at lower levels. The pair could then remain range-bound between $39,600 and $45,456 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above $45,456 will be the first indication that the correction may be over. The pair could then start its northward march toward $52,088.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rebound off the support line of the descending channel on Jan. 10 could not even reach the 20-day EMA ($3,485) which suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/9731d01b-43f3-4dec-a5b3-50ca3408e2d9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are sloping down and the RSI is below 40, suggesting that bears are in control. The sellers will now try to pull the price to the zone between the psychological level at $3,000 and the support line of the channel. A break and close below $2,652 will signal the start of the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns up from the current level, the bulls will make one more attempt to push the ETH/USDT pair above the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the pair could rise to the resistance line of the channel and later to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($3,893). The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above this level to signal that the downtrend could be over.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) is facing strong resistance at the 20-day EMA ($487) but a minor positive is that the bulls have not given up much ground. This suggests that traders are not rushing to the exit.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/527f4e24-0f72-41ed-b460-1e412c2ef663.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks above the 20-day EMA, the bulls will try to clear the overhead hurdle at the downtrend line. If they can pull it off, the BNB/USDT pair will signal a possible change in trend. The pair could then attempt a rally to $617.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA or the downtrend line, it will suggest that bears are selling on rallies. That could keep the pair stuck inside the channel for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) reached the 20-day EMA ($157) on Jan. 13 but the bulls could not clear this overhead hurdle. This suggests that the bears have not yet given up and are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/3b9e9b91-d41d-4290-948f-621de1ad269e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will now attempt to resume the downtrend by pulling the price below the support at $130. If they do that, the SOL/USDT pair could decline to the next important support at $116.\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rises above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rally to the resistance line of the channel. The bulls will have to push the pair above the channel to signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 50-day SMA ($1.35) on Jan. 13 but the bulls did not allow the price to break below the $1.18 support. This suggests that bulls are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/7702835a-a374-4d44-bddb-c66c686ba788.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now attempt to push and sustain the price above the 50-day SMA. If they manage to do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to the resistance line of the descending channel. A break and close above the channel could indicate that the downtrend has ended.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the 50-day SMA, it will suggest that bears continue to sell on rallies. The sellers will then try to sink the pair below $1.18 and pull the price to the critical support at $1.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($0.80) on Jan. 13 but a minor positive is that bulls did not allow the price to dip below the support at $0.75. This indicates accumulation at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/b279f7fa-5f4d-47a6-a9ba-3b9c453c3364.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls drive the price above the moving averages, it will suggest that the bears may be losing their grip. The XRP/USDT pair could then rise to the overhead resistance at $1.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this level, the pair could remain range-bound between $1 and $0.75 for a few more days. A break and close above $1 will signal the start of an up-move toward $1.41.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will attempt to pull the pair below the $0.75 to $0.69 support zone and resume the downtrend to $0.60.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token broke and closed above the resistance line of the channel on Jan. 12. The bears tried to pull the price below the 20-day EMA ($78.61) on Jan. 13 but failed. This indicates that bulls are defending the support aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/a8f1bf10-5cb2-48ce-8275-875981a08e22.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers are currently attempting to push and sustain the price above the channel and the overhead resistance at $83.86. If they manage to do that, the LUNA/USDT pair could rally to $93.81.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is trying to turn up and the RSI has risen into the positive territory, indicating that buyers are attempting a comeback.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the moving averages. That could pull the price down to the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-dips-below-42k-as-new-forecast-says-breakout-most-probable-outcome-for-btc-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin dips below $42K as new forecast says breakout 'most probable outcome' for BTC price}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($26.81) on Jan. 13 but the positive sign is that the bulls did not give up much ground. This indicates that bulls are viewing the dips as a buying opportunity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/8a4df653-11ef-4c97-9ad8-2bf8e0a1ad45.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently trying to sustain the price above the moving averages. If they do that, the DOT/USDT pair could rise to the overhead resistance at $32.78. The flat 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $32.78, the pair may extend its stay inside the range for a few more days. The next trending move may start on a break and close above the overhead resistance at $32.78 or on a break below the support at $22.66.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($96) on Jan. 13, indicating that bears continue to sell on rallies. The price has dipped back to the uptrend line of the symmetrical triangle, which could act as a support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/b07b7ee6-7de7-40d7-8114-9e7a4fe687ae.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the current level, the buyers will again attempt to propel the price above the moving averages. If they succeed, the AVAX/USDT pair could rally to the downtrend line of the triangle.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the triangle will suggest that the correction could be over. The pair may then rise to $128.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price slips below the uptrend line of the channel, the pair may retest the critical level at $75.50. If this support cracks, the pair could start a decline toward $57 and then $50.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the 20-day EMA ($0.16) on Jan. 13, which was the first indication that the selling pressure may be reducing. That was followed by another sharp move on Jan. 14, which pushed the price above the stiff overhead resistance at $0.19.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/128aad9b-38f7-4837-a184-8ba8629f0a41.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the long wick on Jan. 14\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bears continue to sell at higher levels. If the price sustains below $0.19, the DOGE/USDT pair could drop to the moving averages and extend its range-bound action for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price sustains above $0.19, the bulls will make one more attempt to clear the overhead resistance zone at $0.22 to $0.24. If they manage to do that, the pair could rally toward $0.30.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDEvYjVkNDY1OTUtN2MzOS00YTQ1LWExY2UtMWY0NzI5OGExMDEwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220114ei1e000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, LUNA, DOT, AVAX, DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,739 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 January 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and most altcoins have started a strong recovery that could reach overhead resistance levels where bears may mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and most major altcoins appear to have started a relief rally. Glassnode data suggests that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/retail-is-pushing-the-bitcoin-price-up-says-ledger-ceo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin addresses with a non-zero balance}}}\uc2  have risen to about 40 million, indicating increasing adoption by retail traders.\par \par \uc2 Edelman Financial Engines founder Ric Edelman said that the number of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/a-third-of-americans-to-buy-bitcoin-by-end-of-2022-says-ric-edelman"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Americans owning Bitcoin could rise from 24%}}}\uc2  currently to one-third by 2022. He expects this to happen as \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin is becoming more and more mainstream. People are hearing about it everywhere \u8212\'20\'14 it isn\u8217\'20\'19t going away.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/aa1ce27f-d009-4a1b-8fc3-a8c0c2f18198.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The investors buying Bitcoin seem to be in it for the long haul if the outflows from major exchanges are any indication. CryptoQuant data shows {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-exchange-outflows-see-biggest-daily-spike-since-september-2021"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 outflows of 29,371 BTC on Jan. 11}}}\uc2 , the highest withdrawals since Sep. 10.\par \par \uc2 Could the recovery in Bitcoin and the major altcoins sustain the higher levels? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bounced off the $39,600 support on Jan. 10 indicating that bulls are attempting to defend the level with full force. The relief rally could reach the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($45,058) which is likely to act as a resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/9780197d-114a-4d39-85a1-18c90d078b9b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the relative strength index (RSI) in the negative zone indicate that bears have the upper hand. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the BTC/USDT pair could again retest the strong support at $39,600.\par \par \uc2 If the level cracks, the pair could witness panic selling, indicating the start of the next leg of the down move.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bulls push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rise to the 50-simple moving average (SMA) ($49,031). If this level is crossed, the recovery could reach the stiff overhead resistance at $52,088.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the support line of the descending channel on Jan. 10, suggesting that bulls are attempting to defend this level with vigor. The price could reach the overhead zone between the 20-day EMA ($3,536) and the resistance line of the channel.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/ed48069b-65fb-41d2-a36e-5a331a3576b3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are trending down and the RSI is in the negative zone, indicating that bears have the upper hand. If the price turns down from the overhead zone, it will suggest that sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. The bears will then attempt to pull the ETH/USDT pair to the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if bulls push the price above the overhead zone, the pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($3,938). A break and close above this resistance will suggest a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) broke below the support line of the descending channel on Jan. 10, but the bears could not achieve a close below it as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/bd6370a1-8ecf-4035-9d60-f497f44392f4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This could have caught the aggressive bears off guard, resulting in a short squeeze on Jan. 11. Follow-up buying on Jan. 12 has pushed the price to the 20-day EMA ($489). If bulls clear this hurdle, the BNB/USDT pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($542).\par \par \uc2 A break and close above this resistance will suggest that the downtrend could be over. The pair could then rise to $617. Conversely, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA or the downtrend line, the bears will again try to pull the price to the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) is attempting a pullback in a downtrend. The price turned up from $130 on Jan. 10 and could now reach the 20-day EMA ($159).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/77073f1f-3a9a-40a0-8450-41eed1d24e22.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative zone suggest that bears have the upper hand. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the sellers will attempt to sink the SOL/USDT pair to the strong support at $116.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if bulls push the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rise to the resistance line of the channel. A break and close above the channel will signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned up from $1.06 on Jan. 10, indicating that bulls are attempting a relief rally. The buyers have pushed the price to the 20-day EMA ($1.27) on Jan. 12.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/4214e060-6e3a-4e2a-a1e0-b9a41d45ef40.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The RSI is attempting to form a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence, indicating that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening. If bulls thrust the price above the moving averages, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to the resistance line of the descending channel.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the moving averages, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. The bears will then make one more attempt to pull the price down to the critical support at $1.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) dropped to $0.69 on Jan. 10 but the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bulls bought this dip aggressively. The buyers pushed the price back above the overhead resistance at $0.75 on Jan. 11.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/2f1666f1-9bc9-43cd-a69d-7ab870fbff79.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USDT pair reached the 20-day EMA ($0.80) on Jan. 12 but the long wick on the candlestick indicates that bears continue to defend this level. If the price turns down from the current level, the bears will again try to pull the XRP/USDT pair below $0.69. If they manage to do that, the pair could plummet to the Dec. 4 intraday low at $0.60.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bulls push the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($0.86). A break and close above this resistance could clear the path for a possible up-move to $1.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token bounced off the support line of the channel on Jan. 10 and broke above the 50-day SMA ($71.99) on Jan. 11. Follow-up buying has pushed the price to the 20-day EMA ($78.12) on Jan. 12.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/2dc618ff-5192-4542-9fec-b85235c20777.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now try to propel the price above the resistance line of the descending channel. A close above the channel will be the first sign that the downtrend could be over. The LUNA/USDT pair will then attempt a rally to $93.81.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the resistance line, the pair could remain inside the channel for a few more days. A break and close below the support line of the channel could indicate the start of a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-shoots-to-44-000-as-us-inflation-hits-7-in-december"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin shoots to $44,000 as US inflation hits 7.8% in December}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the $22.66 support on Jan. 10, indicating that the bulls are defending the support. The rebound has reached the 20-day EMA ($26.85), which could act as a resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/434d7dad-9a85-4727-a488-b8059e0f8ffc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will again try to sink and sustain the DOT/USDT pair below the $22.66 support. If they pull it off, the pair could resume its downtrend. The next level to watch on the downside is $16.81.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bulls drive the price above the moving averages, the pair could rally to the resistance of the range at $32.78. The buyers will have to push and sustain the price above this level to signal the start of a new up-move.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Although Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) closed below the uptrend line of the symmetrical triangle on Jan. 8 and again on Jan. 10, the bears could not sustain the lower levels. This suggests that the bulls bought the dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/f4aa6854-bccb-4c28-b283-1c682358f790.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price back into the triangle on Jan. 11 and have followed that with another up-move on Jan. 12. The relief rally is likely to face stiff resistance at the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this overhead resistance, the bears will make one more attempt to sink and sustain the AVAX/USDT pair below the triangle and the critical support at $75.50.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bulls drive and sustain the price above the moving averages, the bulls will sense an opportunity and try to push the pair above the downtrend line of the triangle.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears attempted to pull Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) below the Dec. 4 intraday low at $0.13 but the bulls thwarted their attempt on Jan. 10. The buyers pushed the price back above $0.15 on Jan. 11 but hit a roadblock at the 20-day EMA ($0.16).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/1cda0af0-089f-4ce6-9733-64756dc090a6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative territory suggest that bears have the upper hand. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will attempt to pull the price below $0.13.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the DOGE/USDT pair could slide to the psychological support at $0.10. This negative view will invalidate if bulls drive and sustain the price above the moving averages. That could indicate a possible change in trend. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may pick up on a break and close above $0.19.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDEvMWVkM2IzMjItMWY1OC00ZWNlLWI0MTctYzJkODUyM2Q2MDA0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220112ei1c000e4\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 SEBA\par \b \uc2 Seba Bank raises $119M in Series C funding\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Zhiyuan Sun \par \uc2 319 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 January 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CSEBA Bank is privileged to access a wide range of new skills and capabilities to fast-forward our growth plans,\u8221\'20\'1D says the firm\u8217\'20\'19s CEO.\par \par \uc2 Seba Bank, a Swiss-based digital assets banking platform regulated by the \uc2 Swiss Financial Market Supervisory Authority\uc2 , announced on Wednesday that it had completed a successful Series C funding round of 110 million Swiss franc, or $119 million U.S. dollars. Notable investors in the round included cryptocurrency exchange FTX, quantitative digital currency trading firm Alameda Research, decentralized finance asset management firm \uc2 DeFi Technologies\uc2 , and venture capital entities such as Altive, Ordway Selections and Summer Capital.\par \par \uc2 The bank said it plans to use the funds to fuel international growth and drive demand from institutional investors in the digital assets industry. Seba has been at the forefront of crypto innovation in Switzerland. In September 2021, the firm was granted the first Swiss {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/seba-bank-granted-the-first-swiss-digital-asset-custody-license"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22digital asset\b0 \highlight22  custody license}}}\uc2 . One month later, it {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/seba-bank-launches-problems-for-users-to-earn-yield-on-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 launched a program}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/seba-bank-launches-problems-for-users-to-earn-yield-on-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/seba-bank-launches-problems-for-users-to-earn-yield-on-crypto}}}\uc2  for users to earn yields on their {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xtz-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  holdings. In December 2021, the bank launched its own regulated {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/seba-bank-launches-regulated-gold-token-to-enable-digital-ownership-of-physical-gold"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 gold token exchangeable}}}\uc2  with physical gold on-demand, which could potentially be used as a gold-standard digital currency. Seba Bank {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/regulated-swiss-crypto-bank-seba-opens-doors"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 became fully operational}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/regulated-swiss-crypto-bank-seba-opens-doors"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/regulated-swiss-crypto-bank-seba-opens-doors}}}\uc2  to professional investors and institutional clients in 2019.\par \par \uc2 Jonathan Ordway Fackelmayer, Chairman of Ordway Selections, issued the following statement regarding the development:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe are delighted to be part of the lead-investor consortium alongside Altive and Summer Capital. They both hold a deep knowledge of financial services and technology applications. Our consortium believes SEBA Bank is uniquely positioned to respond to the needs of the ever-growing and demanding pool of cryptocurrency investors worldwide.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDEvNmIxOGIxZjgtZGU2OC00NjcyLWJmNDMtMTM4ZDFkOWYxMTVlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220112ei1c0005m\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/10: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, LUNA, DOT, AVAX, DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,852 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 January 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Buyers stepped in to buy BTC\u8217\'20\'19s dip to $39,650, but there are signs that the market-wide correction might not be over.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) dipped {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-drops-below-40k-for-first-time-in-3-months-as-fear-set-to-accelerate"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 below the $40,000 level on Jan. 10}}}\uc2  for the first time since September 2021. The crypto markets were not alone as the U.S. equity markets also witnessed strong selling when traders chose to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2022/01/09/stock-market-futures-open-to-close-news.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reduce}}}\uc2  risk and piled into the 10-year Treasury yield which surged to 1.8% from 1.51% at the end of 2021.\par \par \uc2 On Jan. 9, Goldman Sachs chief economist, Jan Hatzius, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2022/01/10/goldman-predicts-the-fed-while-hike-rates-four-times-this-year-more-than-previously-expected.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  that the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2  may increase rates by four quarter-percentage points in 2022.\par \par \uc2 Analyst Alex Kr\u252\'00\'FCeger also warned that crypto markets {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/most-bullish-macro-backdrop-in-75-years-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 may not be able to ignore the Fed}}}\uc2  if it \u8220\'20\'1Cdecides to go all out wielding a deflationary machete.\u8221\'20\'1D He was not alone as ex-BitMEX CEO Arthur Hayes and Pentoshi also projected a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  picture.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/cf19d9d6-95b0-488e-80ed-35dc88ee79b6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Quant analyst Benjamin Cowen gave some hopes to the bulls when he said that levels of \u8220\'20\'1Cextreme fear\u8221\'20\'1D on the Crypto Fear & Greed Index occurred only four times since 2018 and those were followed by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-batters-longs-as-liquidations-copy-may-2021-run-to-30k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  reversals resulting in strong returns}}}\uc2  between 17% to 1,585% in Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and major altcoins start a sustained recovery or will the support levels give way? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin plunged to $39,650 today when buyers stepped in and bought aggressively as seen from the long tail on the candlestick. If buyers sustain the rebound, the price could attempt to move toward the 20-day exponential moving average ($45,369).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/71f37bb8-7b42-445e-9fb4-09d7a1674cf7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping down and the relative strength index (RSI) is in the oversold zone suggesting that bears are in command. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the BTC/USDT pair could again drop to the strong support at $39,600 and remain range-bound between these two levels for a few days.\par \par \uc2 If the support at $39,600 gives way, the selling could intensify further and the pair could start its march toward $30,000.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bulls drive the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rally to the stiff overhead resistance at $52,088. A break and close above this resistance could signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls have been defending the support line of the descending channel for the past few days but they have not been able to achieve a strong rebound off it. This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels. Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) attempted a recovery on Jan. 9, but it could not rise above the breakdown level at $3,250.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/da576543-3026-4ecf-b68e-9f5165fee090.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price has turned down again today and the bears are attempting to pull the ETH/USDT pair below the descending channel. If they manage to do that, the selling could intensify and the pair could drop to the next strong support at $2,652.\par \par \uc2 This is an important support for the bulls to defend because if it cracks, the pair could plummet toward the psychological support at $2,000.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the current level, the bulls will make one more attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at $3,250 and push the pair to the resistance line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the support line of the descending channel on Jan. 8 but the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick showed buying at lower levels. The bulls pushed the price back into the channel on Jan. 9 but failed to sustain the price above the breakdown level at $435.30.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/a0c8063f-eb93-4d60-864d-0a58be9abc83.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price has turned down once again today and the bears are attempting to sustain the BNB/USDT pair below the channel. If they succeed, the pair could decline to $392.20. This is an important support for the bulls to defend because if it cracks, the next stop could be $330.\par \par \uc2 The RSI has dropped into the oversold territory, indicating that the selling may be overdone in the short term. This could result in a minor recovery or a range-bound action in the next few days. A break and close above the 20-day EMA ($492) will be the first sign that the sellers may be losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/solana"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) attempted a recovery on Jan. 8 but the bulls could not push the price back above $150. This suggests that bears are selling on relief rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/49098655-c0e7-4e63-a376-b16f00575aae.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears sustain the price below $133, the SOL/USDT pair could drop to the strong support at $116. Both moving averages are sloping down and the RSI is close to the oversold zone, indicating that bears are in control.\par \par \uc2 If the $116 level cracks, the pair could decline to the support line of the channel. If this support also breaks down, the selling may intensify and the pair could plummet to $82. The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA ($162).\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke and closed below the $1.18 support on Jan. 9 indicating the resumption of the downtrend. The next support on the downside is the critical level at $1.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/940da126-6419-4772-9fbf-836777b7e64e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are likely to defend this level aggressively as it has not been breached for the past several months. If the price rebounds off $1, the pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($1.39) where the bears are expected to mount a strong resistance.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the moving averages, the bears will make one more attempt to pull the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair below $1. If they succeed, the selling could pick up momentum and the pair could drop to the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/ripple"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  closed below the $0.75 support on Jan. 8 but rose back above the level on Jan. 9. This suggests that bulls were attempting to trap the aggressive bears, but the recovery attempt was short-lived.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/05b3b14f-fc02-4092-831a-0f043952badd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price has turned back below $0.75 today, indicating that bears are selling on every minor rally. The downsloping moving averages and the RSI near the oversold zone indicate that bears are in command.\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below $0.75, the XRP/USDT pair could drop to the Dec. 4 intraday low at $0.60. The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.87) to signal the start of a stronger recovery.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s LUNA token broke below the descending channel pattern on Dec. 8 but the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests buying at lower levels. The bulls pushed the price back into the channel and above the 50-day SMA ($70) on Dec. 9.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/729a05d5-93ac-4d43-aed3-9957ceef4a70.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The relief rally hit a barrier at $75.67 and the price has turned down below the 50-day SMA today. This suggests that bears continue to sell on rallies. The 20-day EMA ($78) is sloping down and the RSI is near 43, indicating that bears are in control.\par \par \uc2 If bears pull the price below $62.46, the selling could intensify and the LUNA/USDT pair could drop to $51.84. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be negated if the price turns up from the support line of the channel and breaks above the resistance line.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/billionaire-investor-bill-miller-puts-50-of-net-worth-in-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Billionaire investor Bill Miller puts 50% of net worth in Bitcoin}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) attempted a rebound off the strong support at $22.66 but the bulls have not been able to push the price to the 20-day EMA ($26.95). This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/9e729a34-51c0-4048-88b6-7d9808b9bc04.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative zone suggest that bears have the upper hand. If bears sink and sustain the price below $22.66, the DOT/USDT pair could start its downward journey to $16.81.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the current level, the bulls will again try to push the pair above the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, the pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($29.66) and then to the overhead resistance at $32.78.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/avalanche"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the uptrend line of the symmetrical triangle on Jan. 8 but the bears could not build upon this advantage. The bulls pushed the price back into the triangle on Jan. 9.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/adaf0908-c4bb-438e-aeec-259b77ac1202.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the recovery was short-lived as the bears have pulled the price back below the triangle. This indicates that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on every minor rally.\par \par \uc2 There is a strong support at $75.50 but if it collapses, the AVAX/USDT pair could tumble to $57.02 and then to $50.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price rebounds off the current level or the $75.50 support and sustains inside the triangle, it will suggest accumulation at lower levels. The pair could then rise to $98 where bears may mount a strong resistance.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the moving averages could open the doors for a rally to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has broken below the critical support at $0.15, signaling the start of the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/26d607ad-89d1-476b-8402-952d1639dd4d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the oversold territory suggest that the path of least resistance is to the downside. If bears sustain the price below $0.15, the DOGE/USDT pair could drop to the Dec. 4 intraday low at $0.13.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off the current level, the bulls will try to push the pair above the moving averages. If they do that, it will bring the $0.19 to $0.15 range into play and the pair could rise to $0.19.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above this resistance to indicate the start of a new up-move.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDEvYThmZDc3YzAtYTMzOC00NzQ0LTkxZjQtNGIxMDQ0Njk4YjBiLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220110ei1a000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 BTC\par \b \uc2 These 3 cryptocurrencies are taking an even bigger hit during Bitcoin's price slump\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 1,020 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 January 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin's run-down in the first ten days of 2022 is still less disappointing than some of its top crypto rivals, which have fallen harder.\par \par \uc2 The cost to purchase one Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has dropped almost 10% in the last seven days and has been eyeing extended declines as it {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-drops-below-40k-for-first-time-in-3-months-as-fear-set-to-accelerate"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 drops below $40,000}}}\uc2 , its interim psychological support, on Jan. 10.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/acdb863c-89d6-46d3-8789-074009766b54.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD weekly price chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Nonetheless, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-drops-to-43-7k-after-fed-minutes-re-confirm-plans-to-hike-rates"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 losses suffered by Bitcoin}}}\uc2  still appear less than that of some of its top crypto rivals' performances. For instance, Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), the seventh-largest cryptocurrency by market valuation, has dropped by nearly 11% to around $1.15 in the last seven days.\par \par \uc2 Similarly, Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ), the eighth-largest by market capitalization, has dipped by around 10% to nearly $0.75 in the same period.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, some cryptocurrencies listed among the top 50 digital assets have experienced bigger losses between 15% and 30% in the last week. They include Ethereum's native token Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), which has plunged over 16%, and its blockchain rival Terra, whose token {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  has declined by nearly 20.50%.\par \par \uc2 That said, listed below are three tokens among the top 50 cryptocurrencies that have performed worse than Bitcoin on a seven-day adjusted timeframe.\par \par \uc2 Axie Infinity (-27.50%)\par \par \uc2 Sitting atop {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/5-nft-based-blockchain-games-that-could-soar-in-2022"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 more than 12,000% year-over-year profits}}}\uc2 , Axie Infinity (AXS) turned out to be one of the best places for traders to secure their profits.\par \par \uc2 AXS price plunged nearly 27.5% to around $70 in the last seven days, thus becoming the worst performer among the large-cap coins. Meanwhile, against Bitcoin, the token slipped by almost 17% to 0.0017 BTC in the same period.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/9096961b-7a67-4393-8c80-9aa3afc9add3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ASX/USD vs. AXS/BTC daily price chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Nevertheless, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/axie-infinity-virtual-land-slot-sells-out-for-550-eth"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/axie-infinity-virtual-land-slot-sells-out-for-550-eth}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/axie-infinity-virtual-land-slot-sells-out-for-550-eth"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AXS price may rebound}}}\uc2  in the coming days as one of the market's key momentum indicators, the relative strength index (RSI), alerts about the token's "oversold" status. In detail, the AXS's daily RSI has slipped below 30, which traditional chartists interpret as a buy signal.\par \par \uc2 More \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  cues for the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/metaverse-gaming-tokens-ethverse-and-axie-infinity-avoid-crypto-downtrend"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Axie Infinity token}}}\uc2  have been coming from its downside target area between $64.50 and $50, as shown in the chart below. Notably, the $64.50-level served as a support to the AXS price during the August\u8211\'20\'13September trading session in 2021.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/b223fe6a-bf10-4f50-80e7-a7d14b8ced25.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AXS/USD daily price chart featuring its potential downside targets. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Similarly, the levels around $50 prompted traders to accumulate AXS en masse on four occasions since Sept. 7 selloff.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, breaking below the downside target range may end up pushing below $40, another support level from August 2021.\par \par \uc2 AAVE (-25%)\par \par \uc2 Unlike Axie Infinity, Aave ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/aave-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AAVE}}}\uc2  ) native token of the same name had been sitting atop dwarfed year-over-year profits \u8212\'20\'14 nearly 60% since Jan. 10, 2021. Nonetheless, it has still become one of the worst-performing cryptocurrencies entering 2022.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/aave-launches-its-permissioned-pool-aave-arc-with-30-institutions-set-to-join"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/aave-launches-its-permissioned-pool-aave-arc-with-30-institutions-set-to-join}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/aave-launches-its-permissioned-pool-aave-arc-with-30-institutions-set-to-join"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AAVE price dropped by a little over 24%}}}\uc2  to $200 in the last seven days. Meanwhile, the token's performance against Bitcoin came out to be nearly -15%, reflecting that traders remained unconvinced about a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  rebound in the Aave market.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/1f62b25a-dcfb-4785-bfa6-238753041ed4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AAVE/USD vs. AAVE/BTC daily price chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 For instance, AAVE's daily RSI has been trending lower since Dec. 27 and now sits near 39. It now eyes an extended correction to reach its oversold levels below 30, meaning there is still room for the AAVE price to go further down than its current rates.\par \par \uc2 The sell signal appears also as AAVE retests its two-month-old ascending trendline support, as shown in the chart below. AAVE has rebounded at least four times from the said rising level since Dec. 4. Therefore, if the coin breaks below it, its likelihood of correcting toward $165, another support level, would be higher.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/4558bf23-b86e-43e1-9ff3-1ba33225fe22.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AAVE/USD daily price chart featuring its interim support and resistance targets. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a rebound from the ascending trendline support may have AAVE rally toward the $250\u8211\'20\'13$275 trading range, which has a recent history of acting as both resistance and support. Since December 2021, the area has been able to cap AAVE's upside attempts successfully\par \par \uc2 IOTA (-24%)\par \par \uc2 Based on their seven-day adjusted timeframe performance, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/iota-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 IOTA}}}\uc2  's losses are marginally less than AAVE's. But given the token has been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/iota-set-to-launch-decentralized-smart-contract-platform-to-expand-web3-ecosystem"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sitting atop nearly 150% year-over-year profits}}}\uc2 , it appears like a good sell for traders looking to offset their losses elsewhere during the recent crypto market decline.\par \par \uc2 Notably, IOTA's price dipped a little over 24% to $1.00 in the past seven days. Against Bitcoin, IOTA is down about 14% in the same period.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/2944a5e1-fa05-4bea-a9a8-dadef1af3240.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 IOTA/USD vs. IOTA/BTC weekly price chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/top-5-cryptocurrencies-to-watch-in-2022-btc-eth-bnb-avax-matic"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Top 5 cryptocurrencies to watch in 2022: BTC, ETH, BNB, AVAX, MATIC}}}\par \par \uc2 A bounce is now likely, however, as the token's daily RSI neared oversold levels, while it dropped to a trading range of $0.93\u8211\'20\'13$1.00, which has a recent history of attracting buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/419b832e-93f9-403e-ad47-c4af5874d613.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 IOTA/USD daily price chart featuring its interim support and resistance targets. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 As a result, if IOTA drops below the $0.93\u8211\'20\'13$1.00 range, its likelihood of extending its price decline towards $0.71 \u8212\'20\'14 a support level from the May\u8211\'20\'13June 2021 trading session \u8212\'20\'14 looks high. Conversely, a rebound action from the area could have the IOTA price eye $1.21 as its interim bull target.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDEvZGZjMjFkNWItMzZkZi00ZTE1LWE4YTEtOWVlZWZiMDU5OWIxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220110ei1a0008e\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Price analysis 1/7: BTC\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/7: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, LUNA, DOT, AVAX, DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,811 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 January 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and most major altcoins have fallen to key underlying support levels, which could be an early sign of an impending oversold bounce.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and the U.S. equity markets fell sharply on Jan. 5, reacting negatively to the minutes from the Federal Reserve's December FOMC meeting, which showed that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-drops-to-43-7k-after-fed-minutes-re-confirm-plans-to-hike-rates"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 members expect the balance sheet reduction}}}\uc2  to start after the Fed begins hiking interest rates in early 2022.\par \par \uc2 Adding to the negative sentiment was the shutdown of the world\u8217\'20\'19s second-biggest Bitcoin mining hub in Kazakhstan, where the internet has been shut down following massive protests by citizens. This caused a dip of about {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/kazakh-government-resigns-shuts-down-internet-amid-protests-causing-bitcoin-network-hash-rate-to-tumble-13-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 13.4% in the Bitcoin network\u8217\'20\'19s overall hash rate}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/kazakh-government-resigns-shuts-down-internet-amid-protests-causing-bitcoin-network-hash-rate-to-tumble-13-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/kazakh-government-resigns-shuts-down-internet-amid-protests-causing-bitcoin-network-hash-rate-to-tumble-13-4}}}\uc2  from 205,000 petahash per second (PH/s) to 177,330 PH/s.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/116f2c3d-b99a-4cf8-ae8c-087940857433.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 According to Galaxy Digital Holdings CEO Mike Novogratz, the current decline was with low volumes and he believes that the markets will be volatile in the next few days. Novogratz suggests that a huge amount of \u8220\'20\'1Cinstitutional demand\u8221\'20\'1D was waiting on the sidelines and he expects Bitcoin to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/here-s-why-bitcoin-traders-say-a-drop-to-38k-is-the-worst-case-scenario"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bottom out in the $38,000 to $40,000 zone}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and major altcoins continue to face selling or will they bounce off strong support levels? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The range-bound action in Bitcoin resolved to the downside on Jan. 5 when bears pulled the price below the strong support at $45,456. This suggests that supply exceeds demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/fe6f5499-c7fe-49f4-aa68-d00b8b69ab4d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 There was a meek attempt to defend the $42,500 support on Jan. 6 but sustained selling has pulled the price close to the next support at $39,600. This leg down has invalidated the positive divergence that was forming on the relative strength index (RSI).\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI near the oversold zone suggest that bears are in control. If bears sink and sustain the price below $39,600, the BTC/USDT pair could nosedive to $30,000.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off $39,600, the bulls will again try to push the pair above the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($46,811). Such a move will be the first indication that the downtrend could be ending.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up on a break and close above the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($50,610).\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($3,756) on Jan. 5 and plunged below the Dec. 4 intraday low at $3,503.68. This suggests that bears have reasserted their supremacy.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/647255dc-c582-46e0-b06d-005e82494158.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the oversold zone suggest that bears are in command. If bears sustain the price below $3,250, the decline could extend to the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will attempt to defend this level and push the price to the resistance line of the channel. A break and close above the channel will signal a change in trend.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bears sink the price below the channel, the ETH/USDT pair could decline to the strong support at $2,652.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) broke below the strong psychological support at $500 on Jan. 5. Follow-up selling has pulled the price to the next support at $435.30.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/8c6e847f-226d-4844-adbf-5cadc7b6a418.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price bounces off the current level, the BNB/USDT pair could rally to $500 where the bears are likely to mount a stiff resistance. The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the oversold zone suggest that bears are in control.\par \par \uc2 If the $435.30 support gives way, the pair could extend its decline to $392.20 and later to $320. This negative view will be negated if the price breaks and sustains above the channel. Such a move could open the doors for a possible move to $575.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) plummeted below $167.88 and the Dec. 13 intraday low at $148.04 on Jan. 5. This indicated that bears have reasserted their dominance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/73b5ea0f-224b-43b0-b2d0-7dc98e15b295.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling has continued and the bears will now try to pull the SOL/USDT pair to the strong support at $116. This level could attract strong buying from the bulls but the relief rally is likely to face selling near the 20-day EMA ($170).\par \par \uc2 Such a move will indicate that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. That could increase the likelihood of a break below $116. The next stop may be the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 The buyers will have to push and sustain the pair above the resistance line of the channel to signal that the downtrend could be ending.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($1.33) on Jan. 5 and dropped to the strong support at $1.18. The bulls have successfully defended this level but have failed to push the price above the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/9233d0d9-0c7f-4ff6-8a0a-c7422c0501d8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears pull the price below $1.18, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to the critical support at $1. This is an important support to watch out for because if it cracks, the selling momentum could pick up and the pair could slide to $0.68.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if bulls drive the price above the moving averages, the pair could rise to the resistance line of the channel. A break and close above the channel will signal a possible change in trend. The pair could then rally to $1.87.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) broke below the $0.75 support on Jan. 5 but the long tail on the candlestick suggests that bulls purchased this dip. However, a minor negative is that the buyers have not been able to build upon the rebound.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/661ebe7e-c607-4967-a93d-ec7ad2a09850.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USDT pair formed a Doji candlestick pattern on Jan. 8 and the bulls are currently attempting to sink the price below $0.75. If that happens, the downtrend could resume and the pair may drop to $0.60.\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative zone indicate that bears are in command. Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off the current level, the bulls will attempt to push the pair above the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, it will suggest that the selling pressure may be reducing. The pair could then rise to $1.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token plummeted below the 20-day EMA ($81) on Jan. 5, indicating that short-term traders may have booked profits after bulls failed to clear the hurdle at $93.81.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/07126629-af18-40ef-94d1-939cfdc55c57.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears have pulled the price to the 50-day SMA ($69), which may act as a strong support. If the price rebounds off the current level, the bulls will try to push the LUNA/USDT pair to the downtrend line of the descending channel.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the channel will indicate that the correction may be over. The bulls will then try to push the price to $93.81. On the contrary, a break and close below the 50-day SMA could intensify selling and the pair may drop to the psychological support at $50.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-and-ether-heading-100k-and-5k-in-2022-bloomberg-intelligence"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin and Ether heading $100K and $5K in 2022: Bloomberg Intelligence}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) is range-bound in a downtrend. The price has been oscillating between $22.66 and $32.78 for the past few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/4398bff4-29f9-4443-982b-72d19e06cf93.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($28) has started to turn down and the RSI has dipped into the negative territory, suggesting that bears have the upper hand. If sellers sink and sustain the price below $22.66, the DOT/USDT pair could plunge to $16.81.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off $22.66, the bulls will try to push the pair to $32.78. A break and close above this level could signal a possible change in trend. The pair could first rise to $40 and later to $44.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) broke below the $98 support on Jan. 5 and dropped to the uptrend line of the symmetrical triangle on Jan. 7. The bulls will attempt to defend this level and push the price back to the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/c8002b49-ada5-4ce1-a590-98a722ee4f3e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($104) has turned down and the RSI is below 38, indicating that rallies are likely to be sold into. If the bounce off the current level turns down either from $98 or from the 20-day EMA, the possibility of a break below the triangle increases.\par \par \uc2 The AVAX/USDT pair could then decline to the $75.50 support where the bulls will try to arrest the decline. This negative view will invalidate if the price turns up and breaks above the triangle. The pair could then rise to $128.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) dipped below the $0.15 support on Jan. 5 but the long tail on the candlestick shows that bulls defended this level. That was followed by a Doji candlestick pattern on Jan. 6, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/5ceef257-5c2c-486e-9d3c-3295c0f70484.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to resolve the uncertainty to the downside on Jan. 7 but the bulls are not willing to relent. However, unless buyers quickly push the DOGE/USDT pair above the 20-day EMA ($0.17), the risk of a break and close below $0.15 increases.\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the pair could slide to $0.13 and then to $0.10. Alternatively, if bulls push the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that buyers are attempting a comeback. The pair could then rise to $0.19 and if bulls clear this hurdle, the rally may extend to $0.22.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDEvYTcyMTQ0ZjMtM2U2YS00Y2JkLWEyMzEtNTIxZDFhMDYwMjUwLkpQRw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220107ei17000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin clings to $42K as key moving average break from July reappears\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 481 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 January 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin cools \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  as BTC price action mimicks action from summer 2021.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) consolidated above $42,000 prior to Wall Street's opening bell on Jan. 7 as more similarities to last year's lows emerged.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/c8d35ca4-6d4d-498b-ada4-53a4bc6c7fc4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 BTC "very closely" mimicking May behavior\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.142027444.742658523.1640948929-762064149.1640948929"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  tracked a nervous Bitcoin market as BTC/USD avoided another retest of $40,000 support.\par \par \uc2 Earlier, after briefly falling below $41,000, analysts had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-may-pass-30k-september-lows-trader-warns"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 warned}}}\uc2  that a further capitulation event may occur, this having the potential to bring the pair down to $30,000 or even lower.\par \par \uc2 That figure rings true for market participants, having formed the bottom of a protracted capitulation which lasted from May to July last year.\par \par \uc2 Then, as now, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/china-s-3rd-largest-bank-rugs-btc-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 miner upheaval}}}\uc2  combined with macroeconomic factors to temporarily take the momentum out of the Bitcoin bull market.\par \par \uc2 "BTC is following May 2021 very closely," trader and analyst Rekt Capital noted in a series of tweets on current price action.\par \par \uc2 He noted that as of Friday, BTC/USD was performing a break of the 50-week exponential moving average (EMA) \u8212\'20\'14 just like the mid-July move which formed the bottom of that capitulation phase. The 50-week EMA sat at $45,000 on the day.\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/BTC?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #BTC}}}\uc2  capitulation event below the blue 50-week EMA is in progress {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BTC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BTC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Crypto?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Crypto}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Bitcoin?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Bitcoin}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/KGvl2ogbGO"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/KGvl2ogbGO}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Rekt Capital (@rektcapital) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rektcapital/status/1479378224979263492?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 January 7, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 Cointelegraph contributor Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe meanwhile noted the differences between the two phases.\par \par \uc2 A "swift correction south" this time around means that prolonged sideways movement and breakout to the upside from 2021 does not overall characterize the current market.\par \par \uc2 "The $46,000 level remains a very important one to watch. If that one breaks, I think the entire bear market is over or the entire correction is over and we're looking for upwards potential," he said during his latest {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ahcFDzsJQLk&feature=youtu.be"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 YouTube update}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Ethereum has trader planning $2,200 buy-in\par \par \uc2 Altcoins also saw trouble on the day, following warnings that any strong moves previously were likely a red flag \u8212\'20\'14 a bull trap.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/dip-buy-and-fed-top-trending-topics-on-social-media-per-survey"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18Dip,\u8217\'20\'19 \u8216\'20\'18Buy\u8217\'20\'19 and \u8216\'20\'18Fed\u8217\'20\'19 top trending topics on social media, per survey}}}\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), the largest altcoin by market cap, traded down 4.5% at the time of writing to near $3,000 \u8212\'20\'14 down $700 in a week.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/a23d47b5-7fc7-4a2a-88eb-06237e8fb700.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD 1-day candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Some in the top ten cryptocurrencies by market cap escaped the downtrend, with Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) up 1.2% at $1.23 and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  flat.\par \par \uc2 A still highly cautious Pentoshi {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Pentosh1/status/1479190960277897216"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 identified}}}\uc2  levels as low as $2,200 for buying ETH, expecting it to hit at "some point this year."\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDEvZDNlNzJiZTMtNGIxNC00YmM0LTk0NjUtODQ2M2I3NTAxOGY1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220107ei170005m\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/5: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, LUNA, DOT, AVAX, DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,781 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 January 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Technical analysis and on-chain data hint that Bitcoin is gearing up for a volatile move and traders expect altcoins to follow.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and most major altcoins are stuck in a tight range with bulls buying near the support and bears selling at resistance levels. Usually, such tight ranges are followed by an expansion in \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Although a few analysts have not ruled out a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-reaches-for-47k-as-analysts-agree-btc-price-consolidation-cannot-last"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 quick drop to low $40,000s}}}\uc2 , most traders expect Bitcoin to rebound sharply and move up to $60,000.\par \par \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  said in a note to investors that if Bitcoin continues to increase its market share over gold as a store of value and crosses the 50% mark, then it could {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-100k-possible-by-chipping-away-at-gold-s-market-share-goldman-sachs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rally to $100,000 over the next five years}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/5aa9ddda-8715-473c-b6cb-0fdfc7dca9fc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 On-chain analytics provider Glassnode said in its report on Jan. 3 that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/wait-and-see-approach-3-4-of-bitcoin-supply-now-illiquid"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 illiquid supply has increased}}}\uc2  to more than 76% of the total circulating supply. According to Glassnode researchers, the drop in liquid supply suggests that price capitulation looks unlikely in the near future.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin surprise with a sharp move down and pull the major altcoins lower? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price is sandwiched between the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($48,033) and the critical support at $45,456. Although both moving averages are sloping down, the relative strength index (RSI) is attempting to form a positive divergence. This indicates that the selling pressure could be reducing.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/a73663e4-4546-4d83-93fa-d95a20cbb60b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, the BTC/USDT pair could rise to $51,936.33. This level is likely to act as a stiff resistance. If the price turns down from it, the pair could remain range-bound between $51,936.33 and $45,456 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above $51,936.33 will suggest the start of an up-move that could reach $60,000. On the contrary, if the price turns down and plummets below $45,456, the selling could intensify and the pair could then drop to the $42,000 to $40,000 support zone.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($3,881) but the positive sign is that bulls are not giving up much ground. This indicates buying on dips. The bulls will now attempt to push the price back above the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/4e30ee8e-7966-4405-aa18-593775abed8a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they do that, it will indicate that the correction could be ending. The ETH/USDT pair could then rise to the 50-day SMA ($4,086), which could again act as a resistance. A break and close above this level will suggest the start of an up-move to $4,488 and then to the all-time high at $4,888.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, a drop to the $3,643.73 to $3,503.68 support zone is possible. This is an important support for the bulls to defend because a break and close below it could open the doors for a possible decline to $3,270 and then to $2,800.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has turned down from the 20-day EMA ($530) and is currently taking support at the psychological level at $500.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/b8291615-0df7-463c-8001-d34beba69213.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears sink and sustain the price below the $500 to $489.20 support zone, the selling momentum could pick up and the BNB/USDT pair could drop to $435.30. The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative territory indicate advantage to bears.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the current level, it will suggest that bulls continue to defend this support. They will then make one more attempt to push the price above the 20-day EMA. If that happens, that pair could rise to $575.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($178) on Jan. 2, indicating that bears are selling on every minor rally. The bears will now try to pull the price below the strong support at $167.88.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/ce087f87-f768-4c49-8bd3-cbe2d498902b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the SOL/USDT pair could drop to $148.04, which could act as a strong support. If the bounce off this level fails to rise above $167.99, it will indicate that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 That could intensify the selling and the pair could drop to the critical support at $120. The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the moving averages to signal that the selling pressure could be reducing. The pair could then rally to $204.75.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been trading between the 20-day EMA ($1.36) on the upside and $1.28 on the downside. This is a minor positive as it suggests that bulls are not willing to cede ground to the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/fe7c5977-01de-4623-a37c-b735b78d69df.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out and the RSI is just below 46, suggesting that the selling pressure could be reducing. If bulls thrust the price above the moving averages, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to $1.60 and then to the resistance line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the channel will signal that the downtrend could be over. This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down and breaks below $1.18. That could pull the price to the crucial support at $1.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($0.86) on Jan. 3 suggesting that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on relief rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/a05efba7-b0a8-4df9-ba41-b242cbf1da0b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The long tail on the Jan. 4 candlestick shows strong buying in the $0.77 to $0.75 support zone. The XRP/USDT pair could now consolidate between $0.75 and the 20-day EMA for the next few days.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the moving averages could clear the path for a rally to $1. If bulls clear this hurdle, the pair could start its journey toward the stiff overhead resistance at $1.41. Alternatively, if the price breaks and closes below $0.75, the pair could drop to $0.60 and then to $0.50.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token turned down from the overhead resistance at $93.81 on Jan. 3 and has reached the 20-day EMA ($83). This suggests that bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/11d7106f-57bc-4fa6-9bc5-ea8bb785031c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears pull the price below $81.11, the selling could intensify as short-term traders may rush to the exit. The LUNA/USDT pair could first drop to $76.72 and then extend the decline to the 50-day SMA ($67).\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price bounces off $81.11, it will suggest that bulls continue to buy on dips. The bulls will then make one more attempt to clear the overhead barrier at $93.81 and push the pair to the all-time high at $103.60.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-monthly-rsi-lowest-since-september-2020-in-fresh-oversold-signal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin monthly RSI lowest since September 2020 in fresh 'oversold' signal}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between the 20-day EMA ($28) and the overhead resistance at $31.49 for the past few days. The flat 20-day EMA and the RSI just above the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/60b5f21c-fbf1-435b-b66a-bf4ca30d0259.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks and closes above the $31.49 to $32.78 resistance zone, it will indicate that the balance has tilted in favor of the bulls. The DOT/USDT pair could then start its northward march toward $40.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, the pair could extend its stay inside the range between $31.49 and $22.66 for a few more days. The bears will have to sink and sustain the price below $22.66 to signal the resumption of the down move.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the moving averages on Jan. 4, indicating that bears are aggressively defending the downtrend line. The flat 20-day EMA ($107) and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest a state of equilibrium between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/09b2b30f-7a17-47cc-af4d-f311435425ad.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below the moving averages, the bears will attempt to sink the AVAX/USDT pair below $98. If they manage to do that, the pair could drop to the strong support at $75.50.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if bulls drive the price back above the moving average, the pair could rise to the downtrend line. A break and close above this level will signal a possible change in trend. The pair could first rise to $128 and then retest the all-time high at $147.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been trading in a tight range between the 20-day EMA ($.0.17) and $0.16 for the past few days. This suggests that both the bulls and the bears are not placing large bets and are playing it safe.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-01/084a5561-336d-4a6b-a618-dcb11e5301b0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Usually, tight ranges are followed by sharp moves. The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative zone suggest the path of least resistance is the downside.\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks below $0.16, the bears will attempt to pull the DOGE/USDT pair below the strong support at $0.15. If they succeed, it could result in a decline to $0.13 and then to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rally to the stiff overhead resistance at $0.19. The bulls will have to clear this hurdle to signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDEvMGZmMTIzZjQtMmVjYS00ZGEwLWE1ZjktNmFiYzY5OTNiN2E2LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220105ei15000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 ETF\par \b \uc2 Crypto funds attracted $9.3B in inflows in 2021 as institutional adoption grew\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Sam Bourgi \par \uc2 401 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 January 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Cryptocurrency investment products saw $9.3 billion in inflows in 2021, up 36% from the previous year.\par \par \uc2 Institutional cryptocurrency funds attracted record inflows in 2021, as demand for digital assets such as Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) continued to grow during a volatile and often unpredictable bull market.\par \par \uc2 Crypto investment products registered $9.3 billion in inflows during the year, up from $6.8 billion in 2020, according to the latest \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  data, which was released on Tuesday. Bitcoin funds attracted $6.3 billion worth of capital last year, while Ether products saw inflows totaling nearly $1.4 billion. Multi-asset funds were also popular, attracting $775 million in investor capital.\par \par \uc2 A total of 37 investment products launched in 2021, compared with 24 that hit the market the year before. Notably, crypto assets that were included in investment products expanded to 15 from nine the previous year.\par \par \uc2 Grayscale remains the single largest crypto asset manager with $43.5 billion in assets under management as of Monday. Other multi-billion-dollar asset managers included 3iQ, \uc2 21Shares\uc2 , \uc2 ETC Group\uc2 , Purpose and ProShares.\par \par \uc2 01/03/22 UPDATE: Net Assets Under Management, Holdings per Share, and Market Price per Share for our Investment Products.\par \par \uc2 Total AUM: $43.5 billion {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BTC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BTC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BAT&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BAT}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BCH&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BCH}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24LINK&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $LINK}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24MANA&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $MANA}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ETH&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ETH}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ETC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ETC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24FIL&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $FIL}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ZEN&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ZEN}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24LTC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $LTC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24LPT&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $LPT}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24XLM&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $XLM}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ZEC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ZEC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24UNI&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $UNI}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24AAVE&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $AAVE}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24COMP&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $COMP}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24CRV&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $CRV}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24MKR&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $MKR}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24SUSHI&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $SUSHI}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24SNX&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $SNX}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24YFI&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $YFI}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ADA&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24SOL&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $SOL}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24AMP&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $AMP}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/67Pb7xneoQ"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/67Pb7xneoQ}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Grayscale (@Grayscale) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Grayscale/status/1478163024934486024?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 January 4, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 Despite massive \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/top-5-bullish-stories-of-2021"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cryptocurrencies enjoyed broader mainstream recognition in 2021}}}\uc2 , with both retail and institutional investors participating in the market. 2021 was the year that crypto became a multi-trillion-dollar asset class, putting it on the radar of fund managers and family offices. Along the way, a slew of BTC exchange-traded products hit the market, including the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/accelerate-financial-s-bitcoin-etf-approved-in-canada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Purpose Bitcoin ETF in Canada}}}\uc2 , which offered North American investors spot exposure to the leading \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-open-interest-matches-record-high-amid-predictions-of-btc-price-fireworks-this-month"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin open interest matches record high amid predictions of BTC price 'fireworks' this month}}}\par \par \uc2 Regulators in the United States would also approve several futures-linked Bitcoin ETFs in 2021, opening the door to broader institutional adoption. The Securities and Exchange Commission is expected to deliver its verdict on a pair of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-delays-decisions-on-bitwise-and-grayscale-s-bitcoin-etfs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 physically-backed Bitcoin funds}}}\uc2  from NYSE Arca and Grayscale in early February.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDEvYWY4YjBmNzYtYTUwMS00NzAxLTk3MmMtZGUxNTI1MzIwMmU2LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220104ei14000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \uc2 Bitcoin price reverses gains on New Year\u8217\'20\'19s Eve; hodlers continue stacking sats\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Sam Bourgi \par \uc2 607 \uc2 words\par \uc2 31 December 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The crypto market remains healthy heading into 2022, but short-term price action continues to be \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and the broader cryptocurrency market turned lower later in the day on Dec. 31, erasing {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-holds-48k-as-final-wall-street-session-caps-60-ytd-gains-for-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 intraday gains}}}\uc2  to cap off a highly successful year on a weaker note.\par \par \uc2 Market Update\par \par \uc2 BTC price fell below $46,000 on Dec. 31 and was last seen hovering below that level, according to data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.60738287.390825259.1639680713-68533732.1612103760"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BITSTAMP"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2 . The flagship cryptocurrency is down over 5% from its intraday peak and 2.9% on the day to trade at $45,933.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/089d9a62-0566-45c0-a7c6-ec915b103043.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin's price is back on the defensive as the year draws to a close. Source: Cointelegraph Markets Pro\par \par \uc2 Altcoins faced a similar downward trajectory as Bitcoin, with the likes of Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) and Solana\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  each falling more than 2%. Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  declined over 4% on the day.\par \par \uc2 The combined market capitalization of all cryptocurrencies shed over $100 billion from its intraday peak, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.coingecko.com/en/global_charts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 falling}}}\uc2  from a high of $2.4 trillion to $2.27 trillion, according to CoinGecko.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/052431c1-3121-4123-8845-23029332b5c6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 The crypto market cap was down more than $100 billion from its intraday peak. Source: CoinGecko\par \par \uc2 The sudden reversal followed a modest relief rally for BTC and other cryptocurrencies that took place early on Dec. 31. As Cointelegraph reported, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-gains-1-5k-in-under-an-hour-as-btc-price-erases-days-of-downtrend"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price appreciated by more than $1,500}}}\uc2  in less than an hour \u8212\'20\'14 a rally that may have been aided by a December options expiry event worth roughly $6 billion.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-12-31-btc-eth-bnb-sol-ada-xrp-luna-avax-dot-doge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 12/31: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , XRP, LUNA, AVAX, DOT, DOGE}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto OGs keep on accumulating\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is bracing for a year-to-date return of less than 60%, which is well below what many, if not most, prognosticators were calling for at the start of 2021. Although BTC never came close to achieving lofty six-figure valuations, the leading cryptocurrency continues to attract investors with a low time preference. (Investors with a low time preference place more emphasis on their financial well-being in the far future as opposed to the present.)\par \par \uc2 BTC\u8217\'20\'19s recent price correction has been largely driven by so-called crypto tourists who entered the market in the summer. As Cointelegraph recently reported, veteran holders are still {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/veteran-bitcoin-hodlers-are-still-selling-record-low-amounts-of-btc-despite-70-gains-in-2021"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 selling record-low amounts of BTC}}}\uc2  as of late December. Meanwhile, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-sees-non-stop-end-of-year-buying-as-10k-btc-leaves-coinbase-in-a-single-day"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 buying activity on Coinbase}}}\uc2  appears to have picked up substantially toward the end of the year.\par \par \uc2 Earlier this week, UTXO Management analyst Dylan LeClair said \u8220\'20\'1CThe true OGs are holding tight,\u8221\'20\'1D in reference to Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s long-term holders having a much lower on-chain cost basis than those who are currently selling. The average on-chain cost basis for long-term BTC holders is $17,825 compared with $33,890 for those currently spending their coins.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Bitcoin?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Bitcoin}}}\uc2  long-term holders have an average on-chain cost basis of $17,825, but the ones currently moving spending their coins have a cost basis of $33,890.\par \par \uc2 The true OGs are holding tight. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/VtxuAcZzUw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/VtxuAcZzUw}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Dylan LeClair (@DylanLeClair_) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/DylanLeClair_/status/1476590721482297348?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 December 30, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/top-5-bullish-stories-of-2021"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Top 5 \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  Bitcoin stories of 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 In addition to the retail-oriented class of long-term hodlers, the crypto market saw an influx of sophisticated institutional investors in 2021. Net proceeds into crypto funds exceeded $9.3 billion in 2021, with Bitcoin accounting for over two-thirds of that total, according to \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  data. These funds registered 16 consecutive weeks of inflows through Dec. 13.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTIvZmI3N2U3MmQtMDM5Yi00NDZmLTkwNjgtZjU0MzE1ZDliMDlhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211231ehcv000dx\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/31: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, LUNA, AVAX, DOT, DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,809 \uc2 words\par \uc2 31 December 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s bounce off the strong support suggests that bulls are attempting to arrest the decline.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and most major altcoins are {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-gains-1-5k-in-under-an-hour-as-btc-price-erases-days-of-downtrend"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 attempting a rebound off their respective support levels}}}\uc2 , indicating that buyers continue to accumulate on dips.\par \par \uc2 Data from Coinglass shows that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-sees-non-stop-end-of-year-buying-as-10k-btc-leaves-coinbase-in-a-single-day"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 9,925 Bitcoin left Coinbase Pro}}}\uc2 , the professional trading arm of \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 , on Dec. 30, a possible sign of institutional buying. This is in sharp contrast to the strong inflows seen in Binance and OKEx. Several analysts believe that institutional buying could pick up in January.\par \par \uc2 Economist and trader Alex Kr\u252\'00\'FCger expects a Bitcoin rally in early January based on fund flows. He also highlighted that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-has-risen-7-to-36-in-the-first-week-of-january-each-year-since-2018"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 January has produced positive results for Bitcoin}}}\uc2  between 2018 and 2021, with gains ranging from 7% to 36%.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/125a6acb-2e98-4b01-8e15-3820e655e36a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While investors debate about the next possible direction of the crypto markets, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-purchases-1-914-bitcoin-now-holds-almost-6b-in-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MicroStrategy has continued to accumulate Bitcoin on dips}}}\uc2 . The business intelligence firm purchased 1,914 Bitcoin between Dec. 9 and Dec. 29, according to a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission. The recent purchase has boosted the company\u8217\'20\'19s holdings to 124,391 Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin lead a strong recovery in the crypto markets in the new year? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bounced off the $45,456 support and has risen above the 200-day simple moving average (SMA) ($47,826). However, the bulls are likely to face a strong challenge at the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($49,096).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/e14069bb-65f4-4ca8-add6-b59044d523a6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears are selling on every minor rally. That will increase the possibility of a break below $45,456. If that happens, the BTC/USDT pair could drop to the strong support zone at $42,000 to $40,000.\par \par \uc2 The relative strength index (RSI) is forming a possible positive divergence, which suggests that the selling pressure could be reducing.\par \par \uc2 If bulls drive the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rally to $51,936.33. A break and close above this resistance could start an up-move to the 50% Fibonacci retracement level at $55,000 and then to the 61.8% retracement level at $58,686.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has bounced off the strong support zone at $3,643.73 to $3,503.68. The bulls will now try to push the price to the 20-day EMA ($3,952), which is an important level to watch out for.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/bca11353-bb43-425e-916b-2d013a6e0fb4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. The bears will then make another attempt to sink the price below the support zone.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below the 200-day SMA ($3,365) may indicate the start of a deeper correction to $2,800. This negative view will be negated if the price breaks and sustains above $4,200. The ETH/USDT pair could then rise to $4,488 and later to $4,868.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) is attempting a bounce off the strong support at $500. The recovery is likely to face selling at the 20-day EMA ($540). If the price turns down from this level, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/4bb1f72e-8307-4f89-adce-f11ce771dadb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that bears are in command. A break and close below $500 could intensify selling and the BNB/USDT pair could drop to the 200-day SMA ($445).\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rises above the 20-day EMA, the bulls will try to push the pair above $575. If they succeed, the pair could rally to $617 and later to the overhead resistance zone at $669.30 to $691.80.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) is attempting to bounce off $167.88. The relief rally is likely to face strong selling at the 20-day EMA ($182). The RSI is in the negative zone and the 20-day EMA is sloping down gradually, indicating that bears are at an advantage.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/a1f10ea6-5be8-46db-b3c5-912d02892d15.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down and dips below the $167.88 support, the SOL/USDT pair could drop to $148.04. The bulls may try to defend this level but if the support gives way, the pair could start its downward journey toward the 200-day SMA ($128).\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if bulls push the price above the 20-day EMA and the overhead resistance at $204.75. The pair could then rise to the resistance line of the falling wedge pattern. A break and close above this level could clear the path for a retest of the all-time high at $259.90.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke and closed below the 20-day EMA ($1.38) on Dec. 29 but the buyers have not yet given up. They are attempting to push the price back above the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/1fa94f70-b391-45d8-95d1-88421ba808aa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to the resistance line of the descending channel. The bears are likely to defend this level aggressively. If the price turns down from the resistance line, the pair could extend its stay inside the channel for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the channel will be the first indication of a possible change in trend. Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level, the pair could drop to $1.18. This is an important level to watch out for because if it cracks, the pair could drop to $1.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) is range-bound between $1 and $0.75. The price bounced off $0.80 on Dec. 30 and the bulls will now attempt to push the price back above the 20-day EMA ($0.88).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/cf9c89f3-27d0-416b-b53d-a8f6820f0e92.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they do that, the XRP/USDT pair could rise to the 200-day SMA ($0.94) and then to the overhead resistance at $1. The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above this resistance to signal the start of a sustained recovery.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is turning down and the RSI is below 45, indicating that bears have the upper hand. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will try to sink the pair below $0.75. A close below this level could clear the path for a decline to $0.60.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token bounced off the 20-day EMA ($81) on Dec. 30, indicating that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/a6624468-15db-4daa-ab14-dd6a51d798fd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now attempt to push the price to the all-time high at $103.60. A break and close above this resistance will signal the start of the next leg of the uptrend that could reach $135.26 and then $150.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from $93.81 and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that traders are closing their positions on rallies. The LUNA/USDT pair could then drop to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $71.61.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/frax-share-swipe-and-gnosis-lead-the-altcoin-market-as-bitcoin-recovers-to-47-5k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Frax Share, Swipe and Gnosis lead the altcoin market as Bitcoin recovers to $47.5k}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the minor support at $98 on Dec. 30 and the bulls are now attempting to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($107).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/c2c85ec4-2579-4871-ba69-b0385e17bedc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the AVAX/USDT pair could rise to the downtrend line where the bears may mount stiff resistance. A break and close above this level will be the first sign that the correction may be over.\par \par \uc2 The pair could then rise to $128. If bulls thrust the price above this resistance, it will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  inverse head and shoulders pattern. The pair could first retest the all-time high at $147 and then attempt a rally to the pattern target at $177.50.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA and breaks below $98, the pair could drop to $75.50.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) broke below the 20-day EMA ($28) on Dec. 28 and the bears have successfully warded off attempts by the bulls to push the price back above the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/3b5f33ec-bcf4-43cc-b9d0-2fde3a48dbeb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level, the bears will try to sink the DOT/USDT pair below the $25 to $22.66 support zone. If that happens, the selling could pick up momentum and the decline could extend to $16.81.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rises above the moving averages, the buyers will try to propel the pair above $31.49. If they manage to do that, it could open the doors for a possible rally to $39.50 and later to $43.56.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) broke below the 20-day EMA ($0.17) on Dec. 28 but the bears could not challenge the major support at $0.15. This suggests that selling dries up at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/0579eecc-e3c1-4e50-bff8-ea63579a6045.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to push the price back above the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, the DOGE/USDT pair could rally to the overhead resistance at $0.19. A break and close above this level will signal the possible start of a new up-move that could reach the 200-day SMA ($0.23).\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will attempt to sink the pair below $0.15. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if it cracks, the pair could plunge to $0.13 and eventually to the psychological support at $0.10.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTIvZjBjMzUwMjktNWVmZS00ZTFmLTg5OTYtMDIyN2RkMzVlMzNmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211231ehcv0008d\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/29: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, LUNA, AVAX, DOT, DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,880 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 December 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and most major altcoins may remain range-bound in the near term as bulls buy the dips and bears sell on rallies.\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 is trading near its all-time high but Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has plunged about 30% from its all-time high at $69,000. Even after the sharp drop, Bitcoin is up 63%, year-to-date, outperforming the S&P 500, which is up about 30% in 2021.\par \par \uc2 Gold, which is popular as a hedge against inflation, is down roughly 7% this year. Arcane research said in its report that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-btc-price-slump-bitcoin-outperforms-stocks-and-gold-for-3rd-year-in-a-row"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s outperformance in the high inflationary environment}}}\uc2  shows that \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin has proven itself to be an excellent inflation hedge.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/b5c43374-4905-4068-9084-85b62752c743.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Real Vision CEO Raoul Pal said in an interview with Vlad from The Stakeborg Talks that the recent selling in Bitcoin may have been due to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/raoul-pal-believes-institutions-have-finished-taking-profits-as-year-winds-up"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 institutional investors booking profits}}}\uc2  but he believes the selling may be coming to an end.\par \par \uc2 However, veteran trader Peter Brandt is of the opinion that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-dips-below-47k-but-one-trader-is-eyeing-solid-risk-reward-for-longing-btc-now"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 panic selling has not yet happened}}}\uc2 , which is known to signal bottoms.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin extend its decline or stage a strong recovery above $50,000 in the next few days? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin rose above the overhead resistance at $51,936.33 on Dec. 27 but the long wick on the candlestick shows that traders sold this rise with vigor. The selling continued on Dec. 28 and the price broke below the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($49,558).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/2b7f9e0b-b067-4f83-833c-06f4545d7b76.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price broke below the 200-day simple moving average (SMA) ($47,755) on Dec. 29 but the long tail on the candlestick shows that bulls are attempting to arrest the decline. If the price rises and sustains above the 200-day SMA, the bulls will again try to push the BTC/USDT pair toward the overhead resistance at $51,936.33.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price sustains below the 200-day EMA, the selling could intensify. The 20-day EMA has started to turn down and the relative strength index (RSI) is below 42, indicating that bears are in control. If the $45,456 support cracks, the pair could plunge to the strong support zone at $42,000 to $40,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) failure to sustain above the 20-day EMA ($4,011) could have attracted selling from short-term traders. The price turned down sharply on Dec. 28 and has dropped close to the strong support at $3,643.73.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/c46eb446-a9e2-4d5c-8ae9-5ea83b66aa41.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the support, the bulls will make one more attempt to push the ETH/USDT pair above the 20-day EMA. A break and close above $4,200 could signal that the corrective phase may be over. The pair could first rally to $4,488 and then challenge the all-time high at $4,868.\par \par \uc2 However, the downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative zone indicate that the path of least resistance is to the downside. If the $3,643.73 support cracks, the pair could decline to the 200-day SMA ($3,353). This level may act as a strong support but if it cracks, the pair could plummet to $2,800.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) soared above the 20-day EMA ($546) on Dec. 27 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. The price turned down and dipped below the 20-day EMA on Dec. 28.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/22012621-a44c-4bbe-90dd-342af4433b05.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to sink the price below the strong support at $500. If they succeed, it could start a down move to the 200-day SMA ($444) where bulls are likely to defend the level aggressively.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level or the strong support at $500, it will suggest that bulls continue to buy on dips. A break and close above $575 will signal that the correction may be over. The pair could first rally to $617 and then to the overhead resistance zone at $669.30 to $691.80.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) recovery stalled at $204.75 on Dec. 27 and the price broke below the 20-day EMA ($185) on Dec. 28. This suggests that bears continue to sell on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/32ae3bbc-0619-4e43-8da0-10122decd9da.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will now attempt to build on their advantage and pull the price below $167.88. If this support cracks, the SOL/USDT pair could drop to $148.04. The 20-day EMA is flattish but the RSI has dipped below 44, indicating that bears are attempting to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate in the short term if the price turns up from the current level and rises above $204.75. That will clear the path for a possible rally to the resistance line of the falling wedge pattern. A breakout of the wedge will signal that bulls are back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned down from $1.59 on Dec. 27 and the price has dipped to the 20-day EMA ($1.39). If the price rebounds off the current level, the bulls will attempt to push the price to the resistance line of the descending channel.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/7de52dcb-b780-494c-a4b8-0101b188f03d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand. A break and close above the channel will indicate that the downtrend could be over. The bulls will then try to push the price toward the strong overhead resistance at $2.47.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price sustains below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears continue to sell on rallies. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then drop to the strong support zone at $1.18. If this support cracks, the pair could decline to $1.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to push Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) back above the 50-day SMA ($0.94) on Dec. 27 may have attracted selling by short-term traders. That pulled the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.89) and the support at $0.85.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/305cf3d4-3355-4a98-a945-0170f8690889.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has turned down and the RSI has dipped into the negative zone, indicating that bears are at a minor advantage. If the price sustains below $0.85, the XRP/USDT pair could decline to the strong support at $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the moving averages, it will suggest that lower levels are attracting strong buying from the bulls. The pair may then rise to $1. A break and close above this level could complete an inverse head and shoulders pattern, which has a pattern target at $1.25.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token turned down from $103.60 on Dec. 27 and the price dipped to the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $83.83. The bulls are likely to attempt to stall the correction in the zone between $83.83 and the 20-day EMA ($80).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/24884e33-d985-495e-a9b0-81737f8224b2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off this zone will suggest that sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders are not waiting for a deep correction to buy.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will then attempt to push the price to $103.60. A break and close above this resistance could indicate the resumption of the uptrend. The first target on the upside is $135.26 and then $150.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be negated in the short term if the price turns down and plummets below the 20-day EMA. That could pull the price down to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $71.61.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/a-fair-comparison-ethereum-growth-outpaces-bitcoin-in-2021"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 A fair comparison? Ethereum growth outpaces Bitcoin in 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) bounce off the 20-day EMA ($108) on Dec. 26 fizzled out at $120.96 on Dec. 27. This suggests that bears continue to sell at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/f1177f62-4266-4156-b414-a1567faa6474.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The AVAX/USDT pair turned down and broke below the 20-day EMA on Dec. 28. If bears sustain the price below this level, the next stop could be $98. A break and close below this support could open the gates for a possible drop to $75.50.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bulls push the price back above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rally to the downtrend line. A break and close above this resistance will suggest that the correction may be over. The pair could first rise to $130 and then retest the all-time high at $147.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $31.49 on Dec. 27 but the long wick on the candlestick suggests selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/6a4d8d1a-c175-421b-a457-a1b4567c6688.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The failed breakout could have acted like a bull trap, catching aggressive buyers on the wrong foot. This may have resulted in long liquidation, pulling the price below the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are flat and the RSI is just below the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 If bulls push the price back above the moving averages, the pair could rally to $31.49. A break and close above this level could signal advantage to buyers. The pair could then rally to $39.35 and later to $43.56.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, a break and close below the $25 to $22.66 support zone will indicate that bears are in command.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance at $0.19 and plunged back below the 20-day EMA ($0.18) on Dec. 28. This suggests that bears continue to defend the overhead resistance level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/cc47347e-471b-4244-93ca-e941ba47ad7b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair could now drop to $0.15, which is a key level for the bulls to defend. If the price rebounds off this support, the pair could remain stuck between $0.15 and $0.19 for the next few days.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above $0.19 to indicate the start of a strong relief rally.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if bears sink and sustain the price below $0.15, it will suggest that the downtrend has resumed. The pair could then drop to $0.13 and later to the psychological support at $0.10.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTIvM2I2ODA5YjgtYzRkNi00NDI4LTk1ZTUtMzFlZjZjYmI2NDUyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211229ehct000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Arcane Research\par \b \uc2 Arcane Research releases its crypto predictions for 2022\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Brian Newar \par \uc2 560 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 December 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Arcane Research released its final weekly report of the year, outlining the top stories and metrics from 2021 and predictions for the market in 2022.\par \par \uc2 Blockchain data research firm Arcane Research has taken a look at the year that was in its final report for 2021 and offered its predictions for crypto markets going into 2022.\par \par \uc2 Arcane\u8217\'20\'19s Tuesday \u8220\'20\'1CThe Weekly Update\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://static1.squarespace.com/static/60377b34e7791c1277aaae97/t/61cb272480430d5cc3337156/1640703789129/Weekly+update+-+Arcane+Research+%28Week+51%29+2021+SUMMARY.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 report}}}\uc2  focuses on Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) but delves into other major coins, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/defi-sector-tokens-offer-shelter-as-bitcoin-falls-below-48-5k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 decentralized finance}}}\uc2  (DeFi), memecoins, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/this-sports-project-is-bringing-smaller-athletes-closer-to-their-fans"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 nonfungible tokens}}}\uc2  (NFT), derivatives and others. Arcane offered a prediction for what would happen in 2022 on every topic covered in the report.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin will outperform the S&P 500 in 2022\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The report noted that through 2021, Bitcoin has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-daily-losses-near-4k-as-s-p-500-hits-69th-all-time-high-of-2021"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 outperformed the S&P 500 index}}}\uc2 . Bitcoin is up 73%, while the S&P 500 is up 28% this year, and Arcane believes Bitcoin will continue this performance next year. The benchmark S&P 500 index compri the 500 biggest companies listed on American stock exchanges.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CXRP and Cardano will fall out of the top 10\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Arcane noted the tremendous gains on Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) this year, peaking at about 1,600% in May and rounding out the year up 1,344%. Based on this and the growth in market capitalization from altcoins such as Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) and Terra ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  ), along with the NFT craze, the analysts are tipping {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  and Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) will exit the top 10 list.\par \par \uc2 Alternate layer ones will continue to outperform ETH\par \par \uc2 While ETH outperformed BTC this year with a gain of 455% to 73%, other {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/stacks-mitchell-cuevas-talks-building-integrated-defi-bridges-for-bitcoin-users"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 layer-one blockchains}}}\uc2  outperformed ETH. Layer one refers to standalone, base-layer blockchains. Terra Luna ends 2021 up 14,823%; Fantom is up 13,549%.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/a20f1710-4521-4ebf-b64c-cea3cce95f64.PNG"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Traditional gaming companies will increasingly add NFTs\par \par \uc2 This year in crypto can be defined in no small part by the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/biggest-nft-drops-and-sales-in-2021"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 massive sales of NFTs}}}\uc2 , and blockchain games like Splinterlands and Alien Worlds have around 526,000 daily active users, according to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://dappradar.com/topic/games"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DappRadar}}}\uc2 . Arcane predicts that in 2022, traditional gaming brands will branch into the NFT space and capitalize on the burgeoning market.\par \par \uc2 Even more crypto companies will go public, and several will have valuations above $5B\par \par \uc2 This year saw {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/analysts-say-coinbase-listing-represents-a-watershed-moment-for-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coinbase go public}}}\uc2  on April 14, and it currently has a market cap of $72 billion. The five biggest crypto company public listings slated for 2022 are all currently valued at over $1 billion. Arcane believes there will be a number of others valued higher than $5 billion, such as crypto exchange \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which is currently valued at $9 billion.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ETFs will hold more than 1M BTC by end of 2022\par \par \uc2 Several Bitcoin futures exchange-traded funds (ETF) were launched in 2021. They currently collectively hold about 846,309 BTC, and Arcane said the growth will only continue in 2022.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/1c861d91-f560-46f7-8da7-30bf7dde85fc.PNG"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-whales-dumping-eth-as-price-slides-below-4k-data-shows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum whales dumping ETH as price slides below $4K, data shows}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CHashrate will become even more geographically distributed\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 When China banned Bitcoin mining, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-hashrate-triples-since-june-28-in-recovery-from-china-syndrome"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s global hash rate sharply fell}}}\uc2 , then nearly as suddenly recovered. Now the United States leads the world in hash rate, followed by Kazakhstan and Russia. Arcane believes miners will disperse even further into regions such as Latin America.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/fbd8cbc6-d5ed-4907-99cc-fb4e655a57b5.PNG"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTIvOWYyNWMyNDYtYWNmZC00ZWJjLTk5ZTgtMGVhNzgyMjQ5ZTVjLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211229ehct0002x\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Arcane Research\par \b \uc2 Arcane Research releases its crypto predictions for 2022\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Brian Newar \par \uc2 552 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 December 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Arcane Research released its final weekly report of the year, outlining the top stories and metrics from 2021 and predictions for the market in 2022.\par \par \uc2 Blockchain data research firm Arcane Research has taken a look at the year that was in its final report for 2021 and offered its predictions for crypto markets going into 2022.\par \par \uc2 Arcane\u8217\'20\'19s Dec. 28 The Weekly Update {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://static1.squarespace.com/static/60377b34e7791c1277aaae97/t/61cb272480430d5cc3337156/1640703789129/Weekly+update+-+Arcane+Research+%28Week+51%29+2021+SUMMARY.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 report}}}\uc2  focuses on Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and Ethereum ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) but delves into other major coins, decentralized finance ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/defi-sector-tokens-offer-shelter-as-bitcoin-falls-below-48-5k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DeFi}}}\uc2  ), meme coins, nonfungible tokens ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/this-sports-project-is-bringing-smaller-athletes-closer-to-their-fans"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 NFT}}}\uc2  ), derivatives, and others. Arcane offered a prediction for what would happen in 2022 on every topic covered in the report.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin will outperform the S&P 500 in 2022.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The report noted that through 2021, Bitcoin has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-daily-losses-near-4k-as-s-p-500-hits-69th-all-time-high-of-2021"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 outperformed the S&P 500 index}}}\uc2 . Bitcoin is up 73% while the S&P 500 is up 28% this year, and Arcane believes Bitcoin will continue this performance next year. The benchmark S&P 500 index consists of the 500 biggest companies listed on American stock exchanges.\par \par \uc2 "XRP and Cardano will fall out of the top 10"\par \par \uc2 Arcane noted the tremendous gains on Binance Coin (BNB) this year, peaking at about 1600% in May and rounding out the year up 1344%. Based on this and the growth in market cap from alts like Solana and Terra, along with the NFT craze, the analysts are tipping Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) and Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) will exit the top-10 list.\par \par \uc2 Alternate layer-ones will continue to outperform ETH.\par \par \uc2 While ETH outperformed BTC this year with a gain of 455% to 73%, other {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/stacks-mitchell-cuevas-talks-building-integrated-defi-bridges-for-bitcoin-users"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 layer-one blockchains}}}\uc2  outperformed ETH. Layer-one refers to standalone, base layer blockchains. Terra Luna ends 2021 up 14,823%, Fantom is up 13,549%.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/a20f1710-4521-4ebf-b64c-cea3cce95f64.PNG"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Traditional gaming companies will increasingly add NFTs\par \par \uc2 This year in crypto can be defined in no small part by the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/biggest-nft-drops-and-sales-in-2021"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 massive sales of NFTs}}}\uc2 , and blockchain games like Splinterlands and Alien Worlds have around 526,000 daily active users according to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://dappradar.com/topic/games"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DappRadar}}}\uc2 . Arcane predicts that in 2022, traditional gaming brands will branch into the NFT space and capitalize on the burgeoning market.\par \par \uc2 Even more crypto companies will go public and several will have valuations above $5B.\par \par \uc2 This year saw {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/analysts-say-coinbase-listing-represents-a-watershed-moment-for-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coinbase go public}}}\uc2  on April 14th and it currently has a market cap of $72 billion. The five biggest crypto company public listings slated for 2022 are all currently valued over $1 billion. Arcane believes there will be a numbe others valued higher than $5 billion like crypto exchange \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which is currently valued at $9 billion.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ETFs will hold more than 1M BTC by end of 2022\par \par \uc2 Several Bitcoin futures exchange-traded funds (ETF) were launched in 2021. They currently collectively hold about 846,309 BTC and Arcane says the growth will only continue in 2022.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/1c861d91-f560-46f7-8da7-30bf7dde85fc.PNG"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-whales-dumping-eth-as-price-slides-below-4k-data-shows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum whales dumping ETH as price slides below $4K, data shows}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CHashrate will become even more geographically distributed"\par \par \uc2 When China banned Bitcoin mining, global {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-hashrate-triples-since-june-28-in-recovery-from-china-syndrome"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin hashrate sharply fell}}}\uc2 , then nearly as suddenly recovered. Now the United States leads the world in hashrate, followed by Kazakhstan and Russia. Arcane believes miners will disperse even further into regions like Latin America.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/fbd8cbc6-d5ed-4907-99cc-fb4e655a57b5.PNG"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTIvOWYyNWMyNDYtYWNmZC00ZWJjLTk5ZTgtMGVhNzgyMjQ5ZTVjLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211229ehct00001\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/27: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, LUNA, AVAX, DOT, DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,818 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 December 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin could lead a recovery in the next few days with altcoins following suit.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and most major altcoins have bounced off their immediate support levels, indicating that the sentiment is improving and traders are buying on minor dips.\par \par \uc2 Billionaire and Mexico\u8217\'20\'19s third-richest person Ricardo Salinas Pliego said in his Christmas and New Year message to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/mexican-billionaire-says-buy-bitcoin-in-new-year-message"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 stay away from fiat money}}}\uc2 , terming it as \u8220\'20\'1Cfake money made of paper lies.\u8221\'20\'1D Instead, he advised people to \u8220\'20\'1Cinvest in Bitcoin.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Veteran trader {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/countdown-to-the-yearly-close-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Peter Brandt warned}}}\uc2  that \u8220\'20\'1Cchart pattern breakouts should be viewed with great suspicion\u8221\'20\'1D during the thinly traded holiday period in the last half of December.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/fa84dbe7-a32b-4ec2-8e74-b28863d542aa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Analysts remain \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for 2022. Crypto analyst and pseudonymous \uc2 Twitter\uc2  user DecodeJar believes that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/analysts-say-2022-will-be-defined-by-agility-and-cost-efficiency-instead-of-blockchain-purity"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin could surpass $100,000}}}\uc2  and reach the conservative price target at $190,000.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin continue its recovery in the next few days and pull altcoins higher? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin successfully held the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($50,033) for the past three days, signaling that bulls are buying on dips. This is likely to attract further buying from the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/b8ed92eb-8540-4e7c-be3b-07ba3528ee0e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn up and the relative strength index (RSI) has risen into the positive zone, indicating that bulls are at an advantage.\par \par \uc2 If buyers propel the price above the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $52,314, the prospects of a rally to the stiff overhead resistance at $60,000 increase. The bears are likely to defend this level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be negated if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and breaks below the moving averages. That could pull the BTC/USDT pair to the strong support at $45,456.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the 20-day EMA ($4,065) on Dec. 23 but the bulls have not been able to build upon this advantage. This suggests that the bears have not yet given up and are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/66aeb6cd-5bd2-4b3a-b22b-9a68de4bab4c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint indicate a balance between supply and demand. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up if bulls propel and sustain the price above the overhead resistance at $4,200. This could clear the path for a possible rally to $4,488, followed by a retest of the all-time high at $4,868.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below $3,893.23, it will suggest that bears have gained the upper hand. That could pull the ETH/USDT pair to $3,643.73 and then to the 200-day simple moving average (SMA) ($3,339).\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 After trading close to the 20-day EMA ($549) for the past three days, Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has climbed above the resistance on Dec. 27.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/00d56176-ad9c-458a-83ba-e949b1877c7e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flat and the RSI is just above the midpoint, suggesting a status of equilibrium between the bulls and the bears. If the price sustains above the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that bulls have overpowered the bears.\par \par \uc2 The BNB/USDT pair could first rally to $575 and then rise to $617. Alternatively, if the price turns down from the current level, the bears will attempt to pull the pair to $500. This is an important support for the bulls to defend because if it cracks, the decline could extend to the 200-day SMA ($442).\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the 20-day EMA ($187) on Dec. 23, indicating that the correction may be ending. The bears tried to pull the price back below the 20-day EMA on Dec. 24 but the bulls did not relent.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/792d91d4-cc3a-49a7-9931-46506cb6f408.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This may have attracted further buying by traders. The SOL/USDT pair could now rise to the resistance line of the falling wedge pattern where the bears are likely to mount stiff resistance.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the resistance line but rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bulls are buying on every minor dip. That will increase the possibility of a break above the wedge, opening the doors for a retest of $259.90.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, the pair could slide to $167.88. A break below this support may sink the pair to the 200-day SMA ($125).\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully defended the 20-day EMA ($1.39) for the past three days. This indicates that the sentiment has turned positive and traders are buying on dips. Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) resumed its recovery on Dec. 27.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/1d754e0c-d2d0-4654-8f76-2eb243f279b4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The RSI has risen above 58 and the 20-day EMA has started to turn up, indicating that bulls are attempting a comeback. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to $1.76 and then to the stiff overhead resistance at $1.87.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the 20-day EMA. Such a move will suggest that bears are selling on rallies. The bears will then attempt to pull the pair below $1.18. If they do that, the pair could drop to $1.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the psychological resistance at $1 on Dec. 24, indicating that bears are active at higher levels. The sellers pulled the price to the 20-day EMA ($0.90) but a minor positive is that bulls have held this level for the past three days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/66d5ed01-c08d-442f-823f-b04cbf543e19.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price is currently stuck between the moving averages. If buyers push the price above the 200-day SMA ($0.94), the XRP/USDT pair could rally to $1. A breakout and close above this level could complete an inverse head and shoulders pattern, which could open the doors for a possible rally to $1.25.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price breaks and sustains below the 20-day EMA, the pair could drop to $0.85. If this level also cracks, the decline could reach the critical support at $0.75. A strong rebound off this level could keep the pair range-bound between $0.75 and $1 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls repeatedly pushed Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token above the $100 resistance in the past three days but they have not been able to sustain the higher levels. This suggests that the bears continue to defend this level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/584f309d-3316-44d9-bd5c-57ff24bf0671.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The LUNA/USDT pair could now correct to the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $83.83 and then to the 50% retracement level at $77.72. This zone is likely to act as strong support.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this zone, it will suggest that the trend remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders are buying on dips. The bulls will then again attempt to push the price above the all-time high at $103.60.\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the pair could rally to $124.65 and then to $150. This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down and breaks below the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $71.61.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-rises-above-51k-as-the-dollar-flexes-muscles-against-the-euro"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin rises above $51K as the dollar flexes muscles against the euro}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) once again bounced off the 20-day EMA ($109) on Dec. 26 indicating that bulls are buying on dips. The rising 20-day EMA and the RSI above 57 indicate that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/d13dc067-f5f8-46b7-ae7c-2d2484dbbe71.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains above the 20-day EMA, the bulls will attempt to clear the overhead resistance zone between the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $119.69 and the 78.6% retracement level at $131.70. If they succeed, the AVAX/USDT pair could rise to the all-time high at $147.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead zone and plummets below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that traders are booking profits at higher levels. The pair could then drop to $98 where buyers may attempt to stall the decline.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully defended the 20-day EMA ($28.91) on Dec. 24 and 25, indicating that the sentiment has turned positive and traders are buying on dips. Sustained buying pushed Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $31.49 on Dec. 27.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/f7b47a38-ea36-4ef6-9847-2ebe2c87c00c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn up gradually and the RSI has jumped into the positive territory, indicating that bulls are in command.\par \par \uc2 If buyers sustain the price above $31.49, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up further and the DOT/USDT pair could start a new up-move. The first target on the upside is $39.35 and if this level is crossed, the next stop could be $43.56.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the moving averages, the pair could drop to the strong support zone at $25 to $22.66.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between the 20-day EMA ($0.18) and the overhead resistance at $0.19 for the past three days. This suggests that both bulls and bears are playing it safe and not making large bets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/c79aaa61-506b-4c03-921f-13d371cbb4eb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A break and close above $0.19 will signal that bulls have absorbed the supply. That could start a recovery to $0.22 and if this level is crossed, the DOGE/USDT pair could reach the 200-day SMA ($0.23).\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to clear this hurdle to signal the start of a sustained up-move. Alternatively, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest an advantage to bears. The pair could then slide to the strong support at $0.15.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTIvMzBmMWJjMDgtN2JjNy00OWUwLTljZWEtZTU1NmM1OTBhZmQzLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211227ehcr0005m\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/24: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, LUNA, AVAX, DOT, DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,798 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 December 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and most major altcoins may extend their recovery for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) bounced back above the psychological level at $50,000 and the S&P 500 hit a new all-time closing high on Dec. 23, suggesting that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-holds-off-on-santa-rally-as-fund-forecasts-a-new-year-short-squeeze"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 panic selling caused due to the omicron variant}}}\uc2  is subsiding and the much-awaited \u8220\'20\'1CSanta rally\u8221\'20\'1D may have started.\par \par \uc2 Data from on-chain analytics firm Glassnode shows that about 100,000 Bitcoin are going from \u8220\'20\'1Cliquid\u8221\'20\'1D to \u8220\'20\'1Cilliquid\u8221\'20\'1D state every month, which means that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-hash-rate-nears-record-200eh-s-as-100k-btc-turns-illiquid-every-month"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 coins are being sent to addresses}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Cwith little history of spending.\u8221\'20\'1D This suggests accumulation by investors.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/35c518b1-8c81-499f-ae30-9f38b454201c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 In another sign that investors are not dumping their coins on small corrections, data from CryptoRank shows that the total {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/just-1-3-million-bitcoin-left-circulating-on-crypto-exchanges"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin on crypto exchanges has dropped}}}\uc2  from 9.5% of the total Bitcoin supply in October 2020 to 6.3% of the supply in December of this year, which is the lowest level in 2021.\par \par \uc2 Is the current recovery the start of a new uptrend or is this just a dead cat bounce that will be sold into? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke and closed above the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($49,720) on Dec. 23, indicating that the sellers may be losing their grip. The flattening 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) near the midpoint suggest a possible change in the short-term trend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/e914826a-c22c-4eeb-b5e4-93c64cf689b4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The recovery could rise to the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $52,314 and then to the 50% retracement level at $55,560. The bears are likely to mount a strong resistance in this zone. If the price turns down from this zone, the bears will again try to resume the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below the strong support zone at $45,000 to $42,000 could open the doors for a possible decline to $30,000. On the other hand, if buyers drive the price above $55,560, the BTC/USDT pair could rise to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $58,686. A break and close above this level will improve the prospects of a retest of the all-time high.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the descending channel and the 20-day EMA ($4,060) on Dec. 23, which is the first indication that the correction may be ending.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/3d397186-b222-4ded-87a4-a0444dff8c49.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up and the ETH/USDT pair could rise to $4,488. This level may again act as a strong resistance but if bulls push the price above it, the pair could retest the all-time high at $4,868.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out and the RSI is near the midpoint, suggesting that bulls are attempting a comeback.\par \par \uc2 However, if the price turns down and breaks back into the channel, it will suggest that the current breakout was a bull trap. The pair could then drop to $3,643.73. A break and close below this support could result in a decline to the 200-day simple moving average (SMA) ($3,316).\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has recovered to the downtrend line, which could act as a strong resistance. If the price turns down from the current level, it will suggest that traders continue to sell on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/09615e26-a2f6-4f09-bc29-cf0ee4d64650.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will now attempt to pull the price down to the strong support zone at $500 to $489.20. If this zone crumbles, the decline could extend to the 200-day SMA ($439) where buyers are likely to step in and provide support.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if bulls drive and sustain the price above the downtrend line, it will suggest that the correction could be over. The buyers will then attempt to resume the up-move, which may face resistance at $575 and later at $617.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 After trading close to the 20-day EMA ($184) for the past few days, Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the resistance on Dec. 23. The 20-day EMA has flattened out and the RSI is close to the midpoint, suggesting a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/55d5a66e-ceea-470c-8f03-f5c0f3ab8870.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This balance will tilt in favor of the bulls if the price sustains above the 20-day EMA. Such a move will indicate that the short-term corrective phase may be ending. The SOL/USDT pair could first rise to $204.10 and then to $240.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and sinks below $168.49, it will suggest that bears continue to sell on rallies. The pair could then drop to $148.04. If this level also cracks, the pair could slump to the 200-day SMA ($123).\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) jumped above the 20-day EMA ($1.37) on Dec. 23, indicating that buyers are attempting a comeback. However, the bears are unlikely to give up easily and will attempt to pull the price back below the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/99040b60-59bf-40c6-ad62-15b26ab684c3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then drop to the strong support at $1.18. A break and close below this level could sink the pair to $1.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment has turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders are buying on dips. The bulls will then attempt to push the price to the overhead resistance at $1.87.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the 200-day SMA ($0.94) on Dec. 22, indicating that the sellers may be losing their grip. The bears are currently attempting to stall the recovery near the psychological mark at $1.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/f98b2bdd-a52c-4c38-ab82-6451b9b27544.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls do not allow the price to slip back below the moving average, it will indicate that traders are buying the dips. That will increase the possibility of a break above $1. If that happens, the XRP/USDT pair could rise to $1.20 and later reach the stiff overhead resistance at $1.41.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price breaks back below the moving averages, it will suggest that traders are selling near the stiff overhead resistance level. This could keep the pair stuck inside a large range between $0.75 and $1.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token turned down from $98.20 on Dec. 22, indicating that bears are defending the psychological resistance at $100. However, the bulls had other plans as they bought the dip and resumed the up-move on Dec. 23.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/95ddb903-b327-481b-8d4e-01ae4a616dc7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($74) and the RSI in the overbought zone indicate a buyers' advantage. If bulls sustain the price above $100, the LUNA/USDT pair could start the next leg of the uptrend. The next target objective on the upside is $124.65 and then $150.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the current level, it will suggest that bears continue to pose a stiff challenge at $100. The selling could intensify if the price plummets below the 20-day EMA. The pair could then drop to $50.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-santa-rally-pauses-at-51-5k-as-funds-bet-on-a-sub-60k-btc-price-for-january-2022"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin 'Santa rally' pauses at $51.5K as funds bet on a sub-$60K BTC price for January 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has been facing resistance in the zone between the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $119.69 and the 78.6% retracement level at $131.70, but a minor positive is that bulls have not given up much ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/b009c364-6396-4b9b-8b6b-61a393d59be0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($107) and the RSI in the positive territory suggest that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If bulls drive the price above $131.70, the AVAX/USDT pair could retest the all-time high at $147.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that demand dries up at higher levels. The pair could then drop to $98.14. If this level cracks, the next stop could be $75.50.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the strong support zone at $25 to $22.66 on Dec. 20 and the bulls pushed the price above the moving averages on Dec. 23.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/7f17271a-d278-4250-9839-10f45c9647fc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers sustain the price above the moving averages, the DOT/USDT pair could rise to $31.49 where the bears may mount stiff resistance.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this level but rebounds off the moving averages, it will suggest a change in sentiment from sell on rallies to buy on dips. That could open the doors for a possible rally to $39.35.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($28.42). That could pull the pair down to the support zone.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) rebound off the strong support at $0.15 has risen above the 20-day EMA ($0.18). This suggests that the bears may be losing their grip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/2f875a41-6f29-4bd6-9b90-aa8b63c72c02.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers will now try to propel the price above the overhead resistance at $0.19. If they succeed, the DOGE/USDT pair could rally to $0.22 and then to the 200-day SMA ($0.23). The bears are likely to defend this zone with vigor.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from $0.19, the pair could again drop toward $0.15 and remain range-bound between these two levels for a few more days. The bears will have to sink and sustain the price below $0.15 to start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTIvZjM2Y2I5ZDAtMTRlZi00YjI5LWFjNGMtNmMxMjhmYjdjNTc3LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211224ehco0008f\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin price flatlines as XRP hits $1 with \u8216\'20\'18massive\u8217\'20\'19 altcoin move set for 2022\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 459 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 December 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin does little to buoy the bulls as BTC price retreats into its narrow range.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) stuck rigidly to its tight range on Dec. 23 as price action continued to contradict strong buying activity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/74ab599d-c535-4599-b22b-ccab2bef34be.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Hodlers busy accumulating\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BITSTAMP"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD failing to hold $49,000 after hitting 10-day highs.\par \par \uc2 The pair remained stuck in a trading zone only around $4,000 wide, a key factor fuelling bets that a \u8220\'20\'1Cshort squeeze\u8221\'20\'1D would hit over the holiday period.\par \par \uc2 Against declining \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , data reinforced conviction among investors, with the supply being bought up at roughly three times the rate of new BTC being mined.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CStrong handed HODLers are absorbing supply at more than triple the rate of new coins being mined each day,\u8221\'20\'1D on-chain analytics firm Glassnode summarized in the latest edition of its weekly newsletter, \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://insights.glassnode.com/the-week-onchain-week-51-2021/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The Week On-Chain}}}\uc2 .\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Glassnode additionally noted that at a spot price of $47,000, over one-quarter of the BTC supply was underwater compared to when it last moved.\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-holds-off-on-santa-rally-as-fund-forecasts-a-new-year-short-squeeze"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 , the likelihood of a squeeze up or down on BTC/USD will likely increase over the new year as decreased activity thins out liquidity and allows for \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  to enter more easily.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/BTC?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #BTC}}}\uc2  Update \u9989\'27\'05 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Bitcoin?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Bitcoin}}}\uc2  bounced 8%\par \par \uc2 $46k re-entry after selling $52k & back up to $50k\par \par \uc2 Throwback and S&R flip likely from here.\par \par \uc2 Only a breakout above $50k would be the significant breakout and LONG entry {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/midterm?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #midterm}}}\uc2  in case u missed this bounce (downtrend breakout) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/eKICOZLza6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/eKICOZLza6}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 AN\u8383\'20\'BFESSA (@Anbessa100) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Anbessa100/status/1473601656424222726?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 December 22, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 Among traders, $50,000 remained the point to watch for resumption of a more \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  stance.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CSanta rally\u8221\'20\'1D comes to XRP as altcoins simmer\par \par \uc2 Among altcoins, Wednesday\u8217\'20\'19s exuberance was waning, with only two of the top 10 cryptocurrencies by market capitalization still in the green on daily timeframes at the time of writing.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-12-22-btc-eth-bnb-sol-ada-xrp-luna-avax-dot-doge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 12/22: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , XRP, LUNA, AVAX, DOT, DOGE}}}\par \par \uc2 The standout was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2 , which maintained weekly gains of over 18% to return to $1 for the first time since the start of December. Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) was back below $4,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/dc0e46f5-7e79-41f6-a441-3a2eff6ef656.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD 1-day candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 For Cointelegraph contributor Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe, however, signs were flowing in that a new year\u8217\'20\'19s rebound made buying this week a solid strategy.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CMore and more weekly charts are shaping up beautifully on the altcoins,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1473941537704849412"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2 Twitter\uc2  followers.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C2022 will be massive.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTIvNWEzYjQ0YTEtYWMyYi00ZmYxLThkYmQtY2NhMzE2OWZkOGEyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211223ehcn0002t\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/22: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, LUNA, AVAX, DOT, DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,792 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 December 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and most major altcoins may extend their recovery if they overcome their respective overhead resistance levels.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is attempting to break above the psychologically critical level at $50,000 and close the year on a strong note. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-nears-50k-here-are-the-btc-price-levels-to-watch-next"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 up-move in Bitcoin}}}\uc2  has led to a sharp recovery in the value of the Crypto Fear & Greed Index from 27 to 45 within a day, signaling improving sentiment.\par \par \uc2 BlockFi co-founder Flori Marquez said in a recent interview that new talent, regulatory clarity and higher crypto prices could lead to a feeling of FOMO, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/fomo-will-drive-crypto-adoption-in-2022-says-blockfi-co-founder"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 boosting \b  \highlight22crypto adoption\b0 \highlight22  in 2022}}}\uc2 . Marquez added that the \u8220\'20\'1Cmajority of Blockfi\u8217\'20\'19s clients\u8211\'20\'13when they receive a BTC reward, they\u8217\'20\'19re not selling that for cash.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/10dc64a9-4b29-441e-9919-8e8e3277ae76.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 In another positive news that could boost \b \highlight22\uc2 crypto adoption\b0 \highlight\uc2  further, popular internet browser {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/opera-to-integrate-with-polygon-opening-dapp-ecosystem-to-80m-users"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Opera announced an integration with Polygon}}}\uc2  (MATIC), expected to go live in the first quarter of 2022. Millions of Opera users, first on the Android platform, and then on other devices, will get access to Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s ecosystem.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and the major altcoins extend their recovery in the last few days of the year? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin dipped below the 200-day simple moving average ($47,259) on Dec. 17 but the bears could not build upon their advantage and extend the decline further. This shows that selling dried up at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/0726e30e-a983-4720-9b7c-42fb0a04bbc8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price back above the 200-day SMA on Dec. 21 but the recovery is facing resistance at the 20-day exponential moving average ($49,517). This indicates that bears have not yet given up and are selling on rallies.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level, the bears will again try to sink the price below the 200-day SMA and extend the decline to the strong support zone at $42,000 to $39,600.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bulls drive the price above the 20-day EMA, the BTC/USDT pair could rise to $52,000. This level may act as a barrier but if bulls thrust the price above it, the rally could reach the next major hurdle at $60,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to push and sustain Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the descending channel and the 20-day EMA ($4,055). If they succeed, it will suggest that the corrective phase could be over.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/f455bb35-fd80-49b3-8e56-c65d0f26bcfe.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers will then attempt to propel the price to $4,488 and next to the all-time high at $4,868. A break and close above this resistance will indicate the resumption of the uptrend. The pair could then rally to $5,859.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative. The bears will then try to pull the price below $3,643.73. If they do that, the ETH/USDT pair could drop to the 200-day SMA ($3,302).\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has held the $500 psychological support for the past few days, indicating that buyers are defending the level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/3ef03d7a-5001-4a49-b8c9-8c55a1097742.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BNB/USDT pair could now rise to the downtrend line where the bears may again mount a strong resistance. If the price turns down from this resistance, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below $500 could start the next leg of the down move, which could reach the 200-day SMA ($437).\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bulls drive the price above the downtrend line, it will indicate that the correction may be over. The pair could then rise to $617 and later to the overhead resistance at $669.30.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/solana"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been trading close to the 20-day EMA ($183) for the past few days, indicating that the selling pressure could be reducing.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/4fc96512-1cc3-467c-b490-3d07fb2fb9f1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) just below the midpoint indicate that bulls are making a comeback. A breakout and close above the 20-day EMA could start a stronger recovery to $204.10 and then to $240.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below $167, it will suggest that bears have absorbed the demand. That could clear the path for a drop to $148.04. If this support cracks, the SOL/USDT pair could plummet to the 200-day SMA ($121).\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bears to pull Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) below $1.18 has resulted in a recovery that has reached the 20-day EMA ($1.35).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/a4cfa374-b108-4733-964d-36cabea602c6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level, the sellers will again try to sink the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair below $1.18. If they succeed, the next stop could be $1. The bulls are likely to defend this support aggressively as it has not been breached for the past many months.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if bulls push and close the price above the 20-day EMA, it will indicate the start of a sustained recovery. The first hurdle is $1.47 but if bulls push the price above it, the pair could reach the stiff overhead resistance at $1.87.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/ripple"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  broke and closed above the 20-day EMA ($0.87) on Dec. 20, suggesting that the selling pressure is reducing. The bulls are currently attempting to push the price above the psychological level at $1.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/80778ec5-ea6c-4819-ad45-f6be42592d68.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn up gradually and the RSI has jumped into the positive territory, indicating that bulls have a slight edge. A break and close above $1 could open the doors for a possible rally to $1.20 and next to $1.41.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from $1, the XRP/USDT pair could drop to the 20-day EMA. A strong rebound off this level will suggest that the sentiment has turned positive and traders are buying the dips. That will increase the possibility of a break above $1. However, if bears sink the price below $0.85, the pair faces a possible drop to $0.75.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s LUNA token broke and closed above the overhead resistance at $78.29 on Dec. 20, indicating the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/bc2fd24a-76ce-47e1-b591-fbb57f411592.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum continued and the LUNA/USDT pair soared to $98.20 today. The sharp rally of the past few days has pushed the RSI into the overbought zone and the pair is nearing the psychological mark at $100. This may result in a minor correction or consolidation in the next few days.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level but rebounds off $78.29, it will suggest that the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders are buying on dips. The buyers will then attempt to resume the uptrend, with the next target objective at $124.65.\par \par \uc2 The bears will have to pull and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA ($69.75) to signal a change in the short-term trend.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/missed-out-on-hot-crypto-stocks-in-2021-it-paid-just-to-buy-bitcoin-and-ethereum-data-shows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Missed out on hot crypto stocks in 2021? It paid just to buy Bitcoin and Ethereum, data shows}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/avalanche"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($104) on Dec. 20, which suggests that the bulls are buying on dips. The up-move rose above the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $119.69 on Dec. 21, indicating that bulls are back in the game.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/7662f7c5-94d4-435b-9f38-6e183b194b8c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 There is a minor resistance at the $78.60% Fibonacci retracement level at $131.70, which if cleared could result in a retest of the all-time high at $147. The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above this level to signal the start of the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive zone suggest that bulls have the upper hand. This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA. Such a move could pull the price to $98. If this level gives way, the next stop could be $75.50.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has bounced off the strong support zone at $25 to $22.66, which suggests that bulls are defending this zone with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/4ed351a1-917d-45b4-a596-d9250c3baf74.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The recovery could first reach the 20-day EMA ($28.21) where the bears are likely to mount a strong defense. If the price turns down from this level, the bears will make one more attempt to pull the price below the support zone.\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the DOT/USDT pair could drop to $16.81. Alternatively, if the price breaks above the 200-day SMA ($28.84), it will suggest that the downtrend is weakening. The pair could first rally to $31.49 and next to $39.35.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the strong support at $0.15 on Dec. 20, indicating that buyers continue to defend the level with all their might.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/41ba2c6c-8a33-4a84-9f30-2345fca003f5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair has reached the 20-day EMA ($0.17), which is acting as a strong resistance. If the price turns down from this level, it could keep the pair stuck between the 20-day EMA and $0.15 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 If this tight range trading resolves to the downside, the pair could slide to $0.13 and a break below this level could result in a decline to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bulls drive and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rise to $0.19. This level may again act as a stiff resistance but if crossed, the pair could start a strong recovery to $0.22.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTIvOWMzNjcwNzQtYWY0Yy00MGEwLWI0NTktYzFmNDIwMzQyZTE3LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211222ehcm0008e\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin nears $50K \u8212\'20\'14 Here are the BTC price levels to watch next\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 536 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 December 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC price action focuses on $50,000 with Bitcoin sentiment gaining confidence.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) neared $50,000 on Dec. 22 as hopes began to appear that the price correction could be over.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/7f1e28c4-4329-40fa-8d62-dac7007b5112.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Get \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  once $50,500 breaks \u8212\'20\'14 Analyst\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BITSTAMP"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD hit highs of $49,600 on \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 its highest since Dec. 13.\par \par \uc2 A {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-hits-49k-as-btc-price-gets-unlikely-boost-from-erdogan-s-turkish-lira-tinkering"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cross-crypto boost}}}\uc2  from turmoil in the Turkish lira Monday lingered in spirit as Bitcoin and altcoins stayed higher, with attention now focusing on the new year and price levels above $50,000.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe first breakthrough has happened on Bitcoin. But, we still need to break enough levels to state that we\u8217\'20\'19re \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Cointelegraph contributor Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1473397874742411272"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 declared}}}\uc2  overnight.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COverall, a breakthrough at $50.5-51.5K and I\u8217\'20\'19m convinced. Also, 2022 should become a great year overall.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/BTC?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #BTC}}}\par \par \uc2 Well look what we have here ladies and gentlemen.\par \par \uc2 Our first green bar has appeared!\par \par \uc2 Now we need to make sure this potential reversal doesn't confirm. If the next bar does not confirm the reversal, then we should continue the breakout of the descending triangle \u9989\'27\'05 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/MrbkrAqyXh"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/MrbkrAqyXh}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/OliTqKrafx"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/OliTqKrafx}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 John Wick (@ZeroHedge_) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/ZeroHedge_/status/1473339193787043847?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 December 21, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 With $50,000 constituting psychological resistance, others turned to on-chain metrics for further proof of underlying strength on Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Among them was fund manager Dan Tapiero, who noted \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  signals on the moving average convergence divergence (MACD) indicator in what has historically been a time to buy.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CRallies start when least expected/when tired bulls give up,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/dtapcap/status/1473526357854457858"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 summarized}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 MACD involves the relationship between two exponential moving averages on BTC/USD, and a rebound from a downtrend has preceded price run-ups.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/ab071a2f-fa1a-405f-b3eb-f0116028009d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-day candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ) with MACD. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The last time the buy signal appeared was at the end of September, right before Bitcoin rose to top new all-time highs just over one month later.\par \par \uc2 Sentiment index almost doubles\par \par \uc2 In more encouraging signs for investors, altcoins began posting more significant daily gains through Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-12-20-btc-eth-bnb-sol-ada-xrp-luna-avax-dot-doge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 12/20: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , XRP, LUNA, AVAX, DOT, DOGE}}}\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), the largest altcoin by market capitalization, maintained $4,000, while standout Terra (LUNA) was up 16% at the time of writing.\par \par \uc2 Ripple\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  token traded up 9%, with none of the top 10 cryptocurrencies by market cap in the red.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIf I\u8217\'20\'19d want to position myself well, I\u8217\'20\'19d want to buy into crypto at this stage,\u8221\'20\'1D van de Poppe {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1473431587865776130"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe sentiment is still not the best, while many altcoins are down a lot, some even 80% since their ATH. The adoption is even growing and price-wise, those coins are in heavy support zones.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://alternative.me/crypto/fear-and-greed-index/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto Fear & Greed Index}}}\uc2  saw a significant uptick overnight, jumping from 27 to 45 but still characterizing the market as being in \u8220\'20\'1Cfear\u8221\'20\'1D mode.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/4b315cf9-977a-4e20-8128-9705abb0aa03.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto Fear & Greed Index. Source: Alternative.me\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTIvMTRjZDVlNzgtM2E4Ny00YmM0LWJlZjEtOWVjOTZmMzUzYjYwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211222ehcm0002t\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/20: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, LUNA, AVAX, DOT, DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,811 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 December 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and most major altcoins are trading below the 200-day SMA, suggesting that bears are in full control.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) continues to lose ground in December, a signal that traders may be locking in their gains before the end of the year. The lack of a Santa rally in the U.S. equity markets indicates that the risk-off sentiment prevails due to the uncertainty regarding the spread of the COVID-19 omicron variant in several parts of the world.\par \par \uc2 Even after the sharp drop in Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price, the demand from institutional investors remains tepid, and data shows that the largest institutional Bitcoin product, the \uc2 Grayscale Bitcoin Trust\uc2  (GBTC), is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/biggest-gbtc-discount-ever-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 trading at a discount of more than 20%}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/af59e842-ba22-4301-9a67-b811a24979cd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Veteran trader Peter Brandt said that \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/don-t-expect-retail-sell-off-to-crash-bitcoin-price-analyst"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 high volume panic capitulations\u8221\'20\'1D usually signal a bottom}}}\uc2  in Bitcoin and that has not yet happened during the current decline from the all-time high. This could be a hint that the \u8220\'20\'1Creal\u8221\'20\'1D capitulation is yet to happen.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and most major altcoins continue their down move in the next few days or will a Santa rally come to the rescue? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls have been defending the 200-day simple moving average (SMA) ($47,130) for the past few days, but they have not been able to push the price above the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($49,622). This shows a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/1a5e0978-8f50-40d9-a656-a0292dfb8325.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled the price below the 200-day SMA on Dec. 20 and if the price sustains below this crucial level, the selling may pick up momentum. TheBTC/USDT pair is at risk of hitting the strong support zone at $42,000 to $39,600. The bulls are likely to defend this zone aggressively but the recovery may face a stiff challenge at the 200-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 This negative view could invalidate if the price turns up from the current level and rises above the 20-day EMA. Such a move will suggest that the break below the 200-day SMA could have been a bear trap. The pair could then rise to $52,000 and later attempt a rally to $60,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside a descending channel for the past few days. The bounce off the support line of the channel on Dec. 13 failed to rise above the 20-day EMA ($4,058), indicating that bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/ae2ed39d-275b-46e4-866f-d26040179244.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) below 43 suggest that the path of least resistance is to the downside. The ETH/USDT pair could slide to $3,643.73 and then to the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off the support line could extend the stay inside the channel for a few more days. The bulls will then make one more attempt to push the price above the channel. If they succeed, it will indicate that the selling pressure may be reducing.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price breaks below the channel, the bears could challenge the 200-day SMA ($3,288). A break and close below this level could intensify the selling.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The buyers successfully defended the 100-day SMA ($509) for the past few days but they could not push Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($552). This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/a50ae81e-f3c4-4f57-acd9-fcc20a157159.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative zone suggest that bears have the upper hand. If the price breaks and sustains below the 100-day SMA, the BNB/USDT pair could drop to the 200-day SMA ($436).\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls have absorbed the supply. That could start a recovery to $617 and next to the stiff overhead resistance at $669.30.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($183) on Dec. 19, indicating that bears are defending this level with vigor. If the price slips and sustains below $167.88, a retest of $148.04 is possible.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/f235fc65-4879-420e-954d-15d1209dc782.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This is an important support to watch out for because a break below it could sink the SOL/USDT pair to the 200-day SMA ($120). The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI below 43 suggest that bears are in control.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the 20-day EMA. Such a move will suggest that the selling pressure may be reducing. The pair could then attempt a rally to $200 and later to $240.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) repeatedly bounced off the strong support at $1.18 in the past few days but the bulls have not been able to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($1.35). This suggests a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/86069d92-4ce8-4a06-b1fc-9108c6483a64.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will now attempt to sink and sustain the price below $1.18. If they manage to do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to the critical support at $1. The bulls are likely to defend this level aggressively.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA. Such a move will indicate that demand exceeds supply. The pair could first rise to $1.47 and then attempt a rally to the overhead resistance at $1.87.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between $0.75 and $0.85 for the past few days. The bulls pushed the price above $0.85 on Dec. 20 but the long wick on the candlestick suggests that bears continue to sell on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/45f8ed56-4fc3-43d6-a822-0566c0126eb5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The RSI has recovered strongly from the oversold levels, indicating that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be losing steam. This could keep the XRP/USDT pair stuck inside the range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above $0.85 will indicate that the bulls have overpowered the bears. That could push the price to the psychological mark at $1. Alternatively, a break and close below $0.75 could open the doors for a possible drop to $0.60.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s LUNA token soared to a new all-time high on Dec. 20 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that short-term traders may be booking profits at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/3f1a2bbc-16dc-4818-bf48-ab08a0f72694.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below $78.29, the bears will attempt to pull the LUNA/USDT pair to the 20-day EMA ($64). This is an important support to keep an eye on because a strong rebound off it will suggest that sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will then again try to push the price above the overhead zone at $78.29 to $81.87. If they do that, the pair could start its rally toward the psychological mark at $100.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bears pull the price below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that traders are exiting their positions. That could sink the pair to $50.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/0-01-of-bitcoin-holders-control-27-of-all-circulating-coins-study"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 0.01% of Bitcoin holders control 27% of all circulating coins: Study}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the strong support at $75.50 on Dec. 14 and broke above the downtrend line on Dec. 15. This indicated that bulls are attempting to resume the uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/61095c42-3446-47d5-b104-e557c9c6c599.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the up-move turned down from the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $119.69, indicating that bears are selling on rallies. The AVAX/USDT pair has reached critical support at the 20-day EMA ($99).\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the current level, the buyers will again attempt to resume the up-move. A break and close above $119.69 could clear the path for a rally to $131.70 and later to the all-time high at $147.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price breaks and sustains below the 20-day EMA, the pair could drift down to the strong support at $75.50.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been trading below the 200-day SMA ($28.82) for the past few days. This suggests that bears are in command. The sellers are currently attempting to sink the price below the strong support zone at $25 to $22.66.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/910f6cf9-cd11-4d30-9d6b-04fed85ba81c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the DOT/USDT pair could extend its downward journey toward the next support at $16.81. The longer the price stays below the 200-day SMA, the greater the possibility of the continuation of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off the current zone, the bulls will make one more attempt to push the pair above the 200-day SMA. If they succeed, it will suggest that the bears are losing their grip. The pair could then rise toward $39.35.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the strong support at $0.15 on Dec. 14 and soared above the 20-day EMA ($0.18) but the long wick on the candlestick shows that traders sold at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/087f29fc-559c-4323-886c-bf89d99ab8b8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled the price back below the 20-day EMA on Dec. 15. This could have trapped the aggressive bulls who may have then been forced to liquidate their position. This has pulled the price to the strong support at $0.15.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below this level could pull the price to the Dec. 4 low at $0.13. If this support cracks, the DOGE/USDT pair could drop to the psychological level at $0.10. Conversely, if the price rebounds off the current level, the bulls will again attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at the 20-day EMA and $0.19.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTIvNGRkODAxNzYtN2ZlMi00ZDU4LWJjZmEtNDViZTQwODhlNjRhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211220ehck000dx\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 New Year's Special\par \b \uc2 Ho-ho-hodl: Crypto-themed gifts that have you covered during the Holidays\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Shiraz Jagati \par \uc2 1,229 \uc2 words\par \uc2 18 December 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 From quality clothing and books to gift cards and everything else in between, when sourcing the perfect crypto-centric gift, it is best to probably think outside the box.\par \par \uc2 Tis\u8217\'20\'19 the season of giving and with Christmas right around the corner, it\u8217\'20\'19s time to get the holiday shopping out of the way. With the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  market having matured as much as it has, there are now crypto enthusiasts in virtually every family and friend circle across the globe. In this festive piece, we\u8217\'20\'19ve listed out some of the best crypto-themed gifts you can get for those who love everything about this fast-evolving space.\par \par \uc2 From quality clothing and books to gift cards and everything else in between, when sourcing the perfect crypto-centric gift, it is best to probably think outside the box because that\u8217\'20\'19s pretty much what might have gotten any cryptocurrency enthusiast into this market in the first place. So, without any further ado, let's jump straight in.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/cdb88413-de0d-4212-a9fa-4b21e442cead.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 The annual Bitcoin Miami Conference is widely considered to be one of the biggest draws for crypto investors \u8212\'20\'14 both big and small \u8212\'20\'14 in the world today, and rightly so. The event has traditionally drawn some of the biggest movers and shakers within this space, with the upcoming conference scheduled to take place from April 6\u8211\'20\'139 at the Miami Beach Convention Center.\par \par \uc2 The 2022 iteration is scheduled to host keynote speeches from prominent crypto personnel including Jack Mallers, founder and CEO of Strike \u8212\'20\'14 the world's leading digital wallet built on Bitcoin's Lightning Network \u8212\'20\'14 El-Salvador President Nayib Bukele, Microstrategy CEO Michael Saylor, Blockstream CEO Adam Back, former United States presidential nominee and entrepreneur Andrew Yang and others.\par \par \uc2 Tickets to the Bitcoin Miami conference are available from as low as $99 \u8212\'20\'14 i.e. festival day passes \u8212\'20\'14 to as high as $13,999 referred to as a \u8220\'20\'1Cwhale pass\u8221\'20\'1D which includes VIP access to every aspect of the event, including backstage meetings and one on one interactions with speakers.\par \par \uc2 Another option worth considering is the North American Bitcoin Conference that is slated to take place between January 17\u8211\'20\'1319, 2022. The event will host personalities such as billionaire Mark Cuban and Miami Mayor Francis Suarez, among others. Tickets are available from $199\u8211\'20\'13$899.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/40f3af9d-c820-4f65-b5eb-03e0c0f084f3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 One of the best gifts a person could get someone actively investing in the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  space is a book that provides an in-depth yet balanced outlook on crypto trading. The Basics of Bitcoins and Blockchains by Antony Lewis is one such option. It provides readers with a thorough discourse of the workings of the cryptocurrency market and the technology underlying it.\par \par \uc2 Camila Russo\u8217\'20\'19s The Infinite Machine is another option worth looking into since it charts the rise of the global blockchain ecosystem from its early days, citing interviews from a number of key personnel who have been associated with this space since its very inception. The book has been formulated in the form of an easy-to-digest literary tale, making it easily accessible.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/3fd2616f-8e63-4ae3-8351-155343f76402.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 A must-have for anyone actively investing in the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, if you know anyone who has a passion for crypto but is still storing their holdings on an exchange or hot wallet, a hardware wallet would make an excellent gift. While being highly affordable, these cold storage devices come replete with well-developed ecosystems that can allow users to dabble in the world of crypto trading, decentralized finance (DeFi), nonfungible tokens (NFTs) and more.\par \par \uc2 In terms of their pricing, the Ledger Nano S is available for a base sum of just $59, while the Trezor One is currently retailing for a similar price point of around $63. Additionally, both companies also offer more expensive variants \u8212\'20\'14 i.e. the Ledger Nano S and the Trezor Model T \u8212\'20\'14 that come loaded with additional features such as Bluetooth connectivity, OLED display panels, support for hundreds of coins and many others.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/14fbdb1d-3515-4893-b6a8-3c79ef60dc59.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 No Christmas celebration can ever be truly complete without the exchange of a festive-themed article of clothing such as a sweater, pullover or hoodies. In this regard, there are now many options that one can choose from when deciding to gift their loved ones some crypto-inspired apparel from hoodies featuring Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and Ethereum ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) logos, to sweaters and pullovers featuring phrases like \u8220\'20\'1CHODL,\u8221\'20\'1D \u8220\'20\'1CFOMO\u8221\'20\'1D and \u8220\'20\'1CBTFD,\u8221\'20\'1D there are literally hundreds of options that one can pick from today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/bce4f918-3e88-48a0-93af-ad58b60e9aa2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 People looking to gift light-hearted items this holiday season may want to consider the highly popular Doge-themed moon lamp that has recently caught the attention of crypto lovers across the globe.\par \par \uc2 The offering comes replete with a massive image of the famous Doge meme \u8212\'20\'14 that has been 3D-printed onto the lamp\u8217\'20\'19s outer surface \u8212\'20\'14 while featuring a USB-chargeable battery pack offering a decent running life. Not only that, there are also a number of color and dimming options that users can choose from. However, the most standout feature of this lamp is that it can be paid for in Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ), making it a truly unique gift option.\par \par \uc2 Other items in a somewhat similar vein include crypto-themed pillows featuring logos of prominent digital currencies like Bitcoin, Ethereum, or even Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ). In addition to being soft and comfortable, these items can serve as perfect home decorations for any crypto enthusiast.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/c8374d98-5b77-49d1-b701-7ecd21f5700b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 One of the most famous, but well-loved, crypto-themed presents that people have been handing out over the holiday season over the last couple of years have been gift cards. These allow users to spend various digital currencies in lieu of highly sought-after items available across a host of major retail outlets.\par \par \uc2 Bitrefill\u8217\'20\'19s Balance Card is an excellent example of this, allowing their owners to spend the loaded currencies via platforms such as \uc2 Amazon.com\uc2 , the \uc2 Google\uc2  and Apple Play Stores, Nike, \uc2 Sony\uc2  and hundreds of other options with the click of a button. The gift cards can be topped up with amounts ranging from as low as $50 to upwards of $1,000 worth of crypto.\par \par \uc2 Similarly, cryptocurrency exchange \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  is now offering interested customers a wide array of holiday-themed digital gift cards, allowing them to spread the holiday love by giving people the chance to send and receive crypto gifts with ease. Existing users of the platform have the option to receive any of the exchange\u8217\'20\'19s listed coins and tokens, which can later be spent in return for many different items.\par \par \uc2 Happy holidays everyone\par \par \uc2 Despite the market acting up in recent weeks \u8212\'20\'14 as is best reflected by the total market cap of the sector dipping from $3 trillion to under $2.3 trillion over the last month or so \u8212\'20\'14 it is worth saying that now is the time for crypto investors and enthusiasts to take a step back and reflect on what truly matters in their lives other than their finances, for this is the one part of the year where we can spend time with the ones we truly cherish and love. Here\u8217\'20\'19s wishing y\u8217\'20\'19all happy holidays from Cointelegraph.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTIvYTFiN2Q2OGUtMDk0My00YWMyLThkZWUtNjg0YTI0NzBkOGU4LmpwZWc=.jpeg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211218ehci0008f\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/6: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, DOT, DOGE, LUNA, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,860 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 December 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and most major altcoins are attempting a recovery, but they are likely to face strong resistance at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is attempting to extend its recovery by rising above the psychological mark at $50,000, but several popular analysts believe that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-could-drive-people-nuts-for-months-with-53k-btc-price-ceiling-analyst"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC could remain range-bound}}}\uc2  for a few weeks or even months.\par \par \uc2 On-chain analytics firm CryptoQuant said that Bitcoin \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whales-move-fresh-coins-to-exchanges-in-repeat-of-behavior-before-42k-btc-price-dip"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 whales are still depositing BTC to exchanges}}}\uc2 .\u8221\'20\'1D This simply indicates that whales are setting themselves up to react at short notice depending on which path the price elects to take.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/33972735-4e29-4003-8d87-90dce770f0d8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The sharp correction of the past few days has pulled the Crypto Fear and Greed Index to 16, which indicates a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-sentiment-comparable-to-a-funeral-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sentiment of \u8220\'20\'1Cextreme fear}}}\uc2 .\u8221\'20\'1D Some believe the current fall looks similar to the March 2020 crash.\par \par \uc2 However, CoinCorner CEO Danny Scott said that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s fall was due to the liquidation of positions by gamblers and not because of sentiment. According to him, the sentiment is \u8220\'20\'1Cstill very \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 After the most recent shakeout, could Bitcoin start a strong recovery and lead crypto markets higher? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke below the uptrend line and the psychological support at $50,000, which may have resulted in panic selling by traders. Although bulls purchased the dip aggressively, they are finding it difficult to push the price above $50,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/40e01dbb-9dbc-4972-90a7-73f11b62f8df.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($55,551) and the relative strength index (RSI) near the oversold zone indicate that bears are in command. The sellers will attempt to flip the uptrend line into resistance. If that happens, the bears will again try to sink the BTC/USDT pair to the strong support zone at $42,000 to $39,600.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bulls push the price above the uptrend line, the pair could rally to the 20-day EMA. This is an important level to watch out for because a break and close above it will be the first sign that bears may be losing their grip. The pair could then rally to the overhead resistance at $61,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) plummeted below the 100-day simple moving average (SMA) ($3,873) on Dec. 4 but the bears could not sustain the lower levels. This suggests that traders are accumulating on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/9a59215d-9f5c-4b0b-833c-ca35a7674631.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The recovery attempt is facing stiff resistance near $4,250. The bears again attempted to pull the price below the $3,900 support on Dec. 6 but the long tail on the candlestick suggests that bulls are defending the level.\par \par \uc2 If buyers push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA ($4,315), the ETH/USDT pair could rise to the overhead resistance at $4,868. A break and close above this resistance will indicate the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will make one more attempt to sink and sustain the pair below the 100-day SMA. If they succeed, the pair could drop to $3,400.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed below the 20-day EMA ($592) on Dec. 3. That was followed by a sharp sell-off on Dec. 4, which pulled the price to the 100-day SMA ($496).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/23ffaba4-4028-4e11-a87b-27ee36ba0daa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers aggressively defended the 100-day SMA as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. The recovery could reach the 20-day EMA where the bears are likely to mount a strong resistance.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the BNB/USDT pair could remain stuck between the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the 20-day EMA could clear the path for an up-move to the overhead resistance zone at $669.30 to $691.80. This positive view will be negated on a drop below the 100-day SMA. The pair could then drop to $435.30.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned down and re-entered the triangle on Dec. 3. This could have trapped the aggressive bulls who bought the breakout of the triangle on Dec. 1 and 2.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/a5fbd521-405f-4dd0-afc7-ce9fdade69bc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling picked up momentum after the SOL/USDT pair broke and closed below the 20-day EMA ($209). The bears pulled the price below the support line of the triangle and the 100-day SMA ($181) on Dec. 4.\par \par \uc2 Although bulls purchased this dip and again defended the 100-day SMA on Dec. 5, they could not build upon the recovery.\par \par \uc2 The bears pounced on this opportunity and are currently attempting to sink the price below the 100-day SMA. If they manage to do that, the pair could drop to the strong support zone at $120 to $140.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($1.63) on Dec. 3, indicating that sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/6498fe57-75d1-4e88-ae64-371e598a7a9d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling intensified on Dec. 4 and the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair plunged to $1.18. Although bulls purchased this dip, they could not sustain the recovery. This indicates that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 If bears sink the price below $1.18, the pair could plummet to the strong support at $1 where buyers are expected to defend the level with all their might. A break and close above the 20-day EMA will be the first sign that the bears may be losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) broke below the strong support at $0.85 on Dec. 4 and fell to an intraday low at $0.60. Aggressive buying at lower levels helped stage a strong recovery as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/376b00c5-e4b2-4b5a-8f54-12aac432243a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers attempted to push the price above $0.85 on Dec. 5 but failed. This suggests that the level has flipped into resistance. The bears will now again try to resume the down move and sink the XRP/USDT pair to $0.60.\par \par \uc2 The RSI has dropped into the oversold territory, indicating that the pair could witness a consolidation or a relief rally in the next few days.\par \par \uc2 If bulls drive the price above $0.85, the pair may rally to the 20-day EMA ($0.97) where bears may again pose a stiff challenge. A break and close above this level will suggest that the sellers may be losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) plummeted below the strong support at $32.21 on Dec. 4 and dropped to the next critical level at $25. Although bulls defended this support, the weak rebound suggests a lack of aggressive buying at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/ddbfa466-7e4d-4021-86d3-d4f6fa817042.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price turned down on Dec. 5 and the bears are again attempting to pull the DOT/USDT pair below the strong support at $25. If they succeed, the pair could drop to $22.50 and later to $20.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price rebounds off the current level, it will suggest that buyers are defending this level with all their might. The pair could then rise to the 20-day EMA ($36).\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this level, it will indicate that sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA to indicate a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/grayscale-finds-that-over-25-of-us-households-surveyed-currently-own-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Grayscale finds that over 25% of US households surveyed currently own Bitcoin}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) plunged below the critical support at $0.15 on Dec. 4 but bulls purchased this dip as seen from the long tail on the candlestick. The failure of the buyers to push the price to the overhead resistance at $0.19 indicates a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/c14138ea-d581-4052-b47f-1d7579d296ab.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to pull the price back below $0.15 on Dec. 6. If this support is breached, the selling could intensify and the DOGE/USDT pair could drop to $0.13 and then to the psychological support at $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the current level, it will suggest that bulls are defending the $0.15 support aggressively. The pair could then rise to the overhead resistance at $0.19. A break and close above this level and the 20-day EMA ($0.20) will signal a possible trend change.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s LUNA token was hugely volatile on Dec. 4 but the strong closing on the day shows that bulls came on top. However, the buyers could not keep up the momentum, resulting in profit-booking on Dec. 5.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/7c9f98a7-9b03-4ced-8c33-ac15776b72ec.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to pull the price back into the ascending channel on Dec. 6 but the bulls are likely to defend this level with vigor. The upsloping 20-day EMA ($55) and the RSI in the positive zone indicate the advantage to buyers.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the current level, the bulls will attempt to thrust the price above the all-time high at $78.29 and resume the uptrend. The LUNA/USDT pair could then rally to $90.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if bears pull the price below the 20-day EMA. That could open the doors for a possible decline to the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche (AVAX) turned down sharply on Dec. 4 and plunged to the strong support at $81. The bulls purchased this dip but the weak bounce indicates a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/38102405-602c-45aa-bbbd-bdc64740d955.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears again attempted to sink and sustain the price below the strong support at $81 and the 100-day SMA ($73) on Dec. 6 but the rebound suggests that bulls are accumulating on dips.\par \par \uc2 The AVAX/USDT could rise to the 20-day EMA ($104) where the bears are expected to mount a strong resistance. A break and close above the 20-day EMA and the downtrend line will signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears continue to sell on rallies. That could pull the pair to the 100-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTIvY2FmYmI0YWItZjBkMC00YjcyLWE0OGEtN2ZmZjMxNTY2MjM4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211206ehc6000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/3: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, DOT, DOGE, LUNA, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,823 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 December 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 It\u8217\'20\'19s clear that bears have nearly extinguished all signs of \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum after BTC price falls below $52,000 and altcoins take a severe belting.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) have turned down from their respective overhead resistance levels, suggesting that bears continue to sell on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/academic-research-claims-eth-is-a-superior-store-of-value-to-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 New research in Australia}}}\uc2  suggests that the Ethereum Improvement Proposal (EIP) 1559 upgrade has turned Ether into a better store of value than Bitcoin. The report said the annual rate of increase in Ether\u8217\'20\'19s supply since EIP-1559 is 0.98% compared to an increase of 1.99% in Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s supply.\par \par \uc2 Demand for Ether has been on the rise following the surging popularity of nonfungible tokens, decentralized finance and Metaverse-related altcoins. Several analysts {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/increased-utility-in-defi-nfts-back-ethereum-s-3-year-high-in-its-eth-btc-pair"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 remain \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  on Ether}}}\uc2  and anticipate it to rally to the range between $6,000 and $10,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/4e160b64-6daa-436b-b163-780f0103185c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 On-chain analytics firm Glassnode said that high open interest in the derivatives market and long-term holders {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-sees-first-downward-difficulty-move-in-5-months-amid-uncertainty-over-hodler-spending"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 selling could extend Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s decline}}}\uc2 . The \u8220\'20\'1Copen interest leverage in options and futures at or new all-time high\u8221\'20\'1D could result in a shakeout.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s correction pull the entire crypto sector lower? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls could not sustain Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price above the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($57,905) on Nov. 30 and Dec. 1. This suggests that bears are defending the 20-day EMA with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/b17f6f73-71bc-4e6a-ada7-75ee5d1169e5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will now attempt to sink and sustain the price below the 100-day simple moving average (SMA) ($54,485) and the Nov. 28 intraday low at $53,256.64. If they succeed, the BTC/USDT pair could plummet to the psychologically critical support at $50,000.\par \par \uc2 This is an important support to keep an eye on because if it breaks down, the selling could pick up momentum and the pair could drop to $40,000. The downsloping 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) in the negative zone suggest the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off the 100-day SMA and rises above the 20-day EMA, it will indicate accumulation at lower levels. The pair could then rise to the 50-day SMA ($60,750).\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether turned down from $4,778.75 on Dec. 1, indicating that bears are aggressively defending the all-time high at $4,868. The price pulled back to the 50-day SMA ($4,319) on Dec. 3.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/8642beee-87b3-403e-a13a-69703dc8f81c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the current level, it will suggest that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips. The bulls will then make one more attempt to propel the price above $4,868.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the ETH/USDT pair could resume its uptrend, with the next target objective at $5,796. Conversely, if the price breaks below the 50-day SMA, it will indicate that traders may be rushing to the exit. The pair could then decline to the strong support at $3,900.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls again attempted to push Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $669.30 on Dec. 1 but failed. This suggests that bears continue to pose a stiff challenge at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/308ef39d-5f66-4d4d-97f4-ac8d60ef9e21.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($602) has flattened out and the RSI is near the midpoint, indicating a possible range-bound action in the near term.\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks below the 20-day EMA, the BNB/USDT pair could drop to the 50-day SMA ($564). This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break below it could pull the price down to the 100-day SMA ($494).\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rises from the current level or the 50-day SMA, the bulls will attempt to push the pair above the $669.30 to $691.80 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle on Dec. 1 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. The bears pulled the price back into the triangle on Dec. 3.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/52e3b4fb-3efc-443b-9446-51be493f11f6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA ($215), the bulls will make one more attempt to start the up-move by pushing the SOL/USDT pair above the overhead resistance at $243.12.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price breaks below the 50-day SMA ($210), it will suggest that the recent breakout above the resistance line may have been a bull trap. The bears will then try to sink the price below the support line of the triangle.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below the 100-day SMA ($178) could start a deeper correction that may reach $140.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) recovered sharply on Dec. 2 but hit a wall at the 20-day EMA ($1.72). The failure of the bulls to clear the overhead hurdle may have attracted heavy selling by the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/250a5cc8-9fd2-40ff-ab7c-f1da1a5eb3c6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sellers will now attempt to sink the price to the strong support zone at $1.50 to $1.41. This is an important support for the bears to defend because if it cracks, the selling could accelerate and the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may start its downward journey to $1.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the support zone, it will indicate buying at lower levels. The bulls will then make one more attempt to propel the price above the 20-day EMA. If that happens, the pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($1.94).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple's ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) failure to break and sustain above the psychological level at $1 indicates that bears are aggressively selling on minor rallies. The price has turned down and the bears will now try to pull the price to the strong support at $0.85.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/41ec2ef8-1fe1-45c9-9b00-00f8e786095a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($1.02) and the RSI below 37 indicate that sellers are in control. If bears sink and sustain the price below $0.85, the XRP/USDT pair could plummet to the next support at $0.70.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns up from the current level or the $0.85 support and breaks above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the selling pressure may be reducing. The pair could then rise to the 50-day SMA ($1.09).\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) turned down from the breakdown level of the H&S pattern at $38.70 on Nov. 30 and broke below the 100-day SMA ($37). The bears will now attempt to pull the price to the strong support at $32.21.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/5c995221-2678-45aa-afea-a06b8a90c61d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If this level cracks, the selling could intensify and the DOT/USDT pair could plummet to the next support at $26. The downsloping 20-day EMA ($39) and the RSI in the negative territory suggest that bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the markets have rejected the lower levels. That may trap several aggressive bears, resulting in a short covering. The pair could then rise to the 50-day SMA ($43) and later to $47.50.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/nft-music-platforms-to-disrupt-spotify-in-2022-saxo-bank-predicts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 NFT music platforms to disrupt Spotify in 2022, Saxo Bank predicts}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls repeatedly failed to push \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.22) in the past few days, suggesting that sentiment remains negative and bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/5a8f9131-c5a3-4c01-9faf-bb091fbf0b66.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is sloping down and the RSI is below 36, indicating that the path of least resistance is to the downside. If bears sink the price below $0.19, the DOGE/USDT pair could drop to the critical support at $0.15.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns up from the current level or rebounds off $0.19 and breaks above the 20-day EMA, it will indicate strong accumulation at lower levels. The pair could then rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.24).\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s LUNA token broke above the moving averages on Nov. 28 and picked up momentum. Strong buying by the bulls pushed the price to a new all-time high on Nov. 30, indicating the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/17458ecb-4893-4366-a4ca-01afb737e312.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bears to stall the up-move at the resistance line indicates aggressive buying by the bulls. If the price sustains above the channel, the LUNA/USDT pair could rally to $85.07.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down and plummets back into the channel, it will suggest that traders are booking profits at higher levels. The pair could then decline to the 20-day EMA ($51).\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this level, it will suggest that sentiment remains positive while a break below the 20-day EMA could pull the price down to the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche (AVAX) turned down from the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $129.26 on Dec. 1. This may have prompted profit-booking from traders, which pulled the price below the 20-day EMA ($109) on Dec. 2.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/70316cbc-eac0-4b43-9c68-fb4f162b1d3c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 If bulls push and sustain the price back above the 20-day EMA, the AVAX/USDT pair could rally to $129.26. A break and close above this level could open the doors for a possible retest of the all-time high at $147.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price fails to sustain above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that traders are selling on minor rallies. The bears will then attempt to sink the price below the psychological support at $100. If that happens, the pair could decline to the 50-day SMA ($87).\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTIvZDU3YzE5MTMtMzhlZi00ZThkLTliNzQtMTRhYjNlOWU0ZDViLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211203ehc3000dz\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Venture Capital\par \b \uc2 Crypto Biz: Wall Street veteran launches $1.5B crypto fund, MELD ISPO shines spotlight on Cardano, Dec. 2\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Sam Bourgi \par \uc2 444 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 December 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Matt Zhang, MELD, 2TM and 1inch Network headline this week's Crypto Biz newsletter.\par \par \uc2 Crypto Biz is a weekly newsletter that provides readers with the latest scoop on the business behind crypto and blockchain. The newsletter is delivered to your inbox every Thursday. Stay informed by subscribing below.\par \par \uc2 Crypto converted another Wall Street veteran this week after former Citi executive Matt Zhang {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/former-citi-banker-launches-1-5b-crypto-fund-taps-algorand-as-first-partner"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 launched a $1.5 billion \b  \highlight22digital asset\b0 \highlight22  fund}}}\uc2 . A {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/meld-s-1b-ispo-highlights-emerging-use-cases-for-cardano-crypto-fundraising"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 new funding mechanism}}}\uc2  allowing users to access early-stage crypto startups shined the spotlight on Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s massive community. One of Latin America\u8217\'20\'19s biggest crypto exchanges {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/mercado-bitcoin-parent-company-2tm-raises-50m-further-cementing-unicorn-status"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 raised $50 million in private funding}}}\uc2  to expand its operations. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/1inch-network-concludes-175m-series-b-led-by-amber-group"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 1inch Network raised another $175 million}}}\uc2  from leading crypto venture capitalists to expand DeFi liquidity.\par \par \uc2 These were just some of the week\u8217\'20\'19s biggest business headlines from the world of crypto. Every Thursday, Cointelegraph\u8217\'20\'19s Crypto Biz newsletter gives readers a pulse of the business behind blockchain and cryptocurrency, delivered directly to their inbox. Below is a concise version of the Thursday edition of our newsletter.\par \par \uc2 Former Citi banker launches $1.5B crypto fund\par \par \uc2 Matt Zhang left a 14-year career at \uc2 Citigroup\uc2  to launch Hivemind Capital Partners, a $1.5 billion multi-strategy crypto and blockchain fund. The fund is designed to invest in emerging blockchain projects, support institutional access to crypto and actively trade digital assets.\par \par \uc2 MELD\u8217\'20\'19s $1B ISPO shines the spotlight on Cardano\par \par \uc2 In October, DeFi banking protocol MELD concluded a $1-billion initial stake pool offering (ISPO), giving Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) holders the ability to stake their \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  in exchange for MELD tokens. The ISPO was a resounding success as more than 40,000 participants staked 620 million \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 . MELD CEO Ken Olling provided Cointelegraph with exclusive commentary.\par \par \uc2 2TM raises $50M, further cementing unicorn status\par \par \uc2 Crypto unicorn 2TM, which operates Mercado Bitcoin, one of Latin America\u8217\'20\'19s largest \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  exchanges, has concluded a $50.3 million private investment round. 2TM is planning to expand its services in the region as \b \highlight22\uc2 crypto adoption\b0 \highlight\uc2  continues to grow in places like Brazil, Mexico and Argentina.\par \par \uc2 Amber Group leads 1inch Network\u8217\'20\'19s $175M Series B\par \par \uc2 Earlier this week, decentralized exchange aggregator 1inch Network closed a $175-million private financing round, with contributions from some of crypto\u8217\'20\'19s biggest venture investors, including Amber Group, VanEck, Jane Street, Fenbushi Capital, Alameda Research, Celsius and Nexo. The Series B was more than double the $70 million target 1inch had initially planned and further demonstrated the enormous appetite for DeFi solutions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTIvMmQwNmU4YjYtYmY0NS00YTMxLWI2NmMtZmVjMTI3NGMzY2I4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211203ehc20008i\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Venture Capital\par \b \uc2 Crypto Biz: Wall Street veteran launches $1.5B crypto fund, MELD ISPO shines spotlight on Cardano, Dec. 2\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Sam Bourgi \par \uc2 410 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 December 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Matt Zhang, MELD, 2TM and 1inch Network headline this week's Crypto Biz newsletter.\par \par \uc2 Crypto converted another Wall Street veteran this week after former Citi executive Matt Zhang {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/former-citi-banker-launches-1-5b-crypto-fund-taps-algorand-as-first-partner"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 launched a $1.5 billion \b  \highlight22digital asset\b0 \highlight22  fund}}}\uc2 . A {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/meld-s-1b-ispo-highlights-emerging-use-cases-for-cardano-crypto-fundraising"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 new funding mechanism}}}\uc2  allowing users to access early-stage crypto startups shined the spotlight on Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s massive community. One of Latin America\u8217\'20\'19s biggest crypto exchanges {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/mercado-bitcoin-parent-company-2tm-raises-50m-further-cementing-unicorn-status"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 raised $50 million in private funding}}}\uc2  to expand its operations. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/1inch-network-concludes-175m-series-b-led-by-amber-group"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 1inch Network raised another $175 million}}}\uc2  from leading crypto venture capitalists to expand DeFi liquidity.\par \par \uc2 These were just some of the week\u8217\'20\'19s biggest business headlines from the world of crypto. Every Thursday, Cointelegraph\u8217\'20\'19s Crypto Biz newsletter gives readers a pulse of the business behind blockchain and cryptocurrency, delivered directly to their inbox. Below is a concise version of the Thursday edition of our newsletter.\par \par \uc2 Former Citi banker launches $1.5B crypto fund\par \par \uc2 Matt Zhang left a 14-year career at \uc2 Citigroup\uc2  to launch Hivemind Capital Partners, a $1.5 billion multi-strategy crypto and blockchain fund. The fund is designed to invest in emerging blockchain projects, support institutional access to crypto and actively trade digital assets.\par \par \uc2 MELD\u8217\'20\'19s $1B ISPO shines the spotlight on Cardano\par \par \uc2 In October, DeFi banking protocol MELD concluded a $1-billion initial stake pool offering (ISPO), giving Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) holders the ability to stake their \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  in exchange for MELD tokens. The ISPO was a resounding success as more than 40,000 participants staked 620 million \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 . MELD CEO Ken Olling provided Cointelegraph with exclusive commentary.\par \par \uc2 2TM raises $50M, further cementing unicorn status\par \par \uc2 Crypto unicorn 2TM, which operates Mercado Bitcoin, one of Latin America\u8217\'20\'19s largest \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  exchanges, has concluded a $50.3 million private investment round. 2TM is planning to expand its services in the region as \b \highlight22\uc2 crypto adoption\b0 \highlight\uc2  continues to grow in places like Brazil, Mexico and Argentina.\par \par \uc2 Amber Group leads 1inch Network\u8217\'20\'19s $175M Series B\par \par \uc2 Earlier this week, decentralized exchange aggregator 1inch Network closed a $175-million private financing round, with contributions from some of crypto\u8217\'20\'19s biggest venture investors, including Amber Group, VanEck, Jane Street, Fenbushi Capital, Alameda Research, Celsius and Nexo. The Series B was more than double the $70 million target 1inch had initially planned and further demonstrated the enormous appetite for DeFi solutions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTIvMmQwNmU4YjYtYmY0NS00YTMxLWI2NmMtZmVjMTI3NGMzY2I4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211202ehc2000e2\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/1: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, DOT, DOGE, AVAX, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,819 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 December 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin continues to encounter resistance near $60,000, but this hasn\u8217\'20\'19t stopped altcoins from advancing on their previous all-time highs.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) finished the month of November with a decline of about 7%. This was in sharp contrast to the prediction of the \u8220\'20\'1Cworst-case scenario\u8221\'20\'1D of $98,000 by PlanB, the creator of the popular stock-to-flow model. Although the analyst described it as a \u8220\'20\'1Cbig miss,\u8221\'20\'1D he said he would {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-fails-worst-case-scenario-monthly-close-for-the-first-time-starts-december-sub-57k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 give the floor model one more month}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 In its latest \u8220\'20\'1CWeek on-chain\u8221\'20\'1D report, Glassnode analysts said that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s correction in November was the \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-correction-weakest-of-2021-so-far-as-hopes-of-santa-claus-rally-rise"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 least severe in 2021}}}\uc2 .\u8221\'20\'1D Analysts now expect Bitcoin to witness a Santa rally, similar to the 47% up-move in December 2020 or the sharper 80% surge that occurred in December of 2017.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/4f9c6abc-0402-4507-875b-3cf4bff64c7d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 In another positive news for Bitcoin bulls, Bloomberg senior exchange-traded fund (ETF) analyst Eric Balchunas said that "{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/fidelity-reportedly-launching-spot-bitcoin-etf-in-canada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Fidelity Advantage Bitcoin ETF}}}\uc2 " was awaiting regulatory approval to be listed on a Canadian exchange. If that happens, Fidelity would become the largest management company to offer a spot-based \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Can bulls sustain the current momentum after starting December on a strong footing? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been clinging to the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($58,463) for the past two days. This suggests that bears are defending the 20-day EMA but the bulls have not ceded much ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/a5e34d4c-f5b1-4094-ab0f-238e8eca99e8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers are again attempting to drive the price above the 20-day EMA as of Dec. 1. If they succeed, it will indicate that the selling pressure may be reducing. The BTC/USDT pair could then rise to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($60,828).\par \par \uc2 This is a critical level for the bears to defend because a break above it will clear the path for a rally to the overhead resistance zone at $67,000 to $69,000.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level or the 50-day SMA, it will suggest that traders are selling on rallies. The pair could then again drop to the 100-day SMA ($54,343). A break and close below $53,256.64 could start a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the resistance at $4,551 on Nov. 30. Sustained buying on Dec. 1 pushed the price near the all-time high at $4,868.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/66084b08-f830-44ee-810b-fc8fe7389c4d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($4,380) has started to turn up and the relative strength index (RSI) has risen into the positive zone, suggesting that bulls are back in control. If bulls thrust the price above $4,868, it will invalidate the prospective head and shoulders (H&S) pattern.\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair could then start its northward march toward the target objective at $5,796. Conversely, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the bears will attempt to sink the pair below the 50-day SMA ($4,289). If they do that, the pair could decline to $4,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) once again bounced off the 20-day EMA ($602) on Nov. 30 indicating that sentiment remains positive and traders are accumulating on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/c0386582-4c2e-477a-8259-49348ba854dc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BNB/USDT pair could now rally to the overhead resistance at $669.30. A break and close above this resistance could complete the inverse H&S pattern, which has a target objective at $828.60.\par \par \uc2 The all-time high at $691.80 may offer resistance but if bulls clear this hurdle, the pair could start its journey toward the pattern target.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $669.30, the bears will again try to pull and sustain the pair below the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the pair may slide to the 50-day SMA ($559).\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) rose above the 20-day EMA ($213) on Nov. 30 but the long wick on the candlestick showed selling at higher levels. The bulls resumed their purchase on Dec. 1 and have pushed the price to the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/85ea9258-ab19-4ca1-980f-77a9cb94440f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above the triangle will indicate that the uncertainty among the bulls and the bears has resolved to the upside. The SOL/USDT pair could first rally to $240 and then retest the all-time high at $259.90. The pattern target of this setup is $310.96.\par \par \uc2 If bulls fail to sustain the price above the resistance line, it will indicate that bears continue to sell on rallies. The bears will have to sink and sustain the price below the triangle to indicate the formation of a short-term top.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned down on Nov. 30 but the bulls purchased this dip and are attempting to resume the relief rally on Dec. 1. If buyers drive the price above $1.63, the recovery could reach the 20-day EMA ($1.74) where the bears may again try to pose a stiff challenge.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/fafbba5a-f0a7-43d7-aa4e-97e8e03b0140.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative zone suggest that bears have the upper hand. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will again attempt to resume the downtrend. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up on a break below $1.40.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bulls drive the price above the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the selling pressure may be reducing. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then rise to the breakdown level at $1.87 and later to the 50-day SMA ($1.96).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple's ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) rebound off the strong support at $0.85 is facing resistance at the 20-day EMA ($1.04) as seen from the long wick on the Nov. 30 candlestick. A minor positive is that bulls are not giving up much ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/644f864f-7703-4caf-be10-e4dad5ee1d38.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price clings close to the psychological level at $1, the bulls will make one more attempt to clear the overhead barrier. A break and close above the moving averages may signal that the XRP/USDT pair could remain stuck between $0.85 and $1.41.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level, it will suggest that traders are selling on rallies near overhead resistance levels. The selling could accelerate on a break and close below $0.85. The pair could then slide to $0.70\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off $32.21 on Nov. 28 and reached the neckline of the H&S pattern. The downsloping 20-day EMA ($40) and the RSI below 43 suggest bears have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/3acb0090-1ae2-4e6e-a1c0-4a0e4bafd272.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA, the bears will attempt to sink the DOT/USDT pair below $32.21. If they manage to do that, the selling could intensify and the pair may drop to $26.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be negated if the price breaks and closes above the 20-day EMA. Such a move could open the doors for a relief rally to the 50-day SMA ($43.63). If bulls clear this hurdle, the up-move may extend to $49.78.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/online-electronics-shop-newegg-to-accept-shiba-inu-crypto-during-holidays"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Online electronics shop Newegg to accept Shiba Inu crypto during holidays}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long wick on \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/compound-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) candlestick of the past two days shows that bears are defending the 20-day EMA ($0.22). This indicates that sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/8def0a59-ee73-4900-a39c-1f66556e6333.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to pull the price to $0.19. A break and close below this support could result in a drop to the critical level at $0.15. The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative territory suggest the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rises from the current level or the support at $0.19 and breaks above the 20-day EMA, it will signal that traders are accumulating on dips. The DOGE/USDT pair could then rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.24). The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may pick up above this level.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche (AVAX) formed a Doji candlestick pattern on Nov. 30 indicating uncertainty among the bulls and the bears. This indecision resolved to the upside on Dec. 1 as bulls pushed the price higher.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/ebe4593c-e476-4faf-a4c5-efe067f8de42.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The AVAX/USDT pair is likely to face stiff resistance at the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $129.26. If the price turns down from this resistance, the bears will make one more attempt to pull the price below the 20-day EMA ($110).\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the pair could drop to the psychological level at $100. A break and close below this support could signal a change in the short-term trend.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if bulls drive the price above $129.26, the pair could rise to $137.06 and then challenge the all-time high at $147.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 SHIBA INU (SHIB) climbed back above the breakdown level at $0.000040 on Nov. 29. This may have trapped the bears who rushed to cover their short positions. This pushed the price to $0.000054 on Nov. 30 but the long wick on the candlestick indicates a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-12/e57f8a7e-51bf-482f-a99b-574133e082cb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.000045) has flattened out and the RSI is near the midpoint, indicating a possible range-bound action in the short term. The SHIB/USDT pair could trade between $0.000035 and $0.000054 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks and sustains below the 20-day EMA, the pair could gradually drop to $0.000035. Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will attempt to push the pair above $0.000054. If they succeed, the pair could rally to $0.000065.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTIvYzEwYTU5NGMtZmQ0My00YzNhLWEzMjUtOGYxY2IzZGQ5YzEzLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211201ehc1000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 11/29: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, DOT, DOGE, AVAX, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,851 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 November 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and most major altcoins rebounded off their strong support levels, but the real challenge for the bulls is to sustain the momentum and clear the $60,000 resistance level.\par \par \uc2 The crypto markets and the global equity markets staged a strong recovery on Nov. 29 in spite of the uncertainty from the newly discovered Omicron variant of COVID-19.\par \par \uc2 Long-term investors seem to view the recent dip as a prime buying opportunity. A recent filing by \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  showed that the firm purchased 7,002 Bitcoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC }}}\uc2  ) at an average price of $59,187. That boosted {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-purchases-414-4-million-worth-of-bitcoin-with-total-btc-balance-eclipsing-3-5-billion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MicroStrategy\u8217\'20\'19s total stash to 121,044 Bitcoin }}}\uc2 , bought at an average price of about $29,534 per coin.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/1bab7d8d-2778-42bd-992a-dcd612f3be00.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360 }}}\par \par \uc2 However, analytics resource Material Scientist {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-holds-57k-amid-warning-weak-hands-could-fuel-a-fresh-btc-price-dip"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cited order book data }}}\uc2  to say that \u8220\'20\'1Ca lot of Bitcoin liquidity has been taken\u8221\'20\'1D and warned that \u8220\'20\'1Cstop hunters\u8221\'20\'1D may attempt to shake out the weak hands with a fall.\par \par \uc2 Is the current recovery a bull trap or is it the start of a sustained relief rally? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s relief rally is facing resistance at the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($58,712). This suggests that sentiment remains negative and bears are attempting to sell on rallies to the overhead resistance level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/9aea3454-3683-4680-8397-59ce1bc7ecd2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Although the 20-day EMA continues to slope down, the RSI has risen above 46, suggesting that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could be weakening.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($60,805) to signal that the corrective phase may be over. The rally could then challenge the overhead resistance zone at $67,000 to $69,000.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down sharply from the 20-day EMA, the bears will attempt to break the strong support at the 100-day SMA ($54,184). If that happens, the BTC/USDT pair could slump to the psychologically critical level at $50,000.\par \par \uc2 The bulls are expected to defend this level aggressively because a break below it could result in panic selling. The pair could then slide to the next important support at $40,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH }}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the neckline of the developing head and shoulders (H&S) pattern on Nov. 28, suggesting that bulls are defending the level with all their might. Sustained buying pushed the price above the 20-day EMA ($4,316) on Nov. 29.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/860eee75-f177-4576-9bf7-5075f016c7ca.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the overhead resistance at $4,551 will indicate that the correction may be over. The ETH/USDT pair could then rally to the all-time high at $4,868. A break above this level will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup and open the doors for a possible rally to $5,796.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the 50-day SMA ($4,243), the bears will make one more attempt to sink the pair below the neckline. A close below this level will complete the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup and start a down move.\par \par \uc2 The selling may accelerate below the 100-day SMA ($3,794). The pair could then start its journey toward the pattern target at $3,047.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Binance Coin\u8217\'20\'19s ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB }}}\uc2  ) Nov. 28 candlestick indicates that bulls are buying the dips below the 20-day EMA ($595). The bulls will now attempt to push the price to the overhead resistance zone at $669.30 to $691.80.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/771b45c0-0c05-43c0-82b5-95b7994da059.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A break and close above $669.30 will complete an inverted H&S pattern. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup has a target objective at $828.60. The 20-day EMA is trying to turn up and the RSI is at 56, suggesting that bulls are attempting to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break and close below the 20-day EMA. The bears will then try to sink and sustain the price below the 50-day SMA. Such a move could result in a decline to the strong support at $510.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL }}}\uc2  ) once again dropped below the support line of the symmetrical triangle on Nov. 28 but the bears could not sustain the lower levels. This suggests aggressive buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/fd78dfc1-0b92-4a4c-9cf9-b01b2f9a4f7b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The SOL/USDT pair broke above the 50-day SMA ($204) on Nov. 29 and the bulls will now try to surmount the barrier at the 20-day EMA ($212). If they succeed, the pair could rally to the resistance line where the bears may pose a stiff challenge.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the resistance line will suggest that the correction may be over. The pair could then rally to $240 and later to $259.90.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will again attempt to sink and sustain the pair below the support line. The selling could accelerate on a break and close below the 100-day SMA ($172).\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is in a downtrend. The price bounced off $1.41 on Nov. 28 but the bulls are struggling to sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/9be4b508-1c9a-491f-9400-989f05e9726a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($1.78) continues to slope down and the RSI is near the oversold zone, indicating that bears are in control. If the price turns down from the current level, the bears will attempt to sink the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair below $1.40.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the downtrend could resume with the next target objective at $1.20. The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA to negate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view. The pair could then rise to the strong resistance at $1.87.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Ripple's ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP }}}\uc2  ) Nov. 28 candlestick shows aggressive buying near the strong support at $0.85. The price has reached the psychological level at $1, which may now act as a resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/e7e41c9b-49d6-4a69-a306-659242477c18.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level, it will suggest that the bears have flipped the $1 level into resistance. The XRP/USDT pair could then drop to $0.85. A break and close below this level will signal the start of a deeper correction to $0.70.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rises above $1, the pair could rally to the 20-day EMA ($1.05). This level could again act as a stiff resistance but if bulls overcome this hurdle, the pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($1.10).\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) bounced off $32.21 on Nov. 28, indicating that bulls are attempting to defend the strong support at $32. The recovery is facing selling at the 100-day SMA ($37.16) suggesting that bears are selling on relief rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/0080bf06-17e1-4131-8c7f-41f32909d84b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level or the breakdown level at $38.70, the bears will attempt to extend the decline. A break and close below $32 could start the next leg of the down move that may reach $26.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($40.41) continues to slope down and the RSI is in the negative zone, suggesting that bears have the upper hand. The bulls will have to push and sustain the DOT/USDT pair above the breakdown level at $38.70 to invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/binance-resumes-doge-withdrawals-days-after-elon-musk-s-comments"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Binance resumes DOGE withdrawals days after Elon Musk\u8217\'20\'19s comments }}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE }}}\uc2  ) bounced off the $0.19 support on Nov. 28, suggesting that bulls are accumulating at lower levels. The buyers pushed the price above the $0.21 overhead resistance on Nov. 29 but could not clear the hurdle at the 20-day EMA ($0.22).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/8510519b-6dcd-4dae-843a-df6086b71b97.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The long wick on Nov. 29\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick indicates that sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. If the price sustains below $0.21, the bears will make one more attempt to pull the price below $0.19. If they do that, the DOGE/USDT pair could plummet to the support at $0.15.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if bulls push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, it will signal a change in the short-term trend. The pair could then rise to the 100-day SMA ($0.24) and pick up momentum if this resistance is crossed.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche (AVAX) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($106) on Nov. 27 and again on Nov. 28 but the bulls are struggling to sustain the rebound. This indicates that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/36b0e5da-f344-4b0e-abb7-e96c58558b27.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The shallow rebound increases the possibility of a break below the 20-day EMA. If bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA and the $100 support zone, the selling could intensify. The AVAX/USDT pair could then drop to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $91.39.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the support zone, the bulls will again attempt a recovery. If buyers propel the price above $120, the pair could rise to $130. A break and close above this resistance could open the doors for a retest of the all-time high at $147.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 SHIBA INU (SHIB) has been trading below $0.000040 for the past three days but the bears have not been able to capitalize on this weakness and pull the price to the 100-day SMA ($0.000027). This indicates a lack of sellers at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/04cf87f5-ccdc-40de-8a02-54b9c8ec3f38.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls drive and sustain the price above $0.000040, the SHIB/USDT pair could rise to the 20-day EMA ($0.000044). This level is again likely to act as a strong resistance. If the price turns down from this level, it will indicate that sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par \uc2 The bears will then make one more attempt to sink the price below $0.000035 and resume the downtrend. This negative view will invalidate in the short term if bulls push and sustain the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.000046). The pair could then rally to $0.000052.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC }}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTEvZmI0Y2Q5NzctOTBhZi00Zjk0LThlYjEtNmY3Nzk5ZDQ0ODVhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211129ehbt000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Key data points suggest the crypto market\u8217\'20\'19s short-term correction is over\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Marcel Pechman \par \uc2 740 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 November 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price is still pinned below $60,000, but the recovery in ETH and altcoins suggests that the current correction could be coming to an end.\par \par \uc2 The performance of cryptocurrencies in the past seven days might have seemed slightly unexciting, especially since the total market capitalization increased by \u8220\'20\'1Conly\u8221\'20\'1D 1.8% to reach $2.7 trillion. However, even with the muted price action, some altcoins managed a decent rally. Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), on the other hand, was down 6% until Nov. 28, but it still managed to close the week up 1.5% after a $3,200 rally that night.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/9cf1d5e3-545b-467b-8b9f-f0ce6cb0ca2e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Winners and losers from the top 80 coins. Source: Nomics\par \par \uc2 Metaverse tokens are still pushing to new highs\par \par \uc2 The metaverse sector continued to outperform with Gala (GALA), The Sandbox (SAND) and Decentraland (MANA) among the top five gainers. While few play-to-earn and metaverse \u8220\'20\'1Cenvironments\u8221\'20\'1D are available for true interaction, major news and partnerships are still boosting these metaverse-related token valuations.\par \par \uc2 As reported by Cointelegraph on Nov. 24, Metaverse Group {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/nifty-news-2-5m-virtual-land-sale-metasoccer-raises-2-2m-cryptodragons-get-egg-cited"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 purchased virtual land in Decentraland}}}\uc2  for about $2.5 million. On Nov. 25, a digital land plot in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/axie-infinity-virtual-land-slot-sells-out-for-550-eth"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Axie Infinity game}}}\uc2  was sold for 550 ETH or roughly $2.5 million.\par \par \uc2 Moreover, a collaboration between Sony Pictures and \uc2 AMC Entertainment\uc2  announced on Nov. 28 will offer up to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/nifty-news-damien-hirst-airdrops-nfts-amc-teams-up-with-spider-man-3d-nfts-on-icp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/nifty-news-damien-hirst-airdrops-nfts-amc-teams-up-with-spider-man-3d-nfts-on-icp}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/nifty-news-damien-hirst-airdrops-nfts-amc-teams-up-with-spider-man-3d-nfts-on-icp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 86,000 Spider-Man nonfungible tokens (NFTs)}}}\uc2  to celebrate the opening day of its new feature movie.\par \par \uc2 Zash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/zec-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ZEC}}}\uc2  ), a privacy-focused cryptocurrency launched in Oct. 2016, spiked 20% in 24 hours on Nov. 20 as developers announced plans to abandon traditional mining and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/zec-price-jumps-20-in-one-day-as-zcash-devs-unveil-transition-to-proof-of-stake"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 migrate to a proof-of-stake network}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Amp (AMP), the native collateral token of the Flexa payment network, also rallied on Nov. 24 after listing on Binance. Meanwhile, Terra (LUNA) benefited from a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/jwang815/status/1465011691503063040"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 5.4 million token burn}}}\uc2  in four days, according to Caviar startup founder and crypto investor Jason Wang.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum-killers limp along\par \par \uc2 Among the worst performers were four smart contract platforms aiming to break Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s dominance: Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), Near Protocol (NEAR), Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) and Harmony (ONE).\par \par \uc2 On Nov. 24, Ethereum co-founder Vitalik Buterin issued a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/vitalik-buterin-proposes-calldata-limit-per-block-to-lower-eth-gas-costs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 proposal for the transaction calldata limit}}}\uc2  in a block to \u8220\'20\'1Ccut costs and to incentivize an ecosystem-wide transition to a rollup-centric Ethereum.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Aave Protocol ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/aave-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AAVE}}}\uc2  ), the collateralized lending and yield platform, continues to trade in a downtrend after its TVL decreased by 30% in three months.\par \par \uc2 Dash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/dash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DASH}}}\uc2  ) saw its number of addresses with at least 1,000 tokens decrease to 5,210, the lowest level since July 2018.\par \par \uc2 Tether and derivatives markets are looking flat\par \par \uc2 The OKEx Tether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tether-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDT}}}\uc2  ) premium, which measures the difference between China-based peer-to-peer (P2P) trades and the official U.S. dollar currency, has improved slightly.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/d8b9b88c-178d-4ce1-93c5-1c425e7d51c5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 OKEx USDT peer-to-peer premium vs. USD. Source: OKEx\par \par \uc2 The indicator\u8217\'20\'19s 99% reading is neutral-to-\b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , signaling weak demand from cryptocurrency traders to convert cash into stablecoins, but it\u8217\'20\'19s still a vast improvement from the 5% discount in mid-October.\par \par \uc2 Furthermore, the cryptocurrency total futures open interest held steady near $50 billion, which is merely 10% below the all-time high. It is worth noting that an open interest decrease is not necessarily \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but maintaining a certain level is interesting because more liquidity providers and market makers enter the market.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/3b49e143-18af-4c7d-94cb-439512a4a8d7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Total crypto aggregated futures open interest. Source: Coinglass.com\par \par \uc2 The futures\u8217\'20\'19 open interest provides a healthy reading, considering the nearly $2.0 billion worth of liquidations that happened during the week. The 10% total crypto market capitalization dropped to $2.37 trillion on Nov. 25 and was responsible for 44% of the forced futures contracts terminations.\par \par \uc2 The above data might not sound exciting, but considering that Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) are both strong on Nov. 29, the rebound from the previous day might indicate that the two-week correction period could be over.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/noshitcoins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 author}}}\uc2  and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTEvYTU3Mzc4MDctMDMxMS00M2YwLWIzNDktMzFiN2NhNjczZTBlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211129ehbt000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Germany\par \b \uc2 Invesco launches spot Bitcoin ETP on Deutsche Borse\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Helen Partz \par \uc2 502 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 November 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 After dropping a Bitcoin futures ETF filing with the U.S. SEC, Invesco has launched a spot BTC exchange-traded note on Deutsche Boerse\u8217\'20\'19s Xetra.\par \par \uc2 Soon after dropping a filing for a Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) futures exchange-traded fund (ETF) in the United States, asset manager Invesco is launching a spot BTC exchange-traded note (ETN) in Europe.\par \par \uc2 On Nov. 29, German stock market operator Deutsche Boerse officially {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.deutsche-boerse-cash-market.com/dbcm-en/newsroom/press-releases/First-Crypto-ETN-from-Invesco-launches-on-Xetra-2852246"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced}}}\uc2  the listing of the Invesco Physical Bitcoin ETN on its digital stock exchange, Xetra. The new product will trade under the ticker symbol BTIC.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.boerse-frankfurt.de/en/etf/invesco-physical-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Admitted}}}\uc2  to the regulated market of the Frankfurt Stock Exchange, the new ETN product is physically backed by Bitcoin and is centrally cleared via Eurex Clearing. \u8220\'20\'1CThrough central clearing, investors benefit from significantly reduced risks in the settlement of transactions,\u8221\'20\'1D the announcement notes.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.etfstream.com/news/invesco-enters-crypto-etp-space-with-bitcoin-launch/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 According}}}\uc2  to a report by the ETF-focused publication ETF Stream, custody of Bitcoin held on behalf of BTIC will be provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/standard-chartered-to-launch-institutional-grade-crypto-custody-in-2021"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Standard Chartered\u8217\'20\'19s crypto custody platform}}}\uc2 , known as Zodia. Northern Trust, a co-investor in Zodia, will reportedly act as the administrator for BTIC. Launched in late 2020, Zodia is registered with the United Kingdom's \uc2 Financial Conduct Authority\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Major European \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  manager \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  is a known partner of Invesco and will serve as both the index sponsor and execution agent for the new ETN. BTIC is tracking the \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  Bitcoin Hourly Reference Rate index, delivering the price performance on the underlying asset minus fees.\par \par \uc2 The news comes shortly after Invesco withdrew its filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission for a Bitcoin futures-based ETF in October in order to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/invesco-exec-reveals-reasons-for-dropping-bitcoin-futures-etf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 provide investors with better investment options}}}\uc2  rather than just a 100% BTC futures ETF.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CPhysical bitcoin is a more observable marketplace. One of our concerns was the depth of synthetic liquidity as well as what that may do to valuations over time and that is something we were not wholly comfortable with,\u8221\'20\'1D said Gary Buxton, head of ETFs and indexed strategies at Invesco. He added that Invesco has been working on the product \u8220\'20\'1Csince the middle of 2018.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/deutsche-boerse-launches-solana-and-polkadot-etns-by-vaneck"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Deutsche Boerse launches Solana and Polkadot ETNs by VanEck}}}\par \par \uc2 Invesco\u8217\'20\'19s entrance to the European industry of crypto exchange-traded products (ETP) comes as Deutsche Boerse actively expands the range of supported crypto derivatives products across its operated exchanges. According to the firm, the Xetra exchange offers as many as 26 ETNs from seven providers on various cryptocurrencies including Bitcoin, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) and others.\par \par \uc2 Both ETFs and ETNs are types of ETPs and they are fairly similar in that they track an underlying asset and trading on exchanges in a manner like that of other securities. While an ETF presumes investment in a fund that holds the assets, an ETN is more like a bond, providing exposure to an unsecured debt note issued by an institution.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTEvNjYyYTkzNjktMzE5My00NmNmLWE2Y2UtNWI5NjNjNGMzZWYxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211129ehbt0008i\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Funding\par \b \uc2 MELD\u8217\'20\'19s $1B ISPO highlights emerging use cases for Cardano, crypto fundraising\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Sam Bourgi \par \uc2 876 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 November 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Can initial stake pool offerings transform how investors participate in early-stage blockchain projects?\par \par \uc2 DeFi banking protocol MELD recently made headlines for attracting more than $1 billion worth of staked Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) to its protocol through a novel funding mechanism called an initial stake pool offering, or ISPO, marking an important innovation in how early adopters support blockchain startups. Cointelegraph had the opportunity to connect with MELD CEO Ken Olling to discuss the significance of the ISPO as well as Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s role in facilitating widescale participation in the stake pools.\par \par \uc2 ISPO: An overview\par \par \uc2 The ISPO is a novel way for investors and other early adopters to support a project by delegating cryptocurrency to public stake pools in exchange for the project\u8217\'20\'19s tokens. MELD is currently the only known project to employ an ISPO even though the concept had been previously proposed elsewhere.\par \par \uc2 The MELD ISPO, which was initiated on July 1, allowed Cardano holders to stake their \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  for any duration and quantity in exchange for MELD tokens. The first stake pool was filled within 24 hours after roughly $100 million worth of \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  was contributed. Within five days, four stake pools equivalent to nearly $200 million were filled.\par \par \uc2 MELD stopped accepting new delegations on Oct. 27. By that time, nearly 620 million \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  had been staked for a cumulative value of over $1 billion. All said, the ISPO had over 40,000 participants. MELD also raked in $10 million in revenue.\par \par \uc2 The ISPO was a significant departure from previous crypto funding initiatives, most {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://3tscapital.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/12/ICO-Funding-Report-2017.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 notably}}}\uc2  the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/did-you-fall-for-it-13-ico-scams-that-fooled-thousands"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 initial coin offering}}}\uc2  (ICO) and security token offering (STO), and was a nod to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ardana-partners-with-near-protocol-on-cardano-bridge-infrastructure"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s growing ecosystem}}}\uc2 . It also highlighted pent-up demand in the market for DeFi projects, which continue to pique investors\u8217\'20\'19 interest.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/16fa257e-2ede-46a8-a0ba-2179d4959540.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Blockchain projects raised billions of dollars in funding in 2017 and 2018 before regulatory crackdowns and a brutal crypto bear market put an end to the mania. Source: 3TS Capital\par \par \uc2 Why Cardano?\par \par \uc2 Of all the proof-of-stake (PoS) chains in existence, MELD selected Cardano for its ISPO for its lower transaction costs, attractive staking mechanism and overall architecture, according to CEO Ken Olling. During MELD\u8217\'20\'19s initial development phase in mid-2020, Cardano was perceived to be the best option considering the circumstances surrounding Ethereum ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) at the time.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThere aren\u8217\'20\'19t any more established blockchains,\u8221\'20\'1D Olling told Cointelegraph, adding:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COne of our requirements was a modern PoS blockchain. The only real option at the time was Cardano. You have Solana, which has a two-tiered, much more complex staking mechanic in regards to the blockchain. It also operates legally in a different way. And then you have other PoS blockchains, but none of them really provided the full picture or the full package.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/how-solana-and-cardano-are-paving-new-avenues-for-nft-growth"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 How Solana and Cardano are paving new avenues for NFT growth}}}\par \par \uc2 Olling said his firm is still \u8220\'20\'1Cvery \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8221\'20\'1D about Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s future despite its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/etoro-to-delist-cardano-by-2022-for-us-users-due-to-regulatory-concerns"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 recent struggles}}}\uc2 . \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's performance has lagged considerably in recent months after being one of the crypto market's hottest performers through September.\par \par \uc2 Achieving financial efficiency\par \par \uc2 At its core, MELD offers non-custodial banking services, enabling users to lend and borrow with both crypto and fiat currencies as well as stake their MELD tokens for interest. Lenders can deposit both cryptocurrency and fiat currency on the platform. Borrowers have the ability to borrow in both types of assets after posting their crypto as collateral.\par \par \uc2 The crypto collateral option is attractive for investors because it means they can borrow fiat to meet their expenses without having to sell their digital assets and thus incur a capital gains penalty. ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cryptocurrency-loans-are-they-loans-for-tax-purposes-expert-blog"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Capital gains taxes}}}\uc2  are a source of consternation for cryptocurrency investors, with large bag holders always looking for ways to use their newfound wealth in the most efficient way possible.)\par \par \uc2 When asked about what differentiates MELD from other {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cDyq4ewsrSE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 crypto lending}}}\uc2  and borrowing platforms, Olling identified two factors: first, \u8220\'20\'1Con the highest level, we offer transparency,\u8221\'20\'1D he said. \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s on the blockchain, so what happens with funds on the protocol is completely open-sourced, unlike centralized crypto lending and borrowing services.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Secondly, and on a more practical level, MELD offers \u8220\'20\'1Cusers fiat currencies for their crypto-backed loans, whereas other [...] DeFi competitors can only offer other cryptocurrencies.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/defi-can-be-100-times-larger-than-today-in-5-years"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DeFi can be 100 times larger than today in 5 years}}}\par \par \uc2 Cryptocurrency lending has emerged as one of the biggest use cases within DeFi, with the likes of Aave and Compound achieving over $14 billion and $11 billion in total value locked (TVL), respectively. More than two-dozen other protocols have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://defillama.com/protocols/lending"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 achieved}}}\uc2  a TVL of at least $100 million, according to industry data.\par \par \uc2 Although the emergence of DeFi has presented a sort of threat to the traditional financial system, the industry's growth has been largely driven by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/defi-s-quest-to-reimagine-finance-must-come-from-a-community-based-design"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 users who already have access to legacy banking systems}}}\uc2 . That appears to be slowly changing as crypto entrepreneurs target the globe's vast unbanked and underbanked populations in pursuit of financial inclusion. According to Olling, financial inclusion is a by-product of a more efficient financial system that is made possible through DeFi.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTEvZTZlZWUyMmUtNWYxYi00MTJkLTllOTctOTBjODQzNDRiN2NkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211129ehbt0008g\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 11/26: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, DOT, DOGE, AVAX, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,782 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 November 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and most major altcoins are on the verge of starting a deeper correction, which will signal that a short-term top may be in place.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and most major altcoins sold off along with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2021/11/26/new-covid-variant-roils-global-markets-with-oil-sinking-5percent.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 global equity markets and crude oil}}}\uc2  on Nov. 26. The markets were roiled on news of a new coronavirus variant detected in South Africa that is worrying scientists due to its large number of mutations in the spike protein.\par \par \uc2 The sharp fall has resulted in cross-crypto liquidations of over $750 million over the 24-hour period but the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-offers-black-friday-deal-with-sub-55k-btc-price-just-like-2020"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 funding rates across exchanges remain elevated}}}\uc2 . This suggests that the selling may not be over yet.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/cbbe7c36-40e3-405c-ad09-dd50077b3659.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s monthly close for November is most likely not going to hit analyst {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-bulls-have-a-lot-to-be-thankful-for-despite-btc-probably-not-hitting-98k-in-5-days"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 PlanB\u8217\'20\'19s worst-case scenario of $98,000}}}\uc2 . This will be the first miss after the model had accurately predicted the end-of-month price levels for August, September and October. However, the stock-to-flow model creator believes that the target objective of $100,000 for Bitcoin in this halving cycle still holds good.\par \par \uc2 Is the current decline a mouthwatering Black Friday deal or the start of a short-term bear phase? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Bitcoin back above the breakdown level at $58,000 on Nov. 25 but they could not clear the barrier at the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($59,510). This may have attracted profit-booking from traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/c8e7a8ae-0aac-44ca-a90d-eaf32839f238.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling picked up momentum after breaking below $55,317 on Nov. 26 and the next stop could be the psychological support at $50,000.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this level, the buyers will attempt to push the price above the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, it will indicate that the selling pressure may be reducing.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the next rebound again turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the sentiment has turned negative and traders are selling on rallies. That will increase the possibility of a break below $50,000.\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the BTC/USDT pair could witness panic selling that may pull the price down to $40,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke above the 20-day EMA ($4,336) on Nov. 25 but the up-move proved to be a bull trap as the price turned down sharply on Nov. 26 and dropped to the neckline of the developing head and shoulders (H&S) pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/c55a16c8-e584-49b7-bf8d-17259b75eb97.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are defending the neckline aggressively. If the price rebounds off the neckline, the buyers will attempt to clear the overhead resistance at $4,551. That could clear the path for a retest of the all-time high at $4,868.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a close below the neckline will complete the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern. That could intensify selling and the ETH/USDT pair could decline to the $3,600 to $3,400 support zone. If this zone also cracks, the next stop could be the target objective at $3,047.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) soared above the overhead resistance at $605.20 on Nov. 25 but the bulls could not clear the strong hurdle at $669.30. This indicates that bears are defending this level with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/8c472f03-085f-48c9-b916-51660d2fa3c0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The failure to rise above $669.30 may have prompted profit-booking by short-term traders. That pulled the price back below the 20-day EMA ($590) on Nov. 26. The bears will now try to sink the BNB/USDT pair to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($539).\par \par \uc2 A break and close below the 50-day SMA may indicate a trend change. The selling could accelerate on a break below $510. The pair could then drop to $450.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the overhead resistance zone of $669.30 to $691.80 to signal the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the 50-day SMA ($202) on Nov. 25 but turned down from the 20-day EMA ($216). This suggests a change in sentiment from buying on dips to selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/d0e4b49e-e211-4c33-9168-20ef48ffc00a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling continued on Nov. 26 and the bears are attempting to sink the price below the support line of the symmetrical triangle. If they sustain the price below the triangle, the SOL/USDT pair could decline to $153 and then to $140.\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) below 43 indicate that bears have the upper hand. This negative view will invalidate if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the resistance line of the triangle.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) formed an inside-day Doji candlestick pattern on Nov. 25, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears. This uncertainty resolved to the downside on Nov. 26 with a break below $1.58.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/4c184e71-d610-4cf6-b627-f83c44a95e38.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair has a strong support at $1.50. Although the downsloping moving averages indicate advantage to bears, the RSI in the oversold territory suggests that the selling may have been overdone in the short term.\par \par \uc2 The bulls may attempt a relief rally that is likely to face strong selling at the 20-day EMA ($1.85). If the price turns down from this level, the bears will make one more attempt to sink the pair below $1.50. If they succeed, the pair could drop to $1. The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Although bulls defended the $1 support for the past few days, they could not push Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($1.08). This suggests a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/13bdacb2-0bdd-48b9-9870-ef34d9bc04d7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling accelerated on Nov. 26 and bears pulled the price below the psychological support at $1. The XRP/USDT pair could now decline to the strong support at $0.85. If the price rebounds off this level, the bulls will attempt to push the price above $1.\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the pair could attempt to gradually move up toward the overhead resistance at $1.24. Conversely, if the price turns down from $1 and breaks below $0.85, the pair could decline to $0.70.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) bounced off the uptrend line on Nov. 25 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. The selling intensified on Nov. 26 and the price dropped below $37.53, completing a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  H&S pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/2d8e684e-863c-4a40-90da-857bc5eaf00d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOT/USDT pair could now drop to $32 and later to $26 where the bulls may try and arrest the decline. On the upside, the breakout level at 38.70 is an important level to keep an eye on.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this level, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bulls drive and sustain the price above $38.70, it will suggest strong demand at lower levels. A break and close above $43.56 could tilt the advantage in favor of the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bat-price-hits-new-high-after-30-daily-rally-as-basic-attention-token-bucks-crypto-downtrend"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BAT price hits new high after 30% daily rally as Basic Attention Token bucks crypto downtrend}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) attempted a relief rally on Nov. 25 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that bears sold near the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/e2565d9f-7810-4366-ab2d-65b9b3db0805.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling picked up momentum on Nov. 26 and the DOGE/USDT pair plunged below the immediate support at $0.21 and even broke below the strong support at $0.19. The bulls are currently attempting to defend the $0.19 level.\par \par \uc2 If the price bounces off the current level, the bears will again pose a stiff challenge at $0.21. If this level flips to resistance, the likelihood of a break below $0.19 increases. If that happens, the pair may drop to the critical support at $0.15. The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA ($0.23).\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche (AVAX) rebounded off the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $112.63 on Nov. 25 but the long wick on the candlestick shows that traders sold on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/42f9a370-638d-4128-a047-4f3829497225.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The AVAX/USDT pair turned down on Nov. 26 and has dropped to the 20-day EMA ($105). This is an important level to watch out for because, during uptrends, traders buy on dips to the 20-day EMA. If the price rebounds off the current level, the bulls will try to push the price to $130.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bears pull the price below the 20-day EMA and the 50% retracement level at $102.01, the pair could drop to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $91.39. The deeper the fall, the longer the time it will take for the next leg of the up-move to begin.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 SHIBA INU (SHIB) plummeted below the strong support at $0.000040 on Nov. 24. The bulls attempted to push the price back above the level and trap the aggressive bears on Nov. 25 but they could not clear the overhead hurdle at the 20-day EMA ($0.000046).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/6a034af9-2833-4b17-8db2-bd606b4b1414.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This indicates that traders are selling on rallies near overhead resistance levels. The bears pulled the price back below the $0.000040 level on Nov. 26, increasing the possibility of the resumption of the correction.\par \par \uc2 The SHIB/USDT pair could now complete a 100% retracement and drop to $0.000027. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the 20-day EMA. The pair could then rise to $0.000052.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTEvYzQ2ZjYwYzktZmJjMy00ZGZmLThmZTAtNDg3MjJiNzRlMzc5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211126ehbq000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 BAT price\par \b \uc2 BAT price hits new high after 30% daily rally as Basic Attention Token bucks crypto downtrend\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 633 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 November 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BAT saw profit-taking sentiment at its new price top, suggesting further sell-offs in the sessions ahead.\par \par \uc2 Basic Attention Token (BAT) rallied to a new record high on Nov. 26, even as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-hits-6-week-lows-in-hours-as-24-hour-crypto-liquidations-near-650m"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 global markets plunged in tandem}}}\uc2  on fears of a highly mutated variant of COVID-19 detected in South Africa.\par \par \uc2 BAT\u8217\'20\'19s price surged over 30% to reach $1.88 for the first time, with its market capitalization rising to $2.74 billion. Its climb appeared in contrast to the cryptocurrency market, which lost {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-offers-black-friday-deal-with-sub-55k-btc-price-just-like-2020"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 nearly $283 billion}}}\uc2  in the same period.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/f834ad9b-fea6-41aa-9ccd-7813afd3fa98.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BAT market capitalization. Source: CoinMarketCap\par \par \uc2 BAT snubs crypto crash\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), the world\u8217\'20\'19s largest cryptocurrency by market cap, led the losses, falling by as much as 7.5% to under $54,000. Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), the second-largest, dropped over 9% to almost $4,000. Solana\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2 , Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2 , Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) and other tokens plunged in sync.\par \par \uc2 Crypto traders flocked to BAT, possibly because of its comparatively lower positive correlation with the top digital assets. According to data tracker Cryptowatch, the 30-day correlation {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptowat.ch/correlations"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 coefficient}}}\uc2  between Basic Attention Token and Bitcoin was 0.24, and the same versus Ether was 0.27.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/3928638a-8af5-4677-ab30-26b65b06e9b8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BAT\u8217\'20\'19s correlation efficient against top crypto assets. Source: Cryptowatch\par \par \uc2 That somewhat explains why BAT was able to ignore the marketwide downtrend on Nov. 26.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  indicators in play\par \par \uc2 BAT\u8217\'20\'19s price rally to its record high prompted traders to secure their interim profits immediately. As a result, the token corrected by more than 20% after hitting $1.88, thus returning below its strong resistance area around $1.50.\par \par \uc2 In detail, the $1.50 level has served as resistance to two technical setups developing on BAT charts since April. First, the level constituted what now appears to be a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-huge-cup-handle-pattern-reaffirms-6-5k-eth-price-target"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cup-and-handle pattern}}}\uc2 . And second, it assisted in forming a broad {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/traders-expect-ethereum-price-to-drop-further-ahead-of-friday-s-550m-options-expiry"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/traders-expect-ethereum-price-to-drop-further-ahead-of-friday-s-550m-options-expiry}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/traders-expect-ethereum-price-to-drop-further-ahead-of-friday-s-550m-options-expiry"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ascending channel setup}}}\uc2 , as shown in the chart below.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/f2428143-dbc7-4984-9311-8290259a06aa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BAT/USD three-day price chart featuring cup-and-handle and ascending triangle setups. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 At the time of publication, BAT was in the first part of the cup-and-handle pattern, making a rounding bowl bottom called the cup. The second part, should it appear, will be a price correction inside a descending channel range, called the handle.\par \par \uc2 A decisive breakout from the handle\u8217\'20\'19s trading range and $1.50-resistance may have traders eye a run-up higher to a level at a length equal to the maximum cup-and-handle pattern\u8217\'20\'19s height. That roughly puts BAT\u8217\'20\'19s price en route to $2.75 in the coming sessions.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-thanksgiving-nft-drops-and-black-friday-deals-go-mainstream"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto Thanksgiving: NFT drops and Black Friday deals go mainstream?}}}\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the profit target for BAT\u8217\'20\'19s ascending triangle pattern \u8212\'20\'14 confirmed by more than two higher lows and a flat upper trendline \u8212\'20\'14 comes to over $2.90 after measuring the structure\u8217\'20\'19s maximum height from its potential breakout point near $1.50.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/99005af6-9eec-47bb-80cb-283a3a5b7d66.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BAT/USD three-day price chart featuring ascending triangle breakout target. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a break below the triangle\u8217\'20\'19s lower trendline would risk invalidating the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup, including the cup and handle. Should it happen, the next resistance level appears near $0.56 for a final \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  confirmation.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTEvMmNiYTE4NjctNTFhOC00NjA2LWI0NmMtYzcxZTIxYjg4MmZlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211126ehbq000ba\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 BAT price\par \b \uc2 BAT price hits new high after 30% daily rally as Basic Attention Token bucks crypto downtrend\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 616 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 November 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BAT saw profit-taking sentiment at its new price top, suggesting further selloff in the sessions ahead.\par \par \uc2 Basic Attention Token ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/coins/basicattentiontoken"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BAT}}}\uc2  ) rallied to a new record high on Nov. 26 even as global markets {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-hits-6-week-lows-in-hours-as-24-hour-crypto-liquidations-near-650m"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 plunged}}}\uc2  in tandem on fears about a highly mutated variant of Covid19 detected in South Africa.\par \par \uc2 BAT's price surged over 30% on Friday to reach $1.88 for the first time in history, with its market capitalization rising to $2.74 billion. Its climb appeared in contrast to the cryptocurrency market that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-offers-black-friday-deal-with-sub-55k-btc-price-just-like-2020"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 lost up to nearly $283 billion}}}\uc2  in the same period.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/f834ad9b-fea6-41aa-9ccd-7813afd3fa98.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BAT market capitalization. Source: CoinMarketCap\par \par \uc2 BAT snubs crypto crash\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), the world's largest cryptocurrency by market capitalization, led the losses by falling by as much as 7.5% to under $54,000. Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), the second-largest crypto, dropped over 9% to almost $4,000. Solana (SOL), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2 , Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ), and other tokens plunged in sync.\par \par \uc2 Crypto traders flocked to BAT \u8212\'20\'14 possibly \u8212\'20\'14 because of its comparative lower positive correlation with the top digital assets. According to data tracker {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptowat.ch/correlations"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CryptoWatch}}}\uc2 , the 30-day correlation coefficient between Basic Attention Token and Bitcoin was 0.24, and the same versus Ether was 0.27.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/3928638a-8af5-4677-ab30-26b65b06e9b8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BAT's correlation efficient against top crypto assets. Source: Crypto Watch\par \par \uc2 That somewhat explains why BAT was able to ignore the market-wide downtrend Friday.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  indicators in play\par \par \uc2 BAT's price rally to its record high prompted traders to secure their interim profits immediately. As a result, the token corrected by more than 20% after hitting $1.88, thus returning below its strong resistance area around $1.50.\par \par \uc2 In detail, the $1.50-level served as resistance to two technical setups developing on BAT charts since April. First, the level constituted what now appears to be a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-huge-cup-handle-pattern-reaffirms-6-5k-eth-price-target"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cup and Handle pattern}}}\uc2 . And second, it assisted in forming a broad {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/traders-expect-ethereum-price-to-drop-further-ahead-of-friday-s-550m-options-expiry"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ascending Channel}}}\uc2  setup, as shown in the chart below.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/f2428143-dbc7-4984-9311-8290259a06aa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BAT/USD three-day price chart featuring Cup and Handle and Ascending Triangle setups. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 At press time, BAT was in the first part of the Cup and Handle pattern, making a rounding bowl bottom called the cup. The second part, should it appear, will be a price correction inside a descending channel range, called handle.\par \par \uc2 A decisive breakout from the handle's trading range and $1.50-resistance may have traders eye a run-up higher to a level at length equal to the maximum Cup and Handle pattern's height. That roughly puts the BAT price en route to $2.75 in the coming sessions.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-thanksgiving-nft-drops-and-black-friday-deals-go-mainstream"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto Thanksgiving: NFT drops and Black Friday deals go mainstream?}}}\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the profit target for the BAT's ascending triangle pattern \u8212\'20\'14 confirmed by more than two higher lows and a flat upper trendline \u8212\'20\'14 comes to be over $2.90 after measuring the structure's maximum height from its potential breakout point near $1.50.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/99005af6-9eec-47bb-80cb-283a3a5b7d66.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BAT/USD three-day price chart featuring Ascending Triangle breakout target. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a break below the Triangle's lower trendline would risk invalidating the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup, including the Cup and Handle. Should it happen, the next resistance level appears near $0.56 for a final \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  confirmation.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTEvMmNiYTE4NjctNTFhOC00NjA2LWI0NmMtYzcxZTIxYjg4MmZlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211126ehbq0005l\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 India\par \b \uc2 Experts divided on how far India\u8217\'20\'19s \u8216\'20\'18private  \highlight22\uc2 crypto\u8217\'20\'19 ban \highlight\uc2  will go\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Keira Wright \par \uc2 603 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 November 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The proposed Indian ban on \u8220\'20\'1Cprivate cryptocurrencies\u8221\'20\'1D is complicated, with some experts saying that "private" could mean every coin, while others are downplaying fears of a total ban.\par \par \uc2 Government documents from 2019 have been cited by an Indian crypto expert to suggest that the proposed ban on all \u8220\'20\'1Cprivate cryptocurrencies\u8221\'20\'1D could include just about every crypto.\par \par \uc2 The Indian government this week announced it would introduce the Cryptocurrency and \b \highlight22\uc2 Regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Official Digital Currency Bill 2021 when it convenes at the Winter Session on Monday.\par \par \uc2 The bill seeks a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/indian-parliament-s-agenda-for-winter-session-includes-bill-on-banning-private-cryptocurrencies"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 legislative vote on creating an official digital currency}}}\uc2  while imposing a ban on \u8220\'20\'1Call private cryptocurrencies.\u8221\'20\'1D However, there seems to be a lot of confusion regarding what exactly constitutes a \u8220\'20\'1Cprivate cryptocurrency,\u8221\'20\'1D with some users speculating it could refer to \u8220\'20\'1Cprivacy\u8221\'20\'1D coins such as Monero ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xmr-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XMR}}}\uc2  ) or Zcash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/zec-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ZEC}}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 Naimish Sanghvi, founder of crypto news website Coin Crunch India, explained in a Thursday {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P_RJxGFrwys"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 interview}}}\uc2  on India Upfront that by the government\u8217\'20\'19s definition, private crypto could mean just about every cryptocurrency there is. He said:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIn the 2019 Department of Economic Affairs report on cryptocurrency, they essentially said that everything that is non-sovereign is designated as a private cryptocurrency.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAnd by that logic, it means that Bitcoin and Ethereum will come into that definition,\u8221\'20\'1D he said, adding that \u8220\'20\'1Canything issued by the government is public and everything issued by private players is public.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Looks like all cryptocurrencies are going to be banned in India. Some people took private cryptocurrencies to mean Monero, ZCash, etc. Not so. They mean all of them. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/Bx4dyX5M0u"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/Bx4dyX5M0u}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 ciar\u225\'00\'E1n.eth (@C1aranMurray) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/C1aranMurray/status/1463558386310684675?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 November 24, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 The 2019 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://dea.gov.in/sites/default/files/Approved%20and%20Signed%20Report%20and%20Bill%20of%20IMC%20on%20VCs%2028%20Feb%202019.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 report}}}\uc2  in question recommended that \u8220\'20\'1Call private cryptocurrencies, except any cryptocurrency which may be issued by the government, be banned in India.\u8221\'20\'1D It stated:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAll these cryptocurrencies have been created by non-sovereigns and are in this sense entirely private enterprises.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 But Rohit Kundliwal, marketing manager at Indian crypto exchange WazirX, urged for calm and downplayed fears of an outright ban.\par \par \uc2 In a LinkedIn {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/rohitkundliwal_please-help-me-spread-this-a-lot-of-news-activity-6869142183967043584-C2nF"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 post}}}\uc2  on Wednesday, Kundliwal pointed out that crypto cannot be banned, only regulated, and that there is no clarity on what constitutes a private cryptocurrency.\par \par \uc2 He added that \u8220\'20\'1CShri Narendra Modi, Nirmala Sitaraman, Finance Ministry and many prominent and sane politicians have told multiple times that there will not be a blanket ban on crypto.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Indian Shiv Sena Member of Parliament Priyanka Vickram Chaturvedi said in a Wednesday {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/IndiaToday/status/1463419449520893959?s=20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 interview}}}\uc2  with India Today that the proposed ban is a \u8220\'20\'1Cmove backward and a little too late.\u8221\'20\'1D She said:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBanning private cryptocurrencies is basically ending the entire idea of a new fintech that can emerge as a huge employment and generator for the new economy.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 She said that the government must \u8220\'20\'1Cfacilitate an environment which is evolving and thriving. The impact of doing this... is that you are killing this entire space.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/india-to-reduce-gst-paid-on-cryptocurrency-exchanges-from-18-to-1-through-regulatory-reclassification"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 India set to reduce GST paid on crypto exchange fees from 18% to 1%}}}\par \par \uc2 The market reacted dramatically to the news of a possible ban, with prices on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-prices-in-india-tumble-after-crypto-bill-announced"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 WazirX plummeting}}}\uc2  on Wednesday morning at 3:30 am UTC as users scrambled to sell their holdings. The panic selling event tanked the price of Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) and Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) in double-digit local price depreciation.\par \par \uc2 On Nov. 18, Indian Prime Minister Narendra Modi {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/indian-pm-urges-democratic-countries-to-collaborate-on-cryptocurrencies"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 called on all democratic nations}}}\uc2  to work together to regulate cryptocurrency, specifically Bitcoin, to \u8220\'20\'1Censure it does not end up in the wrong hands which can spoil our youth.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTEvYzg1NWI1OGItNjEyYy00OTRiLWJkMjktZmZjYWNhY2RmYzVhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211125ehbp0002y\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 India\par \b \uc2 Experts divided on how far India's 'private  \highlight22\uc2 crypto' ban \highlight\uc2  will go\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Keira Wright \par \uc2 602 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 November 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The proposed Indian ban on \u8220\'20\'1Cprivate cryptocurrencies\u8221\'20\'1D is complicated, with some experts saying that "private" could mean every coin, while others are downplaying fears of a total ban.\par \par \uc2 Government documents from 2019 have been cited by an Indian crypto expert to suggest that the proposed ban on all \u8220\'20\'1Cprivate cryptocurrencies\u8221\'20\'1D could include just about every crypto.\par \par \uc2 The Indian government this week announced it would introduce the Cryptocurrency and \b \highlight22\uc2 Regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Official Digital Currency Bill, 2021 when it convenes at the Winter Session on Nov. 29.\par \par \uc2 The bill seeks a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/indian-parliament-s-agenda-for-winter-session-includes-bill-on-banning-private-cryptocurrencies"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 legislative vote on creating an official digital currency}}}\uc2  while imposing a ban on \u8220\'20\'1Call private cryptocurrencies.\u8221\'20\'1D However, there seems to be a lot of confusion regarding what exactly constitutes a \u8220\'20\'1Cprivate cryptocurrency," with some users speculating it could refer to "privacy" coins such as Monero or Zcash.\par \par \uc2 Founder of crypto news website CoinCrunch India, Naimish Sanghvi, explained in a Nov. 25 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P_RJxGFrwys"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 interview}}}\uc2  on India Upfront that by the government\u8217\'20\'19s definition, private crypto could mean just about every cryptocurrency there is. He said:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIn the 2019 Department of Economic Affairs report on cryptocurrency, they essentially said that everything that is non-sovereign is designated as a private cryptocurrency.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAnd by that logic, it means that Bitcoin and Ethereum will come into that definition,\u8221\'20\'1D he said, adding that \u8220\'20\'1Canything issued by the government is public and everything issued by private players is public.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Looks like all cryptocurrencies are going to be banned in India. Some people took private cryptocurrencies to mean Monero, ZCash, etc. Not so. They mean all of them. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/Bx4dyX5M0u"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/Bx4dyX5M0u}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 ciar\u225\'00\'E1n.eth (@C1aranMurray) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/C1aranMurray/status/1463558386310684675?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 November 24, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 The 2019 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://dea.gov.in/sites/default/files/Approved%20and%20Signed%20Report%20and%20Bill%20of%20IMC%20on%20VCs%2028%20Feb%202019.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 report}}}\uc2  in question recommended that \u8220\'20\'1Call private cryptocurrencies, except any cryptocurrency which may be issued by the government, be banned in India.\u8221\'20\'1D It stated:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAll these cryptocurrencies have been created by non-sovereigns and are in this sense entirely private enterprises.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 But marketing manager at Indian crypto exchange WazirX Rohit Kundliwal urged for calm and downplayed fears of an outright ban.\par \par \uc2 In a Linkedin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/rohitkundliwal_please-help-me-spread-this-a-lot-of-news-activity-6869142183967043584-C2nF"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 post}}}\uc2  yesterday Kundliwal pointed out that crypto cannot be banned, only regulated and that there is no clarity on what constitutes a private cryptocurrency.\par \par \uc2 He added that \u8220\'20\'1CShri Narendra Modi, Nirmala Sitaraman, Finance Ministry and many prominent and sane politicians have told multiple times that there will not be a blanket ban on crypto.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Indian Shiv Sena MP Priyanka Vickram Chaturvedi said in a Nov. 24 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/IndiaToday/status/1463419449520893959?s=20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 interview}}}\uc2  with India Today that the proposed ban is a \u8220\'20\'1Cmove backward and a little too late.\u8221\'20\'1D She said:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBanning private cryptocurrencies is basically ending the entire idea of a new fintech that can emerge as a huge employment and generator for the new economy.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 She said that the government must \u8220\'20\'1Cfacilitate an environment which is evolving and thriving. The impact of doing this... is that you are killing this entire space.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/india-to-reduce-gst-paid-on-cryptocurrency-exchanges-from-18-to-1-through-regulatory-reclassification"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 India set to reduce GST paid on crypto exchange fees from 18% to 1%}}}\par \par \uc2 The market reacted dramatically to the news of a possible ban, with prices on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-prices-in-india-tumble-after-crypto-bill-announced"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Indian crypto exchange WazirX plummeting}}}\uc2  on Wednesday morning at 3:30am UTC as users scrambled to sell their holdings. The panic selling event tanked the price of Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) and Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) in double-digit local price depreciation.\par \par \uc2 On Nov. 18, Indian Prime Minister Narendra Modi {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/indian-pm-urges-democratic-countries-to-collaborate-on-cryptocurrencies"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 called on all democratic nations}}}\uc2  to work together to regulate cryptocurrency, specifically Bitcoin, to \u8220\'20\'1Censure it does not end up in the wrong hands which can spoil our youth.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTEvYzg1NWI1OGItNjEyYy00OTRiLWJkMjktZmZjYWNhY2RmYzVhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211125ehbp00002\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 11/24: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, DOT, DOGE, AVAX, CRO\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,822 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 November 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and most major altcoins are struggling to find \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum, a possible signal that prices could continue to erode.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and most major altcoins continue to be pinned below their respective overhead resistances, indicating that bears are selling on rallies.\par \par \uc2 According to Ki Young Ju, CEO of on-chain analytics firm CryptoQuant, \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-exchanges-see-large-deposits-despite-btc-reserves-hitting-3-year-lows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 whales are depositing Bitcoin to exchanges}}}\uc2 .\u8221\'20\'1D Curiously, the outflows from the exchanges have also continued and due to this, the reserves are still hovering close to their lowest levels since mid-2018.\par \par \uc2 In a somewhat contradictory report, Glassnode said that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/long-term-bitcoin-holders-at-multi-year-high-glassnode"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 long-term holders may be \u8220\'20\'1Creducing their spending}}}\uc2 , and thus are more likely to be adding to positions, not exiting them.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/6e14bc66-9c72-4321-b845-f85719a7fecd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While Bitcoin has been in a corrective phase in dollar terms, it has proven to be a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-hits-new-all-time-high-in-turkey-as-fiat-currency-lira-goes-into-freefall"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 savior of purchasing power for Turkish investors}}}\uc2 . While the lira continues to lose value in 2021, Bitcoin in lira terms has regularly been hitting new all-time highs and it crossed 700,000 lira on Nov. 23.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out whether it is time for a rebound or could the correction deepen further?\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to arrest the correction near $55,000 but the bears are not willing to relent. Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s relief rally on Nov. 23 turned down from $58,000, indicating that bears are attempting to flip this level into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/a45c83e2-fcc2-45f7-9f5c-7bc4239497ff.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the relative strength index (RSI) continues to languish in the negative territory, signaling that bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If the price slips below $55,317, the selling may intensify and the BTC/USDT pair could drop to the $52,500 to $50,000 support zone. The bulls are likely to defend this zone aggressively but the subsequent rebound may face selling at the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($60,084).\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the downtrend line. The pair could then attempt to resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rebounded from close to the neckline of the developing head and shoulders (H&S) pattern on Nov. 22. The rebound off the neckline reached the 20-day EMA ($4,337) on Nov. 23, which is acting as a strong resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/00fbb10a-5b2e-4b5e-ab51-e256a8af5e9e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($4,169), the bears will again attempt to pull the ETH/USDT pair below the neckline. If they succeed, it will complete the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern, which has a target objective of $3,047.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bulls push the price above the 20-day EMA and the resistance at $4,451, it will suggest that the selling pressure may be reducing. The pair will then attempt to rally to the overhead resistance zone at $4,772.01 to $4,868. A break and close above this zone will signal the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $605.20 on Nov. 21 and dipped back below the 20-day EMA ($584). However, the bears could not take advantage of this weakness and sink the price to the 50-day SMA ($532).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/a6a7325e-75a8-4230-99e2-887b19398add.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This indicates that bulls are accumulating at lower levels. The buyers tried to clear the overhead hurdle on Nov. 23 but the bears again defended this level aggressively. The price is currently hovering near the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level and breaks above $605.20, the BNB/USDT pair could attempt to challenge the resistance at $669.20. If this level is crossed, the pair could retest the all-time high at $691.80.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price sustains below the 20-day EMA, the bears will again try to pull the pair to the 50-day SMA. A break and close below this support could signal the start of a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/solana"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) broke below the 20-day EMA ($219) on Nov. 22. The bulls pushed the price back above this level on Nov. 23 but could not sustain the higher levels. This indicates that bears are defending the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/4163d34d-d486-4f06-bfbc-a2effab7087d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to pull the price to the support line of the symmetrical triangle. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break below it could tilt the advantage in favor of the bears. The SOL/USDT pair could then start its downward move to $153 and later to $140.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up and breaks above the resistance line, it will signal that bulls have the upper hand. The pair could then rally to the all-time high at $259.90 where the bears are expected to mount a stiff resistance.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($1.90) on Nov. 21 and the bears have pulled the price below the critical support at $1.70 on . If bears sustain the price below $1.70, the selling momentum may pick up.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/9472569e-3894-4180-8b69-89c70ec734df.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI near the oversold zone indicate that bears are in control. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could now drop to the strong support at $1.50 where the buyers are expected to step in.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA to indicate that the selling pressure may be reducing. The trend may turn in favor of the bulls on a break and close above the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the psychological support at $1 on Nov. 23 but the bulls have not been able to push the price to the 20-day EMA ($1.10). The shallow bounce indicates that bears continue to sell on every minor relief rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/539a0d3c-9b02-421b-ae61-5992724e6eed.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will once again try to sink and sustain the price below the strong support at $1. If they manage to do that, the selling could accelerate and the XRP/USDT pair could drop to the critical support at $0.85.\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative zone suggest that the path of least resistance is to the downside. This negative view will invalidate if the price rises and breaks above the 50-day SMA ($1.12). That could open the doors for a possible rally to $1.24.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) rebounded off the uptrend line on Nov. 23 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. The price has again turned down and dropped to the uptrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/2141e885-47d5-41af-ae24-b0bd91ad0e37.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The frequent retest of a support level tends to weaken it. The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is below 40, indicating that bears are in command.\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks and closes below $37.53, the DOT/USDT pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  H&S pattern. The pair could then start a deeper correction toward $26.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the current level, the bulls will make one more attempt to overcome the barrier at $43.56. If they can pull it off, it will signal that the sellers may be losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/shiba-inu-slump-continues-data-shows-retail-interest-waning-as-shib-down-60-in-4-weeks"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Shiba Inu slump continues: Data shows retail interest waning as SHIB down 60% in 4 weeks}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  (DOGE) bounced off the critical support at $0.21 on Nov. 23 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bears continue to sell near the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/6cea77c0-9ada-4cdc-945d-bec765476507.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair broke below the $0.21 support on Nov. 24 and the bears will now attempt to pull the price to the critical support at $0.19. This is an important support for the bulls to defend because if it cracks, the pair could plummet to $0.15.\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.24) and the RSI below 37 indicate that bears have the upper hand. The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the downtrend line. That will indicate a possible comeback by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls failed to push Avalanche (AVAX) above the all-time high at $147 on Nov. 22, indicating that bears are aggressively defending the overhead resistance. This may have prompted profit-booking from the short-term traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/3fd306f9-9606-46c4-874b-bc7e9691898c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The AVAX/USDT pair has started a correction that could find strong support in the zone between the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $112.63 and the 20-day EMA ($103).\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this zone, it will suggest that sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips. The bulls will then make one more attempt to push the pair above the all-time high and resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, a break and close below the 20-day EMA will signal that supply exceeds demand. The pair could then drop to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $91.39.\par \par \uc2 CRO/USDT\par \par \uc2 Crypto.com Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/crypto-com-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CRO}}}\uc2  ) has been in a strong uptrend for the past few days. The vertical rally has pushed the RSI close to 90, indicating that the rally is overheated in the short term. This could result in a minor correction or consolidation for a few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/4afe20f4-36cd-41cf-b22c-95794652e7b9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 CRO/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The up-move may witness profit-booking near the psychologically important barrier at $1. If that happens, the CRO/USDT pair could start a correction. The first major support on the downside is the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $0.73.\par \par \uc2 Generally, vertical rallies are followed by sharp declines. If the price breaks below $0.73, the correction may extend to the 61.8% retracement level at $0.59. Conversely, if the price bounces off $0.73, the bulls will make one more attempt to resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTEvOWJkYmYzODYtNDYzYy00Y2UxLTljYzMtZTcwZjNlMmZjY2Q0LkpQRw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211124ehbo000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 India\par \b \uc2 Crypto prices in India tumble after crypto bill announced\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Arijit Sarkar \par \uc2 523 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 November 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 WazirX CEO Nischal Shetty highlighted that the Indian crypto market usually trades at a premium compared to the global market.\par \par \uc2 Regulatory discussions in India around a \b \highlight22\uc2 crypto ban\b0 \highlight\uc2  caused panic selling on major crypto exchange WazirX, resulting in a massive \b \highlight22\uc2 price drop\b0 \highlight\uc2  for leading cryptocurrencies, including Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 Crypto prices in India crashed soon after parliament announced to introduce and list 26 new bills in the Winter Session, which included the Cryptocurrency and \b \highlight22\uc2 Regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Official Digital Currency Bill, 2021. As Cointelegraph reported, the bill seeks a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/indian-parliament-s-agenda-for-winter-session-includes-bill-on-banning-private-cryptocurrencies"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 legislative vote on creating an official digital currency}}}\uc2  while imposing a ban on \u8220\'20\'1Call private cryptocurrencies,\u8221\'20\'1D starting on Monday.\par \par \uc2 A mass sell-off on WazirX on Wednesday morning at 3:30 am UTC tanked the price of Bitcoin from nearly 4,600,000 Indian rupees ($61,820.73) to 3,917,659 rupees ($52,650.55), a drop of 14.8% within two hours. Similarly, other popular tokens, including Ether and Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), experienced double-digit price depreciation locally on the exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/b89aa338-da94-403c-9045-48992e1a7833.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price crash on WazirX. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://wazirx.com/exchange/BTC-INR"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 WazirX}}}\par \par \uc2 Speaking to Cointelegraph, WazirX CEO Nischal Shetty highlighted that the Indian crypto market usually trades at a premium compared to the global market:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis event of panic selling has led the Indian market to correct and the prices to reach the global level.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Shetty also pointed out the various use cases of cryptocurrencies as an asset or utility and quoted former Finance Secretary of India Subhash Chandra Garg\u8217\'20\'19s suggestion that \u8220\'20\'1Cthere should be a prohibition on the \u8216\'20\'18currency\u8217\'20\'19 use case of crypto,\u8221\'20\'1D if any.\par \par \uc2 Jay Hao, CEO of crypto exchange OKEx, told Cointelegraph about the need for a nuanced approach toward regulating crypto assets in India:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIndia is home to the highest number of crypto owners in the world, and the onus lies on the government to protect the interest of a large number of crypto investors in the country.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Commenting on India\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 crypto ban\b0 \highlight\uc2 , BTC Markets CEO Caroline Bowler said, \u8220\'20\'1CThis ban won\u8217\'20\'19t work in the long-term and would be a step backwards,\u8221\'20\'1D adding that \u8220\'20\'1Cbanning is not an option to protect investor interest.\u8221\'20\'1D Bowler stated:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe thing with cryptocurrency is that while governments may try to ban it or try to contain it, the very decentralized nature of the technology somewhat prohibits that.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 As a final word of advice to Indian inventors, Shetty believes in the need to have faith in our lawmakers. \u8220\'20\'1CLet\u8217\'20\'19s not panic,\u8221\'20\'1D he concluded.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/right-wing-indian-group-calls-for-stricter-crypto-regulations"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Right-wing Indian group calls for stricter crypto regulations}}}\par \par \uc2 This comes after a parliamentary panel discussion on cryptocurrency on Nov. 15 where a plurality of regulators concluded that, although crypto can\u8217\'20\'19t be stopped, it should be regulated more heavily.\par \par \uc2 In August, a representative from the \uc2 Reserve Bank of India\uc2  said that it planned to commence preliminary trials for a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/india-cbdc-pilot-may-commence-in-december-says-rbi-governor"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 central bank digital currency}}}\uc2  before the end of 2021. India is currently one of the largest markets in the world with over 20 million crypto investors.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTEvNmFjOGZiZjgtZTNjOS00ZmRkLThlNTYtM2RhNzQ1ZDVkNjY0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211124ehbo0002v\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 11/22: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, DOT, AVAX, DOGE, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,809 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 November 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and most major altcoins have turned down from their respective overhead resistance levels, indicating that the short-term sentiment has turned negative.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) continues to be pinned down below $60,000, indicating that higher levels are attracting selling from traders.\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 made a new all-time high on Nov. 22 due to reports that United States President Joe Biden had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/president-biden-picks-jerome-powell-to-be-next-fed-chair"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 renominated Jerome Powell}}}\uc2  to serve a second term as the Federal Reserve chair. This news also boosted the U.S. dollar currency index (DXY) to its highest level since July 2020.\par \par \uc2 Usually, sharp gains in the DXY are inversely correlated with Bitcoin and the same can be seen in November of this year as well. While the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/60k-becomes-resistance-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DXY is up about 2.3% in November}}}\uc2 , Bitcoin is down roughly 5.5% during the same period.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/1dd02c4c-115c-439d-a9f9-6ac7891647f0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Independent market analyst, TechDev, said Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s performance in 2021 is following the price action of 2017 but with a lag of 5\u8211\'20\'138 days. If the correlation continues, the eagerly awaited blow-off top phase in Bitcoin is likely to occur.\par \par \uc2 Could the current fall be the final dip before the resumption of the uptrend or is the decline the start of a sharper correction? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s recovery from $55,600 on Nov. 19 reached the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($60,350) on Nov. 20 but the bulls could not clear this hurdle. This indicates that bears are attempting to flip the 50-day SMA into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/a7b2f903-25e8-46b6-9001-3118b2d32e37.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are about to complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the relative strength index (RSI) is in the negative territory, suggesting that the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down and breaks below $55,600, it will indicate the start of a deeper correction to the $52,500 to $50,000 support zone.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the downtrend line. Such a move will indicate that the correction may be over.\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair could then start its northward march toward the overhead resistance zone at $67,000 to $69,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) relief rally from the Nov. 18 intraday low at $3,956.44 rose above the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($4,364) on Nov. 20 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. The bears pulled the price back below the 20-day EMA on Nov. 21.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/0dde5035-79d2-4fb7-be00-23bd9b7132d1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair dropped to the 50-day SMA ($4,240) on Nov. 22 but the long tail on the candlestick indicates that bulls are defending this support. If buyers drive the price above $4,451, the pair could rally to the 61.80% Fibonacci retracement level at $4.519.78 and then to the 78.60% retracement level at $4,672.93.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level, the bears will again try to sink the pair below the 50-day SMA. If they succeed, the pair could drop to $3,956.44. A break and close below this level will complete a head and shoulders pattern. The pair could then drop to $3,400 and eventually to the pattern target at $3,047.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the 50-day SMA ($526) on Nov. 19 but the bulls could not extend the relief rally above the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $602.40.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/3647e129-b010-4a71-a8fc-6e39746ffb45.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled the price below the 20-day EMA ($585) on Nov. 22. If the price sustains below the 20-day EMA, the bears will make one more attempt to sink the BNB/USDT pair below the 50-day SMA. If they succeed, the pair could slide to $485.40.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above $605.20, it will suggest that bulls are back in the game. The pair could then rally to the overhead resistance zone at $659.50 to $669.30.\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s (SOL) bounce off the 50-day SMA ($198) hit a strong hurdle at the downtrend line on Nov. 21, indicating that bears continue to sell on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/f691f753-76a8-4bb2-855a-acd333e75183.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price action of the past few days has formed a symmetrical triangle pattern suggesting a balance between supply and demand. This equilibrium will shift in favor of the bulls on a break and close above the resistance line of the triangle. The SOL/USDT pair could then retest the all-time high at $259.90.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price sustains below the 20-day EMA, the pair could drop to the support line of the triangle. The bears will have to sink the price below this support to gain the upper hand. The pair could then drop to $153.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) rose above the breakdown level at $1.87 on Nov. 20 but the bulls could not push the price above the 20-day EMA ($1.95). This suggests that sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies to the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/501e2fed-a41a-44ab-92a6-f25a343b14e9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price dipped back below $1.87 on Nov. 21 and the bears will now attempt to sink the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair below $1.70. If they manage to do that, the selling could intensify and the pair could drop to $1.50.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rally to the downtrend line. A break and close above this resistance will indicate that the correction may be over.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the strong support at $1 on Nov