dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) rebound off the strong support at $0.21 on Nov. 19 fizzled out at $0.23. This weak relief rally indicates that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/0da3628a-ee29-453f-898b-d3f81b4655f5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.24) and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that bears have the upper hand. If sellers pull the price below $0.21, the DOGE/USDT pair could drop to the critical support at $0.19.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price again rebounds off the current level, the pair could rise to the downtrend line. The bulls will have to push and sustain the pair above this resistance to signal that the correction may be over.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 SHIBA INU (SHIB) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($0.000049) on Nov. 20, indicating that the sentiment has turned negative and traders are selling on rallies to the overhead resistance levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/e5e10740-d463-4323-8d2b-78fcaec10bb1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are attempting to sink the price below the 50-day SMA ($0.000043) and the 78.6% Fibonacci retracement level at $0.000040. If they manage to do that, the SHIB/USDT pair could plummet to $0.000027, completing a 100% retracement.\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative zone indicate that bears have the upper hand. Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off the current level, the bulls will try to push the pair above the 20-day EMA and start an up-move toward $0.000057.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTEvNjRkMTQxMGEtODQ2Yy00ZTMxLTg3ZjgtZmI2NjFlZTgzMzNmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211122ehbm000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 CoinShares\par \b \uc2 Institutional managers bought the dip as crypto funds see $154M in weekly inflows\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Sam Bourgi \par \uc2 454 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 November 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The recent correction in the cryptocurrency market was treated as an opportunity by institutional managers.\par \par \uc2 Institutional investors were unfazed by the recent correction in the cryptocurrency markets, as \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  funds dedicated to Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) continued to grow, according to data from \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Crypto investment products, which include exchange-traded funds (ETFs), saw weekly inflows totaling $154 million for the week ending Nov. 20, according to \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 latest fund flows report. Like in previous weeks, Bitcoin investment products attracted most of the inflows at $114.4 million. Funds devoted to Ether saw weekly inflows of $12.6 million and multi-asset products registered $14.1 million in net investments.\par \par \uc2 Year-to-date, institutional investors have allocated over $6.6 billion to Bitcoin products, $1.17 billion to Ether products and more than $9.2 billion to crypto as a whole.\par \par \uc2 Grayscale, which is the largest crypto asset manager, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Grayscale/status/1461813483398381578"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 recorded}}}\uc2  $51.9 billion in assets under management as of Nov. 19.\par \par \uc2 11/19/21 UPDATE: Net Assets Under Management, Holdings per Share, and Market Price per Share for our Investment Products.\par \par \uc2 Total AUM: $51.9 billion {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BTC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BTC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BAT&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BAT}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BCH&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BCH}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24LINK&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $LINK}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24MANA&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $MANA}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ETH&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ETH}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ETC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ETC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24FIL&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $FIL}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ZEN&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ZEN}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24LTC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $LTC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24LPT&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $LPT}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24XLM&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $XLM}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ZEC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ZEC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24UNI&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $UNI}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24AAVE&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $AAVE}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24COMP&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $COMP}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24CRV&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $CRV}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24MKR&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $MKR}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24SUSHI&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $SUSHI}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24SNX&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $SNX}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24YFI&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $YFI}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24UMA&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $UMA}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BNT&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BNT}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ADA&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24SOL&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $SOL}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/uJNo2skPX0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/uJNo2skPX0}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Grayscale (@Grayscale) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Grayscale/status/1461813483398381578?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 November 19, 2021}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/institutional-managers-bought-2b-worth-of-bitcoin-in-october"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 October was a record-breaking month for Bitcoin funds}}}\uc2 , thanks in part to the approval of two futures-linked ETFs in the United States. Institutional managers bought $2 billion worth of Bitcoin funds over the course of the month as the BTC price reached new all-time highs.\par \par \uc2 Although November has been less \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for Bitcoin from a price perspective, the latest funds flows data suggests that investors are not concerned by the market correction. As Cointelegraph reported, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/3-reasons-why-bitcoin-s-drop-to-56-5k-may-have-been-the-local-bottom"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin touched a low of around $56,500}}}\uc2  on Nov. 20 before correcting higher. The flagship cryptocurrency remains vulnerable to another pullback in the short term as its price consolidates below $58,000.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/60k-becomes-resistance-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $60K becomes resistance \u8212\'20\'14 5 things to watch in Bitcoin this week}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/TechDev_52/status/1462421198407622657"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 According}}}\uc2  to a recent tweet from crypto analyst TechDev, the 2021 bull market has been lagging the 2017 cycle by five-to-eight days as of July. If the trend continues, Bitcoin and the broader market could be poised for a breakout higher in the medium term.\par \par \uc2 Remarkably similar corrective structures so far on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/BTC?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #BTC}}}\uc2  8H.\par \par \uc2 Almost to the day 4 years apart.\par \par \uc2 2021 continues to run 5-8 days behind 2017 since July. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/B60HQlPCec"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/B60HQlPCec}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 TechDev (@TechDev_52) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/TechDev_52/status/1462421198407622657?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 November 21, 2021}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTEvYWJiZmFlMjktY2EwNC00YjBlLWFjNDMtYTJmMjdmOGE4Zjg1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211122ehbm000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 11/19: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, DOT, DOGE, SHIB, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,860 \uc2 words\par \uc2 19 November 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and most major altcoins are attempting a recovery, but higher levels are still likely to attract strong selling.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) dropped below $56,000 on Nov. 19, completing a near {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/fear-returns-to-bitcoin-while-long-term-holders-own-just-3-of-btc-unrealized-losses"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 20% correction from the all-time high}}}\uc2 . The Crypto Fear & Greed Index, which remained in the greed zone for most of the past two months, has plummeted into the fear category with a reading of 34.\par \par \uc2 Cryptocurrency research firm {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/traders-say-bitcoin-s-drop-to-57k-is-an-attractive-entry-for-hodlers"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Delphi Digital said in a recent report}}}\uc2  that the sell-off in Bitcoin was \u8220\'20\'1Clargely driven by a wave of liquidations rather than a fundamental shift in narrative,\u8221\'20\'1D and the analysts expect the drawdown to be \u8220\'20\'1Crelatively short-lived.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/c961de38-f1b0-4ff4-b64c-0977ec8b4bb6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The recent correction does not seem to have shaken the long-term holders. According to the Hodl Waves metric, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-holders-who-bought-at-20k-refuse-to-sell-btc-at-all-time-highs-latest-data"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 supply held by investors}}}\uc2  who purchased over the past 6-to-12-month period has soared to 21.4% as of Nov. 17 compared to 8.7% at the start of June.\par \par \uc2 Could lower levels attract strong buying, resulting in a sharp recovery or will bears sell on rallies? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bounced off the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($59,718) on Nov. 17 but the failure of the bulls to push the price above the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($61,696) indicates that buying dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/42925bff-b760-4ba9-adb0-568db09f59b1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair plunged and closed below the 50-day SMA on Nov. 18. The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the relative strength index (RSI) is in the negative territory, indicating that bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If bulls fail to push and sustain the price above the moving averages, the selling may intensify and the pair could drop to the $52,500 to $50,000 support zone.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bulls thrust the price above the moving averages, the pair could rise to the downtrend line. This level may act as a hurdle but if bulls push the price above it, the pair may rise to the overhead zone at $67,000 to $69,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the 50-day SMA ($4,082) on Nov. 17 but the bulls could not clear the overhead hurdle at the 20-day EMA ($4,387). This intensified selling and the price dipped below the 50-day SMA on Nov. 18.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/cfbfd851-4ca9-4456-b1c8-fea528085a40.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears could not sustain the selling pressure at lower levels, which may have attracted strong buying from the aggressive bulls. The bulls pushed the price back above the 50-day SMA on Nov. 19 and the ETH/USDT pair could now reach the 20-day EMA where the bears may again pose a stiff challenge.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will try to pull and sustain the pair below $3,956.44. That could clear the path for a possible decline to $3,371. Alternatively, a break and close above the 20-day EMA will signal that the corrective phase may be over. The pair could then retest the all-time high.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) plunged to the 50-day SMA ($517) on Nov. 18 but the strong rebound on Nov. 19 indicates aggressive buying at lower levels. The bulls will now try to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($585).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/8bfac036-76d8-41df-9ad1-b0330219be7d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the BNB/USDT pair sustains above the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the short-term correction may be over. The pair could then rise to the overhead resistance zone at $669.30 to $691.80 where the bears may pose a stiff challenge.\par \par \uc2 The break and close above the overhead resistance could signal the resumption of the uptrend. On the contrary, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the likelihood of a break below the 50-day SMA increases. The pair could then drop to the 78.60% Fibonacci retracement level at $485.40.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push Solana (SOL) above the 20-day EMA ($221) on Nov. 17 and 18 but the bears were in no mood to relent. The failure to clear this hurdle may have attracted selling from traders on Nov. 18, which pulled the price to the 50-day SMA ($195).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/21743527-5ca1-4810-8bbd-6265f07101fd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Aggressive buying at lower levels resulted in a sharp rebound on Nov. 19, indicating that bulls are defending the 50-day SMA support.\par \par \uc2 If buyers propel the price above the 20-day EMA, the SOL/USDT pair could rally to the downtrend line. A break and close above the downtrend line could improve the prospects of the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will make one more attempt to pull the pair below the 50-day SMA and the trendline. If they manage to do that, the selling could intensify and the pair may drop to $140.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The long tail on the Nov. 16 and 17 candlestick shows that bulls attempted to defend the strong support at $1.87. However, the failure to sustain Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above $1.87 may have prompted aggressive selling from traders on Nov. 18.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/5736c9ef-009f-4f12-a4a6-1a87bbc259f8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently trying to push the price back above $1.87. If they manage to sustain the price above this level, it could trap the aggressive bears. That could start a strong recovery, which may reach the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA ($1.99), it will suggest that sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. The bears will then try to pull the pair below $1.70, extending the decline to $1.50.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) above the moving averages on Nov. 18 but the long wick on the candlestick shows aggressive selling at higher levels. The price dropped to the psychological support at $1 where the bulls are mounting a strong defense.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/d8e82356-b268-4c83-aa95-20f5544d4a1b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A rebound off the current level could again face strong selling near the moving averages. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA ($1.13), the bears will attempt to sink the XRP/USDT pair below $1.\par \par \uc2 If they can pull it off, the pair could extend its slide to the next support at $0.85. The selling may accelerate below this support.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if bulls drive and sustain the price above the moving averages, the pair could rise to the overhead resistance at $1.24.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) broke below the horizontal support at $38.70 on Nov. 18 but bulls stepped in and arrested the decline at the uptrend line. The sharp rebound shows strong demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/ec7fee44-c1bf-424b-8a66-f77925390cec.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the downsloping 20-day EMA ($45) and the RSI in the negative zone indicate that bears are in command. The bounce is likely to face stiff resistance in the zone between $43.27 and the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the overhead zone, the bears will attempt to pull the DOT/USDT pair below $37.53. A close below this level will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head and shoulders pattern, indicating the start of a deeper correction. Conversely, if bulls push the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rally to $47.83.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/shiba-inu-in-danger-of-topping-signal-as-shib-price-loses-50-in-3-weeks"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Shiba Inu in danger of \u8216\'20\'18topping signal\u8217\'20\'19 as SHIB price loses 50% in 3 weeks}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) dropped to the strong support at $0.21 on Nov. 18. This level has acted as a support during the two previous declines and the bounce on Nov. 19 shows that bulls are trying to start a relief rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/66688418-d06a-4bdd-baf2-a158a24ac157.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The recovery is likely to face a stiff resistance at the downtrend line. The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.25) and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the downtrend line, the bears will again try to sink the DOGE/USDT pair below $0.21. If that happens, the pair could slide to the critical support at $0.19.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the bulls push and sustain the price above the downtrend line. The pair will then attempt a rally to $0.30.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 SHIBA INU (SHIB) dropped below the critical support at $0.000043 on Nov. 18 but the bears could not sink the price below the 50-day SMA ($0.000041). This indicates that bulls purchased aggressively at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/55c0655f-d340-4064-8b48-e67189e54be1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The relief rally is likely to face stiff resistance at the 20-day EMA ($0.000051). If the price turns down from this resistance, it will suggest that sentiment has turned negative and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par \uc2 The bears will then make one more attempt to pull the price below the 50-day SMA. Such a move could accelerate selling and the SHIB/USDT pair may complete a 100% retracement and drop to $0.000027.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a break and close above the 20-day EMA will be the first indication that the correction may be over. The pair could then rally to $0.000057 and later to $0.000065.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche (AVAX) turned down from $110.41 on Nov. 18 but the long tail on the candlestick shows that bulls continue to buy at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/391d1003-ed3b-4fb8-a732-850adee71a3c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($88) and the RSI near the overbought zone indicate that bulls are in control. The buyers are attempting to resume the uptrend by pushing the price above the all-time high.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the AVAX/USDT pair could start its journey toward $115.14 and then to the 161.8% Fibonacci extension level at $128.01.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the bulls fail to sustain the price above $110.41, the pair could witness profit-booking and drop to the 20-day EMA. A break and close below this support could signal that the uptrend may be losing steam. The pair could then drop to $81.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTEvMTMyOGQwYTctYjQ0ZC00MDc1LWIzNjQtMGZjYmFhZjYyYzk5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211119ehbj000e2\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 11/17: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, DOT, DOGE, SHIB, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,908 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 November 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and most major altcoins are attempting to hold above their immediate resistance levels, a sign that bulls could be buying on each dip.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) are testing psychologically important support levels at $60,000 and $4,000 respectively. Both these levels are critical to keeping the uptrend intact in the short term.\par \par \uc2 While the fall may scare off leveraged traders, Bitcoin whales seem to be viewing this dip as a buying opportunity. On-chain data shows that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-bargain-3rd-biggest-whale-address-adds-207-btc-at-62k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 third-largest Bitcoin whale added 207 Bitcoin}}}\uc2  to the holdings at an average price of about $62,053 per Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 After the latest purchase, the whale\u8217\'20\'19s holding has increased by 635 Bitcoin in November, according to journalist Colin Wu.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/da8f135b-7e8c-4c70-bfb7-2aa793387e8c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, it is not all \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  news for Bitcoin and cryptocurrencies. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-dips-under-60k-as-dollar-strength-index-reaches-16-month-highs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 U.S. dollar has risen}}}\uc2  to a sixteen-month high on expectations that soaring inflation may force the \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2  to raise rates and accelerate the tapering of its $120 billion a month asset purchase program.\par \par \uc2 LMAX Group currency strategist Joel Kruger also said that a strengthening dollar may hit risky assets the hardest and that could be the reason for the recent pullback in Bitcoin and altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Will bulls defend the strong support levels and stage a recovery or will aggressive selling pull crypto prices below their strong support levels? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin plummeted below the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($62,607) and the support line of the rising wedge pattern on Nov. 16. This is the first sign that bulls may be losing their grip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/cb496fdb-530b-41b5-80d0-485721c79a78.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers are attempting to defend the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($59,122) but the shallow bounce indicates a lack of urgency among the bulls to buy at current levels.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA, the bears will try to sink the BTC/USDT pair below $57,820. If they succeed, the selling could pick up momentum and the pair may plummet to $52,500.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above the 20-day EMA, it will indicate strong accumulation at lower levels. The pair could then retest the overhead zone at $67,000 to $69,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether broke below the ascending channel on Nov. 15 and that was followed by further selling on Nov. 16, which pulled the price below the 20-day EMA ($4,439). This was the first close below the 20-day EMA since Oct. 1.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/db134f65-bc59-4968-bf45-472f6eb95669.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Nov. 17\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bulls are attempting to defend the 50-day SMA ($4,033). The 20-day EMA has started to turn down and the relative strength index (RSI) has dropped in the negative zone, indicating that bears are making a comeback.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that sentiment has turned negative and traders are selling on rallies. The ETH/USDT pair could then breach the 50-day SMA and plummet to the next support at $3,600.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be negated if the pair rises from the current level and breaks above the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance at $669.30 on Nov. 15 and plunged below the 20-day EMA ($591) on Nov. 16. The selling continued on Nov. 17 and the bears pulled the price near the 50% Fibonacci retracement level at $552.30.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/f58c6023-ea02-4552-bb9d-b4f2e5552f17.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Nov. 17\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests strong buying at lower levels. The buyers will now try to push the price back above the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, the BNB/USDT pair will again try to rise to $669.30.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment has turned negative and traders are selling on rallies. The pair could then extend its decline to the 50-day SMA ($509).\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) plunged below the ascending channel and the 20-day EMA ($224) on Nov. 16, indicating that the bulls may be losing their grip. The buyers are attempting to defend the breakout level at $216 but any bounce is likely to face selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/16e66733-cedf-4d7c-9cd4-b5cca83878f7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out and the RSI has dropped to the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. This equilibrium will shift in favor of the bears if the price breaks and sustains below $216.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off the current level, the SOL/USDT pair could rise to the downtrend line. This level may act as a stiff resistance but if bulls clear this hurdle, the pair may retest the all-time high at $259.90.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) turned down sharply on Nov. 16 and broke below the critical support at $1.87 but a minor positive is that bulls did not allow the price to close below it. The long tail on the candlestick indicates that buyers are attempting to defend the support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/cff80b81-6677-489e-9ff2-26f8ab80c1ae.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to push the price back above $1.87 on Nov. 17 but higher levels may attract selling. Both moving averages have started to turn down and the RSI has dipped into the negative zone, indicating that bears are in command.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA, the bears will try to sink the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair below $1.75. If they manage to do that, the pair could drop to $1.50. The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long wick on Ripple's, or {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  's, Nov. 15 candlestick shows that bears sold on rallies to the overhead resistance at $1.24. The selling accelerated on Nov. 16 and bears pulled the price back below the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/c3ffe8fe-f5b2-4409-8110-09c518e4fe3e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears sustain the price below the moving averages, the XRP/USDT pair could challenge the strong support at $1. The 20-day EMA ($1.15) has started to turn down and the RSI has dipped into the negative territory, indicating that bears have a slight edge.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below $1 could pull the price to $0.85. This level may again act as a strong support but if it cracks, the next stop could be $0.70.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price breaks above the moving averages, the pair could rise to $1.24. The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above this level to signal a comeback.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s (DOT) failure to climb back above the 20-day EMA($45.99) may have prompted profit-booking from short-term bulls and selling by the aggressive bears. This intensified the selling and pulled the price below the 50-day SMA ($41.88) on Nov. 16.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/171daae7-1108-48f6-bf7d-4473b9b6fe4a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOT/USDT pair is attempting to rebound off the uptrend line, indicating that bulls continue to buy on dips. If bulls sustain the price above the 50-day SMA, the pair could rise to the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 This level is likely to again act as a barrier. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will make one more attempt to pull the pair below the uptrend line and extend the decline to $32 and later to $26.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA to indicate that the bears may be losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/metaverse-gaming-tokens-ethverse-and-axie-infinity-avoid-crypto-downtrend"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Metaverse gaming tokens Ethverse and Axie Infinity avoid crypto downtrend}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 After trading between the moving averages for the past few days, \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) made a decisive move lower on Nov. 16. This indicates that supply exceeds demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/168d9e4e-ea58-423d-a446-0fe986711c31.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to defend the support at $0.22. They will now try to push the price above the downtrend line. If they can pull it off, it will indicate that the bears may be losing their grip. The DOGE/USDT pair could then rise to $0.30.\par \par \uc2 However, the 20-day EMA ($0.25) has started to turn down and the RSI is in the negative territory, indicating that bears have the upper hand. If the price turns down from the current level or the downtrend line, the likelihood of a break below $0.22 increases. The pair may then drop to the critical support at $0.19.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to sustain SHIBA INU (SHIB) above the 20-day EMA ($0.000052) on Nov. 14 and 15 but the long wick on the candlestick shows selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/388024b0-8b01-40d0-ab8f-d1358e8b5fe1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling continued on Nov. 16, pulling the price below the 20-day EMA. A minor positive is that bulls are attempting to defend the critical support at $0.000043. If buyers push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, the SHIB/USDT pair could attempt to rise to the resistance at $0.000065.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that traders are selling on every minor rise. That will increase the possibility of a break below $0.000043 and the 50-day SMA ($0.000040). If that happens, the pair may complete a 100% retracement and drop to $0.000027.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche (AVAX) is in an uptrend. The bears tried to stall the up-move and sink the price below the key support level at $81 on Nov. 16 but the bulls did not relent. The long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that buyers defended the 20-day EMA ($85.20) with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/826969b3-fa0b-42ff-b101-0192cbb4b16c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buying resumed on Nov. 17 and the bulls have pushed the price above the overhead resistance at $101.82. If buyers sustain the price above the psychologically critical level at $100, the AVAX/USDT pair could rise to $115.14.\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the overbought territory indicate that bulls are in control. The bears will have to pull the price back below the breakout level at $81 to signal a possible change in the short-term trend.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTEvNzQwMmM3YTYtZDc2NC00OTFjLTliM2QtMWRmODU0NGNiYjI0LkpQRw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211117ehbh000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 CoinShares\par \b \uc2 Institutional Bitcoin products tag record AUM despite volume pulling back\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Brian Quarmby \par \uc2 440 \uc2 words\par \uc2 16 November 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 While institutional crypto products have seen inflows for 13 weeks consecutively, volumes have subsided compared to the first half of the year.\par \par \uc2 Institutional traders have locked a record sum of capital into Bitcoin investment products despite trade volume declining during the second half of 2021.\par \par \uc2 According to \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 Nov. 15 \u8220\'20\'1C\b \highlight22\uc2 Digital Asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  Fund Flows Weekly\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://medium.com/coinshares/volume-55-digital-asset-fund-flows-weekly-b2bc048ef816"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 report}}}\uc2 , Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) investment products saw total inflows of $97.5 million between Nov. 8 and Nov. 12 \u8212\'20\'14 pushing the sector\u8217\'20\'19s assets under management (AUM) up to a record $56 billion. Year-to-date (YTD) inflows also tagged $6.5 billion last week.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin instruments represented 64.6% of the $150.9 million that flowed into \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  investment products last week. While the record AUM coincided with BTC establishing a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-briefly-hits-69k-ath-before-plummeting-back-to-earth"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 new all-time high}}}\uc2  of roughly $69,000 on Nov. 10, the markets have since {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/here-s-why-bitcoin-losing-6k-in-hours-was-good-for-btc-price-action"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pulled back}}}\uc2  by 10% to last trade hands for $62,100.\par \par \uc2 Despite \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  noting that \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  investment products have seen inflows for 13 consecutive weeks, the sector has posted \u8220\'20\'1Csubdued volumes\u8221\'20\'1D during the latter half of 2021.\par \par \uc2 According to the report, daily volumes have averaged at $750 million during the second half of the year \u8212\'20\'14 a 22% retracement compared to $960 million during H1 2021.\par \par \uc2 While Ethereum saw the strongest weekly inflows among altcoin-tracking products with $17.3 million, the figure marked a 44% decline week-over-week for the asset class. Despite volume drying up, \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  reports a record AUM of $21 billion for Ethereum products while the price of ETH posted record highs near $4,900 on Nov. 10\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) ranked as a close second, taking in $16.4 million to post a 227% increase in weekly inflows. \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  said that it was unable to \u8220\'20\'1Cidentify a discernible catalyst\u8221\'20\'1D driving the surging investment into Cardano funds.\par \par \uc2 Institutional traders have locked a record sum of capital into Bitcoin investment products despite trade volume declining during the second half of 2021.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-has-stalled-but-here-s-why-pro-traders-still-expect-80k-by-january"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin has stalled, but here\u8217\'20\'19s why pro traders still expect $80K by January}}}\par \par \uc2 The price of \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  also experienced a significant bounce this week, moving from around $2.00 on Nov. 8 to around $2.36 on Nov 10. However, Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s price tumbled back down to $2.11 on Friday. \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is still down 46% from it's September all-time high of $3.09.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL), Polkadot (DOT) and Ripple (XRP) investment products also saw inflows of $9.8 million, $5.2 million and $3.1 million respectively for the week.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTEvYzBhZGYwYmMtYTBjYS00NTAyLWJhNmYtNzA2ZTQ3MGZhNDlkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211116ehbg00009\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 11/15: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, DOT, DOGE, SHIB, LUNA\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,841 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 November 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and large-cap altcoins are meeting strong overhead resistance, which could be a signal that bears are attempting to stall the next upward move.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) could not sustain its gains and succumbed to profit-booking as the U.S. trading markets started the week, possibly indicating that bears have not given up yet.\par \par \uc2 PlanB, creator of the popular BTC stock-to-flow model, does not seem to be perturbed by the dull price action of the past few days. The analyst believes that his {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bull-market-distribution-has-begun-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 worst-case scenario projection of $98,000}}}\uc2  by Dec. 1 and $135,000 by Jan. 1 remains in place.\par \par \uc2 However, long-term holders do not seem to be waiting for higher levels and have started booking profits, according to analyst William Clemente who cited Glassnode data. According to Clemente, \u8220\'20\'1Cbull market distribution has begun.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/0c3c905a-83dd-48c9-9ac0-5bd5f173d64f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Not everyone is \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Bitcoin. Billionaire fund manager Kyle Bass told Investor\u8217\'20\'19s Podcast Network that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.thestreet.com/investing/kyle-bass-no-lunar-flight-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 making money from Bitcoin will be \u8220\'20\'1Creally difficult\u8221\'20\'1D}}}\uc2  from the current levels because of the intense \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \uc2 United States government\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Could lower levels attract buying by the bulls or will traders continue to book profits? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bounced off the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($63,232) on Nov. 12, but the bears are posing a stiff challenge at the overhead resistance zone at $67,000 to $69,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/15b55374-9a18-4df6-9aee-f09ff0926ace.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The relative strength index (RSI) has formed a negative divergence indicating that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening. The BTC/USDT pair has formed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  rising wedge pattern, which will complete on a break and close below the support line.\par \par \uc2 If that happens, it will suggest that traders are booking profits aggressively and that may result in a slide to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($58,396). The pattern target of the rising wedge pattern is $53,770.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above $67,000, the next stop could be $69,000. A break and close above the resistance line of the wedge could open the doors for a possible rally to $75,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) dipped below the support line of the ascending channel on Feb. 14 but the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests strong buying at lower levels. The bulls attempted to resume the uptrend today but the long wick on the candlestick indicates selling near $4,800.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/7cc9ba2c-7107-4964-969b-0e21e1f78969.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will now make one more attempt to sink and sustain the price below the support line of the channel and the 20-day EMA ($4,491). If they succeed, it will suggest a change in the short-term trend. The ETH/USDT pair could then drop to the 50-day SMA ($3,980).\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price once again rebounds off the support line, it will suggest that bulls are aggressively defending this level. The buyers will then try to overcome the hurdle at $4,868 and push the pair to the psychological mark at $5,000. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up further if bulls thrust the price above the channel.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) is attempting to break above the Nov. 7 high at $669.30 but the bears are in no mood to relent. They are defending the overhead resistance aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/34c365b0-1933-4dc1-806b-f9036eb0becc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BNB/USDT pair formed a Doji candlestick pattern on Nov. 14, signaling indecision among the bulls and the bears. If this uncertainty resolves to the downside, the pair could slide to the 20-day EMA ($593).\par \par \uc2 The bears will have to pull the price below $573 to deepen the correction to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $524.70.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns up from the current level or the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips. A break above $669.30 could result in a retest of the all-time high at $691.80. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up if buyers push and sustain the pair above this level.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) rebounded off the support line of the ascending channel on Nov. 13, indicating that bulls continue to buy on dips. The bulls will now try to push the price above the overhead resistance at $248 and challenge the all-time high at $259.90.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/7f2e1b19-d527-4def-90e9-277984255a54.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the positive territory indicate that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If bulls push the price above the all-time high, the SOL/USDT pair could rally to the resistance line of the ascending channel.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the support line of the channel. That could clear the path for a possible decline to the 50-day SMA ($189).\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) has been trading below the 20-day EMA ($2.06) for the past three days but the bears have not been able to capitalize on this and pull the price to the strong support at $1.87.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/bb9cb64d-c3b2-4dee-8836-bc8a7ba57dee.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest a range-bound action in the near term.\par \par \uc2 If bulls propel the price above the downtrend line, it will suggest that the bears may be losing their grip. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then rise to the overhead resistance at $2.47 where the bears may again mount a stiff resistance.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the current level, the pair could drop to $1.87. The bears will have to pull the price below this support to signal the start of a downtrend.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been sustaining above the 20-day EMA ($1.17) for the past few days but the bulls are struggling to push the price above the overhead resistance at $1.24. The long wick on Nov. 15\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bears are selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/0cbe02cd-dbfd-4aa5-9174-7a3c3a687974.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The failure to push the price above $1.24 may prompt profit-booking from short-term traders. That may pull the price to the 50-day SMA ($1.10). If this support also cracks, the bears may smell an opportunity and try to sink the XRP/USDT pair below $1.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off the current level and breaks above $1.24, it will indicate that buyers have overpowered the bears. That could clear the path for a possible rally to $1.41. The bulls will have to clear this hurdle to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) broke below the 20-day EMA ($47.15) on Nov. 10 but the bears could not build upon this advantage and sink the price to the 50-day SMA ($41.33). This suggests that traders are buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/44fe1637-4d64-45e7-ad1d-331c0ebf151a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOT/USDT pair has been clinging to the 20-day EMA for the past few days, increasing the prospects of a break above it. If that happens, the pair could rise to $49.78 and thereafter challenge the all-time high at $55.09.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below $44.04, the pair could slide to the 50-day SMA. The bears will have to pull the price below the strong support at $40 to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/litecoin-grapples-with-double-top-risks-after-ltc-price-rallies-37-in-november"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Litecoin grapples with \u8216\'20\'18double top\u8217\'20\'19 risks after LTC price rallies 37% in November}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between the moving averages for the past few days. The bulls pushed the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.26) on Nov. 14 but the long wick on the candlestick suggests that bears are aggressively defending the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/7a566159-49b8-4b82-9fb7-a95f106e3d60.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out and the RSI is near the center, suggesting a status of equilibrium between the bulls and the bears.\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above the downtrend line will be the first sign that the selling pressure may be reducing. The DOGE/USDT pair could then rise to $0.30 and later to the overhead resistance at $0.34.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, the selling could intensify if bears sink the price below the 50-day SMA. The pair could then drop to $0.22 and next to the strong support at $0.19.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 SHIBA INU (SHIB) has been oscillating above and below the 20-day EMA ($0.000053) for the past few days, indicating a lack of clear direction.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/4785f05a-a930-4c6a-ba89-3da4c7138de6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand. If buyers push the price above $0.000057, the SHIB/USDT pair could attempt to rally to the overhead resistance at $0.000065.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, a break below $0.000048 could open the doors for a possible decline to the strong support at $0.000043. The next trending move could start on a break above $0.000065 or on a break below $0.000043.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s LUNA token rebounded off the 20-day EMA ($48.23) on Nov. 13, indicating that bulls continue to buy on dips to this support. The rising moving averages and the RSI in the positive zone indicate that buyers have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/cb5c2b09-2616-466b-bdaf-2eb939f93753.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The LUNA/USDT pair formed an inside-day candlestick pattern on Nov. 14, suggesting indecision among the bulls and the bears.\par \par \uc2 If bulls drive the price above $53.43, the pair could retest the all-time high at $54.95 and thereafter rally to the resistance line of the wedge. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up if buyers thrust the price above the resistance line.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price turns down and breaks below the support line of the wedge. That may pull the price to the 50-day SMA ($43.26).\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTEvYTZjZmVlNWEtNDZlMC00MTYwLTlmZTAtNWQxODZiZDE3NjIwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211115ehbf000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin sets up nail-biting weekly close after Taproot goes live\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 426 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 November 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin looks to launch into a make-or-break weekly close after BTC price action holds higher on Taproot activation.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) traded above a key zone into the weekly close on Nov. 13 after the successful activation of the Taproot soft fork.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/73ea0e90-e2c5-4033-b7c4-a27cade2813c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 What ETF rejection?\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BITSTAMP"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD holding above $64,000 at 10 am UTC Sunday.\par \par \uc2 The pair had gained in the latter part of Saturday after briefly acting below $63,000 thanks to U.S. regulators {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-halts-losses-amid-criticism-etf-rejections-have-cost-investors-12-700-gains"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rejecting}}}\uc2  what would have been the first spot-based exchange-traded fund (ETF).\par \par \uc2 Seemingly unfazed by the move, however, Bitcoin then returned to form, seeing local highs of $65,350 on \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2  before consolidating.\par \par \uc2 Far from lamenting the ETF news, Sunday was all about positive steps for Bitcoin, with market participants celebrating {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/breaking-the-bitcoin-network-welcomes-taproot-soft-fork-upgrade"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Taproot\u8217\'20\'19s launch}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The biggest upgrade to the Bitcoin protocol since 2017, Taproot provides a host of benefits impacting everything from security to Lightning Network efficiency. It was first proposed seven years ago by developer Greg Maxwell and has now finally become reality.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe real work will be in building wallets/protocols that build on top of it to make use of its advantages,\u8221\'20\'1D Bitcoin core developer Pieter Wuille {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/pwuille/status/1459778730369368067"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  as part of comments Sunday.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI'm very excited to see where that takes us.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-due-to-hit-90k-in-coming-weeks-despite-pullback-latest-technical-analysis"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 , soft forks have historically preceded \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  BTC price periods.\par \par \uc2 Can Bitcoin "save" the weekly close?\par \par \uc2 Sunday\u8217\'20\'19s weekly close meanwhile sets up a challenge for bulls looking for a clean break above a six-month resistance level.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-11-12-btc-eth-bnb-ada-sol-xrp-dot-doge-shib-luna"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 11/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , SOL, XRP, DOT, DOGE, SHIB, LUNA}}}\par \par \uc2 With Bitcoin characteristically putting in weaker price moves on Sundays and recovering on Mondays in recent weeks, the market stayed in the dark as the weekend came to a close.\par \par \uc2 Can the weekly be saved for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Bitcoin?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Bitcoin}}}\uc2 ?\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe (@CryptoMichNL) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1459828613931540484?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 November 14, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CLooking for price to hold prev ath from April and this to be a higher low,\u8221\'20\'1D trader Pentoshi {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Pentosh1/status/1459571920869990403"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added}}}\uc2  analyzing daily timeframes.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe range we don't want to go back into is the one we just came from.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/b70f8108-2b63-487c-ae57-f6a3f913b1e5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-week candle chart showing range. Source: Pentoshi/ Twitter\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CMoonvember\u8221\'20\'1D still holds an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/new-ath-renews-faith-in-planb-s-prediction-of-98k-btc-by-december"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 increasingly controversial}}}\uc2  end-of-month price target of almost $100,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTEvMTMwNjI3NTEtMDViYy00NGU0LTg3M2UtNjg2NWExNTlhZGRkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211114ehbe0005l\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 11/12: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, XRP, DOT, DOGE, SHIB, LUNA\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,865 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 November 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pressures mount against Bitcoin price and this could lead to sharp short-term pullbacks in the prices of many altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price continues to weaken following the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/here-s-why-bitcoin-losing-6k-in-hours-was-good-for-btc-price-action"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 shakeout of the leveraged traders}}}\uc2  in the derivatives markets on Nov. 10. This caused the derivative funding rates to drop to the neutral territory of 0.01% across exchanges.\par \par \uc2 Data analysis firm Arcane Research said in its latest weekly newsletter that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-derivatives-markets-healthier-than-in-q1-says-research-after-fresh-leverage-shakeout"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 derivatives markets had matured}}}\uc2  compared to the run to the previous all-time high in April. The firm highlighted that the futures\u8217\'20\'19 basis, the difference between Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s spot price and futures price, which was at elevated levels in April have dropped much lower, \u8220\'20\'1Cindicating a healthier market.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/453693ab-2991-4eb0-9208-621001e54532.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 According to Bloomberg senior ETF analyst Eric Balchunas, the ProShares Bitcoin futures exchange-traded fund (ETF) has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/proshares-bitcoin-futures-fund-in-top-2-of-all-etfs-for-volume"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 soared in popularity}}}\uc2 , with its average volume placing it among the top 2% of all ETFs in terms of the trading volume.\par \par \uc2 Another sign of the increasing popularity of cryptocurrencies is Grayscale Investments, whose assets under management topped $60 billion, flipping the biggest gold fund, \uc2 SPDR Gold Shares\uc2  (GLD).\par \par \uc2 In the short-term, will Bitcoin and altcoins recover from their strong support levels or will profit-booking drag the prices much lower? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin reversed direction from $69,000 on Nov. 10 and dropped to the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($62,532). The long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick indicated strong buying at the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/5e977682-3b95-48df-877f-150c71888e63.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the bulls could not build up on the rebound on Nov. 11, indicating hesitation to buy at higher levels. The bears have renewed their selling on Nov. 12 and are attempting to sustain the price below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the BTC/USDT pair could drop to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($57,048). The negative divergence on the relative strength index (RSI) also warns that the bulls may be losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price bounces off the current level, it will indicate that the sentiment remains positive and traders continue to accumulate on dips. A break and close above $69,000 will signal the resumption of the uptrend. The pair may then rally to $75,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $4,868 on Nov. 10 and declined to the support line of the ascending channel. The bulls purchased this drop and attempted to resume the up-move on Nov. 11 but higher levels again attracted selling.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/408e7211-8a1f-4f27-b53a-a8cd46eca587.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair has again dropped to the support line of the channel on Nov. 12. If the price rebounds off this level, the bulls will attempt to resume the uptrend by pushing the price above the all-time high at $4,868.\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($4,430) and the RSI in the positive zone indicate advantage to buyers. Alternatively, if the price breaks below the channel, it will signal that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened. The pair could then drop to the critical support at $4,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) formed an outside-day candlestick pattern on Nov. 10 as the price reversed direction from $662.90 and dived to the 20-day EMA ($573). A minor positive is that bulls bought the dips to the 20-day EMA as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/2890489b-b5d5-459d-9a81-f6b59f159727.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BNB/USDT pair formed an inside-day candlestick pattern on Nov. 11, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears. If the price slips below $600, the pair could retest the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 If this support is breached, the pair could drop to the 50% Fibonacci retracement level at $552.30 and then to 61.8% retracement at $524.70.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above $635.20, it will suggest accumulation at lower levels. The pair may then attempt to challenge the overhead resistance at $691.80.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned around sharply and plunged below the downtrend line and the moving averages on Nov. 10. This suggests that traders are selling aggressively at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/06cfe3bf-c372-475a-8fa2-4832a1a59f24.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push the price back above the downtrend line on Nov. 11 but failed. Renewed selling pulled the price back below the 20-day EMA ($2.06) on Nov. 12. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could now drop to the critical support zone of $1.87 to $1.80.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below this zone will be a huge negative as that may aggravate selling and result in a further decline to $1.50. The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above $2.47 to gain strength.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) plummeted to the support line of the ascending channel on Nov. 10 but the bulls bought this dip with vigor as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. They tried to push the price back above the centerline of the channel on Nov. 11 but failed.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/dab1462c-7108-4f49-bf21-9e7094d17fc7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears sold at higher levels and pulled the price back toward the support line on Nov. 12. The repeated retest of a support level within a short interval tends to weaken it.\par \par \uc2 If bears sink the price below the channel and the strong support at $216, the SOL/USDT pair could drop to the 50-day SMA ($182).\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off the current level with strength, the bulls will make one more attempt to resume the uptrend. If buyers drive the price above $248, the pair may challenge the all-time high at $259.90.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) turned around sharply from $1.34 and plunged below the 20-day EMA ($1.16) on Nov. 10. The long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick showed strong buying at lower levels. The bulls pushed the price back above the 20-day EMA on Nov. 11 but could not clear the overhead hurdle at $1.24.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/bc6c4e69-2f9c-41dc-a71e-86771028914d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This may have attracted selling by traders and the price has dropped back to the 20-day EMA. If this support cracks, the XRP/USDT pair could slide to the 50-day SMA ($1.09). Such a fall will suggest that the pair may remain range-bound for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out and the RSI is also just above the midpoint, indicating a consolidation in the short term. The next trending move may start after a break above $1.41 or on a break below $1.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) plummeted below the breakout level at $49.78 and the 20-day EMA ($47.35) on Nov. 10, indicating that traders booked profits aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/e4a807f6-a710-4bac-83a3-8da149ddf3bd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers pushed the price back above the 20-day EMA on Nov. 11 but could not clear the overhead hurdle at $49.78. This attracted selling on Nov. 12 and the DOT/USDT pair has dipped below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 If the price closes below the 20-day EMA, the pair could slide to the strong support at the 50-day SMA ($40.32). This level could again act as a strong support but any recovery is likely to face selling at the 20-day EMA. The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above $49.78 to signal strength.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-due-to-hit-90k-in-coming-weeks-despite-pullback-latest-technical-analysis"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin due to hit $90K 'in coming weeks' despite pullback \u8212\'20\'14 latest technical analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) broke below the moving averages on Nov. 10 but the bulls bought the dip as seen from the long tail on the candlestick. They pushed the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.26) on Nov. 11 and 12 but have not been able to sustain the higher levels. This indicates that bears are selling on rallies above the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/2ed54aed-756e-4e0a-aa83-ca1fac3e6f27.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are flat and the RSI is just below the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. If the price breaks below the 50-day SMA ($0.24), the DOGE/USDT pair could drop to $0.22 and then to $0.19.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the 50-day SMA, the bulls will try to push the pair above the downtrend line. If they succeed, the pair could rise to $0.30 and thereafter challenge the stiff overhead resistance at $0.34.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 SHIBA INU (SHIB) broke above the downtrend line and the 20-day EMA ($0.000053) on Nov. 11, indicating that bulls are attempting to make a comeback. However, the bears have other plans as they are trying to pull the price back below the 20-day EMA on Nov. 12.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/189c9ac9-6c84-4991-8f12-d4fa40312ff4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the SHIB/USDT pair could drop to the important support at $0.000043. A strong rebound off $0.000043 will suggest accumulation at lower levels. The pair may then consolidate between $0.000043 and $0.000065 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint indicate a range-bound action in the near term. The next trending move could start after bulls push the price above $0.000065 or bears sink the pair below $0.000043.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s LUNA token dipped below the critical support at $49.54 on Nov. 10 but the long tail on the candlestick shows strong buying at the support line of the rising wedge pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/bb0e483c-7c5d-4e69-b5a6-1f50c8fefc25.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price back above $49.54 on Nov. 11 but have not been able to sustain the higher levels. Strong selling by the bears has pulled the price to the 20-day EMA ($47.17).\par \par \uc2 A break and close below the support line will complete the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern, intensifying the selling. There is a minor support at the 50-day SMA ($42.43) but if it cracks, the decline could extend to $35.29.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off the current level, it will suggest accumulation at lower levels. The LUNA/USDT pair could then again rise to $52 and later to $54.95.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTEvYjBhOWMwZGItMDMzOS00ZjZmLThiOGEtYjFiNzlhMzBiYzAwLkpQRw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211112ehbc000e2\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Solana\par \b \uc2 Solana Labs co-founder: We don\u8217\'20\'19t want to kill \u8216\'20\'18beautiful\u8217\'20\'19 Ethereum\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Brian Quarmby \par \uc2 645 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 November 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Raj Gokal said the Solana ecosystem has been \u8220\'20\'1Cexploding\u8221\'20\'1D across every vertical and \u8220\'20\'1Cuse case\u8221\'20\'1D in 2021, and thinks that \u8220\'20\'1CEthereum is impossible to kill.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 While many pundits have labeled Solana as an \u8220\'20\'1CEthereum killer\u8221\'20\'1D due to its lower fees and faster transaction times, Solana Labs co-founder Raj Gokal said the project has no desire to kill the cryptocurrency \u8212\'20\'14 and wouldn\u8217\'20\'19t be able to if it did.\par \par \uc2 Gokal made the comments in response to a Wednesday \uc2 Twitter\uc2  post from the co-founder of venture capital firm Placeholder, Chris Burniske, who wrote that \u8220\'20\'1Cdespite pretty words, L1 knives are fully out. In crypto, generally, people want their biggest bags to win.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis will influence almost all communications, so dont take what you see and hear as truth,\u8221\'20\'1D he added,\par \par \uc2 In response, Gokal emphasized that \u8220\'20\'1Cit doesn\u8217\'20\'19t have to be a fight\u8221\'20\'1D as he argued that the goal for all people working in the crypto space should be to onboard \u8220\'20\'1Cevery human\u8221\'20\'1D on to Web 3.0 and noted that:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C\u8217\'20\'19Knives out\u8217\'20\'19 implies we are trying to kill Ethereum. Ethereum cannot be killed, it\u8217\'20\'19s impossible. And it\u8217\'20\'19s already a beautiful force of good in the world, empowering millions and creating billions in wealth. Bitcoin is quite obviously the same.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 According to CoinGecko, Solana\u8217\'20\'19s native cryptocurrency, SOL, is currently the fifth-ranked \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  in terms of total market capitalization with $71.7 billion and is ahead of fellow \u8220\'20\'1CEthereum killer\u8221\'20\'1D Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) at sixth with $67.4 billion. Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) sits well ahead of the two in second place with a market cap of around $564.7 billion.\par \par \uc2 Solana has been making up a lot of ground lately, however. It\u8217\'20\'19s up 11,742% over the past year to sit at $237.53, while ETH has gained 931% within that time frame to reach around $4,800.\par \par \uc2 I know you may not even be talking about {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/solana?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @solana}}}\uc2 , and if so I apologize. but I\u8217\'20\'19m just sad and disappointed that every time non-ethereum chains like solana see success or take big swings at growing, it\u8217\'20\'19s seen as taking swings against incumbents.\par \par \uc2 we are trying to grow the movement\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Raj Gokal (@rajgokal) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rajgokal/status/1458421357138546689?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 November 10, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s expansion\par \par \uc2 Earlier this week, the Solana Foundation {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://conference.solana.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 hosted}}}\uc2  the \u8220\'20\'1CSolana Breakpoint 2021\u8221\'20\'1D conference in Lisbon, Portugal featuring guests such as Gokal, Solana Labs CEO and co-founder Anatoly Yakovenko, FTX CEO Sam Bankman-Fried, Reddit co-founder Alexis Ohanian and Circle CEO Jeremy Allaire.\par \par \uc2 Speaking on day one of the event, Gokal {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RZszqxOIn4I"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 stated}}}\uc2  that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/expanding-ecosystem-and-1-86b-futures-open-interest-back-solana-s-250-target"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana ecosystem}}}\uc2  has been \u8220\'20\'1Cexploding\u8221\'20\'1D in 2021 across every vertical and \u8220\'20\'1Cuse case.\u8221\'20\'1D The co-founder highlighted data showing 2.2 million nonfungible tokens (NFT) were minted on the Solana blockchain {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-secondary-nft-sales-reach-half-a-billion-in-three-months"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 within three months}}}\uc2 , along with more than $15 billion worth of total value locked in Solana-based decentralized finance (DeFi) as of Sunday ($14.47 billion at the time of writing).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/d18aa716-0731-48a3-ae2d-ec52adbad1b6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana ecosystem as of October\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/nydfs-licensed-standard-custody-brings-solana-staking-to-institutions"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 NYDFS-licensed Standard Custody brings Solana staking to institutions}}}\par \par \uc2 In a Friday {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://messari.io/article/the-perpetual-sol-rise?utm_source=messaricrypto&utm_medium=tweet&utm_campaign=perpetual-sol-rise"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 post}}}\uc2  titled \u8220\'20\'1CThe Perpetual SOL Rise\u8221\'20\'1D from Messari researcher Dustin Teander, he noted that \u8220\'20\'1CSolana has received sizable investor attention over the last quarter\u8221\'20\'1D and pointed to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-battles-cardano-for-the-top-five-spot-as-sol-market-cap-crosses-70b-mark"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a long list}}}\uc2  of promising \u8220\'20\'1Cgrowth catalysts\u8221\'20\'1D for the project.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIn many respects, the price discovery has been healthily fueled across various sectors \u8212\'20\'14 a $100M gaming fund announced, Brave announcing native integration on the Web3 front, $100M investment from Reddit for Social Media, $40M raised by Neon Labs to bring EVM infrastructure over, pplpleasr launching NFTs on Solana, FTX building out an NFT integration.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAnd, of course, there\u8217\'20\'19s Solana\u8217\'20\'19s DeFi ecosystem that has seen a 4x TVL expansion since September,\u8221\'20\'1D he added.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTEvMTY1NzIwMjAtMWZmYi00OGMyLThlMjYtNzE5Nzk5Y2NmYzNkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211112ehbc0002y\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Solana\par \b \uc2 Solana Labs co-founder: We don't want to kill 'beautiful' Ethereum\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Brian Quarmby \par \uc2 642 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 November 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Raj Gokal said the Solana ecosystem has been \u8220\'20\'1Cexploding\u8221\'20\'1D across every vertical and \u8220\'20\'1Cuse case\u8221\'20\'1D in 2021, and thinks that \u8220\'20\'1CEthereum is impossible to kill.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 While many pundits have labeled Solana (SOL) as an "Ethereum killer" due to its lower fees and faster transaction times, Solana Labs co-founder Raj Gokal said the project has no desire to kill the cryptocurrency \u8212\'20\'14 and wouldn\u8217\'20\'19t be able to if it did.\par \par \uc2 Gokal made the comments in response to a Nov.10 \uc2 Twitter\uc2  post from the co-founder of venture capital firm Placeholder, Chris Burniske who wrote that \u8220\'20\'1Cdespite pretty words, L1 knives are fully out. In crypto, generally, people want their biggest bags to win.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis will influence almost all communications, so don't take what you see and hear as truth,\u8221\'20\'1D he added,\par \par \uc2 In response, Gokal emphasized that \u8220\'20\'1Cit doesn\u8217\'20\'19t have to be a fight\u8221\'20\'1D as he argued that the goal for all people working in the crypto space should be to onboard \u8220\'20\'1Cevery human\u8221\'20\'1D on to Web 3.0, and noted that:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C\u8217\'20\'19Knives out\u8217\'20\'19 implies we are trying to kill Ethereum. Ethereum cannot be killed, it\u8217\'20\'19s impossible. And it\u8217\'20\'19s already a beautiful force of good in the world, empowering millions and creating billions in wealth. Bitcoin is quite obviously the same.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 According to CoinGecko, SOL is currently the fifth-ranked \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  in terms of total market cap with $71.7 billion, and is ahead of fellow \u8216\'20\'18ETH killer\u8217\'20\'19 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) at sixth with $67.4 billion. ETH sits well ahead of the two in second place with a market cap of around $564.7 billion.\par \par \uc2 Solana has been making up a lot of ground lately however. It's up 11,742% over the past year to sit at $237.53, while ETH has gained 931% within that time frame to reach around $4,800.\par \par \uc2 I know you may not even be talking about {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/solana?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @solana}}}\uc2 , and if so I apologize. but I\u8217\'20\'19m just sad and disappointed that every time non-ethereum chains like solana see success or take big swings at growing, it\u8217\'20\'19s seen as taking swings against incumbents.\par \par \uc2 we are trying to grow the movement\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Raj Gokal (@rajgokal) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rajgokal/status/1458421357138546689?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 November 10, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s expansion\par \par \uc2 Earlier this week the Solana Foundation {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://conference.solana.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 hosted}}}\uc2  the \u8220\'20\'1CSolana Breakpoint 2021\u8221\'20\'1D conference in Lisbon, Portugal featuring guests such as Gokal, CEO and co-founder of Solana Labs Anatoly Yakovenko, FTX CEO Sam Bankman-Fried, Reddit co-founder Alexis Ohanian and Circle CEO Jeremy Allaire.\par \par \uc2 Speaking on day one of the event, Gokal {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RZszqxOIn4I"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 stated}}}\uc2  that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/expanding-ecosystem-and-1-86b-futures-open-interest-back-solana-s-250-target"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana ecosystem}}}\uc2  has been \u8220\'20\'1Cexploding\u8221\'20\'1D in 2021 across every vertical and \u8220\'20\'1Cuse case.\u8221\'20\'1D The co-founder highlighted data showing 2.2 million NFTs were minted on the Solana blockchain {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-secondary-nft-sales-reach-half-a-billion-in-three-months"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 within three months}}}\uc2 , along with more than $15 billion worth of total value locked in Solana-based DeFi as of Nov. 7 ($14.47 billion at the time of writing).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/d18aa716-0731-48a3-ae2d-ec52adbad1b6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana ecosystem as of October\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/nydfs-licensed-standard-custody-brings-solana-staking-to-institutions"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 NYDFS-licensed Standard Custody brings Solana staking to institutions}}}\par \par \uc2 In a Nov. 12 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://messari.io/article/the-perpetual-sol-rise?utm_source=messaricrypto&utm_medium=tweet&utm_campaign=perpetual-sol-rise"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 post}}}\uc2  titled \u8220\'20\'1CThe Perpetual SOL Rise\u8221\'20\'1D from Messari researcher Dustin Teander, he noted that \u8220\'20\'1CSolana has received sizable investor attention over the last quarter,\u8221\'20\'1D and pointed to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-battles-cardano-for-the-top-five-spot-as-sol-market-cap-crosses-70b-mark"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a long list}}}\uc2  of promising \u8220\'20\'1Cgrowth catalysts\u8221\'20\'1D for the project.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIn many respects, the price discovery has been healthily fueled across various sectors \u8212\'20\'14 a $100M gaming fund announced, Brave announcing native integration on the Web3 front, $100M investment from Reddit for Social Media, $40M raised by Neon Labs to bring EVM infrastructure over, pplpleasr launching NFTs on Solana, FTX building out an NFT integration.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAnd, of course, there\u8217\'20\'19s Solana\u8217\'20\'19s DeFi ecosystem that has seen a 4x TVL expansion since September,\u8221\'20\'1D he added.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTEvMTY1NzIwMjAtMWZmYi00OGMyLThlMjYtNzE5Nzk5Y2NmYzNkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211112ehbc00005\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 11/10: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, XRP, DOT, DOGE, SHIB, LUNA\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,797 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 November 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s new all-time high at $69,000 and Ether\u8217\'20\'19s slow climb toward $5,000 are clear signals that bulls are in control and a hint that altcoins intend to follow.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) have again risen to a new all-time high on Nov. 10, indicating that the trend remains firmly in favor of the bulls.\par \par \uc2 In a recent report from Kraken exchange, analysts said that the current quarter\u8217\'20\'19s price action has a correlation of 0.88 with the fourth quarter of 2017.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin had rallied 220% in 4Q 2017 and if history repeats itself, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/kraken-predicts-96k-btc-price-top-as-analyst-says-1t-bitcoin-market-cap-is-now-cemented"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin could reach $96,355}}}\uc2 , which could potentially be this cycle\u8217\'20\'19s top.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/c2343c63-db44-4145-9edd-5134c0d6c44d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Long-term holders, who have held their Bitcoin for more than 12 months, are reluctant to spend their coins, according to Glassnode\u8217\'20\'19s \u8220\'20\'1CThe Week On-Chain\u8221\'20\'1D report. Another positive is that investors continue to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/record-whale-accumulation-precipitated-latest-all-time-high-bitcoin-breakout"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 withdraw coins from centralized exchanges}}}\uc2  whose share of supply has dropped to a new record low at 12.9%.\par \par \uc2 Can Bitcoin and altcoins sustain their \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum or will profit-booking drag prices lower? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to pull Bitcoin below the breakout level at $67,000 on Nov. 9 but they could not sustain the lower levels. The modest pullback indicates that bulls are buying on every minor dip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/1e83d9ca-2097-4219-9a03-ce95686c8889.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up and the relative strength index (RSI) is near the overbought territory, indicating that bulls are in control.\par \par \uc2 If buyers sustain the price above $67,000, the BTC/USDT pair could pick up momentum and accelerate to the next target objective at $75,000. A break and close above this resistance may open the doors for a possible rally to $89,476.12.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, the zone between $67,000 and $63,750 is likely to act as a strong support. If this zone is breached, it will indicate that traders may be aggressively booking profits. The pair may then drop to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($56,348).\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether has been trading inside an ascending channel for many days. The bulls are attempting to keep the price above the centerline of the channel. The major target to watch on the upside is the psychological level at $5,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/5efe3224-6f18-4247-881b-148c72daacf0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This level is likely to act as a stiff resistance but if bulls do not give up much ground, the ETH/USDT pair may overcome the barrier and rally to the next target objective at $5,283.17.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the resistance line of the channel, the pair could drop to the support line. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break below it will suggest a possible change in the short-term trend.\par \par \uc2 The pair could first drop to $4,146.30 but if this support also gives way, the correction could reach the psychological support at $4,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the $630 support on Nov. 11 but the bears could not sustain the lower levels. The altcoin staged a strong recovery and the bulls are now trying to push the price above $669.30.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/2013fb26-d25b-4b20-8f52-312ca95da988.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the BNB/USDT pair will challenge the overhead resistance at $691.80. The rising moving averages and the RSI in the overbought zone indicate the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance, it will suggest that traders are defending the level aggressively. The bears will then make one more attempt to pull the price down to the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($566).\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the downtrend line on Nov. 9, indicating that the selling pressure is decreasing. The bears are currently attempting to pull the price back below the breakout level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/0237606d-4c23-4923-9a97-cb1bb0327bf4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, it will suggest that the break above the downtrend line may have been a bear trap. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then drop below the moving averages and retest the critical support at $1.87.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off the breakout level, it will suggest that bulls are buying on dips. The pair could then rally to the overhead resistance at $2.47. This is an important resistance for the bears to defend because if it cracks, the pair could rise to $2.80.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Solana\u8217\'20\'19s (SOL) Nov. 8 candlestick shows buying at the centerline of the ascending channel. However, the bulls could not build on this advantage as strong selling at higher levels pulled the price below the centerline on Nov. 9.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/cc9819a2-ed59-4f08-9175-e353a21cf1d1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The SOL/USDT pair could now drop to the support line of the channel. A strong rebound off this support will indicate that the up-move remains intact. Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is in the positive territory, signaling that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the channel will indicate strength and the pair may rally to $300 and then to $321. Conversely, if bears sink the price below the channel and the $216 support, the decline could extend to the 50-day SMA ($179).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the overhead resistance at $1.24 on Nov. 8, signaling that bulls are attempting a comeback. The bears tried to pull the price back below $1.24 but failed to sustain the lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/6b3a4266-0b58-424d-8384-ec3108eb1a84.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This suggests that bulls have flipped the $1.24 level into support. This level could now act as a launchpad for the next leg of the up-move. The XRP/USDT pair could rally to the overhead resistance at $1.41 where the bears are expected to mount a stiff resistance.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $1.41 but rebounds off the $1.24, it will suggest that traders continue to buy on dips. That will increase the likelihood of a breakout of $1.41. This positive view will be negated if the bears sink and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA ($1.17).\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) turned down from $53.87 on Nov. 8, indicating that bears are selling at higher levels. The price has dipped back to $49.78, which is likely to act as a strong support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/eafbeb74-1d8f-45cf-b8f9-56c9ed81c526.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The repeated retest of a support level within a short interval tends to weaken it. If the price breaks below $49.78, the DOT/USDT pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($48.09). This is an important support for the bulls to defend.\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off the 20-day EMA will suggest that sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips. The bulls will have to push the price above $55.09 to signal the resumption of the uptrend. The next target objective on the upside is $63.08.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price plummets below the 20-day EMA, traders may rush to the exit. That could pull the price down to the 50-day SMA ($39.87).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-markets-rally-as-inflation-rages-at-30-year-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto markets rally as inflation rages at 30-year high}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $0.29 on Nov. 8, indicating selling on rallies. The price has dipped back to the 20-day EMA ($0.26), which is an important support to keep an eye on.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/f03c3423-b8ea-4ad9-9fe1-b8c57babe931.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the current level, the bulls will again try to propel the DOGE/USDT pair above $0.30. If they can pull it off, the pair could challenge the overhead resistance at $0.34. A break and close above this level will signal that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price breaks below the 20-day EMA, the next stop could be the 50-day SMA ($0.24). If this support is breached, the selling could intensify and the pair may drop to the strong support at $0.19.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 SHIBA INU (SHIB) rose above the downtrend line on Nov. 9 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. This shows that every rise is being sold by the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/7524a1d2-5370-47f4-8a74-f5efcf1cd7f0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The SHIB/USDT pair formed a Doji candlestick pattern on Nov. 9 that resolved to the downside on Nov. 10. If bears sustain the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.000053), the pair could drop to the 78.6% Fibonacci retracement level at $0.000040 and then to the 50-day SMA ($0.000033).\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the pair rebounds off the current level and rises above the downtrend line, it could reach $0.000065. The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a range-bound action in the near term.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s LUNA token has been trading inside a rising wedge pattern. The bulls attempted to push the price to the resistance line of the wedge on Nov. 8 but could not sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/a862f3d8-952a-4b80-bf54-1d60958c5134.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Profit-booking near the resistance line pulled the price back toward the critical level at $49.54 on Nov. 9. The strong rebound off this level on Nov. 10 suggests that bulls are defending this level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 The buyers will now attempt to push the price to the resistance line of the wedge. If bulls thrust the price above the wedge, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up and the LUNA/USDT pair may reach $62.59.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and plummets below the support line of the wedge.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTEvMmU2MjA5YTctY2ZkMi00NTQ1LTg2N2YtY2ExZTQyOWE5ZTk3LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211110ehba000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 New York\par \b \uc2 NYDFS-licensed Standard Custody brings Solana staking to institutions\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Sam Bourgi \par \uc2 354 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 November 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Institutional demand for crypto is on the rise as investors look beyond the "big two" in Bitcoin and Ethereum.\par \par \uc2 Standard Custody & Trust Company, a \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  custodian based in New York, has expanded its crypto offerings to include Solana (SOL), giving institutional investors the ability to stake and custody the world\u8217\'20\'19s sixth-largest cryptocurrency.\par \par \uc2 Beginning Wednesday, institutional investors will have the ability to interact directly with Solana\u8217\'20\'19s rapidly growing ecosystem through both segregated and on-chain accounts, with staking services offered through Figment, an application layer solution provider for institutions. The company said it also plans to provide custody services for Solana Program Library tokens, which are a collection of on-chain programs.\par \par \uc2 Standard Custody is rolling out support for Solana to meet growing institutional demand for SOL, which has charted exponential growth since the start of the year. Earlier this week, SOL briefly overtook Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and Tether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tether-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDT}}}\uc2  ) to become the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-surpasses-cardano-tether-to-become-fourth-biggest-crypto-worth-76-billion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fourth-largest cryptocurrency by market capitalization}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Standard Custody CEO Jack McDonald credited Solana\u8217\'20\'19s recent growth to nonfungible tokens and decentralized finance \u8212\'20\'14 two of blockchain\u8217\'20\'19s biggest and most lucrative use cases. Solana\u8217\'20\'19s presence in both sectors has increased dramatically in recent months.\par \par \uc2 Institutional involvement in the cryptocurrency sector has grown considerably over the past year, marking a decisive shift in how traditional investors view digital assets. Since the launch of Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) futures all the way back in December 2017, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cme-introduces-micro-ether-futures-as-eth-nears-ath-above-4-4k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 crypto sector has delivered institutional onramps}}}\uc2  to trading platforms, secure custody solutions and new product offerings such as exchange-traded products, micro futures and, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/breaking-blockfi-files-for-physically-backed-bitcoin-etf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 more recently, exchange-traded funds}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/breaking-blockfi-files-for-physically-backed-bitcoin-etf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/breaking-blockfi-files-for-physically-backed-bitcoin-etf}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/institutional-managers-bought-2b-worth-of-bitcoin-in-october"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Institutional managers bought $2B worth of Bitcoin in October}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/these-publicly-traded-firms-are-pulling-institutions-into-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Companies such as Coinbase, Microstrategy and Riot Blockchain}}}\uc2  are also playing an important role in attracting institutional investors to crypto. As more institutional capital flows into digital assets, publicly-listed companies with direct exposure to the sector have emerged as a viable gateway for traditional investors.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTEvMzUwN2Y5ODQtMGY1Ni00MzgzLTllZDYtMWQyMGYwZDI5NGUwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211110ehba0008j\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 11/8: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, XRP, DOT, SHIB, DOGE, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,898 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 November 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and Ethereum are taking full control of the market and technical analysis shows altcoins intend to keep pace with the top 2 cryptocurrencies.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is close to making a new all-time high and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) finally soared to hit a new high at $4,800. This pushed the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-markets-tag-3t-combined-market-cap-for-first-time"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 total crypto market capitalization above $3 trillion}}}\uc2  for the first time ever on Nov. 8, according to data from CoinGecko.\par \par \uc2 Data from Santiment shows that Bitcoin whales holding between 10,000 BTC to 100,000 BTC in their wallets {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-in-classic-bull-pennant-breakout-as-btc-whales-go-on-buying-spree"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-in-classic-bull-pennant-breakout-as-btc-whales-go-on-buying-spree}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-in-classic-bull-pennant-breakout-as-btc-whales-go-on-buying-spree"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 have been buying aggressively }}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-in-classic-bull-pennant-breakout-as-btc-whales-go-on-buying-spree"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-in-classic-bull-pennant-breakout-as-btc-whales-go-on-buying-spree}}}\uc2  in the past few days. They have added 92,000 Bitcoin in the past 25 days, out of which roughly 43,000 have been purchased in the past five days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/9172a99b-ed63-41bc-a1a5-cd550c629203.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Another important group that has been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/resistance-is-futile-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 holding their stash is the Bitcoin miners}}}\uc2 . Data from CryptoQuant shows that barring a few exceptions, the outflows from miner wallets have largely remained flat in the past few months.\par \par \uc2 Could the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend in Bitcoin and Ether pull the other major coins higher? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke above the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  flag pattern on Nov. 2, indicating the possible resumption of the uptrend. The bears repeatedly attempted to pull the price back inside the flag but could not break the support at the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($61,400).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/9c5307ae-6c67-4096-912e-b1f2d082b239.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising moving averages and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive territory indicate the path of least resistance is to the upside. If bulls drive the price above $67,000, the BTC/USDT pair could pick up momentum.\par \par \uc2 The first target on the upside is $75,000, which may act as a resistance, but if bulls overcome this hurdle, the pair could start its march toward the pattern target at $89,476.12.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA. A break and close below this support could open the doors for a possible decline to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($55,284).\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether rebounded off the breakout level at $4,375 on Nov. 6, indicating that bulls have flipped this level into support. The buying resumed on Nov. 7 and the bulls have pushed the price above the previous all-time high at $4,665.87 on Nov. 8.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/2357d2ef-6f46-421a-a251-74b49791847e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair could now rally to the psychologically important level at $5,000 where the bears are expected to mount a stiff resistance. If the price turns down from $5,000 but does not break below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest strong buying on dips.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above $5,000 could open the doors for a further rally to $5,283.17. The important support to watch on the downside is the 20-day EMA and it has not been broken since Oct. 1.\par \par \uc2 If this support cracks, it will signal that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening. The pair could then drop to $3,888.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) picked up momentum after breaking out of $518.90. The bears are attempting to defend the overhead resistance at $691.80 as seen from the long wick on the Nov. 7 candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/5d69364d-176d-4eb5-94e0-7638fcba9ba3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls do not give up much ground from the current level, it will indicate strength and increase the prospects of a break above the overhead resistance. If that happens, the BNB/USDT pair could move up to $717.80.\par \par \uc2 Although the upsloping moving averages indicate advantage to buyers, the overbought levels on the RSI suggest that the pair could soon enter a minor consolidation or correction. The first support on the downside is $600.\par \par \uc2 If this support is breached, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($549). Such a deep correction could delay the start of the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) had been trading between the 20-day EMA ($2.04) and the critical support at $1.87 for the past few days. Although the bears successfully defended the 20-day EMA, they could not sink the price below $1.87, indicating accumulation at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/6a468ffa-e749-43b0-934e-84e6b3efa44a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers have propelled the price above the 20-day EMA and the RSI has also climbed into the positive zone, indicating that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could now rise to the resistance line.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the resistance line will indicate that bulls are back in the game. The pair could then rise to $2.47 where the bears are likely to mount a stiff resistance.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the downtrend line, the bears will again try to sink the pair below $1.87.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) is in a strong uptrend and trading inside an ascending channel. The up-move is facing profit-booking near the resistance line of the channel but a positive sign is that the bulls have not given up much ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/1a4b87c3-e210-46ce-b7df-6950d533e720.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the centerline of the channel, the bulls will make one more attempt to push the SOL/USDT pair above the resistance line. If they manage to do that, the pair could rally to $300 and then to $321.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price breaks below the centerline, the pair could drop to the support line of the channel. A break below the channel could start a deeper correction to $200 and later to the 50-day SMA ($175).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) broke above the $1.24 overhead resistance on Nov. 8 but the bulls are finding it difficult to sustain the breakout. This suggests that bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/7d63971b-6006-4cf3-89b3-3ecfd44cfe38.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($1.13) is sloping up and the RSI is in the positive zone, indicating the path of least resistance is to the upside. If bulls sustain the price above $1.24, the XRP/USDT pair could rise to $1.41.\par \par \uc2 This level could again act as a stiff resistance but if buyers overcome this hurdle, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA. The selling could intensify if the support cracks and the pair may drop to $1.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) bounced off the breakout level at $49.78 on Nov. 6, indicating that bulls are attempting to flip this level into support. The buyers will now attempt to push the price above $55.09 and resume the uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/1ac59e79-fb45-48f6-82cc-cfc3bc36a136.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the DOT/USDT pair could start its northward march toward the next target objective at $63.08. The upsloping moving averages and the RSI near the overbought zone indicate that buyers have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the pair could remain range-bound between $49.78 and $55. A break and close below $49.78 will be the first indication that traders may be booking profits on their positions.\par \par \uc2 The pair could then drop to the 20-day EMA ($47.41). If the price rebounds off this level, the bulls will again try to resume the uptrend but if the support gives way, the pair may drop to the 50-day SMA ($38.92).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-retains-65k-after-elon-musk-sell-off-sees-btc-pass-tesla-market-cap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin retains $65K after Elon Musk sell-off sees BTC pass Tesla market cap}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 SHIBA INU (SHIB) has been in a strong corrective phase in the past few days. Although the price rebounded from just below the 20-day EMA ($0.000053) on Nov. 5, the bulls are struggling to sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/62a304f0-fd23-4d72-bfba-0902f3205f7b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This suggests that traders are selling at higher levels. If bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, the SHIB/USDT pair could drop to $0.000043. This is an important level to keep an eye on because if it breaks down, the correction may extend to $0.000040.\par \par \uc2 The longer the price sustains below the 20-day EMA, the greater is the possibility of a fall to the 50-day SMA ($0.000031).\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above the downtrend line will be the first sign that the selling pressure may be reducing. The pair could then rise to $0.000065 and later to $0.000075.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) dipped below the 20-day EMA ($0.26) on Nov. 4, 5, and 6 but the long tail on the candlesticks suggests strong buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/a710b297-34fb-4959-9062-5a9b93e1f99b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The gradually rising 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive territory indicate that bulls have a slight advantage. The bulls are attempting to push the price to the stiff overhead resistance at $0.34 but the long wick on Nov. 8\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bears are selling on rallies.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level, the bears will again try to pull the price below the 20-day EMA. If that happens, the DOGE/USDT pair could drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.24). A break below this support may result in a decline to $0.19.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche (AVAX) is in a strong uptrend. The up-move picked up momentum after the price rose above the overhead resistance at $81. The bulls will now try to drive the price to $100.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/e4f20acd-99f0-4d12-b500-376f29e819a7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If this level is crossed, the AVAX/USDT pair could extend the up-move to $108.56. The rising 20-day EMA ($72) and the RSI above 75, indicate that bulls are in command.\par \par \uc2 However, if the price turns down from the current level, the pair could drop to the breakout level at $81. If bulls flip this level into support, the possibility of the continuation of the uptrend increases.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break and close below the $81 support. The pair could then drop to the 20-day EMA, which is an important level for the bulls because a break below it could signal a short-term top has been made.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTEvM2UwNzM1YjItYWE0Yi00NTgyLTk4MzItOGE2NTg3YzczZWRiLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211108ehb8000e5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 SOL\par \b \uc2 Solana surpasses Cardano, Tether to become 4th-biggest crypto worth $76B\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 673 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 November 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) outranked its rival blockchain project Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and leading stablecoin Tether (USDT) to become the fourth-largest cryptocurrency by market capitalization.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) surpassed Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and leading stablecoin Tether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tether-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDT}}}\uc2  ) to become the fourth-largest cryptocurrency by market capitalization.\par \par \uc2 At press time, the net worth of total SOL tokens in circulation was a little over $76 billion, falling only behind Binance Coin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) $109 billion, Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) $540 billion and Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) $1.17 trillion.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/e56a6ea3-e6b8-4764-95c0-ee121c454c7f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Top ten cryptocurrencies by market cap as of 13:30 UTC, Nov. 7. Source: Messari\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s and Tether\u8217\'20\'19s market caps came out to be $66.39 billion and $74.42 billion, respectively.\par \par \uc2 $100-million fund launch boosts SOL\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook\par \par \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s market capitalization surged as its native token, SOL, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-reverses-tuesday-gains-while-solana-joins-ethereum-in-fresh-all-time-highs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rose to yet another record high}}}\uc2 . On Nov. 7, SOL\u8217\'20\'19s price crossed above $262 for the first time in history, primarily owing to a market-wide price rally that saw other top cryptocurrencies ink similar gains.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, SOL received additional \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  cues from Solana\u8217\'20\'19s foray into Web 3.0 gaming development via its venture capital arm. Dubbed Solana Ventures, the firm {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-ventures-lightspeed-venture-partners-and-ftx-launch-100m-gaming-fund"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced}}}\uc2  Friday that it, alongside FTX and \uc2 Lightspeed Venture Partners\uc2 , would invest $100 million into the game studios and technology sector.\par \par \uc2 In doing so, Solana Ventures aims to attract desktop and mobile video game developers to build their projects atop its public blockchain, thereby raising the prospect of higher SOL adoption. A similar adoption boom in 2021 helped send {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/expanding-ecosystem-and-1-86b-futures-open-interest-back-solana-s-250-target"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL\u8217\'20\'19s price}}}\uc2  up by almost 17,500% year-to-date \u8212\'20\'14 from $1.51 to $262.45.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/fe153d7e-fad0-4580-9ff1-ca08306544ba.jpeg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana ecosystem in a nutshell. Source: Solanians Telegram Channel\par \par \uc2 The uptrend surfaced as speculators started treating Solana as one of the most serious challengers to Ethereum, the leading smart contracts platform {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/layer-2-and-multi-chain-defi-platforms-see-record-inflows-as-ethereum-fees-soar"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 grappling with higher gas fees}}}\uc2  and network congestion issues.\par \par \uc2 For instance, Solana {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.solwealth.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 claims}}}\uc2  that it could process 50,000\u8211\'20\'1360,000 transactions per second (TPS) for an average transaction fee of $0.00025. In comparison, Ethereum transacts 15\u8211\'20\'1330 TPS, with its median transaction cost ranging between $4 and $21.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/0f70d230-92e5-493b-bb5b-7aacb91ab438.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Smart contract platforms comparison. Source: Solwealth\par \par \uc2 Paul Veradittakit, a partner at Pantera Capital, told Bloomberg that Solana is \u8220\'20\'1Cthe top competition\u8221\'20\'1D to Ethereum, Cardano and other smart contract platforms, regarding \u8220\'20\'1Cdeveloper adoption and momentum.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-battles-cardano-for-the-top-five-spot-as-sol-market-cap-crosses-70b-mark"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana battles Cardano for the top-five spot as SOL market cap crosses $70B mark}}}\par \par \uc2 Nevertheless, Solana also exhibited signs of resource exhaustion \u8212\'20\'14 i.e., a lack of prioritization among SOL transactions and a lower number of validators that led to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-chart-bull-flag-eyes-250-despite-sol-price-down-40-since-last-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 an 18-hour-long network outage}}}\uc2  in September. If not fixed, it could raise the risks of reversed or altered transactions across the Solana network.\par \par \uc2 Correction risks for SOL\u8217\'20\'19s price\par \par \uc2 Despite its latest rally to an all-time high, SOL risks undergoing a correction due to at least two \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  indicators.\par \par \uc2 First, SOL\u8217\'20\'19s price has been forming a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/all-time-highs-next-bitcoin-holds-62k-as-the-dollar-index-tumbles-to-3-week-lows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rising wedge}}}\uc2 , a technical pattern that typically results in lower prices. And second, the cryptocurrency has also been confirming a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence between its rising price and declining momentum (as confirmed by lower highs on its daily relative strength index).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/e8061af0-b170-403f-98e0-4c76cc1747ed.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USD daily price chart featuring rising wedge and price-momentum divergence. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A break below the wedge\u8217\'20\'19s lower trendline, if accompanied by an increase in volume, would risk sending SOL\u8217\'20\'19s price lower by as much as the maximum height. That roughly puts SOL\u8217\'20\'19s downside target to levels between $205 and $91.52, depending on the level at which the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  breakout begins.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTEvMmU2NDUyNDEtNjA3Zi00ZDRiLWI4YjMtMTQ0MDE5OGVmZTUxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211108ehb70002y\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 SOL\par \b \uc2 Solana surpasses Cardano, Tether to become fourth-biggest crypto worth $76 billion\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 665 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 November 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) outranked its rival blockchain project Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and leading stablecoin Tether (USDT) to become the fourth-largest cryptocurrency by market capitalization.\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/coins/solana?_ga=2.14156402.412491594.1635767293-280836029.1632902133"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) surpassed Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and leading stablecoin Tether (USDT) to become the fourth-largest cryptocurrency by market capitalization.\par \par \uc2 At press time, the net worth of total SOL tokens in circulation was a little over $76 billion, falling only behind Binance Coin's ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https:/