aising the prospect of higher SOL adoption. A similar adoption boom in 2021 helped send the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/expanding-ecosystem-and-1-86b-futures-open-interest-back-solana-s-250-target"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL price}}}\uc2  up by almost 17,500% YTD \u8212\'20\'14 from $1.51 to $262.45.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/fe153d7e-fad0-4580-9ff1-ca08306544ba.jpeg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana ecosystem in a nutshell. Source: Solanians Telegram Channel\par \par \uc2 The uptrend surfaced as speculators started treating Solana as one of the most serious challengers to Ethereum, the leading smart contracts platform {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/layer-2-and-multi-chain-defi-platforms-see-record-inflows-as-ethereum-fees-soar"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 grappling with higher gas fees}}}\uc2  and network congestion issues.\par \par \uc2 For instance, Solana {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.solwealth.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 claims}}}\uc2  that it could process 50,000-60,000 transactions per second (tps) for an average transaction fee of $0.00025. In comparison, Ethereum transacts 15-30 tps, with its median transaction cost ranging between $4 and $21.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/0f70d230-92e5-493b-bb5b-7aacb91ab438.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Smart contract platforms comparison. Source: Solwealth\par \par \uc2 Paul Veradittakit, a partner at Pantera Capital, told Bloomberg, called Solana "the top competition" to Ethereum, Cardano, and other smart contract platforms, regarding "developer adoption and momentum."\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-battles-cardano-for-the-top-five-spot-as-sol-market-cap-crosses-70b-mark"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana battles Cardano for the top-five spot as SOL market cap crosses $70B-mark}}}\par \par \uc2 Nonetheless, Solana also exhibited signs of resource exhaustion, i.e., a lack of prioritization among SOL transactions and a lower number of validators that led to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-chart-bull-flag-eyes-250-despite-sol-price-down-40-since-last-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 an eighteen-hour long network outage}}}\uc2  in September. If not fixed, it could raise the risks of reversed or altered transactions across the Solana network.\par \par \uc2 Correction risks for SOL price\par \par \uc2 Despite its latest rally to an all-time high, SOL risks undergoing a correction due to at least two \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  indicators.\par \par \uc2 First, the SOL price has been forming a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/all-time-highs-next-bitcoin-holds-62k-as-the-dollar-index-tumbles-to-3-week-lows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Rising Wedge}}}\uc2 , a technical pattern that typically results in lower prices. And second, the cryptocurrency has also been confirming a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence between its rising price and declining momentum (as confirmed by lower highs on its daily relative strength index).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/e8061af0-b170-403f-98e0-4c76cc1747ed.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USD daily price chart featuring rising wedge and price-momentum divergence. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A break below the Wedge's lower trendline, if accompanied by an increase in volume, would risk sending the SOL price lower by as much as the maximum height. That roughly puts SOL's downside target to levels between $205 and $91.52, depending on the level at which the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  breakout begins.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTEvMmU2NDUyNDEtNjA3Zi00ZDRiLWI4YjMtMTQ0MDE5OGVmZTUxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211107ehb70008f\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin price consolidation \u8216\'20\'18could be over,\u8217\'20\'19 says trader as Ethereum, Polkadot hit all-time highs\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 372 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 November 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin retains gains but it's all about Ethereum and Polkadot with new all-time highs Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is in line for a continuation of its bull run, fresh analysis says, as BTC/USD retains its 2.2% daily gains.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/e207176c-6b0f-4795-a845-4f51ac727089.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 $62,500 eyed for BTC price bounce\par \par \uc2 As data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.121254216.1571181373.1628517932-1136475544.1627545224"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BITSTAMP"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  tracks Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s best day for a week, confidence in higher levels is building.\par \par \uc2 Earlier Tuesday, Nov. 2, the largest cryptocurrency {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-hits-1-week-high-in-minutes-on-sudden-1-5k-gains"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 abruptly exited}}}\uc2  a sideways trading channel to add almost $2,000 in just over an hour.\par \par \uc2 Amid calls of a potential breakout, popular trader Pentoshi believes that $62,500 may be buyers\u8217\'20\'19 only chance to \u8220\'20\'1Cbuy the dip.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C$BTC any pullback towards 62.5k is a great bid zone to add,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Pentosh1/status/1455493355073425409/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 advised}}}\uc2 Twitter\uc2  followers alongside an accompanying chart.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CLooks as tho consolidation could be over and ready to trend again.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/b483a08a-7cbe-41c7-ac08-3a7e8ae27be4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD annotated chart. Source: Pentoshi/\uc2 Twitter\par \par \uc2 With the Wall Street open around the corner, confidence is firmly evident among market participants, with analyst TechDev calling for a march beyond all-time highs of $67,100.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-11-1-btc-eth-bnb-ada-sol-xrp-dot-shib-doge-luna"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 11/1: BTC, ETH, BNB, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , SOL, XRP, DOT, SHIB, DOGE, LUNA}}}\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), the largest altcoin by market capitalization, saw a fresh all-time high of $4,482 Tuesday, days after its previous record.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/55d46dcb-6220-4a48-b19e-2f8ab1a83ba6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The top 10 cryptocurrencies by market cap were led by Polkadot (DOT), up 15% on the day at $52 \u8212\'20\'14 itself an all-time high after its own {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/polkadot-eyes-breakout-to-75-after-dot-price-rally-sets-up-classic-bullish-reversal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 October rally}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/BTC?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #BTC}}}\uc2  daily looks poised to begin its move up to 84K. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/QtTFjjpBBl"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/QtTFjjpBBl}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 TechDev (@TechDev_52) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/TechDev_52/status/1455472851805511682?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 November 2, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/uptober-closes-at-record-high-in-best-month-of-2021-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 de facto hit}}}\uc2  its \u8220\'20\'1Cworst-case scenario\u8221\'20\'1D monthly close for October, thus remaining on course to see almost $100,000 by the end of this month.\par \par \uc2 New all-time highs for ETH and DOT\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment is also coming from a resurgent altcoin sphere.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTEvYWMyYTEyMDktODk2ZS00MWNmLWE3NDUtMmM4MjRlNTVlZjdiLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211102ehb20008i\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 11/1: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, XRP, DOT, SHIB, DOGE, LUNA\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,806 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 November 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and Ether closed October on a strong note, increasing the possibility that the rally will pick up pace in November.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) had their highest monthly close ever in October, indicating strong momentum that favors buyers. The focus now shifts to November, which has been largely \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Since 2013, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-moonvember-begins-as-data-shows-november-is-best-month-for-s-p-500"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin has closed November}}}\uc2  in the red on only two occasions, in 2018 and 2019. Another positive impetus for Bitcoin could be the tailwinds from the United States stock markets, which also have an enviable record in November.\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 has recorded a median rise of 2% in November, the only month of the year to achieve such impressive median returns.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/49017b43-d3db-4713-8193-508b3ebfac12.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Data from Glassnode also shows that Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/uptober-closes-at-record-high-in-best-month-of-2021-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reserves on exchanges are at their lowest level}}}\uc2  in three years. The amount of Bitcoin held on the books of exchanges has dropped from 3.1 million Bitcoin in April 2020 to 2.47 million BTC. According to analysts, this could be \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for Bitcoin if the demand shoots up because that could create a supply shock.\par \par \uc2 Could Ether lead the altcoins higher or will Bitcoin remain in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin turned down from the resistance line of the flag pattern on Oct. 31 but the bulls did not allow the price to sustain below the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($59,876). This is a positive sign as it shows that traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/c738ded4-d70c-499d-be81-015be46def07.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the resistance line will complete the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  flag setup. The BTC/USDT pair could then rally to the all-time high at $67,000. This level is likely to act as a major roadblock but if bulls can overcome it, the pair could start its journey toward the target objective at $89,476.12.\par \par \uc2 The rising moving averages and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive zone indicate that bulls have the upper hand. The first sign of weakness will be a break and close below the 20-day EMA. Such a move could result in a decline to the support line of the pattern.\par \par \uc2 The selling could accelerate if bears sustain the price below the flag. The pair could then drop to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($53,115).\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Ether\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick on Nov. 1 shows that bulls are buying on dips with vigor. The bulls have not allowed the price to dip and sustain below the 20-day EMA ($4,042) since Oct. 1, which suggests that sentiment remains positive.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/e39945c9-e7e5-4466-8957-36e7d4ca522d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls thrust the price above the overhead resistance at $4,460.47, the ETH/USDT pair could resume the uptrend. The pair could then rally to the psychologically important level at $5,000 where the bears are likely to pose a stiff challenge.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the bears will try to pull the pair to the 20-day EMA. This is an important support to watch out for because a break below it could prompt short-term traders to book profits.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears attempted to pull Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) back below $518.90 for the past two days but the long tail on the candlestick shows bulls had other plans. Lower levels are attracting strong buying and the bulls will now try to resume the uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/dc29d7cf-47c9-4149-bd7b-e0f783b357bc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA (486) and the RSI just below the overbought zone suggest that bulls are in command. If bulls sustain the price above $540.50, the BNB/USDT pair could move towards the pattern target at $554 and later to the psychological resistance at $600.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest aggressive selling at higher levels. That may trap several aggressive bulls, pulling the pair to the critical support at $392.20.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls have successfully defended the strong support at $1.87 for the past few days but they are struggling to push Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($2.07). This indicates a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/8053bf5e-2b4c-4695-ba9b-6bcdbac4df75.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to sink the price below the support zone at $1.87 to $1.80. If that happens, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to $1.58. The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative zone indicate that bears are in control.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rises from the current level and breaks above the moving averages, it will indicate strong accumulation at $1.87. The pair could then rally to the overhead resistance at $2.47.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) rebounded off the 20-day EMA on Oct. 31, signaling strong buying at lower levels. The bulls will now try to push the price above the overhead resistance zone at $216 to $218.93.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/ba170b1b-cd57-452d-a9ca-2dc7f45684d7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the SOL/USDT pair could resume its uptrend and rally to the pattern target at $239.83. A break and close above this resistance could open the doors for a possible rally to $265.80.\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($185) and the RSI in the positive zone indicate that bulls have the upper hand. This positive view will be negated if the price turns down from the overhead resistance and plummets below the 20-day EMA. That could pull the price down to the trendline.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) is stuck between the downtrend line and the $1 support as the bears are selling on rallies and bulls are buying on dips. The bulls tried to push the price above the downtrend line on Oct. 31 but the long wick on the candlestick shows selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/a718c24e-75a9-4d1a-8ead-02490d7524a3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are attempting to sink the price below the moving averages as of Nov. 1. If that happens, the XRP/USDT pair could again drop to the strong support at $1. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break below it may pull the price to $0.85.\par \par \uc2 If bulls drive the price above the downtrend line, the pair could rally to the overhead resistance at $1.24. The flat moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($41.93) on Oct. 31 as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. This is a positive sign as it shows that traders are accumulating on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/2fa19021-72d7-41e0-bc97-75676fbb3de5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Sustained buying on Nov. 1 has pushed the price above the overhead resistance at $46.39. The bulls tried to clear the next overhead hurdle at the all-time high at $49.78 but the bears are not willing to relent.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and finds support at $46.30, it will improve the prospects of the resumption of the up-move toward the pattern target at $53.90.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a close below $46.39. The pair could then drop to the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whale-indicator-detects-multi-month-accumulation-trend-as-btc-eyes-67k-retest"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin whale indicator detects multi-month accumulation trend as BTC eyes $67K-retest}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 SHIBA INU\u8217\'20\'19s (SHIB) long tail on the Oct. 31 candlestick suggests that bulls aggressively bought the dip to the 50% Fibonacci retracement level at $0.00005778.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/b30c126e-f366-4b70-8e13-c8274e3af061.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers will now try to push the price toward the all-time high at $0.00008854. This level is likely to attract strong selling by the bears. If the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the SHIB/USDT pair could trade between $0.00008854 and $0.00005778 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above $0.00008854 could indicate the resumption of the uptrend that may reach the 300% Fibonacci extension level at $0.00010349. Conversely, a break and close below $0.00005778 may pull the price down to the 20-day EMA ($0.000048).\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($0.25) on Oct. 31 but the bulls are struggling to sustain the price above $0.27. This suggests that bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/69a535cc-8e3c-4a7e-901c-d4397120c97d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.25) is sloping up and the RSI is just above the midpoint, indicating a minor advantage to buyers. If the price sustains above $0.27, the DOGE/USDT pair may rally to $0.30 and later to $0.35.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate in the short term if bears pull the price below the 20-day EMA. The pair could then decline to the 50-day SMA ($0.23). If this support is breached, the down move could extend to $0.19.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra protocol\u8217\'20\'19s LUNA token has been trading between the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle and the 20-day EMA ($41.65), which is a positive sign. This suggests that traders are buying on dips to the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-11/2191eb6a-0ecf-4aa8-bb02-557f7c0c2cb3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers will have to push and sustain the price above the triangle to indicate the possible resumption of the uptrend. The LUNA/USDT pair could first rise to $49.54 and if this obstacle is crossed, the uptrend may extend to the pattern target at $62.59.\par \par \uc2 If bears pull the price below the 20-day EMA, the pair could slide to the 50-day SMA ($38.89) and later to the support line of the triangle. A break and close below this support will indicate that bears have overpowered the bulls. The pair may then drop to $33 and next to $22.40.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTEvNzNlMGU2OTAtZjkyMy00MDcxLWFkZGEtYjA1MmU0NTJmM2I1LkpQRw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211101ehb1000e2\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 10/29: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, XRP, DOT, DOGE, SHIB, LUNA\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,884 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 October 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Ethereum is outperforming Bitcoin in the short-term and the strength of ETH in its USD and BTC pair could be a sign that the entire altcoin market is on the verge of a larger rally.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is still in a corrective phase but Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has attracted strong buying, which pushed it to a new all-time high on Oct. 29. The successful Altair Beacon chain upgrade {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-hits-new-ath-after-altair-upgrade-shows-clear-path-to-the-merge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seems to have boosted sentiment}}}\uc2  and it also paves way for the merge with the Ethereum mainnet and the change to proof-of-stake.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  has continued to add to its already impressive Bitcoin stack. The company\u8217\'20\'19s Q3 report {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-added-9-000-btc-last-quarter-its-stash-is-now-worth-7-billion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 shows that it added 8,957 Bitcoin}}}\uc2 , taking its haul to 114,042 Bitcoi as of Sept. 30, purchased at an average price of $27,713.\par \par \uc2 The software firm\u8217\'20\'19s appetite does not seem to have been satisfied yet and CEO \uc2 Michael Saylor\uc2  said the company \u8220\'20\'1Cwill continue to evaluate opportunities to raise additional capital to execute\u8221\'20\'1D its Bitcoin strategy.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/2687dc24-cefc-48c4-b8fa-9098cf552ddd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend in the crypto sector seems to have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/linkedin-reports-crypto-and-blockchain-job-listings-have-surged-615-since-august-2020"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 increased the demand for employees}}}\uc2  with experience in crypto or blockchain. A recent report by LinkedIn editor Devin Banerjee cited data from LinkedIn\u8217\'20\'19s Economic Graph team, which showed that postings for jobs that included terms such as \u8220\'20\'1Cblockchain\u8221\'20\'1D or \u8220\'20\'1Ccrypto\u8221\'20\'1D surged 615% in August, compared to a year earlier.\par \par \uc2 Could the sharp rally in Ether be the start of a new altseason? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin dipped below the 20-day exponential moving average ($59,389) on Oct. 27 but the bears could not sustain the lower levels. The price quickly recovered and rose above the 20-day EMA on Oct. 28, suggesting strong buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/e8c60b31-4bd4-4a8a-8842-9c8195ce470c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price action of the past few days has formed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  flag pattern that will complete on a break and close above the resistance line. Such a move will indicate the resumption of the uptrend. The first resistance on the upside is the all-time high at $67,000.\par \par \uc2 If bulls clear this overhead hurdle, the BTC/USDT pair could start its northward march toward the pattern target at $89,476.12.\par \par \uc2 The rising moving averages and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive zone indicate advantage to bulls. The bears will have to pull and sustain the price below the flag to invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. In that case, the pair could slide to $52,920.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether sharply rebounded off the 20-day EMA ($3,953) on Oct. 28, indicating that dip buyers used the recent pullback to accumulate. The biggest altcoin rose to a new all-time high today, signaling the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/4f844b83-16a8-4662-bcb2-a43d732a5957.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive territory indicate that bulls are in command. If buyers sustain the price above $4,375, the ETH/USDT pair could start its journey toward the pattern target at $4,657 and then rally to $5,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price fails to sustain above $4,375, it will suggest that demand dries up at higher levels. The pair could then consolidate between $4,375 and $3,888 for a few days. A break and close below this range will suggest the start of a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully defended the neckline of the inverse head and shoulders pattern on Oct. 27, which is a positive sign. This may have prompted buying from traders, propelling Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $518.90.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/263efd7a-3770-4d16-9613-e31dd7cac1a7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($470) is sloping up and the RSI is in the positive zone, indicating that buyers are in control. If bulls sustain the price above $518.90, the BNB/USDT pair could resume its uptrend toward the pattern target at $554.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price fails to sustain above $518.90, it will suggest that traders are booking profits at higher levels. The pair could then drop to the neckline, which is an important support for the bulls to defend.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls defended the strong support at $1.87 on Oct. 27 but the rebound lacks strength. This suggests that traders are hesitant to buy Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/a1de6a9a-0749-465b-a5ce-3c417db123e8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping down and the RSI is in the negative zone, indicating that the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level or from the 20-day EMA ($2.12), the bears will again try to break and close the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair below the $1.87 support. Such a move could signal the start of a deeper correction to $1.58.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if bulls push and sustain the price above the moving averages. The pair could then rally to $2.47.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/solana"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($180) on Oct. 27, indicating that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips. The bulls will now try to thrust the price above the overhead resistance zone at $216 to $218.93.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/d28b9daa-f99d-4e42-a152-b0aeda933c20.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive zone suggest that bulls have the upper hand. A break and close above $218.93 will suggest the resumption of the uptrend and the SOL/USDT pair could rally to $239.83.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are unlikely to throw in the towel easily. If the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance, the pair may consolidate between $171.47 and $218.93 for a few days. A break below $171.47 could signal the start of a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/ripple"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  slipped below the $1 support on Oct. 27 but the bears could not sustain the lower levels. This suggests that bulls are accumulating near the critical support. The buyers will now try to push and sustain the price above the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/aa16d85f-2223-4318-8531-46117539484a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the XRP/USDT pair could rally to $1.24 where the bears are expected to mount a stiff resistance. If the price turns down from this level, the pair could remain range-bound for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The flat moving averages and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand. This equilibrium will shift in favor of the bulls if the pair rises above $1.24. Conversely, a break below $1 could sink the pair to the strong support zone at $0.88 to $0.85.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the breakout level at $38.77 on Oct. 27, suggesting that the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/3cbf2caf-35ae-4364-a4b1-811e529a65d0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now try to push the price above the overhead hurdle at $46.39 and retest the all-time high at $49.78. If this resistance is breached, the DOT/USDT pair could climb toward the next target objective at $53.90.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance, the bears will try to pull the price below the 20-day EMA ($40.90). A break below this level could retest the critical support at $38.77. If this level cracks, the next stop could be the 50-day simple moving average ($35.68).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/axie-infinity-decentraland-and-metaverse-cryptos-rally-after-facebook-rebrands-to-meta"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Axie Infinity, Decentraland and \u8216\'20\'18metaverse\u8217\'20\'19 cryptos rally after Facebook rebrands to Meta}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) broke below the 50-day SMA ($0.23) on Oct. 27 but the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests aggressive buying at lower levels. The bulls continued their purchase on Oct. 28, which may have caught a few aggressive bears off guard.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/035fc83a-1f6f-4369-9e00-22024f8d5ff2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A combination of short-covering by the bears and bottom fishing by the bulls pushed the price above the $0.27 resistance on Oct. 28. However, the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that traders may have booked profits at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 The bulls and the bears are likely to witness a tough battle at $0.27. If bulls flip this level into support, the DOGE/USDT pair could again try to rally toward $0.35. A break and close above this level could clear the path for a possible move to $0.45.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a break and close below $0.27 could pull the price down to the 20-day EMA ($0.25).\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu (SHIB) skyrocketed above the 200% Fibonacci extension level at $0.00007586 on Oct. 27 and hit a new all-time high at $0.00008854 on Oct. 28.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/d9410fb6-5e5b-45a8-8b8d-9747c508adc5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sharp rally of the past few days pushed the RSI to 91.66 on Oct. 27, resulting in a pullback on Oct. 28. The SHIB/USDT pair has formed an inside-day candlestick pattern today, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears.\par \par \uc2 Although the uptrend remains intact, the pair could enter a few days of consolidation or correction to digest the gains of the past few days.\par \par \uc2 The 50% Fibonacci retracement level at $0.00005778 is a critical level to watch out for because a break below it could intensify selling and pull the pair down to the 61.8% retracement at $0.00005052.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above $0.00008854, the pair could rally to the 300% Fibonacci extension level at $0.00010349.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra protocol\u8217\'20\'19s LUNA token bounced off the 50-day SMA ($38.69) on Oct. 27, indicating strong buying at lower levels. The price action of the past few days has resulted in the formation of a symmetrical triangle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/d1a51625-e194-484b-8369-e5750192b7e0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now try to propel the price above the triangle. If they manage to do that, the LUNA/USDT pair could resume its uptrend. The bears may pose a stiff challenge at the all-time high at $49.54 but if this level is crossed, the pair may reach the pattern target at $62.59.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance, it will suggest that bears continue to sell on rallies. The pair may then extend its stay inside the triangle for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTAvMzc5ZTBlOTUtMmMxMi00MGM1LTliNDMtNjYzOTRiNDI5NzIwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211029ehat000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 10/27: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, XRP, DOT, DOGE, SHIB, LUNA\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,816 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 October 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and Ether may witness a deeper pullback over the coming days and this move could shake weaker hands out of altcoins and other high risk positions.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has broken back below the psychological support at $60,000. While this seems to be negative in the short term, the price action has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-dip-matches-october-2017-with-btc-explosion-still-forecast-before-2022"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 continued to mirror its movement in 2017}}}\uc2 . If the similarity continues for the remainder of the year, Bitcoin bulls may be in for a party.\par \par \uc2 PlanB, creator of the popular Bitcoin Stock-to-Flow (S2F) model, recently proclaimed in a tweet that the second leg of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s bull market has begun. If Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price action continues to follow the S2F model, the analyst believes a rally to $100,000 to $135,000 may be possible by the end of the year.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/6bbe40d6-9c75-4795-8991-a49d2c038b4a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Although Bitcoin garners the lion\u8217\'20\'19s share of attention, cryptocurrency exchange Okcoin said in a recent report that institutional investors\u8217\'20\'19 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/okcoin-reports-altcoins-drove-institutional-interest-in-crypto-for-2021"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 appetite for non-Bitcoin crypto assets}}}\uc2  has been growing. The report said that 53% of the purchases by institutional investors in September were in altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Is the current fall in Bitcoin a buying opportunity or the start of a deeper correction? How are the altcoins expected to react? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin failed to retest the overhead resistance zone at $64,854 to $67,000 on Oct. 25, which may have prompted short-term traders to book profits. That has pulled the price down to the strong support at the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($58,948).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/ec09d086-8131-4035-a36b-cb18308a4d7a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A break and close below the 20-day EMA will be the first sign that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening. If bulls fail to reclaim the level quickly, the selling could accelerate and the BTC/USDT pair could slide to $52,920.\par \par \uc2 The relative strength index (RSI) has dropped to the midpoint and the 20-day EMA is flattening out, suggesting a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 This advantage will tilt in favor of the bears if the pair slides and sustains below the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($51,556). On the other hand, a breakout to a new all-time high will indicate that bulls are back in command.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to resume the uptrend in Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) on Oct. 26 and 27 but could not sustain the price above $4,200. This suggests that bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/cae5365f-1a2d-49c8-b9aa-906293c51830.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sellers have pulled the price to the 20-day EMA ($3,869), which is an important support to keep an eye on. A strong bounce off the 20-day EMA will suggest that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying the dips. The bulls will then again try to resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the 20-day EMA cracks, it will signal that traders may be booking profits and supply exceeds demand. The bears will then try to pull the price to the 50-day SMA ($3,488).\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance and broke below the 20-day EMA ($462) today. This is the first sign that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment could be weakening.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/f175d020-2b60-4679-97c1-5bd57506b539.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that bulls are attempting to defend the neckline of the inverse head and shoulders pattern.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the BNB/USDT pair could again try to rally to the overhead resistance at $518.90. A break and close above this resistance could signal the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a close below the neckline could pull the price to the 50-day SMA ($423). If this support is breached, the next stop could be $392.20. The flattish moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint do not indicate a clear advantage to either bulls or bears.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) tight range trading between the 20-day EMA ($2.15) and the support line of the symmetrical triangle resolved to the downside on Oct. 27. This suggests that bears have asserted their supremacy.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/0c5395d9-ce5a-4a33-8ade-f907e1e75c48.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sellers pulled the price below $1.87 on Oct. 27 but the long tail on the candlestick suggests that bulls are attempting to defend the support. The recovery attempt is likely to face strong resistance at the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will again try to break the $1.87 support. If that happens, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could resume the down move toward the pattern target at $1.58.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the resistance line of the triangle to invalidate the negative view.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) broke above the overhead resistance at $216 on Oct. 25 but the bulls could not sustain the breakout. This may have attracted profit-booking by short-term traders, pulling the price to the 20-day EMA ($177).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/f0e58713-5a40-4d58-970f-7b07829af473.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Oct. 27\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that sentiment remains positive and bulls are buying on dips to the 20-day EMA. The buyers will now again try to push the price above the overhead resistance.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the SOL/USDT pair could resume the uptrend with the next target objective at $239.83. Contrary to this assumption, if bears pull the price below $171.47, the pair could extend the drop to the trendline. A break below this support will signal a possible trend change.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) above the downtrend line on Oct. 26 but could not sustain the higher levels as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. This may have trapped the aggressive bulls, resulting in strong selling on Oct. 27.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/c1acd928-6dde-481c-9f35-00437efe3ecc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A close below the $1 support will complete a descending triangle pattern that could pull the price down to the strong support zone at $0.88 to $0.85. If this zone fails to arrest the decline, the XRP/USDT pair could extend the slide to the pattern target at $0.77.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($1.08) is flat but the RSI has dropped into the negative zone, indicating that the bears are attending a strong comeback. This negative view will invalidate if bulls push and sustain the price above the downtrend line. That could clear the path for a possible rally to $1.24.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s (DOT) failure to rise above the overhead resistance at $46.39 on Oct. 26 may have prompted selling by short-term traders. This pulled the price down to the strong support at $38.77 on Oct. 27.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/49f98806-2a9b-4a99-85f4-29838446d1ae.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Oct. 27\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that bulls are defending the support with vigor. If buyers push the price above $46.39, the DOT/USDT pair could resume its up-move and challenge the all-time high at $49.78.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bulls fail to clear the overhead hurdle, the pair may consolidate between $46.39 and $38.77 for a few days. A break and close below $38.77 could signal the start of a deeper correction to the 50-day SMA ($35.14).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/shiba-inu-could-surpass-dogecoin-after-a-700-shib-price-rally-in-october"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Shiba Inu could surpass Dogecoin after a 700% SHIB price rally in October}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $0.28 on Oct. 24, indicating that traders are liquidating positions on rallies. The bulls again tried to push the price above the $0.27 overhead resistance on Oct. 26 but failed.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/bc2cbad9-9282-4290-ab97-42e626cc9668.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling accelerated on Oct. 27 after bears pulled the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.24). This resulted in a decline close to the strong support zone at $0.21 to $0.19. The long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that traders continue to defend the support zone.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out and the RSI is just below the midpoint, suggesting a possible range-bound action in the near term. The next trending move could start on a break above $0.28 or a close below $0.19.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 SHIBA INU (SHIB) is in a strong uptrend. The long wick on the Oct. 24 candlestick shows that bears tried to stall the up-move at $0.00004465 but they could not sustain the selling pressure. Buying resumed on Oct. 25 and the meme coin resumed its northward march.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/621c2fce-eedd-4d9d-bae4-1191273f7578.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The strong up-move has pushed the RSI near the 90 level, which suggests that the rally may be overextended in the short term. However, this does not guarantee the start of a correction because the RSI had reached above 93 on Oct. 6 before a pullback happened.\par \par \uc2 The bulls have pushed the SHIB/USDT pair above the 161.8% Fibonacci extension level at $0.00006531. If the price sustains above this level, the next stop could be the 200% extension level at $0.00007586.\par \par \uc2 Vertical rallies are rarely sustainable and they usually end with waterfall declines. Therefore, chasing prices higher after the recent rally may be risky.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra protocol\u8217\'20\'19s LUNA token broke above the overhead resistance at $45.01 on Oct. 26 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/ba72e84d-fde0-4825-a586-97fa7a1a5c7b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears sensed an opportunity and pulled the price below the $39.75 support on Oct. 27, but a minor positive is that bulls bought the dip to the 50-day SMA ($38.16). If the price sustains above $39.75, the bulls may again try to push the LUNA/USDT pair toward $45.01.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price breaks below the 50-day SMA, the pair could drop to the strong support zone at $34.86 to $32.50. This is an important zone for the bulls to defend because a break below it could accelerate selling.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTAvNjNlOTEzYWQtOTgyYi00ZjI5LTliM2ItNWNkMjc4MjI2MDE0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211027ehar000dy\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 SHIB\par \b \uc2 Shiba Inu could surpass \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  after a 700% SHIB price rally in October\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 887 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 October 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu's run-up to its record high stretched its October returns to over 726%.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu (SHIB) continued its march upward on Oct. 27, with its price hitting a record high of nearly $0.000060 before correcting lower.\par \par \uc2 SHIB rallied by more than 25% to an all-time high of $0.00005959, crossing above its previous all-time high of 0.00005000, according to data from Binance. The latest move upside pushed the token\u8217\'20\'19s month-to-date (MTD) returns to approximately 726%, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/shib-plummets-20-as-elon-musk-reveals-he-owns-none"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 making it the fifth-highest grossing cryptocurrency}}}\uc2  entering the final quarter of 2021.\par \par \uc2 SHIB\u8217\'20\'19s October gains had slipped to near 606% following a price correction from its record high, still higher than the rest of the top-cap crypto rivals, including Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and Solana (SOL).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/34c3e727-3108-4d88-b878-4f306b66f8a2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Top five cryptocurrencies ranked according to their October gains. Source: Messari\par \par \uc2 Still, SHIB\u8217\'20\'19s superior performance particularly stands out against its meme coin rival, \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ), whose MTD gains are currently only about 8%. Moreover, Shiba Inu\u8217\'20\'19s market capitalization has now reached $22.1 billion \u8212\'20\'14 the 11th-largest \u8212\'20\'14 putting it right behind \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s $31.53 billion in 10th place.\par \par \uc2 SHIB copying DOGE bull run?\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu was launched in 2020 after taking heavy inspiration from \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2 , a 2013-born joke cryptocurrency fashioned after the Japanese dog breed. Eight years since its introduction, \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s popularity emerged with its use as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/for-sports-fans-doge-is-starting-to-look-like-crypto-s-real-mvp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 payments by sports teams}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/amc-theaters-acceptance-of-dogecoin-follows-viral-community-appeal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AMC theaters}}}\uc2  and as a speculative investment vehicle thanks to Tesla CEO {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/dogecoin-gains-8-after-elon-musk-says-doge-payments-compete-with-bitcoin-ethereum"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Elon Musk\u8217\'20\'19s social media endorsements}}}\uc2  of the token.\par \par \uc2 DOGE\u8217\'20\'19s price underwent an incredible upside boom in the first five months of 2021, rising more than 15,000% amid a retail-led frenzy. In doing so, the king meme token {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/may-8-day-to-watch-for-dogecoin-amid-warning-doge-can-suffer-xrp-style-crash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reached its record high}}}\uc2  of $0.76 on May 8, only to correct by over 68% to trade around $0.23 at press time.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/fc0056c5-5984-4278-ba1d-f5897d16fe49.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USD daily price chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Overall, \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  went through extreme trends in the previous 12 months, starting with a long period of consolidation, eventually following it up with an extended \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  breakout and further by a massive price correction.\par \par \uc2 It appears Shiba Inu\u8217\'20\'19s price trends in recent months took cues from \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s consolidation and breakout phases, as the SHIB/USDT chart shows below.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/a527d073-3e96-494b-81bf-94c3c3783a40.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily price chart featuring \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s three phases. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/only-whales-move-doge-data-suggests-major-dogecoin-wealth-gap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin-like 1,500% price boom}}}\uc2  in the Shiba Inu market puts its long-term profit target near $0.00013500. Nonetheless, the fractal also warns about massive, periodical price corrections toward the 20-day exponential moving average support (the green waves in the charts above) as the price increases.\par \par \uc2 The overall Shiba Inu dominance in the cryptocurrency market has surged from 0.16% to 0.91% MTD. On the other hand, \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s control on the market has reduced from 1.5% to as low as 1.20% in the same period.\par \par \uc2 SHIB price macro fundamentals\par \par \uc2 Joe Wiesenthal, editor at Bloomberg Markets, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/TheStalwart/status/1453317910022266880"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 noted}}}\uc2  that Shiba Inu has \u8220\'20\'1Cadvanced smart-contracting capabilities,\u8221\'20\'1D making it better than \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CYou can check out Shibaswap, a Uniswap-like decentralized exchange for the SHIB community. It\u8217\'20\'19s got NFT, liquidity mining. All of it. Meanwhile, \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  doesn\u8217\'20\'19t have any of this right now.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 As {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/secret-curve-and-shiba-inu-gains-suggest-that-altseason-is-coming"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph covered}}}\uc2 , the recent SHIB price rally may have also taken cues from the Monday launch of the Shiboshis Social Club. This online community rewards exclusive perks to people who own exclusive Shiba Inu-generated nonfungible tokens (NFT), dubbed Shiboshis.\par \par \uc2 As a result, retail appears to have been tailing Shiba Inu\u8217\'20\'19s speculative bull run, with a recent study by Bacancy Technology {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.marketwatch.com/amp/story/shiba-inu-is-the-third-most-googled-crypto-in-2021-new-study-shows-11635282527"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 showing}}}\uc2  that it received 2.8 million \uc2 Google\uc2  searches on average in 2021, the third-highest after Bitcoin and Ethereum.\par \par \uc2 In comparison, search volume of \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  came as the sixth-largest.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.change.org/p/robinhood-convince-robinhood-they-will-prosper-if-they-list-shiba-inu-coin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 petition}}}\uc2  on \uc2 Change.org\uc2  pleading with Robinhood to list SHIB tokens on its zero-fee trading app garnered over 500,000 signatures. Robinhood CEO Vlad Tenev said during the company\u8217\'20\'19s earnings call Tuesday that Robinhood is considering adding new coins to the service portfolio, albeit without mentioning their names.\par \par \uc2 That may have pushed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-surge-to-49k-prompts-several-altcoins-to-hit-new-all-time-highs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Shiba Inu\u8217\'20\'19s price to its record high}}}\uc2  Wednesday, further signaling booming retail interest in the meme crypto.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CMemes have value and have been an investible thesis in 2021,\u8221\'20\'1D Jonathan Cheesman, head of over-the-counter and institutional sales at crypto-derivatives exchange FTX, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2021-10-24/shiba-inu-jumps-50-to-record-becoming-11th-biggest-crypto-coin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2  Bloomberg, adding:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CLower dollar-price tokens are attractive to retail.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/shiba-inu-risks-drop-with-shib-s-574-october-s-price-rally-near-exhaustion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Shiba Inu risks drop with SHIB's 574% October's price rally near exhaustion}}}\par \par \uc2 But according to Ben Caselin, head of research and strategy at crypto exchange AAX, SHIB traders should tread ahead carefully due to excessive speculation, citing prior patterns that indicate that the token would likely \u8220\'20\'1Cshed much of its value\u8221\'20\'1D as it gets challenged by other meme projects.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTAvYmQ4M2IyM2MtNzFjNi00NThjLWFlMzItNjU5MjQ2NWZjYWI0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211027ehar0008h\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 10/25: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, SOL, DOT, DOGE, LUNA, UNI\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,824 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 October 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and several altcoins are attempting to resume their uptrend, but higher levels are likely to witness strong resistance from the bears.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has recovered from the dip below $60,000, indicating strong buying at lower levels. CryptoQuant CEO Ki Young Ju said that investors used market orders to buy $840 million worth of Bitcoin futures on dips to $60,000.\par \par \uc2 This suggests that analysts are positive for the rest of the year and anticipate the bull run to continue. Analyst TechDev believes that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price action in 2021 is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-action-in-2021-so-far-mirrors-2017-will-it-continue"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 following the same trajectory as in 2017}}}\uc2 . If that were to happen, Bitcoin could be getting ready for a sharp move higher in the remainder of the year.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/608053eb-565d-4a6f-bc9f-5abfaf3a1bb7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 In a step that could boost the adoption of cryptocurrencies further, \uc2 Mastercard\uc2  is expected to announce that its banking partners and merchants on its payment networks {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/mastercard-plans-to-allow-us-partners-to-offer-crypto-loyalty-rewards"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 may soon be able to add crypto services}}}\uc2 . \uc2 Mastercard\uc2  has tied up with the Bakkt platform to enable its United States-based customers to buy, sell and hold cryptocurrencies through custodial wallets.\par \par \uc2 Is the correction in Bitcoin over and could it rise to a new all-time high? If that happens, will the altcoins also resume their uptrends? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long tail on the Oct. 23 and Oct. 24 candlestick suggests that bulls are attempting to defend the psychologically important support at $60,000. Bitcoin has resumed its up-move and will now attempt to challenge the overhead resistance zone at $64,854 to $67,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/5e9c8192-e3be-427c-87da-2eb19b1cb1e6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($58,794) and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive zone suggest that bulls are in control. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up further if the BTC/USDT pair closes above $67,000.\par \par \uc2 That could open the doors for a possible rally to $75,000 and later to the target objective at $85,756.75.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price once again turns down from the overhead resistance and plummets below the 20-day EMA. That could result in panic selling by short-term traders and may pull the price down to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($51,160).\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) dropped below $4,027.88 on Oct. 22 but the bears could not capitalize on this advantage. The bulls quickly reclaimed the level on Oct. 23, indicating strong buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/2f87ad05-6223-4d84-86ce-b9b943b08805.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls thwarted another attempt by the bears to pull the price below $4,027.88 on Oct. 24, as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. If bulls sustain the price above $4,027.88, the ETH/USDT pair could rise to the all-time high at $4,375.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above this resistance could start the pair\u8217\'20\'19s journey toward the psychologically important level at $5,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level, the bears will try to pull the pair below the 20-day EMA ($3,826). This is the first sign that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening. The pair could then drop to the 50-day SMA ($3,473).\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls are buying on dips to the 20-day EMA ($461), indicating that the sentiment remains positive. Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) could now rise to the stiff overhead resistance at $518.90.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/f597f5aa-bf29-4691-a5c3-d76bd2af868d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A breakout and close above $518.90 will suggest the start of a new up-move. The BNB/USDT pair could then attempt to rally to the pattern target at $554. A break above this level could push the pair to $600.\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive zone indicate the path of least resistance is to the upside. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and plummets below the 50-day SMA ($423).\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke and closed marginally below the support line of the symmetrical triangle pattern on Oct. 24. This suggests that the uncertainty of the past few days may be resolving in favor of the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/82497d36-9ecd-461a-b568-7749e4d56674.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears pull the price below $1.09, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could start its southward journey toward the strong support at $1.87. The marginally downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest that sellers have a slight advantage.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the resistance line of the triangle. That could trap the aggressive bears, resulting in a rally to $2.47 and then to the pattern target at $2.80.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the 20-day EMA ($1.09) on Oct. 24 but the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bulls are buying at lower levels. The buyers will now try to push the price above the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/95471961-24dd-4a7b-bd61-e646680550ec.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, it will suggest a change in the short-term trend. The XRP/USDT pair could then rally to $1.24 where the bears may again mount a stiff resistance. If the price turns down from this level, the pair could remain range-bound between $1.24 and $1 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below $1 could tilt the advantage in favor of bears, resulting in a decline to the strong support zone at $0.88 to $0.85. Conversely, a break and close above $1.24 could push the pair to $1.41.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Solana\u8217\'20\'19s (SOL) Oct. 24 candlestick shows that traders aggressively bought at lower levels. Sustained buying has pushed the price to a new all-time high at $218.93 on Oct. 25.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/400f2626-2fc7-4ca6-8c39-8db037b3dd02.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls sustain the price above $216, the SOL/USDT pair could start its journey toward $239.83. The rising 20-day EMA ($173) and the RSI in the overbought territory indicate that buyers have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 However, if the price turns down from the current level, it will suggest that bears are in no mood to relent. The pair could then drop to $177.70 and remain range-bound between these levels for a few days.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below $171.47 will be the first sign of weakness, which could pull the pair down to the trendline.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s (DOT) shallow correction from $46.39 suggests that bulls are not rushing to the exit as they anticipate the up-move to continue. The rising moving averages and the RSI above 63 indicate that bulls are in command.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/285fee7d-5b79-4bc6-a883-dabf047d408c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers will now try to push the price above $46.39 and retest the all-time high at $49.78. A breakout and close above this resistance could signal the start of a new uptrend, which has a target objective at $53.90.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance, it will suggest that demand dries up at higher levels. The bears will then attempt to pull the DOT/USDT pair below $38.77. If that happens, the decline could extend to the 50-day SMA ($34.65).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-charges-toward-64k-as-tesla-ath-boosts-elon-musk-to-250b-net-worth"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin charges toward $64K as Tesla ATH boosts Elon Musk to $250B net worth}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) tight range trading between the downtrend line and the 20-day EMA ($0.24) resolved to the upside on Oct. 24. The strong momentum on the day pushed the price above the overhead resistance at $0.27 but the bulls are struggling to sustain the higher levels. This suggests that bears are defending the overhead resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/ef9aec85-ce6f-4508-b5b1-3d21d22d3b15.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair could now drop to the 20-day EMA. If the price rebounds off this support, it will suggest that the sentiment has turned positive and traders are buying on dips. That will increase the likelihood of a break above $0.28.\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the pair could climb to $0.32 and then $0.35. Conversely, if bears pull the price below the moving averages, the pair could drop to the strong support zone at $0.21 to $0.19. A bounce off this zone could keep the pair range-bound for a few days.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra protocol\u8217\'20\'19s LUNA token turned down from the overhead resistance at $45.01 on Oct. 22 and bounced off the 20-day EMA ($40.03) on Oct. 24, indicating that the price is stuck between these two levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/02838c90-24c0-41c8-8ce4-9897e5f8ff68.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The gradually upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the positive territory indicate a slight advantage to buyers. If bulls thrust and sustain the price above $45.01, the LUNA/USDT pair could challenge the all-time high at $49.54.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above this resistance could clear the path for a further rally to $60.57. Alternatively, a drop below $40 could sink the pair to the strong support zone at $34.86 to $32.50. The selling could accelerate if this zone cracks.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap (UNI) continues to trade in a narrow range between the neckline of the inverse H&S pattern and the 20-day EMA ($25.68). This suggests that bears are defending the neckline while bulls are refusing to give up the 20-day EMA support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/a7ca026a-d931-4a69-9a50-440d98490369.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Tight ranges usually result in a strong trending move. A break and close above the neckline will complete the inverse head and shoulder pattern. The UNI/USDT pair could first rise to $31.41 before heading for the pattern target at $36.98.\par \par \uc2 The gradually rising 20-day EMA and the RSI just above the midpoint suggests a minor advantage to buyers. Contrary to this assumption, if the price plummets and sustains below the moving averages, a drop to $22 is possible.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTAvNzZmMmJlZmQtOGI3MS00MTdjLThlYjAtNThlZTI4ZDcyY2U4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211025ehap000dy\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Solana\par \b \uc2 Solana reclaims $200 \u8212\'20\'14 3 reasons why SOL price is up 35% in seven days\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 573 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 October 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 SOL rallied as the combined value locked in decentralized finance projects built atop the Solana blockchain jumped to a new milestone high of $13.53 billion.\par \par \uc2 The price of Solana\u8217\'20\'19s native SOL coin edged up on Oct. 25 in the wake of a marketwide rally led by Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), with the total value locked (TVL) on Solana hitting record highs and SOL\u8217\'20\'19s price seeing a promising technical setup.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin triggers marketwide rally\par \par \uc2 SOL climbed by more than 6% to hit an intraday high of around $214. The price of SOL is now up a little over 35% over the past week, pushing it closer to its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-10-20-btc-eth-bnb-ada-xrp-sol-dot-doge-luna-uni"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 record high of about $222}}}\uc2  set in early September.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/paypal-logs-its-largest-bitcoin-volume-since-may-btc-price-crash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s run-up to its new record high of $67,000}}}\uc2  last week resulted in the total crypto market capitalization passing the $2.5-trillion mark, a new milestone for the cryptocurrency.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/a218b874-9242-48dd-8acc-e641cd4c20a7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Top 10 cryptocurrencies and their performance over the last seven days. Source: Messari\par \par \uc2 That helped push SOL higher, with rival cryptocurrencies Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) and Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  also jumping by over 10% and 1% in the past week, respectively.\par \par \uc2 Solana TVL hits record high\par \par \uc2 The SOL price rally also appeared as the TVL of all the decentralized finance (DeFi) projects built on the Solana blockchain {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://defillama.com/chain/Solana/all/USD"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reached}}}\uc2  a new record high of $13.53 billion, as per data aggregator service DeFi Llama.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/1922f347-b1d2-4372-9c54-63fbcea6ce3b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana TVL hits another high. Source: Defi Llama\par \par \uc2 The most dominant {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-based-cross-chain-exchange-saber-raises-7-7m-to-expand-team-and-tokens"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DeFi project on the Solana blockchain is Saber}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-based-cross-chain-exchange-saber-raises-7-7m-to-expand-team-and-tokens"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-based-cross-chain-exchange-saber-raises-7-7m-to-expand-team-and-tokens}}}\uc2 , an automated market maker (AMM) protocol that enables Solana users and applications to trade between stable pairs of assets efficiently and earn yields by providing liquidity to the platform.\par \par \uc2 Its contribution to the Solana liquidity pool was $2.05 billion as of publication time.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, there are four other DeFi projects with a TVL of more than $1 billion. These include {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/strong-fundamentals-lure-traders-back-to-audius-raydium-and-helium"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Raydium}}}\uc2  ($1.91 billion), Sunny ($1.73 billion), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/finance-redefined-defi-partys-over-back-to-building-now-sept-30oct-7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Serum}}}\uc2  ($1.69 billion) and Marinade Finance ($1.63 billion).\par \par \uc2 Solana also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/solana/status/1450106521644408839"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 declared}}}\uc2  that it would add more DeFi projects to its list after the completion of its \u8220\'20\'1CIgnition\u8221\'20\'1D hackathon on Oct. 18. Users will need to hold SOL tokens to use these applications, to pay for transaction fees, thus raising the prospect of the token\u8217\'20\'19s higher demand in the future.\par \par \uc2 SOL price technicals\par \par \uc2 SOL\u8217\'20\'19s latest price rally came as part of a breakout move out of what appears like a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pennant. As {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-gains-over-26-in-two-days-250-sol-price-target-next"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph reported earlier}}}\uc2 , the technical outlook could send SOL to levels equal to the maximum distance between the pennant\u8217\'20\'19s upper and lower trendline around $85.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/c558c6d1-6cf1-458d-a1c3-6d24bcf9cb2a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USD daily price chart featuring pennant breakout. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 As a result, adding $85 to the breakout level around $158, SOL\u8217\'20\'19s pennant price target is $243 U\u8212\'20\'14 i.e., almost $250. Meanwhile, a retest of the pennant\u8217\'20\'19s upper trendline as support would risk invalidating the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTAvNDRkYTM1ZGQtNzA4NC00ZWE2LWEyM2QtNzFkYTMxODdjOWNiLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211025ehap0008i\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin decides fate of $60K as weekly close keeps BTC traders on their toes\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 425 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 October 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 What will happen to BTC price action as Bitcoin nears its weekly close?\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC }}}\uc2  ) is lining up a crucial weekly support test on Oct. 23 after impulsive sellers moved large amounts of BTC to major exchange Binance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/21f86dd1-a87c-469c-b85f-7eb2ee88c081.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 BTC dices with $60,000\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD is keeping traders nervous into Saturday, data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.121254216.1571181373.1628517932-1136475544.1627545224"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro }}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BITSTAMP"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView }}}\uc2  shows, deciding on the fate of $60,000 support.\par \par \uc2 The level had proven the first major area of buyer interest overnight after old all-time highs at $64,900 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/analysts-hold-their-250k-bitcoin-price-target-even-as-btc-falls-below-60k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 failed }}}\uc2  to prop up the market.\par \par \uc2 While analysts remain \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on longer timeframes, the comedown is creating an interesting close to the current weekly candle.\par \par \uc2 Last week, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/BTC?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #BTC }}}\uc2  Weekly Closed above a historical major resistance area (red)\par \par \uc2 This week, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BTC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BTC }}}\uc2  may be dipping towards the same area but this time to turn it into a support\par \par \uc2 Weekly retest may soon be in progress {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Crypto?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Crypto }}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Bitcoin?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Bitcoin }}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/j8yGm7g5bt"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/j8yGm7g5bt }}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Rekt Capital (@rektcapital) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rektcapital/status/1451602018225819657?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 October 22, 2021 }}}\par \par \uc2 For Cointelegraph contributor Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe, however, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1451600409345339404"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 called }}}\uc2  the correction "fine" and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1451706301663301639"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 maintained }}}\uc2  his prognosis of a macro price top of as much as $300,000.\par \par \uc2 Elsewhere, a popular theory {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/BitBitCrypto/status/1451568661639086084"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 revolves }}}\uc2  around a structured flushing out of overleveraged traders, these having pushed up funding rates to classic unsustainable levels during the run to $67,100 all-time highs.\par \par \uc2 Front-running the United States' first \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  is likewise still a major topic of debate, as noted by popular \uc2 Twitter\uc2  account BitBit.\par \par \uc2 roughly 1.25 trillion dollars were injected into the market in a span of exactly 3 months, ahead of the \b \highlight22\uc2 ETF approval\b0 \highlight\uc2 . now you tell me that some big pockets didn't have this info way before you could guess.\par \par \uc2 1.25 trillion.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Bitbit BTFD (3, 3) (,) (,) crypto (@BitBitCrypto) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/BitBitCrypto/status/1451766618439233541?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 October 23, 2021 }}}\par \par \uc2 Binance reserves shoot higher\par \par \uc2 While exchange balances broadly continue to trend lower, meanwhile, Binance has seen a dramatic uptick in its reserves in recent days.\par \par \uc2 Related: Price analysis 10/22: BTC, ETH, BNB, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , XRP, SOL, DOT, DOGE, LUNA, UNI\par \par \uc2 According to data from statistics resource Bybt, these increased by over 50,000 BTC to near 400,000 BTC as of Friday.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/05a0c601-d64e-4407-9616-e19eb219422d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin balance on Binance. Source: Bybt\par \par \uc2 Exchange reserve upticks tend to signify a desire to sell or have BTC available to sell at short notice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTAvZDk3ZDIyNTAtNTk2MS00YTZkLWFiZmUtMTg3Nzg3OTNlYjQxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211023ehan0005m\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 10/22: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, SOL, DOT, DOGE, LUNA, UNI\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,901 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 October 2021\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2021. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC and ETH reversed course as both assets search for underlying support, suggesting that bears are attempting to trap over-leveraged bulls.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) have both witnessed aggressive profit-booking after hitting their respective new all-time high. This suggests that traders who had bought on rumors of a Bitcoin exchange-traded fund booked profits following the successful launch of the ProShares\u8217\'20\'19 Bitcoin Strategy exchange-traded fund (ETF) (BITO).\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/valkyrie-bitcoin-futures-linked-etf-launches-on-nasdaq-with-share-prices-dropping-3-in-first-hour"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 stage a recovery in Bitcoin after the launch}}}\uc2  of the second BTC futures-linked ETF by \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  manager Valkyrie on Oct. 22 but met with strong selling pressure at higher levels. The selling has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-sheds-6-in-battle-for-all-time-high-support-amid-falling-funding-rates"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pulled the greed level}}}\uc2  on the Crypto Fear and Greed Index from 84 on Oct. 21 to 75 on Oct. 22.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/0c1468a6-13d1-4094-8d60-d124123b1946.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 JPMorgan Chase\uc2  strategists said in a note that BITO was \u8220\'20\'1Cunlikely to trigger a new phase of significantly more fresh capital entering Bitcoin\u8221\'20\'1D and the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/jpmorgan-says-inflation-concerns-not-etfs-driving-bitcoin-price-jump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 hype in the product may wane}}}\uc2  after a week. The strategists pointed out that capital was shifting away from gold ETFs into Bitcoin funds since September and that \u8220\'20\'1Csupports a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook for Bitcoin into year-end.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and Ether witness a deep correction and what are the critical support levels to watch out for? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin made a new all-time high at $67,000 on Oct. 20 but the bulls could not sustain the breakout as bears pulled the price back below the breakout level at $64,854 on Oct. 21. This suggests that sellers are attempting to trap the aggressive bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/27c9d8cf-6509-454b-a092-d3129a09ac7c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to start a recovery on Oct. 22 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that traders are selling on minor rallies. The strong support to watch on the downside is the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($57,778).\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this support, it will suggest that sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips. That will increase the possibility of a break above the overhead resistance zone between $64,854 and $67,000. The pair could then rally to $75,000.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price breaks below the 20-day EMA, the selling may accelerate and the BTC/USDT pair could drop to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($50,496).\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether broke and closed above the overhead resistance at $4,027.88 on Oct. 20. That was followed by another sharp up-move on Oct. 21, which pushed the price to $4,375, just above the previous all-time high at $4,372.72.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/3a74d7dc-56e5-4caa-baea-477dec8633ff.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the long wick and the negative close on Oct. 21 show that traders may have sold aggressively near the all-time high. The bears are attempting to sustain the price below the breakout level at $4,027.88.\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($3,712) and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive zone suggest that bulls remain in command. If the price bounces off the current level, the bulls will make one more attempt to thrust the ETH/USDT pair to a new all-time high.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below the neckline of the inverse head and shoulders (H&S) pattern could signal the possible start of a deeper correction to $3,200.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $505.90, which shows that bears are defending the overhead resistance at $518.90. The altcoin could not drop to the 20-day EMA ($455), which is expected to act as a strong support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/ee40f1e0-b72d-4f8a-8797-41c95e19d1cb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price bounces off the 20-day EMA, the BNB/USDT pair could make one more attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at $518.90. If they manage to do that, the pair could rally toward the pattern target at $554.\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive zone indicate that bulls have the upper hand. This advantage could shift in favor of the bears if the price turns down and slips below the moving averages. The selling could intensify further on a break below $392.20.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke above the 20-day EMA ($2.18) on Oct. 21 but the bulls could not push the price above the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle pattern. This indicates that bears are vigorously defending this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/e4a9d120-d632-4bca-9071-bc9c0317d92a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sellers are currently trying to sink the price below the support line of the triangle. If they succeed, it will suggest that the equilibrium between the bulls and the bears has resolved to the downside.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then slide to the strong support at $1.87. A break and close below this level could result in panic selling. The break and close above the triangle will be the first indication that bulls are back in the game. The pair may then rally to $2.47 and pick up momentum above this resistance.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) returned from the downtrend line on Oct. 21, indicating that bears are defending this level aggressively. On the downside, the bulls are attempting to sustain the price above the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/775bb1b6-7b50-4d2c-aec1-1f546e1adb04.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the current level, the bulls will again try to push the XRP/USDT pair above the downtrend line. If they manage to do that, the pair could rally to $1.41. A break and close above this resistance could push the price to $1.66.\par \par \uc2 The flat moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint suggest the pair may remain range-bound for a few days. A break and close below $1 will clear the path for a possible drop to the strong support at $0.85.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) broke and closed above the overhead resistance zone between $171.47 and $177.79 on Oct. 21. This completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern, which has a target objective of $226.94.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/46f4b227-aecd-4292-a95a-3143c54b678d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears may pose a stiff challenge at the current all-time high at $216 but the strong momentum of the past three days shows that bulls are aggressively buying at higher levels. A break and close above $216 will signal the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the SOL/USDT pair turns down from $216, a retest of $177.79 is possible. If the price rebounds off this level, it will indicate that bulls continue to buy on dips. The bulls will then again try to resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below $171.47 will signal that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has possibly weakened.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) broke above the immediate resistance at $44.78 on Oct. 20, indicating the possible resumption of the up-move. The bears tried to trap the aggressive bulls by pulling the price toward the breakout level at $39.02 on Oct. 21 but buyers had other plans.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/fc4f408e-2ed8-411e-9261-b80f13153d33.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($38.88) and the RSI near the overbought zone suggest that bulls have the upper hand. If buyers sustain the price above $45, the DOT/USDT pair could retest the all-time high at $49.78.\par \par \uc2 This level may act as a stiff hurdle but if bulls do not give up much ground, the pair could extend the up-move to $53.90. The bears will have to pull the price below the breakout level at $38.77 to turn the advantage in their favor. The pair could then decline to the 50-day SMA ($34.07).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/paypal-logs-its-largest-bitcoin-volume-since-may-btc-price-crash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 PayPal logs its largest Bitcoin volume since May BTC price crash}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) continues to face stiff resistance at the downtrend line, indicating that bears are defending this level aggressively. A minor positive is that bulls have not allowed the price to break and sustain below the 20-day EMA ($0.23).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/f107886f-166a-4c93-bf52-4c7900992114.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls fail to push and sustain the price above the downtrend line, the likelihood of a break below the 20-day EMA will increase. That could pull the price to the strong support zone at $0.21 to $0.19. The bulls are expected to defend this zone vigorously.\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off this support zone will point to a possible range-bound action between $0.19 and $0.27 for a few days. The trend will tilt in favor of the bulls if the DOGE/USDT pair rises and closes above $0.27. The pair could thereafter rise to $0.32 and then to $0.35.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra protocol\u8217\'20\'19s LUNA token rallied close to the overhead resistance at $45.01 on Oct. 20 where bears attempted to stall the up-move. The price turned down from the overhead resistance but the bulls defended the breakout level at $39.75 on Oct. 21. This shows that the sentiment has turned positive and traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/7842ee20-cb58-4be5-96bd-650bf05b298a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls thrust and sustain the price above $45.01, the LUNA/USDT pair could retest the all-time high at $49.54. This level may again act as an obstacle but if bulls arrest the next decline above $45.01, the prospects of a new all-time high increase. The pair could then rally to $60.57.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($39.18), the decline could extend to $34.86. The selling could intensify below $32.50.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap (UNI) broke and closed above the neckline of the inverse H&S pattern on Oct. 20 but the bulls could not build on this advantage. The bears pulled the price back below the neckline on Oct. 21.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2021-10/23b8510a-1318-407d-b3a5-e5b8102a453a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, a minor positive is that bulls did not allow the price to slip below the 20-day EMA ($25.46). This shows that buyers are accumulating on every minor dip. If bulls drive the price above $28, the UNI/USDT pair could jump to $31.41.\par \par \uc2 This level may again act as a stiff resistance but if bulls overcome this barrier, the pair could rally to the pattern target at $36.98. Conversely, a break below the moving averages could pull the price down to the strong support at $22. The short-term trend will turn negative if this support is breached.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjEtMTAvMzMwZjNhZDYtMGEwNi00OTRkLWJjNTctODYyZWE2M2MyOWNhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020211022eham000dx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw122\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1830\pichgoal600
